	<string key="NAME304" kor="스킬 마스터리" ger="Skill Mastery" eng="Skill Mastery" tur="Beceri Ustalığı" fre="Skill Mastery" spa="Skill Mastery" ita="Skill Mastery" rus="Skill Mastery" ame="Skill Mastery" cns="能量强化" tha="Skill Mastery" twn="技能精通" jap="スキルマスタリー" idn="Skill Mastery"/>
	<string key="TIP304" kor="별다른 입력 없이 착용만 하면 효력이 발생하는 패시브 스킬. SP 양이 증가 하여 기본 액션의 사용 시간 및 횟수 가 늘어난다." ger="Ein passiver Skill, der ohne dein Zutun wirksam ist. SP werden erhöht und die Anwendungsdauer und -frequenz der Basic Actions werden verbessert." eng="A passive skill that will be effective simply by wearing it, you don't need to activate it. Max SP is increased so that your skills will occur more often and last longer." tur="Sadece giyerek, etkinleştirmene gerek kalmadan etkili olan pasif bir beceri. Maksimum SP artar ve böylece becerilerin daha sık ve daha uzun süre kullanılabilir." fre="Un skill passif qui s'utilise simplement en le portant, sans avoir à utiliser de commande.  Les SP sont augmentés   et le temps d'utilisation et la fréquence   des actions basiques sont augmentés." spa="Un skill pasivo que puede ser efectivo simplemente poniéndoselo sin una fuerza en particular.  SP aumenta   y también se incrementan el tiempo de uso y   frecuencia de las acciones básicas." ita="Skill passiva che si attiva senza alcun comando particolare. Aumentano gli SP, il tempo d'uso e la frequenza delle azioni di base." rus="Пассивное умение, которое действует постоянно и не требует активации. Максимальное значение SP увеличивается: ты сможешь использовать свои умения чаще, и они будут длиться дольше." ame="A passive skill that will be effective simply by wearing it, you don't need to activate it. Max SP is increased so that your skills will occur more often and last longer." cns="被动技能。增加能量上限。" tha="passive skill ที่ส่งผลทันทีที่ติดตั้ง โดยไม่ต้องทำการ active ก่อน  MAX SP ของคุณจะเพิ่มขึ้น ทำให้ Skill ติดมากขึ้นและอยู่นานขึ้น" twn="只要著裝就會產生效果的被動技能。會增加SP量，讓基本動作的使用期間以及次數增加。" jap="着用するだけで効果が発生するパッシブ能力。最大SP量が増加し、使用できるアクションの使用時間や回数が増える。" idn="Skill pasif yang sangat efektif dan cukup dengan menggunakannya. Kamu tidak perlu mengaktifkannya. Maksimal SP akan meningkat sehingga kamu bisa menggunakan skill lebih lama."/>
	<string key="F_TEXT304"/>
	<string key="NAME305" kor="펜 플러스 50" ger="PEN Plus 50" eng="PEN Plus 50" tur="PEN Plus 50" fre="PEN Plus 50" spa="PEN Plus 50" ita="PEN Plus 50" rus="PEN Plus 50" ame="PEN Plus 50" cns="金币+50%" tha="PEN Plus 50" twn="P幣增加50%" jap="PENプラス50" idn="PEN Plus 50"/>
	<string key="TIP305" kor="부스트 아이템 착용 시 펜 지급량이 50% 증가한다." ger="Nach Benutzung dieses Items erhöht sich die PEN-Rate um 50%" eng="When you wear this boost item, you will gain PEN 50% faster." tur="Bu yükseltme eşyasını giydiğinde %50 daha hızlı PEN alırsın." fre="Quand tu portes cet item de boost, les PEN obtenus augmentent de 50%" spa="Cuando adoptas este item estímulo, la provisión de PEN se incrementa un 50%" ita="Usando questo oggetto, i PEN aumentano del 50%." rus="С этим усилителем ты будешь получать PEN на 50% быстрее." ame="When you wear this boost item, you will gain PEN 50% faster." cns="装备该道具时，金币获得量增加50%" tha="ถ้าคุณใส่ boost item นี้ คุณจะได้รับ  PEN มากขึ้น 50%" twn="購買加值道具後，有效時間內所得P幣增加50%" jap="ブーストアイテムを着用時、入手するPENが50%増加する。" idn="Ketika kamu menggunakan barang ini, kamu akan mendapatkan PEN 50% lebih cepat."/>
	<string key="F_TEXT305" kor="10시간 사용가능" ger="Use for 10hours" eng="Use for 10hours" tur="10 saatliğine kullan" fre="Use for 10hours" spa="Use for 10hours" ita="Use for 10hours" rus="Использовать в течение 10 часов" ame="Use for 10hours" cns="可使用10小时" tha="ใช้ได้ 10 ชั่วโมง" twn="可使用10小時" jap="10時間使用可能" idn="Berlaku selama 10 jam"/>
	<string key="NAME306" kor="펜 플러스 100" ger="PEN Plus 100" eng="PEN Plus 100" tur="PEN Plus 100" fre="PEN Plus 100" spa="PEN Plus 100" ita="PEN Plus 100" rus="PEN Plus 100" ame="PEN Plus 100" cns="金币+100%" tha="PEN Plus 100" twn="P幣增加100%" jap="PENプラス100" idn="PEN Plus 100"/>
	<string key="TIP306" kor="부스트 아이템 착용 시 펜 지급량이 100% 증가한다." ger="Nach Benutzung dieses Items erhöht sich die PEN-Rate um 100%" eng="When you wear this boost item, you will gain PEN 100% faster." tur="Bu yükseltme eşyasını giydiğinde %100 daha hızlı PEN alırsın." fre="Quand tu portes cet item de boost, les PEN obtenus augmentent de 100%" spa="Cuando adoptas este item estímulo, la provisión de PEN se incrementa un 100%" ita="Usando questo oggetto, i PEN aumentano del 100%." rus="С этим усилителем ты будешь получать PEN на 100% быстрее." ame="When you wear this boost item, you will gain PEN 100% faster." cns="装备该道具时，金币获得量增加100%" tha="ถ้าคุณใส่ boost item นี้ คุณจะได้รับ  PEN มากขึ้น 100%" twn="購買加值道具後，有效時間內所得P幣增加100%" jap="ブーストアイテムを着用時、入手するPENが100%増加する。" idn="Ketika kamu menggunakan barang ini, kamu akan mendapatkan PEN 100% lebih cepat."/>
	<string key="F_TEXT306" kor="10시간 사용가능" ger="Use for 10hours" eng="Use for 10hours" tur="10 saatliğine kullan" fre="Use for 10hours" spa="Use for 10hours" ita="Use for 10hours" rus="Использовать в течение 10 часов" ame="Use for 10hours" cns="可使用10小时" tha="ใช้ได้ 10 ชั่วโมง" twn="可使用10小時" jap="10時間使用可能" idn="Berlaku selama 10 jam"/>
	<string key="NAME307" kor="닉네임 변경" ger="Change Nickname" eng="Change Nickname" tur="Rumuz değiştir" fre="Change Nickname" spa="Change Nickname" ita="Change Nickname" rus="Сменить имя игрока" ame="Change Nickname" cns="变更昵称" tha="Change Nickname" twn="暱稱變更" jap="ニックネーム変更" idn="Change Nickname"/>
	<string key="TIP307" kor="닉네임을 변경할 수 있습니다." ger="Die Namensänderung bleibt bestehen." eng="This will change your nickname permanently." tur="Bununla rumuzunu kalıcı olarak değiştirebilirsin." fre="Le nickname est définitivement changé." spa="El nickname modificado permanecerá." ita="Il nuovo Nickname rimane." rus="Это изменит твое имя в игре навсегда." ame="This will change your nickname permanently." cns="可以变更昵称" tha="เปลี่ยนชื่อ nickname คุณได้ถาวร" twn="可變更暱稱。" jap="ニックネームを変更できます。" idn="Ini akan mengubah nickname kamu secara permanen."/>
	<string key="F_TEXT307"/>
	<string key="NAME308" kor="데스매치 전적 초기화" ger="Death Match-Statistik zurücksetzen" eng="Reset the Death Match History" tur="Death Match Geçmişini sıfırla" fre="Remettre à zéro l'historique des Death Match" spa="Resetear el Historial de Death Match" ita="Ripristina le stat del DM" rus="Сбросить историю Death Match" ame="Reset the Death Match History" cns="团队模式数据清零" tha="Reset Kill/Death Rate" twn="生死模式戰績重置" jap="デスマッチ戦績初期化" idn="Mereset rekaman Death Match"/>
	<string key="TIP308" kor="데스매치 전적 초기화 아이템" ger="Item zurücksetzen (Death Match)" eng="Reset Item (Death Match)" tur="Eşyayı Sıfırla (Death Match)" fre="Reset Item (Death Match)" spa="Reset Item (Death Match)" ita="Reset Item (Death Match)" rus="Сбросить предмет (Death Match)" ame="Reset Item (Death Match)" cns="可以将现有的团队模式数据清零的道具" tha="ช่วย reset ค่าอัตรา  Kill/Death ของคุณ" twn="使用後會將生死模式的戰績重置" jap="デスマッチ戦績初期化アイテム" idn="Reset Item (Death Match)"/>
	<string key="F_TEXT308"/>
	<string key="NAME309" kor="경험치 플러스 30" ger="EXP Plus 30" eng="EXP Plus 30" tur="EXP Plus 30" fre="EXP Plus 30" spa="EXP Plus 30" ita="EXP Plus 30" rus="EXP Plus 30" ame="EXP Plus 30" cns="经验值+30%" tha="EXP Level Plus 30" twn="經驗值增加30%" jap="経験値プラス30" idn="EXP Plus 30"/>
	<string key="TIP309" kor="부스트 아이템 착용 시 경험치 지급량이 30% 증가한다." ger="Nach Benutzung dieses Items erhöht sich die EXP-Rate um 30%." eng="When you wear this boost item, you will gain EXP 30% faster." tur="Bu yükseltme eşyasını giydiğinde %30 daha hızlı EXP alırsın." fre="Quand tu portes cet item de boost, les EXP obtenus augmentent de 30%." spa="Cuando adoptas este item estímulo, la provisión de EXP se incrementa un 30%." ita="Usando questo oggetto, l'EXP aumenta del 30%." rus="С этим усилителем ты будешь получать EXP на 30% быстрее." ame="When you wear this boost item, you will gain EXP 30% faster." cns="装备该道具时，经验值获得量增加30%" tha="ถ้าคุณใส่ boost item นี้ คุณจะได้รับ EXP  มากขึ้น 30%" twn="有效時間內所得經驗值增加30%" jap="ブーストアイテムを着用時、経験値獲得量が30%増加する。" idn="Ketika kamu menggunakan barang ini, kamu akan mendapatkan EXP 30% Lebih cepat."/>
	<string key="F_TEXT309" kor="10시간 사용가능" ger="Use for 10hours" eng="Use for 10hours" tur="10 saatliğine kullan" fre="Use for 10hours" spa="Use for 10hours" ita="Use for 10hours" rus="Использовать в течение 10 часов" ame="Use for 10hours" cns="可使用10小时" tha="ใช้ได้ 10 ชั่วโมง" twn="可使用10小時" jap="10時間使用可能" idn="Berlaku selama 10 jam"/>
	<string key="NAME310" kor="펌비 폭탄500" ger="FUMBI Capsule 1" eng="FUMBI Capsule 1" tur="FUMBI Capsule 1" fre="FUMBI Capsule 1" spa="FUMBI Capsule 1" ita="FUMBI Capsule 1" rus="Fumbi Capsule 1" ame="FUMBI Capsule 1" cns="波比炸弹500" tha="FUMBI Capsule 1" twn="Fumbi 炸彈初代" jap="ファンビカプセル" idn="FUMBI Capsule 1"/>
	<string key="TIP310" kor="사용 시 펜과 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Mit diesem Lotterie-Item kannst du bis zu 300.000PEN gewinnen." eng="This is a lottery item, you can get at maximum 300.000 PEN" tur="Bu, maksimum 300,000 PEN kazanabileceğin bir çekiliş eşyasıdır." fre="C'est un item te permettant de participer à une loterie, tu peux obtenir au maximum 300.000 PEN." spa="Este es un item de lotería, puedes obtener 300.000 PEN como máximo." ita="E' un oggetto per la lotteria, puoi ottenere al massimo 300.000 PEN." rus="Это лотерейный предмет, позволяющий получить до 300 000 PEN" ame="This is a lottery item, you can get at maximum 300.000 PEN" cns="使用时获赠随机数量的金币" tha="ล็อตเตอรี่ไอเทม มีโอกาสได้เงินสูงสุดถึง  300.000 PEN" twn="使用時會隨機獲得P幣和道具。" jap="使用すると、最大300,000PEN獲得することができます。" idn="Ini merupakan barang undian, kamu bisa mendapatkan maksimal 300.000 PEN."/>
