	<string key="T1070006" kor="아빠토끼의 양복을 리폼해 입고{N}클럽에 부비부비하러 달을 탈출한{N}대담한 첫째 토끼 ‘도리’" ger="not trans" eng="not trans" tur="dönüş. yok" fre="not trans" spa="not trans" ita="not trans" rus="not trans" ame="not trans" cns="偷穿兔爸爸的礼服，只为了去和心爱的小兔子约会。" tha="not trans" twn="改造老爹兔的西裝，為穿著{N}跑到夜店裡玩耍而逃出月亮的{N}大膽老大兔‘多利’" jap="パパウサギの洋服を勝手に着て、夜遊びしに月を脱出した{N}大胆な長男ウサギ「ドリー」" idn="Tidak bisa ditransaksikan"/>
	<string key="N1070005" kor="화이트 래빗" ger="White Rabbit" eng="White Rabbit" tur="White Rabbit" fre="White Rabbit" spa="White Rabbit" ita="White Rabbit" rus="White Rabbit" ame="White Rabbit" cns="小白兔" tha="White Rabbit" twn="白色兔" jap="ホワイトラビット" idn="White Rabbit"/>
	<string key="T1070005" kor="포켓몬 탄생을 꿈꾸며 찐달걀을{N}소중히 품고 있는 어리버리{N}막내 토끼 ‘버리’" ger="Der naive Baby Hase bewacht ständig ein Ei und träumt von einem Pokemon." eng="Naive baby rabbit who holds an egg and dreams about the birth of a Pokemon." tur="Elinde bir yumurta tutup içinden bir pokemon çıkacağını hayal eden toy bir yavru tavşan." fre="Un lapin blanc naïf qui transporte un œuf et rêve de le voir donner naissance à un Poketmon." spa="El ingenuo conejito que lleva un huevo y sueña con el nacimiento de un Poketmon." ita="Un ingenuo coniglietto che tiene un ovetto e sogna di vederne uscire un Poketmon." rus="Наивный крольчонок, который держит яйцо и мечтает о рождении покемона." ame="Naive baby rabbit who holds an egg and dreams about the birth of a Pokemon." cns="单纯可爱的小白兔，特别听妈妈的话。{N}妈妈叫我别开门，我就不开门！" tha="น้องกระต่ายตัวน้อยที่สวมกอดไข่และความฝัน ถึงการกำเนิดของ Pokemon" twn="為想要讓寵物精靈出生而每天抱著蛋{N}的笨蛋{N}老么兔‘波利’" jap="ペット誕生を夢見て、ゆで卵を大事に抱いている{N}哀れな三男ウサギ「バリー」" idn="Bayi kelinci naif yang memegang telur dan bermimpi tentang kelahiran Pokemon."/>
	<string key="N1070004" kor="스톰 배트래빗" ger="Stormbat Rabbit" eng="Stormbat Rabbit" tur="Stormbat Rabbit" fre="Stormbat Rabbit" spa="Stormbat Rabbit" ita="Stormbat Rabbit" rus="Stormbat Rabbit" ame="Stormbat Rabbit" cns="棒球兔" tha="Stormbat Rabbit" twn="棒球兔" jap="ストームバットラビット" idn="Strombat Rabbit"/>
	<string key="T1070004" kor="절구공이 대신 야구방망이로 절구를 찍다가{N}엄마토끼한테 혼나 달에서 쫓겨난{N}가여운 둘째 토끼 ‘두리’" ger="Ein Hase mit Baseballschläger... Vorsicht!" eng="A rabbit with a bat...beware!" tur="Yarasalı bir tavşan... Dikkat et!" fre="Un lapin avec une raquette...attention!" spa="Un conejo con un Bate....Cuidado!" ita="Un coniglio con una mazza... attento!" rus="Кролик с дубинкой... Берегись!" ame="not trans" cns="叫嚣着要打出全垒打的棒球兔。" tha="กระต่ายมีปีก ระวังตัวให้ดี !" twn="沒有使用臼棒，而是使用棒球棒在搗東西，因為被{N}媽媽罵而被趕出月亮的{N}可愛老三兔‘杜利’" jap="野球バットで餅をついてママウサギに怒られた{N}気の毒な次男ウサギ「ドゥリー」" idn="Kelinci dengan alat pemukul… Hati-hati!"/>
	<string key="N1060041" kor="스몰 옥토버페스트 비어M" ger="Small OktoberfestBeer M" eng="Small OktoberfestBeer M" tur="Small OktoberfestBeer M" fre="Small OktoberfestBeer M" spa="Small OktoberfestBeer M" ita="Small OktoberfestBeer M" rus="Small Oktoberfest Beer M" ame="Small OktoberfestBeer M" cns="中杯啤酒头饰" tha="Small OktoberfestBeer M" twn="小型啤酒熊M" jap="スモールオクトーバーフェストビールM" idn="Small OktoberfestBeer M"/>
	<string key="T1060041" kor="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" ger="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" eng="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" tur="Bu başlık, dünyaca ünlü Alman Oktoberfest'in iki hafta boyunca kafasında ne olduğunu tüm ziyaretçilere gösteriyor: Sadece bira Sadece bira" fre="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" spa="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" ita="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" rus="Этот головной убор показывает, что на уме у каждого посетителя всемирно известного немецкого Октоберфеста на протяжении двух недель — только пиво." ame="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" cns="在为期两周的德国慕尼黑啤酒节，每个参与者都在头上展示了这个头饰：它只是啤酒" tha="อุปกรณ์สวมหัวที่แสดงออกบอกว่า  German Oktoberfest ผู้ลือลั่นระดับโลกนี้คิดถึงอะไรตลอด 2 อาทิตย์นั้น  แน่นอน เบียร์นั่นเอง !" twn="This headgear shows what every visitor  of the world-famous German Oktoberfest  got in his head for two weeks: it’s just beer" jap="この帽子は、世界的に有名なドイツのオクトーバーフェストのすべての訪問者の二週間の頭の中を形にしたものです。" idn="Topi yang menampilkan Oktoberfest Beer German yang sangat terkenal: itu hanya bir"/>
