	<string key="T2010009" kor="DHA와 오메가 쓰리가 풍부하게 함유된 등푸른 서브머신건 (영양소 섭취는 장담 못합니다.)" ger="Sub Machine Guns im Fisch-Design{N}mit besonders viel DHA und Omega 3{N}(wir garantieren aber keine gesunde Ernährung.)" eng="Blue fish Sub Machine Gun{N}containing plenty of DHA and Omega 3{N}(We cannot guarantee nutrition.)" tur="Bol DHA ve Omega 3 içeren{N}lüfer Sub Machine Gun{N}(Beslenme kısmını garanti edemeyiz.)" fre="Blue Fish Sub Machine Gun{N}contient beaucoup de DHA et d'Omega 3{N}(Nous ne pouvons pas garantir la nutrition.)" spa="Blue Fish Sub Machine Gun{N}contiene gran cantidad de DHA and Omega 3{N}(No podemos garantizar que sea nutritivo.)" ita="Sub Machine Gun a forma di pesce azzurro{N}contenente un sacco di DHA e Omega 3{N}(non garantiamo il potere nutritivo.)." rus="Blue Fish Sub Machine Gun{N}с высоким содержанием ДГК и других Омега-3 кислот.{N}(Мы не можем гарантировать питательную ценность.)" ame="Blue fish Sub Machine Gun{N}containing plenty of DHA and Omega 3{N}(We cannot guarantee nutrition.){N}{CB-0,255,0,255}[Operation]{N}Left click: Fire" cns="两条咸鱼改造而成的特典速射双枪。{N}使用不当的话，会被咸鱼打脸的。" tha="Blue fish Sub Machine Gun{N}ประกอบด้วย  DHA และ Omega 3 มากมี {N}(แต่เรื่องสารอาหาร เราไม่ขอรับรอง)" twn="含有豐富DHA和Omega 3的藍背雙槍 (但不能保證可以攝取營養素。)" jap="DHAたっぷり！栄養豊富な青魚サブマシンガン" idn="Blue fish Sub Machine Gun{N}yang mengandung cukup DHA dan Omega 3{N}(Kami tidak bisa menjamin nutrisi.)"/>
	<string key="F2010009" kor="유니크 발사 무기" ger="Unique Shooting Weapon" eng="Unique Shooting Weapon" tur="Benzersiz Ateşli Silah" fre="Unique Shooting Weapon" spa="Unique Shooting Weapon" ita="Unique Shooting Weapon" rus="Уникальное стрелковое оружие" ame="Unique Shooting Weapon" cns="特典远程武器" tha="Unique Shooting Weapon" twn="獨特發射武器" jap="ユニーク発射武器" idn="Senjata Tembak Unik"/>
