	<string key="N1020054" kor="할로윈 노블 로브" ger="Halloween Noble Robe" eng="Halloween Noble Robe" tur="Halloween Noble Robe" fre="Halloween Noble Robe" spa="Halloween Noble Robe" ita="Halloween Noble Robe" rus="Halloween Noble Robe" ame="Halloween Noble Robe" cns="万圣节高贵长袍" tha="Halloween Noble Robe" twn="萬聖高貴長袍" jap="ハロウィンノーブルローブ" idn="Halloween Noble Robe"/>
	<string key="T1020054" kor="할로윈 기간에만 입을 수 있는 가상공간 전용의 특수 제작 귀족 의상" ger="Ein edler Anzug, speziell kreiert ausschließlich für Halloween in der virtuellen Realität." eng="Noble dress specifically made for virtual space which can be worn during Halloween only." tur="Özel olarak sanal uzay için yapılmış, sadece Cadılar Bayramı'nda giyilebilecek asil bir elbise." fre="Robe de noble crée spécifiquement pour l'univers virtuel et pouvant uniquement être portée pendant Halloween." spa="Vestido noble diseñado específicamente para el espacio virtual que sólo puede ser usado en Halloween." ita="Abito elegante, ideato appositamente per lo spazio virtuale, che può essere indossato solo ad Halloween." rus="Великосветское платье, изготовленное специально для виртуального пространства, которое можно носить только на Хэллоуин." ame="Noble dress specifically made for virtual space which can be worn during Halloween only." cns="只有在万圣节期间才可以穿的特殊贵族服饰" tha="Noble dress ที่ถูกออกแบบมาใช้ใน virtual spaceโดยเฉพาะ สามารถใช้ได้เฉพาะในช่วงฮัลโลวีน" twn="只有在萬聖節期間才可以穿的幻想專用特殊貴族服飾" jap="ハロウィン期間中のみ着用できる仮想空間専用の特殊な貴族コスチューム" idn="Pakaian bangsawan yang dibuat khusus untuk dipakai selama Halloween."/>
	<string key="N1020053" kor="할로윈 윗치 드레스" ger="Halloween Witch Dress" eng="Halloween Witch Dress" tur="Halloween Witch Dress" fre="Halloween Witch Dress" spa="Halloween Witch Dress" ita="Halloween Witch Dress" rus="Halloween Witch Dress" ame="Halloween Witch Dress" cns="万圣节魔女礼服" tha="Halloween Witch Dress" twn="萬聖女巫洋裝" jap="ハロウィンウィッチドレス" idn="Halloween Witch Dress"/>
	<string key="T1020053" kor="할로윈 기간에만 입을 수 있는 가상공간 전용의 특수 제작 마녀 의상" ger="Ein Hexendress, speziell kreiert ausschließlich für Halloween in der virtuellen Realität." eng="Witch dress specifically made for virtual space which can worn during Halloween only." tur="Özel olarak sanal uzay için yapılmış, sadece Cadılar Bayramı'nda giyilebilecek bir cadı elbisesi." fre="Robe de sorcière crée spécifiquement pour l'univers virtuel et pouvant uniquement être portée pendant Halloween." spa="Vestido de bruja diseñado específicamente para el espacio virtual que sólo puede ser usado en Halloween." ita="Abito da strega, ideato appositamente per lo spazio virtuale, che può essere indossato solo ad Halloween." rus="Костюм ведьмы, изготовленный специально для виртуального пространства, который можно носить только на Хэллоуин." ame="Witch dress specifically made for virtual space which can worn during Halloween only." cns="只有在万圣节期间才可以穿的特殊魔女服饰" tha="Witch dress ที่ถูกออกแบบมาใช้ใน virtual space โดยเฉพาะ สามารถใช้ได้เฉพาะในช่วงฮัลโลวีน" twn="只有在萬聖節期間才可以穿的幻想專用特殊魔女服飾。" jap="ハロウィン期間中のみ着用できる仮想空間専用の特殊な魔女コスチューム" idn="Pakaian penyihir yang dibuat khusus untuk dipakai selama Halloween."/>
