	<string key="T1050048" kor="강력한 여성 파이터의 파워를 느낄 수 있는 강철 프로텍터" ger="Diese eisernen Beinschoner geben dir die Kraft einer starken Kämpferin." eng="Iron protector gives you the power of a female fighter." tur="Demir koruyucu, insana güçlü bir kadın savaşçı görünümü katar." fre="Protections en acier donnant l'apparence d'une puissante combattante." spa="Protector de hierro que te da el poder de una luchadora." ita="Protezioni che ti donano il potere di una vera lottatrice." rus="Железная защита придает тебе силу женщины-бойца." ame="Iron protector gives you the power of a female fighter." cns="将礼服采用战斗风格重新设计的铁拳鞋子" tha="Iron protector ที่ให้รูปลักษณ์ของนักสู้หญิงที่แข็งแกร่งกับคุณ" twn="可感受到強悍女鬥士力量的鋼鐵防護" jap="強力な女戦士のアイアンプロテクター" idn="Pelindung besi yang memberikanmu penampilan petarung perempuan yang kuat."/>
	<string key="N1060049" kor="빈티지 캡" ger="Vintage Cap" eng="Vintage Cap" tur="Vintage Cap" fre="Vintage Cap" spa="Vintage Cap" ita="Vintage Cap" rus="Vintage Cap" ame="Vintage Cap" cns="斗士帽子" tha="Vintage Cap" twn="夢幻帽" jap="ビンテージキャップ" idn="Vintage Cap"/>
	<string key="T1060049" kor="빈티지 스타일의 모자" ger="not trans" eng="not trans" tur="dönüş. yok" fre="not trans" spa="not trans" ita="not trans" rus="not trans" ame="not trans" cns="只有不断战斗才能得以满足的斗士帽子" tha="not trans" twn="夢幻帽" jap="ビンテージスタイル帽子" idn="Tidak bisa ditransaksikan"/>
	<string key="N2010011" kor="아야! 라이플" ger="AYA! Rifle" eng="AYA! Rifle" tur="OVV! Rifle" fre="AYA! Rifle" spa="AYA! Rifle" ita="AYA! Rifle" rus="AYA! Rifle" ame="AYA! Rifle" cns="超大号针筒" tha="AYA! Rifle" twn="AYA！ Rifle" jap="ホスピタルライフル" idn="AYA! Rifle"/>
	<string key="T2010011" kor="보기만 해도 병원의 공포가 느껴진다. 게다가 맞으면 굉장히 아프다고 한다. 아야!" ger="Der Anblick wird euch das Fürchten lehren, aber schlimmer noch werden die Schmerzen, wenn ihr getroffen werdet. Ouch!!!" eng="You will be seized with fear by just looking at it, and you will get severe pain when you are shot. Ouch!! !" tur="Sadece bakmak bile insanı korkutmaya yeter, vurulduğunda inanılmaz bir acı çekersin. Uvv!! !" fre="Tu vas être envahi par la peur simplement en le regardant, et tu risques d'avoir vraiment mal si tu te fais toucher. Aïe !! !" spa="Serás víctima del miedo con sólo mirarlo, y sufrirás un intenso dolor cuando te disparen. ¡Ay! !" ita="Rimarrai paralizzato dalla paura solo vedendolo e sentirai un dolore lancinante se sarai colpito. Ahia!!!" rus="Тебя охватит страх от одного лишь ее вида, а уж когда тебя подстрелят, боль будет нестерпимой. Ой!" ame="You will be seized with fear by just looking at it, and you will get severe pain when you are shot. Ouch!! !{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}[Operation]{N}Left click: Fire{N}Right click: Zoom-in" cns="超大号针筒造型的特典半自动步枪。{N}想起了小时候被针筒支配的恐惧了吗？啊！！！好痛！！！" tha="แค่มองดูมัน ก็น่าชะงักงันด้วยความน่ากลัวแล้ว ยิ่งถ้าโดนยิงใส่ละก็ รับรองเจ็บปวดเหลือคณานับเลยละ โอ๊ยย!" twn="光看就可以感受到無比的恐懼，如果被攻擊到一定會很痛。啊～好痛！" jap="注射器の恐怖！撃たれたら物凄く痛そう！泣いてしまいそうだ！"/>
	<string key="F2030003" kor="유니크 발사 무기" ger="Unique Shooting Weapon" eng="Unique Shooting Weapon" tur="Benzersiz Ateşli Silah" fre="Unique Shooting Weapon" spa="Unique Shooting Weapon" ita="Unique Shooting Weapon" rus="Уникальное стрелковое оружие" ame="Unique Shooting Weapon" cns="特典远程武器" tha="Unique Shooting Weapon" twn="獨特發射武器" jap="ユニーク発射武器" idn="Senjata Tembak Unik"/>
	<string key="N2030003" kor="시그널 레일건" ger="Signal Railgun" eng="Signal Railgun" tur="Signal Railgun" fre="Signal Railgun" spa="Signal Railgun" ita="Signal Railgun" rus="Signal Railgun" ame="Signal Railgun" cns="信号枪" tha="Signal Railgun" twn="電磁信號槍" jap="シグナルレールガン" idn="Signal Railgun"/>
	<string key="T2030003" kor="에너지 집중에 더 신경 써 튜닝한 저비용 고효율 만능 레일건, 더 정확하고 강력한 공격을 기대할 수 있다." ger="Kostengünstige aber hochwirksame Rail Gun, die durch Konzentration von Energie genauer ist und eine stärkere Wirkung hat." eng="Low-cost, high-efficiency Rail gun tuned to focus on concentrating energy. It has more accurate and stronger attack power." tur="Enerjiyi yoğunlaştırmaya odaklı, fiyatı düşük, etkisi yüksek Rail Gun. Daha isabetli ve etkili saldırı gücüne sahip." fre="Rail gun bon marché, très efficace, il est amélioré pour être focalisé sur la concentration d'énergie. Il est plus précis et plus puissant." spa="De bajo costo y gran eficiencia, el Railgun se calibró para centrarse en concentrar energía.  Tiene un poder de ataque más poderoso y preciso." ita="Railgun dai costi contenuti, molto efficiente ed ideata per concentrare l'energia. E' molto precisa e ha un elevato potere di attacco." rus="Недорогая и высокоэффективная рельсовая пушка, настроенная так, чтобы концентрировать энергию. Обладает более точной и мощной силой атаки." ame="Low-cost, high-efficiency Rail gun tuned to focus on concentrating energy. It has more accurate and stronger attack power.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}[Operation]{N}Left click: Fire{N}Right click: Zoom-in" cns="信号枪造型的特典轨道炮。{N}造价低、效率高，拥有更准确、更强大的攻击力。" tha="ราคาถูก แต่ก็เปี่ยมประสิทธิภามากยิ่งนัก เป็น Rail Gun ที่เน้นประสิทธิภาพเรื่องการจัดการพลังงาน และมีความแม่นยำและพลังทำลายที่สูง" twn="更加集中能量，可調整式的低費用高效能電磁槍，可期待他有更精準更強烈的攻擊。" jap="エネルギー集中力に重点をおいてチューニングしたしたレールガン。より高い精度や攻撃力を期待できる。"/>
	<string key="F2010011" kor="유니크 저격무기" ger="Unique Sniping Weapon" eng="Unique Sniping Weapon" tur="Unique Sniping Weapon" fre="Unique Sniping Weapon" spa="Unique Sniping Weapon" ita="Unique Sniping Weapon" rus="Уникальное снайперское оружие" ame="Unique Sniping Weapon" cns="特典狙击武器" tha="Unique Sniping Weapon" twn="獨特狙擊武器" jap="ユニーク狙撃武器" idn="Senjata Snipe Unik"/>
	<string key="N7000001" kor="에스퍼 칩-서브 머신 건" ger="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" eng="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" tur="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" fre="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" spa="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" ita="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" rus="Чип eSper — Submachine Gun" ame="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" cns="超能芯片-速射双枪" tha="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun" twn="超能者晶片 - 雙槍" jap="ESPチップ－サブマシンガン" idn="Esper Chip - Submachine Gun"/>
