	<string key="T5030010" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得金色半自动步枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N5030011" kor="G의 레일 건  화이트 캡슐" ger="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" eng="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" tur="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" fre="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" spa="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" ita="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" rus="G's Rail Gun White Capsule" ame="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" cns="G的白色轨道炮扭蛋" tha="G`s Rail Gun White Capsule" twn="G的白色電磁槍膠囊" jap="【G】「レールガン・ホワイト」カプセル" idn="G Rail Gun White Capsule"/>
	<string key="T5030011" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得白色轨道炮的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N6000001" kor="통합 쿠폰" ger="Integrierter Coupon" eng="Integrated Coupon" tur="Integrated Coupon" fre="Coupon intégré" spa="Coupon Integrado" ita="Coupon integrato" rus="Integrated Coupon" cns="兑换券" tha="Integrated Coupon" twn="優惠卷" jap="総合クーポン" idn="Integrated Coupon"/>
	<string key="T6000001" kor="쿠폰 샵에서 사용 할 수 있습니다." ger="Dieser Coupon kann im Coupon Shop verwendet werden." eng="This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop." tur="Bu Kupon, Kupon Mağazasında kullanılabilir." fre="Ce coupon peut être utilisé dans la boutique Coupons." spa="Este Cupón puede ser utilizado en la tienda de Cupones." ita="Questo Coupon si può usare al Coupon Shop." rus="Этот купон можно использовать в магазине купонов." cns="可以在兑换券商店使用" tha="นำคูปองนี้ไปใช้ใน  Coupon Shop  ได้" twn="在優惠卷商店可以使用。" jap="クーポンショップで使用できます。" idn="Kupon ini bisa digunakan di Toko Coupon."/>
	<string key="F1060003" kor="체이서 아이템" ger="Chaser Item" eng="Chaser Item" tur="Takipçi Eşyası" fre="Chaser Item" spa="Chaser Item" ita="Chaser Item" rus="Предмет Chaser" ame="Chaser Item" cns="追猎者道具" tha="Chaser Item" twn="追逐道具" jap="チェーサーアイテム" idn="Barang Chaser"/>
	<string key="N1070007" kor="아스테로이드 바이러스" ger="Asteroid Virus" eng="Asteroid Virus" tur="Asteroid Virus" fre="Asteroid Virus" spa="Asteroid Virus" ita="Asteroid Virus" rus="Asteroid Virus" ame="Asteroid Virus" cns="小行星病毒" tha="Asteroid Virus" twn="小行星病毒" jap="アステロイドウィルス" idn="Asteroid Virus"/>
	<string key="T1070007" kor="캐릭터를 따라다니는 체이서 모드용 액세서리 체이서가 될 경우 아스테로이드 바이러스가 등장하며 스턴 면역의 특성이 있다. 이동속도가 다른 체이서에 비해 현저히 낮다.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}체이서가 될 확률 조정가능." ger="Accessoire für den Chaser Mode.{N}Wenn du zum Chaser wirst, erscheint ein Asteroid-Virus, der dir Immunität gegen Betäubung gibt. Allerdings wird deine Bewegungsgeschwindigkeit im Vergleich zu den anderen Chaser Items erheblich verringert.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Die Wahrscheinlichkeit, Chaser zu werden, ist beeinflußbar." eng="Accessory for the Chaser Mode. When you become the Chaser, the Asteroid virus will appear and give you stun immunity. But the movement speed is remarkably low comparing to other Chaser items.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}You can change the probability for becoming a Chaser." tur="Chaser Mode için aksesuar. Takipçi olduğunda Asteroid virus ortaya çıkar ve sana sersemlemeye karşı bağışıklık verir. Fakat diğer Takipçi eşyalarıyla kıyaslandığında hareket hızı önemli derecede düşüktür.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Takipçi olma olasılığını değiştirebilirsin." fre="Accessoire pour le Mode Chaser. Lorsque tu deviens Chaser, l'Asteroid virus apparaitra et tu seras immunisé au stun. Mais la vitesse de déplacement est réduite.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Tu peux changer la probabilité de devenir chaser." spa="Cuando te conviertas en el Chaser, aparecerá el Asteroid virus y tendrás inmunidad contra el stun (aturdimiento). Pero la velocidad de movimiento será considerablemente menor a comparación con otros items Chaser.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Puedes cambiar la probabilidad para convertirte en un Chaser." ita="Accessorio per il Chaser Mode. Quando diventi Chaser, appare il virus Asteroid che ti dona immunità allo Stun. Però, la velocità di movimento è decisamente inferiore a quella degli altri oggetti per Chaser.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Puoi modificare la possibilità di diventare Chaser." rus="Аксессуар для режима Chaser. Когда ты станешь преследователем, появится вирус Asteroid и даст тебе иммунитет к оглушению. Скорость перемещения, однако, значительно ниже по сравнению с другими предметами Chaser.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Ты можешь изменить вероятность стать преследователем." ame="Accessory for the Chaser Mode. When you become the Chaser, the Asteroid virus will appear and give you stun immunity. But the movement speed is remarkably low comparing to other Chaser items.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}You can change the probability for becoming a Chaser." cns="逃亡模式用饰品，作为追猎者登场时对小行星病毒、眩晕免疫。移动速度比其他追猎者慢。{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}成为追猎者的概率可以调整。" tha="Accessory สำหรับ Chaser Mode เมื่อคุณเป็น Chaser แล้ว Asteroid virus จะปรากฏขึ้นและให้ผลต้านทานอาการ stun กับคุณ แต่กระนั้นก็ตาม ความเร็วในการเคลื่อนที่จัดว่าค่อนข้างต่ำเมื่อเทียบกับไอเทมสำหรับ Chaser อันอื่นๆ  {N}{CB-0,255,0,255} คุณสามารถเปลี่ยนอัตราการเป็น Chaser ได้" twn="如角色成為被追逐的對象時，小行星病毒會線，同時具有昏厥免疫的特性，但移動速度會比其他的追逐氣顯著地低。{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}可操控被追逐的機率。" jap="キャラクターを追っかけるチェーサーモード用アクセサリー。チェーサーに選定されたら、アステロイドウィルスが登場し、スタンに免疫ができる。移動速度が他のチェーサーに比べ、とても遅い。{N}{CB－0,255,0,255}チェーサーになる確率調整可能。" idn="Aksesoris untuk Mode Chaser. Ketika kamu menjadi Chaser, virus Asteroid akan muncul dan memberikanmu kekebalan terhadap stun. Tapi kecepatan gerak akan berkurang dibandingkan dengan barang chaser yang lain.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Kamu bisa mengubah kemungkinan menjadi Chaser."/>
	<string key="N1070008" kor="스페이스 래빗" ger="Space Rabbit" eng="Space Rabbit" tur="Space Rabbit" fre="Space Rabbit" spa="Space Rabbit" ita="Space Rabbit" rus="Space Rabbit" ame="Space Rabbit" cns="太空兔" tha="Space Rabbit" twn="太空兔" jap="スペースラビット" idn="Space Rabbit"/>
	<string key="T1070008" kor="아폴로 11호의 승무원들을 만난 이후, 우주복을 입고 무중력 놀이에 빠져버린 셋째 토끼 ‘토리’" ger="Der dritte Hase, “Tori”, spielt gerne in Raumanzügen, seitdem er die Crew von Apollo 11 getroffen hat." eng="The third rabbit “Tori” which started to enjoy playing in a space suit in zero gravity after meeting the Apollo 11 crew." tur="Apollo 11 mürettebatıyla karşılaştıktan sonra sıfır yer çekiminde uzay kıyafetiyle oyun oynamanın keyfini sürmeye başlayan üçüncü tavşan &quot;Tori&quot;." fre="Le troisième lapin &quot;Tori&quot; qui a commencé à s'amuser à jouer dans une combinaison spatiale gravité zéro après avoir rencontré l'équipe d'Apollo 11." spa="El tercer conejo “Tori” que empezó a disfrutar vestirse con un traje espacial en gravedad cero luego de conocer la tripulación del Apollo 11." ita="Il terzo coniglietto “Tori”, che ha iniziato a divertirsi con la sua tuta spaziale a gravità zero dopo aver incontrato la ciurma dell'Apollo 11." rus="Третий кролик по кличке Тори, который полюбил играть в космическом скафандре в условиях невесомости после встречи с командой «Аполлона-11»." ame="The third rabbit “Tori” which started to enjoy playing in a space suit in zero gravity after meeting the Apollo 11 crew." cns="梦想着成为第一个登月的兔子。{N}不过月球上不是已经有一只兔子了吗？" tha="The third rabbit “Tori” which started to enjoy playing in a space suit in zero gravity after meeting the Apollo 11 crew." twn="在與阿波羅11號的太空員見面之後，就愛上穿著太空裝體驗無重力感的老三兔子‘托利’。" jap="アポロ11号の乗務員に憧れ、宇宙にハマってしまった三男ウサギ「トリー」" idn="Kelinci ketiga &quot;Tori&quot; yang mulai senang bermain dalam pakaian luar angkasa pada gravitasi nol setelah menemui kru Apollo 11."/>
	<string key="N1000031"/>
