	<string key="T1070012" kor="겨울이 추워 외출할때는 꼭 외투를 꼼꼼히 챙겨입는 귀여운 꼬마 루돌프" ger="Die hübsche Baby Rudolph trägt immer einen Mantel, weil es im Winter so kalt ist." eng="Pretty baby Rudolph who wears her coat constantly because winter is too cold." tur="Kışın hava çok soğuk olduğu için sürekli paltoyla dolaşan güzel bir yavru Rudolph." fre="L'adorable bébé Rudolphette qui porte toujours son manteau car l'hiver est vraiment trop froid." spa="El hermoso Rudolph bebé que usa su chaqueta constantemente porque el invierno es muy frío." ita="Un grazioso piccolo Rudolph, che indossa sempre il cappotto perché in inverno c'è troppo freddo." rus="Прелестная малышка Рудольф, которая никогда не снимает пальто, ведь зимой так холодно!" ame="Pretty baby Rudolph who wears her coat constantly because winter is too cold." cns="因为怕冷，出门时一定要裹上好几层的小鲁道夫" tha="น้อง Rudolph ตัวน้อย ผู้ไม่เคยห่างหายจากการห่มตัวสวมเสื้อผ้า เพราะฤดูหนาวนั้นหนาวเย็นเกินไปสำหรับเธอ" twn="在寒冷冬天外出時，一定會穿上外套的可愛小魯道夫。" jap="寒がり屋の子供ルドルフ" idn="Bayi cantik Rudolph yang terus-menerus mengenakan jas miliknya karena musim dingin yang sangat dingin."/>
	<string key="N1070011" kor="꼬꼬마 루돌프" ger="Kid Rudolph" eng="Kid Rudolph" tur="Kid Rudolph" fre="Kid Rudolph" spa="Kid Rudolph" ita="Kid Rudolph" rus="Kid Rudolph" ame="Kid Rudolph" cns="迷你鲁道夫" tha="Kid Rudolph" twn="迷你魯道夫" jap="キッドルドルフ" idn="Kid Rudolph"/>
	<string key="T1070011" kor="누가 뭐래도 자신의 빨간코가 너무나 사랑스러운 깜찍이 꼬꼬마 루돌프" ger="Der niedliche Baby Rudolph liebt seine rote Nase, egal was alle anderen sagen." eng="Cute baby Rudolph who likes his red nose no matter what they say." tur="Kim ne derse desin kırmızı burnunu seven sevimli bir yavru Rudolph." fre="Le mignon bébé Rudolph qui aime son nez rouge, qu'importe ce que disent les autres." spa="El dulce Rudolph bebé que le gusta su nariz roja sin importar lo que digan." ita="Un dolcissimo piccolo Rudolph, che adora il suo naso rosso nonostante ciò che si dice in giro." rus="Милый малыш Рудольф, который любит свой красный нос, что бы там ни говорили." ame="Cute baby Rudolph who likes his red nose no matter what they say." cns="不管别人怎么说，都觉得自己的红鼻子很可爱的迷你鲁道夫" tha="น้อง Rudolph น้อยน่ารัก ผู้ชื่นชมจมูกแดงกลมของตนเป็นพิเศษ ไม่ว่าใครจะว่าอะไรก็ตาม" twn="不管誰說什麼，總是覺得自己的紅鼻子最可愛的迷你魯道夫。" jap="赤い鼻が魅力的な子供ルドルフ" idn="Bayi imut Rudolph yang menyukai hidung merahnya tidak peduli apa yang dikatakan oleh mereka."/>
	<string key="N1070010" kor="똘프" ger="Ddolph" eng="Ddolph" tur="Ddolph" fre="Ddolph" spa="Ddolph" ita="Ddolph" rus="Ddolph" ame="Ddolph" cns="鲁道夫" tha="Ddolph" twn="魯道夫" jap="ドルフ" idn="Ddolph"/>
	<string key="T1070010" kor="어릴적 빨간코 놀림에 복수하고자 몸을 키운 소심쟁이 똘프" ger="Ein schüchterner Rudolph, der extra viel trainiert hat, weil ihn seine Freunde immer wegen seiner roten Nase geärgert haben." eng="Timid Rudolph who grew strong muscles to get revenge on his friends who teased him about his red nose." tur="Kırmızı burnuyla dalga geçen arkadaşlarından intikam almak için kas yapmış çekingen Rudolph." fre="Un Rudolph timide qui a fait de la musculation pour se venger de ses amis qui se moquaient de lui à cause de son nez rouge." spa="El tímido Rudolph que desarrolló fuertes músculos para vengarse de sus amigos que se burlaban de él por su nariz roja." ita="Un timido Rudolph, che ha allenato i suoi muscoli per vendicarsi di coloro che lo hanno preso in giro per il suo naso rosso." rus="Робкий Рудольф, который хорошенько подкачался, чтобы отомстить друзьям, которые дразнили его из-за красного носа." ame="Timid Rudolph who grew strong muscles to get revenge on his friends who teased him about his red nose." cns="因为被被嘲笑是红鼻子而努力健身，随时准备复仇的鲁道夫" tha="Rudolph ผู้ขลาดกลัว หากเติบโตมาอย่างแข็งแกร่ง เปี่ยมด้วยมัดกล้ามเนื้อ และแสวงหาการแก้แค้นต่อบรรดาเพื่อนๆ ที่เคยล้อเลียนเค้าเรื่องจมูกแดง" twn="小時候因為紅鼻子被嘲笑而想要復仇努力鍛鍊身體的小心眼道夫。" jap="赤い鼻がコンプレックスの気の弱いドルフ" idn="Rudolph yang pemalu tumbuh kekar untuk membalaskan dendam temannya yang mengejek hidung merahnya."/>
	<string key="N1070009" kor="디제이 산타" ger="DJ Santa" eng="DJ Santa" tur="DJ Santa" fre="DJ Santa" spa="DJ Santa" ita="DJ Santa" rus="DJ Santa" ame="DJ Santa" cns="打碟圣诞老人" tha="DJ Santa" twn="DJ聖誕" jap="DJサンタ" idn="DJ Santa"/>
	<string key="T1070009" kor="디제잉이 적성이 맞으시다는 늦깎이 산타할아버지" ger="Ein Weihnachtsmann, der gerne ein DJ wäre." eng="A Santa Claus that loves to DJ." tur="DJ'lik yapmayı seven bir Noel Baba." fre="Un Père Noël qui aime faire le DJ." spa="Un Santa Claus que ama ser DJ." ita="Un Babbo Natale che ama fare il DJ." rus="Санта-Клаус, который обожает крутить пластинки." ame="A Santa Claus that loves to DJ." cns="对打碟很感兴趣的圣诞老人，喜欢在圣诞晚会的时候客串打碟者。" tha="Santa Claus ผู้โปรดปรานการ  DJ !" twn="非常適合擔任DJ的聖誕老公公。" jap="DJになりたいサンタお爺さん" idn="Santa Claus menyukai DJ."/>
	<string key="N2030004" kor="드래곤에이드" ger="Dragonade" eng="Dragonade" tur="Dragonade" fre="Dragonade" spa="Dragonade" ita="Dragonade" rus="Dragonade" ame="Dragonade" cns="龙息炮" tha="Dragonade" twn="龍砲" jap="ドラゴネード" idn="Dragonade"/>
	<string key="T2030004" kor="용이 쏘는 달콤쌉싸르한 에이드의 맛을 느껴보세요." ger="Sag den Gegnern ade - mit der neuen Dragonade!" eng="Experience the taste of ade which is fired from Dragonade." tur="Dragonade'in ateşini test et." fre="Dites au revoir à vos ennemis en tirant avec le Dragonade." spa="Experimenta la adrenalina que es disparada de Dragonade." ita="Assapora il gusto del fuoco infernale con il Dragonade." rus="Узнай вкус того, чем стреляет Dragonade." ame="Experience the taste of ade which is fired from Dragonade." cns="聚能炮的特典版本。{N}蕴含魔龙之怒的强大武器，可产生毁灭性的伤害。" tha="สัมผัสรสชาติของ ade !!! ที่ถูกยิงออกมาจาก Dragonade" twn="讓你的敵人嘗嘗龍砲的威力吧。" jap="ドラゴンが吐き出す強烈なブレスをいかが？" idn="Pengalaman merupakan rasa ade yang ditembakkan dari Dragonade."/>
	<string key="N2010012" kor="레이저 캣" ger="Laser Cat" eng="Laser Cat" tur="Laser Cat" fre="Laser Cat" spa="Laser Cat" ita="Laser Cat" rus="Laser Cat" ame="Laser Cat" cns="激光喵粉碎步枪" tha="Laser Cat" twn="雷射貓" jap="レーザーキャット" idn="Laser Cat"/>
	<string key="T2010012" kor="누구나 좋아하는 2가지를 합쳤다. 캣 and 레이저! 누가 레이저 캣의 승자가 될 것인가!" ger="Kombiniere zwei Dinge, die jeder mag: Katzen und Laser!! Wer wird die Laser Cat bekommen?" eng="Put together two things everybody likes. Cat and Laser!! Who will be the winner of Laser Cat!" tur="Herkesin sevdiği iki şey bir arada. Kedi ve Lazer!! Laser Cat'in kazananı kim olacak!" fre="Mettez ensemble deux choses que tout le monde aime. Chat et Laser !! Qui sera le vainqueur du Laser Cat !" spa="Junta las dos cosas que todos quieren. Cat y Laser!! ¿Quién será el ganador de Laser Cat?" ita="Unisce due cose che tutti amano. Un gatto ed il laser!! Chi riuscirà a battere il Laser Cat?" rus="Коты и лазеры — всеобщие любимцы, собранные вместе! Кто же выиграет Laser Cat?" ame="Put together two things everybody likes. Cat and Laser!! Who will be the winner of Laser Cat!" cns="猫咪造型的特典粉碎步枪。{N}哪只猫咪不喜欢激光呢！" tha="นำสองสิ่งที่ทุกคนชอบมารวมกัน แมว และ เลเซอร์ !! แล้วใครละ จะเป็นผู้ชนะ Laser Cat ไปได้ !!!" twn="將任何人都喜歡的2種元素結合在一起，貓跟雷射！誰會是勝過雷射貓的人呢！" jap="誰もが好きな二つがコラボ！猫andレーザー！誰がレーザーキャットの飼い主になるんでしょうか？" idn="Letakkan dua hal yang disukai oleh semua orang. Kucing dan laser! Yang akan menjadi pemenang Laser Cat!"/>
	<string key="N5030012" kor="G의 레이저 캣 캡슐" ger="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" eng="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" tur="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" fre="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" spa="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" ita="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" rus="G's Laser Cat Capsule" ame="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" cns="G的激光喵粉碎步枪扭蛋" tha="G`s Laser Cat Capsule" twn="G的雷射貓膠囊" jap="【G】「レーザーキャット」カプセル" idn="G Laser Cat Capsule"/>
	<string key="T5030012" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得激光喵粉碎步枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N5030013" kor="G의 스매쉬 라이플 블랙 캡슐" ger="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" eng="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" tur="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" fre="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" spa="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" ita="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" rus="G's Smash Rifle Black Capsule" ame="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" cns="G的黑色粉碎步枪扭蛋" tha="G`s Smash Rifle Black Capsule" twn="G的黑色粉粹步槍膠囊" jap="【G】「スマッシュライフル・ブラック」カプセル" idn="G Smash Rifle Black Capsule"/>
	<string key="T5030013" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得黑色粉碎步枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N6010010" kor="G의 레이저 캣 쿠폰" ger="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" eng="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" tur="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" fre="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" spa="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" ita="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" rus="G's Laser Cat Coupon" ame="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" cns="G的激光喵粉碎步枪兑换券" tha="G`s Laser Cat Coupon" twn="G的雷射貓禮券" jap="【G】「レーザーキャット」クーポン" idn="G Laser Cat Coupon"/>
	<string key="T6010010" kor="G의 레이저 캣 캡슐을 통해서 지급되는 이벤트용 쿠폰" ger="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" eng="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" tur="Bu Kupon, bir etkinlik için kullanılabilir. Yaklaşan etkinlikler için haberleri düzenli olarak takip et!" fre="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" spa="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" ita="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" rus="Этот купон можно использовать для какого-нибудь события. Следи за новостями о предстоящих событиях!" ame="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" cns="在“G的激光喵粉碎步枪扭蛋”中获得的活动兑换券" tha="คูปองสำหรับ event  คอยติดตามเกาะกระแสข่าวของ event ที่กำลังมาให้ดีละ !" twn="透過G的雷射貓膠囊獲得的活動用禮券" jap="【G】「レーザーキャット」カプセルから入手できるイベントクーポン" idn="Coupon ini bisa digunakan untuk event. Periksalah berita untuk event yang akan datang!"/>
	<string key="N6010011" kor="G의 스매쉬 라이플 블랙 쿠폰" ger="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" eng="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" tur="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" fre="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" spa="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" ita="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" rus="G's Smash Rifle Black Coupon" ame="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" cns="G的黑色粉碎步枪兑换券" tha="G`s Smash Rifle Black Coupon" twn="G的黑色粉粹步槍禮券" jap="【G】「スマッシュライフル・ブラック」クーポン" idn="G Smash Rifle Black Coupon"/>
	<string key="T6010011" kor="G의 스매쉬 라이플 블랙 캡슐을 통해서 지급되는 이벤트용 쿠폰" ger="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" eng="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" tur="Bu Kupon, bir etkinlik için kullanılabilir. Yaklaşan etkinlikler için haberleri düzenli olarak takip et!" fre="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" spa="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" ita="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" rus="Этот купон можно использовать для какого-нибудь события. Следи за новостями о предстоящих событиях!" ame="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" cns="在“G的黑色粉碎步枪扭蛋”中获得的活动兑换券" tha="คูปองสำหรับ event  คอยติดตามเกาะกระแสข่าวของ event ที่กำลังมาให้ดีละ !" twn="透過G的黑色粉粹步槍膠囊獲得的活動用禮券" jap="【G】「スマッシュライフル・ブラック」カプセルから入手できるイベントクーポン" idn="Coupon ini bisa digunakan untuk event. Periksalah berita untuk event yang akan datang!"/>
	<string key="N5030014" kor="G의 드래곤에이드 캡슐" ger="G`s Dragonade Capsule" eng="G`s Dragonade Capsule" tur="G`s Dragonade Capsule" fre="G`s Dragonade Capsule" spa="G`s Dragonade Capsule" ita="G`s Dragonade Capsule" rus="G's Dragonade Capsule" ame="G`s Dragonade Capsule" cns="G的黑色龙息炮扭蛋" tha="G`s Dragonade Capsule" twn="G的龍砲膠囊" jap="【G】「ドラゴネード」カプセル" idn="G Dragonade Capsule"/>
	<string key="T5030014" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得黑色龙息炮的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N5030015" kor="G의 캐노네이드 블랙 캡슐" ger="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" eng="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" tur="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" fre="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" spa="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" ita="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" rus="G's Cannonade Black Capsule" ame="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" cns="G的黑色聚能炮扭蛋" tha="G`s Cannonade Black Capsule" twn="G的黑色火砲彈膠囊" jap="【G】「キャノネード・ブラック」カプセル" idn="G Cannonade Black Capsule"/>
