	<string key="N6010017" kor="G의 드라큘라 라이플 쿠폰" ger="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" eng="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" tur="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" fre="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" spa="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" ita="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" rus="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" ame="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" cns="G的德古拉吉他兑换券" tha="G's Dracula Rifle Coupon" twn="G的吸血鬼禮券" jap="【G】「ドラキュラライフル」クーポン" idn="G Dracula Rifle Coupon"/>
	<string key="T6010017" kor="G의 드라큘라 라이플 캡슐을 통해서 지급되는 쿠폰 이벤트 쿠폰" ger="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" eng="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" tur="Bu Kupon, bir etkinlik için kullanılabilir. Yaklaşan etkinlikler için haberleri düzenli olarak takip et!" fre="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" spa="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" ita="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" rus="Этот купон можно использовать для какого-нибудь события. Следи за новостями о предстоящих событиях!" ame="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" cns="在“G的德古拉吉他扭蛋”中获得的活动兑换券" tha="คูปองสำหรับ event  คอยติดตามเกาะกระแสข่าวของ event ที่กำลังมาให้ดีละ !" twn="透過G的吸血鬼膠囊所獲的活動禮券。" jap="【G】「ドラキュラライフル」カプセルから入手できるイベントクーポン" idn="Coupon ini bisa digunakan untuk event. Periksalah berita untuk event yang akan datang!"/>
	<string key="N6010018" kor="G의 가우스 라이플 블랙 쿠폰" ger="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" eng="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" tur="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" fre="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" spa="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" ita="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" rus="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" ame="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" cns="G的黑色高斯步枪兑换券" tha="G's Gauss Rifle Black Coupon" twn="G的黑色高斯步槍禮券" jap="【G】「ガウスライフル・ブラック」クーポン" idn="G Gauss Rifle Black Coupon"/>
