	<string key="T6010020" kor="G의 핸드건 블루 캡슐을 통해서 지급되는 쿠폰 이벤트 쿠폰" ger="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" eng="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" tur="Bu Kupon, bir etkinlik için kullanılabilir. Yaklaşan etkinlikler için haberleri düzenli olarak takip et!" fre="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" spa="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" ita="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" rus="Этот купон можно использовать для какого-нибудь события. Следи за новостями о предстоящих событиях!" ame="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" cns="在“G的蓝色手枪扭蛋”中获得的活动兑换券" tha="คูปองสำหรับ event  คอยติดตามเกาะกระแสข่าวของ event ที่กำลังมาให้ดีละ !" twn="透過G的藍色手槍膠囊所獲的活動禮券。" jap="【G】「ハンドガン・ブルー」カプセルから入手できるイベントクーポン" idn="Coupon ini bisa digunakan untuk event. Periksalah berita untuk event yang akan datang!"/>
	<string key="N2010014" kor="토이건" ger="Toy Gun" eng="Toy Gun" tur="Toy Gun" fre="Toy Gun" spa="Toy Gun" ita="Toy Gun" rus="Toy Gun" ame="Toy Gun" cns="玩具枪" tha="Toy Gun" twn="玩具槍" jap="トイガン" idn="Toy Gun"/>
	<string key="T2010014" kor="어렸을때 즐겨 가지고 놀았던 장난감 총 컨셉의 핸드건" ger="Spielzeug-Hand Gun, die es aber in sich hat." eng="Hand Gun with a toy gun concept used during childhood." tur="Çocukluk döneminde kullanılan oyuncak silah konseptine sahip bir Hand Gun." fre="Une arme de poing avec le style d'un jouet d'enfant." spa="Hand Gun de estilo arma de juguete utilizado durante la niñez." ita="Hand Gun che ricorda le pistole giocattolo usate dai bambini." rus="Hand Gun, напоминающий игрушечный пистолет из детства." ame="Hand Gun with a toy gun concept used during childhood." cns="玩具枪造型的特典手枪。{N}还记得当年爸爸给买的生日礼物吗？举起手来！" tha="ปืนพกกับแนวคิดปืนของเล่นที่ทำมาให้เด็กๆ ใช้" twn="根據小時候把玩的玩具槍模型所製作的手槍" jap="子供の頃よく遊んだおもちゃの銃をコンセプトしたハンドガン" idn="Hand Gun dengan konsep pistol mainan yang digunakan oleh anak-anak."/>
	<string key="N4030023" kor="아케이드 노멀 캡슐" ger="Arcade Nomal Capsule" eng="Arcade Nomal Capsule" tur="Arcade Nomal Capsule" fre="Arcade Nomal Capsule" spa="Arcade Nomal Capsule" ita="Arcade Nomal Capsule" rus="Arcade Nomal Capsule" ame="Arcade Nomal Capsule" cns="普通剧情挑战扭蛋" tha="Arcade Nomal Capsule" twn="普通任務膠囊" jap="アーケードノーマルカプセル" idn="Arcade Nomal Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030023" kor="아케이드 노멀 모드의 모든 스테이지 클리어 시 주는 캡슐 아이템{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule gibt es als Belohnung beim Abschluß aller Abschnitte im Normalen Mode.{N}Wenn du sie nutzt, erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Normal Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" tur="Normal Modun tüm aşamaları geçilince verilen kapsül.{N}Kapsülü kullanırsan şu eşyalardan birini alırsın:" fre="Capsule pouvant être obtenue en terminant tous les stages du Normal Mode.{N}Si tu utilises la Capsules, tu pourras obtenir une récompense au hasard{N}dans 3 catégories différentes comportant les items suivants." spa="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Normal Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" ita="La Capsule assegnata al completamento di tutte le fasi del Normal Mode.{N}Utilizzandola, ottieni i seguenti oggetti." rus="Эта капсула выдается за прохождение всех этапов в обычном режиме.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь один из следующих предметов:" ame="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Normal Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}eSper Chip: HP +1, EXP Up+5%{N}Pirate Jacket, Open Shoulder Gown, Captain Guard Upper Suits, Space Suit: None{N}and PEN(800~50000)" cns="通关剧情挑战普通难度，可以获得该扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลที่มอบให้คุณ เมื่อคุณเคลียร์ฉากทั้งหมดใน normal mode ได้ {N} เมื่อคุณกดใช้ คุณจะได้รับหนึ่งในไอเทม จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="在完成Arcade普通模式的所有關卡後所支付的膠囊道具{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="アーケードモード(ノーマル)の全てのステージをクリアするともらえるカプセルアイテム{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、シナリオアーケードモードに出現するキャラクターのコスチュームがランダムで獲得できます。" idn="Kapsul yang akan diberikan jika kamu menyelesaikan semua stage Mode Normal.{N}Jika kamu menggunakan kapsul, salah satu barang berikut akan diberikan padamu:"/>
	<string key="N4030024" kor="아케이드 하드 캡슐" ger="Arcade Hard Capsule" eng="Arcade Hard Capsule" tur="Arcade Hard Capsule" fre="Arcade Hard Capsule" spa="Arcade Hard Capsule" ita="Arcade Hard Capsule" rus="Arcade Hard Capsule" ame="Arcade Hard Capsule" cns="困难剧情挑战扭蛋" tha="Arcade Hard Capsule" twn="困難任務膠囊" jap="アーケードハードカプセル" idn="Arcade Hard Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030024" kor="아케이드 하드 모드의 모든 스테이지 클리어 시 주는 캡슐 아이템{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule gibt es als Belohnung beim Abschluß aller Abschnitte im Hard Mode.{N}Wenn du sie nutzt, erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Hard Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" tur="Hard Modun tüm aşamaları geçilince verilen kapsül.{N}Kapsülü kullanırsan şu eşyalardan birini alırsın:" fre="Capsule pouvant être obtenue en terminant tous les stages du Hard Mode.{N}Si tu utilises la Capsules, tu pourras obtenir une récompense au hasard{N}dans 3 catégories différentes comportant les items suivants." spa="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Hard Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" ita="La Capsule assegnata al completamento di tutte le fasi dell'Hard Mode.{N}Utilizzandola, ottieni i seguenti oggetti." rus="Эта капсула выдается за прохождение всех этапов в cложном режиме.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь один из следующих предметов:" ame="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Hard Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}eSper Chip: HP +2, EXP Up+8%{N}Pirate Jacket, Open Shoulder Gown, Captain Guard Upper Suits, Space Suit: All weapons +3{N}and PEN(800~50000)" cns="通关剧情挑战困难难度，可以获得该扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลที่มอบให้คุณ เมื่อคุณเคลียร์ฉากทั้งหมดใน Hard mode ได้ {N} เมื่อคุณกดใช้ คุณจะได้รับหนึ่งในไอเทม จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="在完成Arcade困難模式的所有關卡後所支付的膠囊道具{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="アーケードモード(ハード)の全てのステージをクリアするともらえるカプセルアイテム{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、シナリオアーケードモードに出現するキャラクターのコスチュームがランダムで獲得できます。" idn="Kapsul yang akan diberikan jika kamu menyelesaikan semua stage Mode Susah.{N}Jika kamu menggunakan kapsul, salah satu barang berikut akan diberikan padamu:"/>
	<string key="N4030025" kor="아케이드 에스퍼 캡슐" ger="Arcade Esper Capsule" eng="Arcade Esper Capsule" tur="Arcade Esper Capsule" fre="Arcade Esper Capsule" spa="Arcade Esper Capsule" ita="Arcade Esper Capsule" rus="Arcade Esper Capsule" ame="Arcade Esper Capsule" cns="绝境剧情挑战扭蛋" tha="Arcade Esper Capsule" twn="S4任務膠囊" jap="アーケードエキスパートカプセル" idn="Arcade Esper Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030025" kor="아케이드 에스퍼 모드의 모든 스테이지 클리어 시 주는 캡슐 아이템{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule gibt es als Belohnung beim Abschluß aller Abschnitte im eSper Mode.{N}Wenn du sie nutzt, erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of eSper Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" tur="ESper Modunun tüm aşamaları geçilince verilen kapsül.{N}Kapsülü kullanırsan şu eşyalardan birini alırsın:" fre="Capsule pouvant être obtenue en terminant tous les stages de l'eSper Mode.{N}Si tu utilises la Capsules, tu pourras obtenir une récompense au hasard{N}dans 3 catégories différentes comportant les items suivants." spa="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of eSper Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" ita="La Capsule assegnata al completamento di tutte le fasi dell'eSper Mode.{N}Utilizzandola, ottieni i seguenti oggetti." rus="Эта капсула выдается за прохождение всех этапов в режиме eSper.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь один из следующих предметов:" ame="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of eSper Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}eSper Chip: HP +3, EXP Up+10%{N}Pirate Jacket, Open Shoulder Gown, Captain Guard Upper Suits, Space Suit: All weapons +3{N}and PEN(800~50000)" cns="通关剧情挑战绝境难度，可以获得该扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลที่มอบให้คุณ เมื่อคุณเคลียร์ฉากทั้งหมดใน eSper mode ได้ {N} เมื่อคุณกดใช้ คุณจะได้รับหนึ่งในไอเทม จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="在完成Arcade艱深模式的所有關卡後所支付的膠囊道具{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="アーケードモード(エキスパート)の全てのステージをクリアするともらえるカプセルアイテム{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、シナリオアーケードモードに出現するキャラクターのコスチュームがランダムで獲得できます。" idn="Kapsul yang akan diberikan jika kamu menyelesaikan semua stage Mode eSper.{N}Jika kamu menggunakan kapsul, salah satu barang berikut akan diberikan padamu:"/>
	<string key="N1060065" kor="에그 펌비" ger="Egg Fumbi" eng="Egg Fumbi" tur="Egg Fumbi" fre="Egg Fumbi" spa="Egg Fumbi" ita="Egg Fumbi" rus="Egg Fumbi" ame="Egg Fumbi" cns="鸡蛋波比" tha="Egg Fumbi" twn="蛋型Fumbi" jap="エッグファンビ" idn="Egg Fumbi"/>
	<string key="T1060065" kor="부활절 이벤트에만 찾아오는 작지만 든든한 베이비 펌비" ger="Ein niedlicher Baby Fumbi, der sich nur zu Ostern blicken lässt." eng="Cutie Baby Fumbi which only comes at Easter." tur="Sadece Paskalya'da gelen sevimli yavru Fumbi." fre="Un adorable bébé Fumbi qui apparaît uniquement pour Pâques." spa="Hermoso Fumbi bebé que sólo viene en Pascuas." ita="Un grazioso Baby Fumbi che compare solo a Pasqua." rus="Миленький малыш Fumbi, который появляется только на Пасху." ame="Cutie Baby Fumbi which only comes at Easter." cns="只有在复活节活动见到的鸡蛋波比" tha="น้อง Fumbi น้อยน่ารัก ที่มาในช่วงอีสเตอร์เท่านั้น" twn="配合復活節活動所推出的Baby Fumbi" jap="復活祭イベント時期のみ訪れる子供ファンビ" idn="Bayi Fumbi imut yang hanya datang saat Paskah."/>
	<string key="N4030026" kor="이스터 캡슐" ger="Easter Egg" eng="Easter Egg" tur="Easter Egg" fre="Easter Egg" spa="Easter Egg" ita="Easter Egg" rus="Easter Egg" ame="Easter Egg" cns="复活节扭蛋" tha="Easter Egg" twn="復活節膠囊" jap="イースターカプセル" idn="Easter Egg"/>
	<string key="T4030026" kor="부활절 이벤트용 캡슐" ger="Aus dieser Osterkapsel könnt ihr mit etwas Glück den Osterfumbi bekommen.{N}Die folgenden Items können in der Kapsel enthalten sein:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Osterfumbi mit Smart Pack Effekt (1/7/30 Tage/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 Tage){N}PEN(300PEN~50.000PEN)." eng="Easter Capsule which can give you the Egg Fumbi.{N} Following items will be randomly given to you.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi with Smart Pack(1/7/30days/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30days){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." tur="Egg Fumbi veren bir Easter Capsule.{N} Şu eşyalar Rasgele verilecek.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi ve Smart Pack(1/7/30gün/Kalıcı){N}Kıskançlık Bekçisi SP+6 (1/30gün){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." fre="Une Easter Capsule qui te fera peut-être obtenir l'Egg Fumbi.{N} Les items suivants peuvent être obtenus aléatoirement.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi avec Smart Pack(1/7/30jours/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30jours){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." spa="Easter Capsule que puede darte el Egg Fumbi.{N} Los siguientes ítems serán dados al azar:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi con Smart Pack(1/7/30días/Permanente){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30días){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." ita="Una Capsule di Pasqua con cui puoi ottenere un Egg Fumbi.{N}Sono assegnati in modo casuale i seguenti oggetti.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi con Smart Pack (1/7/30 giorni/permanente){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 giorni){N}PEN (300 PEN~50.000 PEN)." rus="Из этой Пасхальной капсулы можно получить Egg Fumbi.{N} Ты получишь следующие случайные предметы:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi со Smart Pack (действует 1, 7, 30 дней или бессрочно){N}Envy Ranger SP +6 (действует 1 или 30 дней){N}300–50 000 PEN." ame="Easter Capsule which can give you the Egg Fumbi.{N} Following items will be randomly given to you.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi with Smart Pack(1/7/30days/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30days){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." cns="复活节活动用扭蛋" tha="Easter Capsule which can give you the Egg Fumbi.{N} Following items will be randomly given to you." twn="復活節活動用膠囊" jap="復活祭イベント用カプセル" idn="Kapsul Paskah yang akan memberikan Egg Fumbi padamu.{N}Barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi dengan Smart Pack(1/7/30 hari/Permanen){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 hari){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)."/>
	<string key="N1060066" kor="화이트데이 사탕" cns="情人节糖果" twn="白色情人節糖果" jap="ホワイトデーキャンディ"/>
	<string key="T1060066" kor="사랑하는 그녀에게 캔디와 같은 달콤한 마음을 전달하세요." cns="给心爱的她传递像糖一样甜蜜的真心" twn="把甜甜的糖果和甜蜜的心一起交給心愛的她吧。" jap="愛しい彼女にキャンディのような甘い気持ちを伝えて下さい。"/>
	<string key="N4030027" kor="성 패트릭의 날 기념 무기 캡슐" ger="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" eng="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" tur="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" fre="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" spa="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" ita="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" rus="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" ame="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" cns="圣帕特里克节武器扭蛋" tha="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" twn="聖派翠克日紀念武器膠囊" jap="セイントパトリックデー記念武器カプセル" idn="St. Patrick Day Green Weapon Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030027" kor="성 패트릭 데이를 기념하기 위해 발매된 초록빛 가득한 무기 캡슐! 캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." eng="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." tur="St. Patrick Günü'ne özel yeşil silah kapsülü. Kapsülden şu eşyalar Rasgele şekilde verilir." fre="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." spa="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." ita="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." rus="Капсула с зеленым оружием в честь Дня святого Патрика. Из этой капсулы ты получишь следующие случайные предметы:" ame="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Green Sub Machine Gun(Attack +6), Green Semi Rifle(Attack +6), Green Smash Rifle(Attack +6): 1day/7days/30days.{N}PEN(300PEN~50000PEN)" cns="为纪念圣帕特里克节而推出的武器扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具" tha="Green weapon Capsule สำหรับการเฉลิมฉลองวันนักบุญ Patricks  คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมแบบสุ่มได้จากรายชื่อดังนี้:" twn="為紀念聖佩特利之日所發行的充滿綠光的武器膠囊！使用膠囊道具時，如下道具會隨機獲得。" jap="セイントパトリックデーを記念し発売された、緑色いっぱいの武器カプセル！カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul senjata hijau untuk merayakan hari St. Patrick, barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak dari kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4030028" kor="성 패트릭의 날 기념 코스튬 캡슐(남)" ger="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" eng="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" tur="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" fre="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" spa="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" ita="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" rus="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule (мужская)" ame="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" cns="圣帕特里克节男性套装扭蛋" tha="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" twn="聖派翠克日紀念服飾膠囊(男)" jap="セイントパトリックデー記念コスチュームカプセル(男)" idn="St. Patrics Day Green Costume Capsule (laki-laki)"/>
	<string key="T4030028" kor="성 패트릭 데이를 기념하기 위해 발매된 초록빛 가득한 남자 코스튬 캡슐! 캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." eng="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." tur="St. Patrick Günü'ne özel yeşil erkek kostümü kapsülü. Kapsülden şu eşyalar Rasgele şekilde verilir." fre="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." spa="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." ita="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." rus="Капсула с зеленым мужским костюмом в честь Дня святого Патрика. Из этой капсулы ты получишь следующие случайные предметы:" ame="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Green Guardian Armor(Attack +8 for all weapons), Green Activity Suit(Attack +8 for all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}Green Guardian Plate(Defense +9 against all weapons), Green Activity Pants(Defense +9 against all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}PEN(300PEN~50000PEN)" cns="为纪念圣帕特里克节而推出的男性套装扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具" tha="Green male Costume Capsule สำหรับการเฉลิมฉลองวันนักบุญ Patricks  คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมแบบสุ่มได้จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="為紀念聖佩特利之日所發行的充滿綠光的男性服飾膠囊！使用膠囊道具時，如下道具會隨機獲得。" jap="セイントパトリックデーを記念し発売された、緑色いっぱいの男性コスチュームカプセル！カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul kostum  hijau laki-laki untuk merayakan hari St. Patrick, barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak dari kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4030029" kor="성 패트릭의 날 기념 코스튬 캡슐(여)" ger="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" eng="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" tur="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" fre="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" spa="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" ita="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" rus="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule (женская)" ame="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" cns="圣帕特里克节女性套装扭蛋" tha="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" twn="聖派翠克日記念服飾膠囊(女)" jap="セイントパトリックデー記念コスチュームカプセル" idn="St. Patrick Day Green Costume Capsule (perempuan)"/>
	<string key="T4030029" kor="성 패트릭 데이를 기념하기 위해 발매된 초록빛 가득한 여자 코스튬 캡슐! 캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." eng="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." tur="St. Patrick Günü'ne özel yeşil kadın kostümü kapsülü. Kapsülden şu eşyalar Rasgele şekilde verilir." fre="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." spa="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." ita="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." rus="Капсула с зеленым женским костюмом в честь Дня святого Патрика. Из этой капсулы ты получишь следующие случайные предметы:" ame="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Green Indian Shirt(Attack +8 for all weapons), Green Sentimental Corset(Attack +8 for all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}Green Indian Mode Pants(Defense +9 against all weapons), Green Sentimental Pleats(Defense +9 against all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}PEN(300PEN~50000PEN)" cns="为纪念圣帕特里克节而推出的女性套装扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具" tha="Green female Costume Capsule สำหรับการเฉลิมฉลองวันนักบุญ Patricks  คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมแบบสุ่มได้จากรายชื่อดังนี้:" twn="為紀念聖佩特利之日所發行的充滿綠光的女性服飾膠囊！使用膠囊道具時，如下道具會隨機獲得。" jap="セイントパトリックデーを記念し発売された、緑色いっぱいの女性コスチュームカプセル！カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul kostum  hijau perempuan untuk merayakan hari St. Patrick, barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak dari kapsul."/>
	<string key="N3080001" kor="메탈릭" ger="Metallic" eng="Metallic" tur="Metallic" fre="Metallic" spa="Metallic" ita="Metallic" rus="Metallic" ame="Metallic" cns="合金护甲" tha="Metallic" twn="金屬防彈" jap="メタリック" idn="Metallic"/>
	<string key="T3080001" kor="신체를 단단한 강철로 바꾸어 탄환을 튕겨내는 방어형 스킬. 사용 중에는 이동할 수 없다. 메탈릭 상태에서는 체력이 서서히 회복되며 방어력이 상승함과 동시에 받은 데미지의 일부분을 공격한 사람에게 되돌려 준다." ger="Dieser defensive Skill verwandelt den Körper in harten Stahl, wodurch Kugeln abprallen. Während dieser Skill aktiv ist, kann der Charakter nicht bewegt werden. Im Metallic-Status erhält der Charakter kontinuierlich HP und die Verteidigung wird erhöht. Gleichzeitig wird Schaden auf den Angreifer zurückreflektiert." eng="Defensive skill bounces off bullets by changing the character’s body to hard steel. The character cannot move while he uses the skill. On Metallic status, a character gets his HP gradually and defensive power increases as well. At the same time, it gives the damage back to the attacker." tur="Karakterin vücudunu sert bir çeliğe dönüştürerek mermileri sektiren bir savunma becerisi. Karakter bu beceriyi kullanırken hareket edemez. Metallic durumdayken karakter savunma gücünü ve HP'sini yavaş yavaş yeniler. Ayrıca bu beceri, hasarı tekrar saldıran kişiye gönderir." fre="Skill défensif qui fait rebondir les balles en transformant le corps du personnage en acier résistant. Le  personnage ne peut pas bouger pendant qu'il utilise le skill. Pendant le statut Metallic, le personnage obtient régulièrement des HP et sa défense augmente aussi. En même temps, il renvoit les dégats aux attaquants." spa="Skill defensivo que rebota las balas convirtiendo  el cuerpo del personaje en  acero  duro. El personaje no puede moverse mientras usa el skill. En el estado Metallico, el  personaje recupera su HP gradualmente y su poder defensivo aumenta también. Al mismo tiempo  devuelve el daño de vuelta al atacante," ita="Skill difensiva che fa rimbalzare i proiettili rendendo d'acciaio il corpo del personaggio. Con Metallic, il personaggio recupera gradualmente gli HP e aumenta la difesa. Allo stesso tempo, restitusce il danno al nemico che lo attacca." rus="Это оборонительное умение заставляет пули отскакивать, превратив тело персонажа в твердую сталь. Во время использования умения персонаж не может двигаться. В состоянии Metallic постепенно восполняется HP и увеличивается сила защиты, а любой наносимый урон отражается обратно на атакующего." ame="Defensive skill bounces off bullets by changing the character’s body to hard steel. The character cannot move while he uses the skill. On Metallic status, a character gets his HP gradually and defensive power increases as well. At the same time, it gives the damage back to the attacker.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}[Operation]{N}SHIFT" cns="把身体变为坚硬钢铁的防御性技能。使用时无法移动。在合金护甲状态时生命会慢慢恢复，防御力上升的同时，会将遭受的部分伤害反弹给攻击者。" tha="Skill ป้องกัน ที่ช่วยให้คุณสามารถสะท้อนกระสุนไปได้ ด้วยการเปลี่ยนร่างกายไปเป็นเหล็กกล้า ขณะที่ใช้ skill นี้ คุณจะไม่สามารถเคลื่อนที่ได้  และระหว่างอยู่ในสภาวะ Metallic นี้ คุณจะได้รับ Hp ฟื้นคืนเรื่อยๆ พร้อมกับพลังป้องกันที่เพิ่มขึ้น และในเวลาเดียวกัน ก็ช่วยสะท้อนความเสียหายกลับหาฝ่ายที่โจมตีเข้ามาใส่ด้วย" twn="將身體變成為堅固的鋼鐵，同時可以防禦子彈的防禦型技能。使用中無法進行移動，在金屬防彈的狀態下，體力會慢慢地恢復，在提升防禦力的同時，獲得的一部分傷害會反彈回去給進行攻擊的人。" jap="身体を鋼に変え、弾丸を跳ね返す防御目的の特殊能力。使用している時には移動ができない。メタリック状態では、体力が徐々に回復され、防御力も上昇する他、受けたダメージの一部を攻撃者に返す。" idn="Skill pertahanan yang memantulkan peluru dengan mengubah tubuh karakter menjadi baja yang keras. Karakter tidak bisa bergerak sementara menggunakan skill ini. Dalam status Metallic, HP dan pertahanan karakter akan meningkat drastis. Pada saat yang sama, bisa mengembalikan serangan pada penyerang."/>
	<string key="N2060003" kor="하트 오브 프린세스" ger="Heart Of Princess" eng="Heart Of Princess" tur="Heart Of Princess" fre="Heart Of Princess" spa="Heart Of Princess" ita="Heart Of Princess" rus="Heart Of Princess" ame="Heart Of Princess" cns="魔法仙女棒" tha="Heart Of Princess" twn="公主之心" jap="ハート・オブ・プリンセス" idn="Heart Of Princess"/>
	<string key="T2060003" kor="당신을 감싸는 따사롭고 신비한 오로라가 느껴집니다! 머나먼 나라에서 온 공주님의 따뜻한 사랑을 느껴보아요~♡" ger="Auch aus größerer Entfernung kann man die Hoffnung spüren und die wärmende Liebe der Prinzessin fühlen." eng="You can feel the mysterious aurora and the warm love from the princess from far far away." tur="Uzak diyalardaki prensesin gizemli aurasını ve sıcak sevgisini hissedebilirsin." fre="Vous pouvez sentir l'aura d'amour mystérieux et chaleureux de la princesse de Fort Fort Lointain" spa="Puedes sentir la  aurora misteriosa y el amor cálido de la princesa desde un lugar muy, muy lejano." ita="Puoi sentire l'aura misteriosa e il calore dell'amore della principessa da molto lontano." rus="Почувствуй таинственное сияние и горячую любовь принцессы, живущей за тридевять земель." ame="You can feel the mysterious aurora and the warm love from the princess from far far away." cns="拥有魔法仙女力量的特典治愈能量。{N}魔法仙女的强大魔力，不论多重的伤都能治愈。" tha="คุณสามารถสัมผัสได้ถึงออโรร่าแห่งความรักอันอบอุ่นได้จากเจ้าหญิงในที่ห่างไกล" twn="可以感受到包圍著您的溫暖神秘曙光！快來感受由遠方國家來的公主所傳達的溫暖之愛~♡" idn="Kamu bisa merasakan aurora misterius dan kehangatan cinta dari putri dari jauh."/>
	<string key="N1020069" kor="코튼 캣 보이 자켓" ger="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" eng="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" tur="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" fre="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" spa="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" ita="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" rus="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" ame="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" cns="软嘟嘟男孩夹克" tha="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket" twn="棉花貓男孩外套" jap="コットンキャットボーイジャケット" idn="Cotton Cat Boy Jacket"/>
