	<string key="T1060068" kor="금방이라도 '야옹~'하고 울 것 같은 아기 고양이를 닮은 모자" ger="Diese Mütze erinnert an eine leidvoll miauende Katze." eng="Baby kitten's cap looking as if it would meow with sorrow." tur="Sanki kederle miyavlayacakmış gibi görünen yavru kedi şapkası." fre="Une casquette de chaton qui regarde comme si il miaulait avec tristesse." spa="Gorro de gatito que parece como si maullara de pena." ita="Copricapo che ricorda un micino che miagola." rus="Шапочка котенка, которая выглядит так, словно вот-вот грустно замяукает." ame="Baby kitten's cap looking as if it would meow with sorrow." cns="联想到初生婴儿的女性帽子" tha="หมวกลูกแมวตัวน้อย ที่ดูเหมือนกับว่ามันจะร้องเหมียวอย่างเศร้าๆ ออกมาได้" twn="感覺隨時都會'喵嗚~'叫出來的小貓咪帽" idn="Topi bayi kucing yang tampak seolah mengeong karena sedih."/>
	<string key="N2020004" kor="메탈 스톰" ger="Metal Storm" eng="Metal Storm" tur="Metal Storm" fre="Metal Storm" spa="Metal Storm" ita="Metal Storm" rus="Metal Storm" ame="Metal Storm" cns="金属风暴" tha="Metal Storm" twn="金屬風暴" jap="メタルストーム" idn="Metal Storm"/>
	<string key="T2020004" kor="무수한 탄환이 지면을 붉게 달군다! 그야말로 탄환의 폭풍!" ger="Diese Waffe wird das Schlachtfeld blutrot färben." eng="The battleground gets heated up in red by countless bullets." tur="Savaş alanı, sayısız merminin kızıllığıyla ısınır." fre="Le sol est réchauffé par d'innombrables balles." spa="El campo de batalla se tiñe de rojo por las innumerables balas." ita="Il campo di battaglia diventa infuocato con i proiettili infiniti." rus="Бесчисленные пули раскаляют поле битвы докрасна." ame="Le sol est réchauffé par d'innombrables balles." cns="拥有无可匹敌的重火力的特典加特林。{N}以一己之力发射出金属的风暴，让敌人体验到枪林弹雨的感觉吧！" tha="สนามรบร้อนระอุแดงเดือดด้วยกระสุนจำนวนนับไม่ถ้วน" twn="無數的子彈讓地面變得非常地火熱！ 這才叫做真正的子彈風暴！" jap="無数の弾丸が大地を燃やす！来たれ、弾丸の嵐！" idn="Situasi battleground menjadi panas karena peluru yang tidak terhitung."/>
	<string key="F2020004" kor="유니크 중화기" ger="not trans" eng="not trans" tur="dönüş. yok" fre="not trans" spa="not trans" ita="not trans" rus="not trans" ame="not trans" cns="特典重型武器" tha="not trans" twn="獨特重武器" jap="ユニーク重火器" idn="Tidak bisa ditransaksikan"/>
	<string key="N2000007" kor="루시퍼" ger="Lucifer" eng="Lucifer" tur="Lucifer" fre="Lucifer" spa="Lucifer" ita="Lucifer" rus="Lucifer" ame="Lucifer" cns="路西法之剑" tha="Lucifer" twn="魔王劍" jap="ルシフェル" idn="Lucifer"/>
	<string key="T2000007" kor="타락한 자의 교만을 형상화한  대검. 어둡지만 강력한 힘을 느낄 수 있다." ger="Die Teufelsschwert" eng="The Devil's Sword" tur="Şeytanın Kılıcı" fre="L'épée du diable" spa="Espada del Diablo" ita="Il Diavolo Spada" rus="The Devil's Sword" ame="not trans" cns="堕落者路西法所使用的特典离子重剑。因为吸取了路西法的力量，外形也产生了变化。" tha="not trans" twn="利用墮落者的傲慢所製成的大劍，雖然黑暗但卻可以感受到強烈的力量 。" jap="堕落した者の大剣。闇の力を感じる。" idn="Tidak bisa ditransaksikan"/>
	<string key="F2000007" kor="유니크 근접무기" ger="Einzigartige Nahkampfwaffe" eng="Unique Close-range weapon" tur="Benzersiz Yakın Mesafe Silahı" fre="Arme de mélée unique" spa="Arma Unica de Corto Alcanse" ita="Close-range Weapon unica" rus="Уникальное оружие ближнего боя" ame="not trans" cns="独特的近距离武器" tha="Unique Close-range weapon" twn="獨特近距離武器" jap="ユニーク近接武器" idn="Senjata Melee Unik"/>
	<string key="N4030030" kor="G의 메탈 스톰 캡슐" ger="G's Metal Storm Capsule" eng="G's Metal Storm Capsule" tur="G's Metal Storm Capsule" fre="G's Metal Storm Capsule" spa="G's Metal Storm Capsule" ita="G's Metal Storm Capsule" rus="G's Metal Storm Capsule" ame="G's Metal Storm Capsule" cns="G的金属风暴扭蛋" tha="G's Metal Storm Capsule" twn="G的金屬風暴膠囊" jap="【G】「メタルストーム」カプセル" idn="G Metal Storm Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030030" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得金属风暴的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N6010021" kor="G의 메탈 스톰 쿠폰" ger="G's Metal Storm Coupon" eng="G's Metal Storm Coupon" tur="G's Metal Storm Coupon" fre="G's Metal Storm Coupon" spa="G's Metal Storm Coupon" ita="G's Metal Storm Coupon" rus="G's Metal Storm Coupon" ame="G's Metal Storm Coupon" cns="G的金属风暴兑换券" tha="G's Metal Storm Coupon" twn="G的金屬風暴禮券" jap="【G】「メタルストーム」クーポン" idn="G Metal Storm Coupon"/>
	<string key="T6010021" kor="G의 메탈 스톰캡슐을 통해서 지급되는 쿠폰 이벤트 쿠폰" ger="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" eng="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" tur="Bu Kupon, bir etkinlik için kullanılabilir. Yaklaşan etkinlikler için haberleri düzenli olarak takip et!" fre="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" spa="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" ita="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" rus="Этот купон можно использовать для какого-нибудь события. Следи за новостями о предстоящих событиях!" ame="This coupon can be used for an event. Check the news regularly for upcoming events!" cns="G的金属风暴扭蛋获得的活动兑换券" tha="คูปองสำหรับ event  คอยติดตามเกาะกระแสข่าวของ event ที่กำลังมาให้ดีละ !" twn="透過G的金屬風暴膠囊所獲得的活動禮券" jap="【G】「メタルストーム」カプセルから入手できるイベントクーポン" idn="Coupon ini bisa digunakan untuk event. Periksalah berita untuk event yang akan datang!"/>
	<string key="N4030031" kor="G의 헤비머신건 블랙 캡슐" ger="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" eng="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" tur="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" fre="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" spa="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" ita="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" rus="G's Heavy Machine Gun Black Capsule" ame="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" cns="G的黑色加特林扭蛋" tha="G's HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule" twn="G的黑色重機槍膠囊" jap="【G】「ヘビーマシンガン・ブラック」カプセル" idn="G HeavyMachineGun Black Capsule"/>
