	<string key="F_TEXT315"/>
	<string key="N2040004" kor="허니 비 센트리건" ger="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" eng="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" tur="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" fre="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" spa="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" ita="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" rus="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" ame="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" cns="小蜜蜂炮台" tha="Honey Bee Sentry Gun" twn="針鋒" jap="ハニービー・セントリーガン" idn="Honey Bee Sentry Gun"/>
	<string key="T2040004" kor="우습게 보고 만만히 대했다간 큰 코 다칠 수도 있어요. 침에 한번 쏘이고 나면 다시는 보고 싶지 않은 무기 넘버 1순위!" ger="Wenn du sie unterschätzt, wirst du später hart dafür büßen. Lass dich nicht von ihr stechen!" eng="If you look down on it, you might have to pay dearly later on. The sting of the Honey Bee is very painful!" tur="Onu hor görmeye kalkarsan daha sonra bunun bedelini fazlasıyla ödemek zorunda kalabilirsin. Honey Bee'nin iğnesi çok acıtır!" fre="Si vous baissez le regard vers elle, you pourriez le payer très cher peu après. Vous ne voudrez plus la revoir à nouveau si vous êtes piqué par celle-ci." spa="Si la miras bien, podrías pagarlo muy caro mas adelante. No vas a querer volver a verla si te ataca." ita="Non sottovalutarla o dovrai pagare il tuo errore a caro prezzo. Non la rivedrai se ti pungerà." rus="Не смотри на него свысока, иначе впоследствии, возможно, дорого за это заплатишь. Медоносная пчела очень больно жалит!" cns="小蜜蜂造型的特典机械炮台。{N}不要小看蜜蜂哦，一旦被刺中会很疼的！" tha="ถ้าคุณดูถูกมัน คุณอาจจะต้องเจ็บตัวมากมายหลังจากนั้น เหล็กไนของผึ้งนะเจ็บปวดยิ่งนักนะ!" twn="如果小看它可能反而會讓自己受傷！只要被它的針射中，相信就永遠不會想要再看到這個武器了！" jap="可愛いからといってバカにしてはいけません。一度刺されたら、二度と会いたくない武器ナンバー1！" idn="Jika kamu meremehkannya, kamu bisa menyesal nantinya. Sengatan Honey Bee sangat menyakitkan!"/>
	<string key="F2040004" kor="유니크 설치무기" ger="Einzigartige aufstellbare Waffe" eng="Unique Deployable weapon" tur="Unique Deployable weapon" fre="Arme déployable unique" spa="Despliegue de Arma Unica" ita="Installation Weapon unica" rus="Уникальное развертываемое оружие" cns="特典安装武器" tha="Unique Deployable weapon" twn="獨特設置武器" jap="ユニーク設置武器" idn="Unique Deployable weapon"/>
	<string key="N4060001" kor="I의 퍼피 리볼버 캡슐" ger="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" eng="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" tur="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" fre="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" spa="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" ita="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" rus="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" ame="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" cns="I的小狗左轮扭蛋" tha="I's Puppy Revolver Capsule" twn="I的小狗左輪手槍膠囊" jap="【I】「パピー・リボルバー」カプセル" idn="I Puppy Revolver Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4060001" kor="해커 G의 무기에 대항하기 위해 해커 I가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}I캡슐은 레벨20, 보유 펜 15,000 이상이 되어야 구입 가능합니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel, hergestellt von Hacker I zum Kampf gegen die Waffen von Hacker G.{N}Du erhältst aus jeder Kategorie einen Gewinn, insgesamt also 3 Gewinne aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!." tur="Hacker G'nin silahlarına karşı Hacker I tarafından geliştirilen benzersiz kapsül.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Capsule unique que Hacker I fournit pour se battre contre les armes de Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir cet objet dans chaque zone, donc vous gagnerez trois objets au total à partir d'une captule!." spa="Capsule exclusiva que ofrece Hacker I para luchar contra las armas de Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un item de cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una Capsule!." ita="Capsule unica fornita da un Hacker per combattere contro le armi dell'Hacker G.{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi vincerai 3 oggetti in totale con una Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная Hacker I для борьбы с оружием Hacker G.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon{N}1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack(permanent)(Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed+3%, HP+5%, SP+5){N}2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N}Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip(permanent or periodic){N}1. eSper chip Magazine plus 1/2 or Reload speed up 1/2(1hour or permanent){N}2. Weapon: attack+5/+6(1day) or attack+1(permanent){N}*If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N}Zone3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000" cns="可以获得小狗左轮的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}I扭蛋必须达到等级20，拥有金币15,000以上才能购买" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง ที่  Hacker I จัดหามาใช้ในการต่อสู้ต่อต้านกับอาวุธของHacker G.{N}คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมได้ 1 ชนิดจากแต่ละโซน หมายความว่าคุณจะได้รับถึง 3 ชนิดจากแคปซูลเดียว!" twn="為對抗駭客G的武器，是駭客 I所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="ハッカー【G】武器に対抗するためにハッカーIが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker I untuk bertarung melawan senjata Hacker G.{N}Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4060002" kor="I의 리볼버 골드 캡슐" ger="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" eng="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" tur="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" fre="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" spa="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" ita="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" rus="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" ame="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" cns="I的金色左轮手枪扭蛋" tha="I's Revolver Gold Capsule" twn="I的黃金左輪手槍膠囊" jap="【I】「リボルバー・ゴールド」カプセル" idn="I Revolver Gold Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4060002" kor="해커 G의 무기에 대항하기 위해 해커 I가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}I캡슐은 레벨20, 보유 펜 15,000 이상이 되어야 구입 가능합니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel, hergestellt von Hacker I zum Kampf gegen die Waffen von Hacker G.{N}Du erhältst aus jeder Kategorie einen Gewinn, insgesamt also 3 Gewinne aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!." tur="Hacker G'nin silahlarına karşı Hacker I tarafından geliştirilen benzersiz kapsül.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Capsule unique que Hacker I fournit pour se battre contre les armes de Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir cet objet dans chaque zone, donc vous gagnerez trois objets au total à partir d'une captule!." spa="Capsule exclusiva que ofrece Hacker I para luchar contra las armas de Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un item de cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una Capsule!." ita="Capsule unica fornita da un Hacker per combattere contro le armi dell'Hacker G.{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi vincerai 3 oggetti in totale con una Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная Hacker I для борьбы с оружием Hacker G.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon{N}1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack(permanent)(Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed+3%, HP+5%, SP+5){N}2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N}Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip(permanent or periodic){N}1. eSper chip Magazine plus 1/2 or Reload speed up 1/2(1hour or permanent){N}2.