	<string key="N4060003" kor="I의 드래곤에이드 캡슐" ger="I's Dragonade Capsule" eng="I's Dragonade Capsule" tur="I's Dragonade Capsule" fre="I's Dragonade Capsule" spa="I's Dragonade Capsule" ita="I's Dragonade Capsule" rus="I's Dragonade Capsule" ame="I's Dragonade Capsule" cns="I的龙息炮扭蛋" tha="I's Dragonade Capsule" twn="I的龍砲膠囊" jap="【I】「ドラゴネード」カプセル" idn="I Dragonade Capsule"/>
