	<string key="N4060009" kor="I의 시그널 레일건 캡슐" ger="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" eng="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" tur="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" fre="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" spa="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" ita="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" rus="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" ame="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" cns="I的信号枪扭蛋" tha="I's Signal Rail Gun Capsule" twn="I的電磁信號槍膠囊" jap="【I】「シグナル・レールガン」カプセル" idn="I Signal Rail Gun Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4060009" kor="해커 G의 무기에 대항하기 위해 해커 I가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}I캡슐은 레벨20, 보유 펜 15,000 이상이 되어야 구입 가능합니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel, hergestellt von Hacker I zum Kampf gegen die Waffen von Hacker G.{N}Du erhältst aus jeder Kategorie einen Gewinn, insgesamt also 3 Gewinne aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!." tur="Hacker G'nin silahlarına karşı Hacker I tarafından geliştirilen benzersiz kapsül.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Capsule unique que Hacker I fournit pour se battre contre les armes de Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir cet objet dans chaque zone, donc vous gagnerez trois objets au total à partir d'une captule!." spa="Capsule exclusiva que ofrece Hacker I para luchar contra las armas de Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un item de cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una Capsule!." ita="Capsule unica fornita da un Hacker per combattere contro le armi dell'Hacker G.{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi vincerai 3 oggetti in totale con una Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная Hacker I для борьбы с оружием Hacker G.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon{N}1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack(permanent)(Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed+3%, HP+5, SP+5){N}2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N}Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip(permanent or periodic){N}1. eSper chip Magazine plus 1/2 or Reload speed up 1/2(1hour or permanent){N}2. Weapon: attack+5/+6(1day) or attack+1(permanent){N}*If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N}Zone3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000" cns="可以获得信号枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255，0，0，255}I的扭蛋只有在角色等级达到20、持有15，000金币才可以购买。" tha="Capsule เฉพาะที่ Hacker I มอบให้เพื่อต่อสู้กับอาวุธของ Hacker G{N}คุณสามารถได้รับ Item 1 ชิ้นจากแต่ละ Zone ดังนั้น คุณสามารถได้รับ Item ถึง 3 ชิ้นจาก Capsule เพียงชิ้นเดียว!" twn="為對抗駭客G的武器，是駭客 I所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="ハッカー【G】武器に対抗するためにハッカーIが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker I untuk bertarung melawan senjata Hacker G.{N}Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4060010" kor="I의 레일건 화이트 캡슐" ger="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" eng="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" tur="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" fre="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" spa="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" ita="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" rus="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" ame="I's Rail Gun White Capsule" cns="I的白色轨道炮扭蛋" twn="I的白色電磁槍膠囊" jap="【I】「レールガン・ホワイト」カプセル" idn="I Rail Gun White Capsule"/>
