	<string key="T1060089" kor="당신에게 사랑이라는 달콤한 마법을 걸어요~♡" ger="Alles Liebe zum Valentinstag!" eng="Happy Valentines Day!" tur="Sevgililer Günün kutlu olsun!" fre="Joyeuse Saint-Valentin !" spa="Feliz Día de San Valentín!" ita="Buon San Valentino!" rus="С Днем святого Валентина!" cns="向你施展爱情的魔法~♡" tha="Happy Valentines Day!" twn="對你施展愛的甜蜜魔法~♡" idn="Selamat Hari Valentine!"/>
	<string key="N4030061" kor="G의 블러디 스파이 대거 캡슐" ger="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" eng="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" tur="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" fre="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" spa="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" ita="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" rus="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" ame="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" cns="G的腥红之舞扭蛋" tha="G's Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule" twn="G的血腥膠囊" jap="【G】「ブラッディ・スパイダガー」カプセル" idn="G Bloody Spy Dagger Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030061" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная капсула, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Netsphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждой зоны, так что одна капсула принесет тебе целых 3 предмета!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得腥红之舞匕首的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="อาวุธเฉพาะของ G  Hacker ในตำนานแห่ง Netsphere {N}บรรจุรายการไอเทมดังต่อไปนี้" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N1060090" kor="스윗 캔디 글래스" ger="Sweet Candy Glass" eng="Sweet Candy Glass" tur="Sweet Candy Glass" fre="Sweet Candy Glass" spa="Sweet Candy Glass" ita="Sweet Candy Glass" rus="Sweet Candy Glass" ame="Sweet Candy Glass" cns="甜蜜糖果眼镜" tha="Sweet Candy Glass" twn="可愛糖果眼鏡" jap="スイートキャンディグラス" idn="Sweet Candy Glass"/>
	<string key="T1060090" kor="의미 있는 날, 나를 돋보이게 해줄 단 하나의 러블리 아이템!" ger="Diese Brille steht dir wunderbar! Aber bitte nicht essen (obwohl Sie so s?ß aussieht)." eng="You look so lovely with these glasses! Please don't eat them, even they look so sweet!" tur="Bu gözlükle çok tatlı görünüyorsun! Çok tatlı görünüyor olsa da onu yemesen iyi olur!" fre="Vous ?tes super classe avec ces lunettes ! Essayez de ne pas les manger tout de suite…" spa="Te ves adorable con estos lentes! Por favor no te lo comas, aunque se ven tan dulce!" ita="Sei adorabile con questi occhiali! Non mangiarli anche se sembrano una caramella!" rus="В этих очках ты выглядишь просто прелестно! Постарайся их не съесть, хоть они и выглядят так аппетитно!" ame="You look so lovely with these glasses! Please don't eat them, even they look so sweet!" cns="由甜蜜的各色糖果特制而成的眼镜，在作为眼镜的同时，还可以直接吃哟！" tha="คุณดูน่ารักมากเมื่อใส่แว่นอันนี้ แต่ไม่นะ! อย่ากินมัน แม้มันจะดูเหมือนของหวานก็ตาม" twn="在具有意義的那一天裡，能夠讓你更為顯耀的可愛的道具！" jap="私を輝かせてくれる、たった一つのラブリーアイテム！" idn="Dengan kacamata ini kamu terlihat cantik! Tolong jangan di makan, meskipun kacamatanya terlihat manis!"/>
	<string key="N1060091" kor="민트 캔디 글래스" ger="Mint Candy Glass" eng="Mint Candy Glass" tur="Mint Candy Glass" fre="Mint Candy Glass" spa="Mint Candy Glass" ita="Mint Candy Glass" rus="Mint Candy Glass" ame="Mint Candy Glass" cns="清凉糖果眼镜" tha="Mint Candy Glass" twn="薄荷糖果眼鏡" jap="ミントキャンディグラス" idn="Mint Candy Glass"/>
	<string key="T1060091" kor="의미 있는 날, 나를 돋보이게 해줄 단 하나의 러블리 아이템!" ger="Diese Brille steht dir wunderbar! Aber bitte nicht essen (obwohl Sie so s?ß aussieht)." eng="You look so lovely with these glasses! Please don't eat them, even they look so sweet!" tur="Bu gözlükle çok tatlı görünüyorsun! Çok tatlı görünüyor olsa da onu yemesen iyi olur!" fre="Vous ?tes super classe avec ces lunettes ! Essayez de ne pas les manger tout de suite…" spa="Te ves encantador con estos lentes! Por favor no te los comas, aunque se ven tan dulce!" ita="Sei adorabile con questi occhiali! Non mangiarli anche se sembrano una caramella!" rus="В этих очках ты выглядишь просто прелестно! Постарайся их не съесть, хоть они и выглядят так аппетитно!" ame="You look so lovely with these glasses! Please don't eat them, even they look so sweet!" cns="由清凉的薄荷糖特制而成的眼镜，在作为眼镜的同时，还可以直接吃哟！" tha="คุณดูน่ารักมากเมื่อใส่แว่นอันนี้ แต่ไม่นะ! อย่ากินมัน แม้มันจะดูเหมือนของหวานก็ตาม" twn="在具有意義的那一天裡，能夠讓你更為顯耀的可愛的道具！" jap="私を輝かせてくれる、たった一つのラブリーアイテム！" idn="Dengan kacamata ini kamu terlihat cantik! Tolong jangan di makan, meskipun kacamatanya terlihat manis!"/>
	<string key="N2010021" kor="실버헌터 호밍 라이플" ger="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" eng="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" tur="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" fre="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" spa="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" ita="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" rus="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" ame="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" cns="银色猎人" tha="Silverhunter Homing Rifle" twn="銀色獵人" jap="エクソシストホーミングライフル" idn="Silverhunter Homing Rifle"/>
	<string key="T2010021" kor="악마를 용납하지 않는 엑소시스터 집단의 주 무장. 발사 시 탄착군이 보정되어 일반인라도 쉽게 다룰 수 있게 설계되어 있다." ger="Die Hauptwaffe von Exocister, um Teufel zu töten. Empfehlenswert für Neulinge. Einfaches Zielen." eng="Exocister's main weapon for killing devils. It is recommened to novices. Easy to aim." tur="Şeytan çıkarıcıların şeytanları öldürmek için kullandıkları ana silah. Yeni başlayanlara tavsiye edilir. Nişan alması kolaydır." fre="L'arme principale de l'Exorciste. Visée facile. Recommandée pour les novices." spa="Arma Principal del Exocista para matar Demonios. Es recomenda para Principiantes. Tiene mucho Aim." ita="Arma principale di un esorcista che uccide i demoni. E' consigliata ai principianti. E' facile prendere la mira." rus="Главное оружие экзорциста для убийства демонов. Рекомендовано для новичков. Легко прицеливаться." cns="驱魔人专用的特典追踪步枪。{N}为了消灭恶魔而存在的武器，里面添加了银的成分。" tha="ิอาวุธหลักของ Exocister ในการปราบปีศาจ แม้มือใหม่ก็ใช้มันได้ เพราะมันใช้เล็งได้ง่ายมากมาย" twn="無法容許惡魔存活的聖女集團的主要武裝道具。發射時會協助命中目標，設計則是連一般人都可以輕鬆操作。" jap="悪魔を断罪するエクソシストの武器。発射時、命中精度が補正され、一般人でも使えるように設計されている。" idn="Senjata utama Exocister untuk mengalahkan iblis. Direkomendasikan untuk pemula. Memudahkan dalam membidik."/>
