	<string key="T1070026" kor="임진년 새해가 밝았어요! 흑룡이 여러분과 친구가 되어 항상 같이 합니다~" ger="Black Dragon will be summoned and stay with you." eng="Black Dragon will be summoned and stay with you." tur="Black Dragon çağrılacak ve seninle kalacak." fre="Black Dragon will be summoned and stay with you." spa="Black Dragon will be summoned and stay with you." ita="Black Dragon will be summoned and stay with you." rus="Черный дракон будет призван и останется с тобой." ame="Black Dragon will be summoned and stay with you." cns="调皮的小黑龙，总爱抱着自己的珠子不撒手。" twn="黑炫風與你簽下契約！" idn="Memanggil Black Dragon yang akan mendampingimu."/>
