	<string key="T4080001" kor="인챈트 성공 확률을 올려주는 아이템입니다. 해당 아이템은 인챈트 페이지에서 사용할 수 있습니다." ger="Erhöhte Wahrscheinlichkeit für erfolgreichen Enchant" eng="Increase the chance for Enchant Success" tur="Büyülerin başarı şansını arttır." fre="Augmentation des chances pour l'enchantement" spa="Incrementa la chance para el éxito del Enchant" ita="Aumenta la probabilità di avere Successo nell'Enchant" rus="Немного повышает шансы на успешное зачарование." cns="强化道具时，提升10%的强化概率，该道具可在强化页面使用。" twn="提高強化成功率的道具，可於強化系統中使用" idn="Meningkatkan kemungkinan untuk Keberhasilan Enchant"/>
	<string key="N4080002" kor="럭키 인챈트 UP 플러스" ger="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" eng="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" tur="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" fre="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" spa="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" ita="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" rus="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS" cns="中级幸运强化券" twn="幸運合成增加20%" idn="Lucky Enchant UP PLUS"/>
	<string key="T4080002" kor="인챈트 성공 확률을 크게 올려주는 아이템입니다. 해당 아이템은 인챈트 페이지에서 사용할 수 있습니다." ger="Wahrscheinlichkeit eines erfolgreichen Enchants deutlich erhöht" eng="Highly increases the chance for Enchant Success" tur="Büyülerin başarı şansını yüksek oranda arttır." fre="Augmente considérablement les chances qu'un enchantement réussisse" spa="Incrementa altamente la chance para el éxito del Enchant" ita="Aumenta di molto la probabilità di avere Successo nell'Enchant" rus="Сильно повышает шансы на успешное зачарование." cns="强化道具时，提升20%的强化概率，该道具可在强化页面使用" twn="大大提升合成成功機率的道具，道具可於合成系統中使用" idn="Sangat meningkatkan kemungkinan untuk Keberhasilan Enchant"/>
	<string key="N4080003" kor="초기화 방지" ger="Reset Insurance" eng="Reset Insurance" tur="Reset Insurance" fre="Reset Insurance" spa="Reset Insurance" ita="Reset Insurance" rus="Reset Insurance" cns="强化保护盾" twn="初始化防護盾"/>
	<string key="T4080003" kor="인챈트 결과가 초기화일때 이를 무시하는 아이템입니다. 해당 아이템은 인챈트 페이지에서 사용할 수 있습니다." ger="Item zur Absicherung des Enchant-Resets. Kann in der Enchant-Anzeige verwendet werden." eng="Enchant reset insurance item. This item can be used at enchant page" tur="Reset insurance eşyasını büyüle. Bu eşya, büyü sayfasında kullanılabilir" fre="Assurance de réinitialisation de l'enchantement. Cet objet peut être utilisé sur la page de l'enchantement" spa="Artículo para asegurar el restablecimiento del Enchant Este artículo puede ser usado en la página de Enchant." ita="Assicurazione sul reset dell'Enchant. Si può usare nella pagina dell'Enchant." rus="Предотвращает сброс зачарования. Можно использовать на странице зачарования." cns="防止强化失败时，道具已有的强化效果初始化" twn="裝備強化發生還原機率時，能防止裝備被還原的道具。該道具只能在強化系統中使用。"/>
	<string key="N4090004" kor="[더미]선택효력 삭제" cns="[仿制品]强化效果删除" twn="強化效果刪除"/>
	<string key="T4090004" kor="[더미]아이템의 인챈트 효력 중 한가지를 선택해 삭제할 수 있는 아이템입니다. 해당 아이템은 인벤토리와 인챈트 페이지에서 사용할 수 있습니다." cns="[仿制品]可以删除道具的强化效果，每次只能删除1个。删除后，道具的强化等级将会下降" twn="自強化裝備上，選擇刪除一個強化效果。該道具只能背包和強化系統中使用。"/>
	<string key="N2000021" kor="번 시그마 블레이드" ger="Burn Sigma Blade" eng="Burn Sigma Blade" tur="Burn Sigma Blade" fre="Lame Sigma de Feu" spa="Burn Sigma Blade" ita="Burn Sigma Blade" rus="Burn Sigma Blade" cns="日轮之刃" twn="業火變形刀" idn="Burn Sigma Blade"/>
	<string key="T2000021" kor="불의 힘이 깃든 거대한 검. 평소에는 보잘 것 없지만 봉인이 풀리면 엄청난 힘을 얻게 된다는데…" ger="In der Klinge ist die ultimative Kraft von Volcano gebannt. Wer kann den Bann lösen?" eng="The blade seals the ultimate power of Volcano. Who can reveal its power?" tur="Bıçakta, bir volkanın üst düzey gücü mühürlü. Bu gücü kim ortaya çıkarabilir?" fre="La lame contient le pouvoir ultime du volcan. Qui pourra révéler ce pouvoir ?" spa="La espada sella el poder definitivo de Volcano, ¿quién puede revelar su poder?" ita="La lama cela l'incredibile potere di Vulcano. Chi può svelarlo?" rus="Этот меч таит в себе великую мощь вулкана. Сможешь ли ты им овладеть?" cns="红蜂帝国在收集了契约之刃的战斗数据后，改进而成的特典契约之刃。{N}解除封印后，拥有巨大的杀伤力。不过解除的时间有限。" twn="火焰能量降臨般的巨刀。平常看似微不足道，解除封印下將聚合強大之力。" idn="Pedang yang menyegel kekuatan dari Volcano. Siapa yang bisa mengeluarkan kekuatannya?"/>
	<string key="N1061052" kor="마시멜로우 퍼피 - 그린애플" ger="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" eng="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" tur="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" fre="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" spa="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" ita="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" rus="marshmallow puppy(Blue)" cns="棉花糖小狗-青苹果" twn="綿綿藍天狗" idn="marshmallow puppy(Blue)"/>
	<string key="T1061052" kor="화이트데이를 기념한 달콤하고 폭신한 마시멜로우 퍼피! 마시멜로우 퍼피로 마음을 전달하세요!" ger="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" eng="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" tur="Tatlı ve yumuşak Marshmallow Puppy!!" fre="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" spa="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" ita="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" rus="Милый и мягкий зефирный щенок!" cns="纪念白色情人节的甜蜜可口的棉花糖小狗！用棉花糖小狗传递心意吧！" twn="軟綿綿甜滋滋的白色情人節紀念寵物! 快用綿綿藍天狗來表白你的心意吧!" idn="Marshmallow Puppy yang manis dan lembut!!"/>
	<string key="N1061053" kor="마시멜로우 퍼피 - 오렌지" ger="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" eng="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" tur="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" fre="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" spa="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" ita="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" rus="marshmallow puppy(Pink)" cns="棉花糖小狗-橙子" twn="綿綿粉心狗" idn="marshmallow puppy(Pink)"/>
	<string key="T1061053" kor="화이트데이를 기념한 달콤하고 폭신한 마시멜로우 퍼피! 마시멜로우 퍼피로 마음을 전달하세요!" ger="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" eng="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" tur="Tatlı ve yumuşak Marshmallow Puppy!!" fre="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" spa="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" ita="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" rus="Милый и мягкий зефирный щенок!" cns="纪念白色情人节的甜蜜可口的棉花糖小狗！用棉花糖小狗传递心意吧！" twn="軟綿綿甜滋滋的白色情人節紀念寵物! 快用綿綿粉心狗來表白你的心意吧!" idn="Marshmallow Puppy yang manis dan lembut!!"/>
	<string key="N4030117" kor="G의 번 시그마 블레이드 캡슐" ger="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" eng="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" tur="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" fre="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" spa="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" ita="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" rus="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" ame="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" cns="G的日轮之刃扭蛋" tha="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" twn="G的業火變形刀膠囊" idn="G Burn Sigma Blade Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030117" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得日轮之刃的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4030118" kor="G의 진 카타나 캡슐" ger="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" eng="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" tur="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" fre="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" spa="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" ita="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" rus="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" ame="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" cns="G的日轮太刀扭蛋" tha="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" twn="G的日輪武士刀膠囊" idn="G Zin-Katana Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030118" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得日轮太刀的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
