	<string key="T6000006" kor="에스포리그 하늘에서 떨어진 부활절 계란으로, 5개를 모으시면  닭이 먼저냐? 달걀이 먼저냐? 이벤트에 참여 하실 수 있습니다." ger="Um beim Flip the Easter Coin Event mitzumachen, musst du im Spiel 5 Ostereier sammeln." eng="To participate Flip the Easter coin event, you have to acquire 5 easter eggs from the game." tur="Paskalya coini ile yazı tura atma etkinliğine katılmak için oyunda 5 Easter Egg toplaman gerekiyor." fre="Pour pouvoir lancer la pièce, tu dois trouver au moins 5 œufs de Pâques dans le jeu." spa="Para participar en el evento &quot;Flip de Easter coin&quot;, tienes que adquirir 5 huevos de Pascua del juego." ita="Per partecipare al lancio della moneta, devi trovare 5 uova di Pasqua in partita." rus="Собери 5 пасхальных яиц, чтобы принять участие во «Flip the Easter coin» событии." cns="从极限战境天空掉下的复活节鸡蛋，收集5个的话可以参与活动先有鸡?先有鸡蛋?" idn="Untuk mengikuti event Flip Easter coin, kamu harus mendapatkan 5 easter egg dari permainan."/>
	<string key="N1061054" kor="엔젤 에그" ger="Angel egg" eng="Angel egg" tur="Angel egg" fre="Angel egg" spa="Angel egg" ita="Angel egg" rus="Angel egg" cns="天使彩蛋" idn="Angel egg"/>
