	<string key="N4030127" kor="G의 코그휠 시그마 블레이드 캡슐" ger="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" eng="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" tur="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" fre="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" spa="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" ita="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" rus="G's Cogwheel Sigma Blade Capsule" ame="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule" cns="G的极光之刃扭蛋" twn="G的極光變型刀膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4030127" kor="G의 코그휠 시그마 블레이드 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" eng="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 4 items in total from one Capsule!" spa="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 5 items in total from one Capsule!" ita="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 6 items in total from one Capsule!" rus="Capsule с Cogwheel Sigma Blade.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 8 items in total from one Capsule!" cns="可以获得极光之刃的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N2010030" kor="코그휠 어썰트 라이플" ger="Cogwheel assault Rifle" eng="Cogwheel assault Rifle" tur="Cogwheel assault Rifle" fre="Cogwheel assault Rifle" spa="Cogwheel assault Rifle" ita="Cogwheel assault Rifle" rus="Cogwheel assault Rifle" ame="Cogwheel assault Rifle" cns="极光步枪" twn="極光突擊步槍"/>
	<string key="T2010030" kor="번개의 힘을 간직한 강력한 라이플" ger="Rifle strong as thunder" eng="Rifle strong as thunder" tur="Gök gürültüsü kadar güçlü bir silah" fre="Rifle strong as thunder" spa="Rifle strong as thunder" ita="Rifle strong as thunder" rus="Эта винтовка сильна как гром" ame="Rifle strong as thunder" cns="将闪电的巨大能量植入其中的特典突击步枪。{N}发动攻击的时候，记得大喊一声：“闪电！赐予我力量！”" twn="內存閃電能量的強力步槍"/>
	<string key="N2000023" kor="코그휠 시그마 블레이드" ger="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" eng="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" tur="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" fre="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" spa="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" ita="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" rus="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" ame="Cogwheel Sigma Blade" cns="极光之刃" twn="極光變型刀"/>
	<string key="T2000023" kor="번개의 힘을 간직한 강력한 블레이드" ger="Blade strong as thunder" eng="Blade strong as thunder" tur="Gök gürültüsü kadar güçlü bir bıçak" fre="Blade strong as thunder" spa="Blade strong as thunder" ita="Blade strong as thunder" rus="Этот меч силен как гром" ame="Blade strong as thunder" cns="将闪电的巨大能量植入其中的特典契约之刃。{N}发动攻击的时候，记得大喊一声：“十万伏特！”" twn="內存閃電能量的強力變形刀"/>
	<string key="N1070027" kor="셜록 스파키 펭귄" ger="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" eng="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" tur="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" fre="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" spa="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" ita="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" rus="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" ame="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" cns="企鹅夏洛克" tha="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" twn="閃亮華生企鵝" jap="Sherlock Sparky Penguin" idn="Sherlock Sparky Penguin"/>
	<string key="T1070027" kor="셜록 홈즈에 버금가는 똑똑한 두뇌를 지닌 스파키 펭귄!" ger="Smart wie Sherlock Holmes! Gescheiter Pinguin!" eng="Smart as Sherlock Holmes! Sparky Penguin!" tur="Sherlock Holmes kadar zeki! Sparky Penguin!" fre="Aussi futé que Sherlock Holmes ! Astucieux, le pingouin !" spa="¡Inteligente como Sherlock Holmes! ¡Sparky Penguin!" ita="Astuto quanto Sherlock Holmes! E' il pinguino Sparky!" rus="Умный как Шерлок Холмс! Пингвин по имени Спарки!" cns="虽然是只企鹅，但拥有着与福尔摩斯匹敌的聪明头脑！" twn="頭腦聰明程度只僅次於福爾摩斯的閃亮企鵝" idn="Sepintar Sherlock Holmes! Sparky Penguin!"/>
	<string key="N4030126" kor="G의 셜록 스파키 펭귄 캡슐" ger="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" eng="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" tur="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" fre="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" spa="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" ita="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" rus="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" ame="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" cns="G的企鹅夏洛克宠物扭蛋" tha="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" twn="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" jap="G's Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule" idn="G Sherlock Sparky Penguin Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4030126" kor="G의 셜록 스파키 펭귄 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="&quot;Einzigartiges Capsule Item gestellt vom Net-Sphere Hacker G.{N}In jeder Zone kannst du ein Item erhalten, so erhältst du insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Capsule!" eng="&quot;Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="&quot;Une Capsule unique offerte par le légendaire Net-Sphere Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir un objet pour chaque zone, soit au total 3 objets dans une seule Capsule !" spa="&quot;Artículo de Capsule exclusivo suministrado por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un artículo de cada zona, así que podrás ganar 3 artículos en total de una Capsule!" ita="&quot;Capsule unica fornita dal leggendario Hacker G della Netsphere.{N}Puoi trovare un oggetto per ogni area, quindi alla fine ne avrai 3 con una Capsule!!" rus="Уникальная Capsule предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" cns="可以获得企鹅夏洛克的宠物扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" idn="&quot;Kapsul unik yang diberikan oleh sang legendaris Net-Sphere Hacker G.{N} Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang dari setiap zona, jadi dari satu kapsul kamu bisa memenangkan total barang 3!"/>
