	<string key="T4030131" kor="두개의 유니크가 들어있는 G의 코그휠 더블 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" eng="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 2 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" spa="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" ita="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" rus="G's 2x Capsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 2 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" cns="可以获得极光双重武器的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="G的極光系雙武器膠囊內含兩種特殊版武器。{N}使用膠囊時可隨機獲得以下道具。"/>
