	<string key="T1061064" kor="펌비를 사랑하는 동호회 모임의 회장이 강력  건의해 어쩔수 없이 만들었다는 비화가 얽힌 펌비 안테나!" cns="爱慕波比的同好会会长强烈建议制作的波比天线！" twn="喜歡Fumbi的粉絲團團長請求製作的產品，有火花環繞Fumbi 天線!" jap="CBT参加者にだけ与えられるファンビアンテナ。いつでもファンビになれる！"/>
	<string key="N4060016" kor="I의 데몬 사이드 캡슐" ger="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" eng="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" tur="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" fre="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" spa="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" ita="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" rus="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" ame="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" cns="I的死神之镰扭蛋" twn="HP+30膠囊" jap="HP+30カプセル"/>
	<string key="T4060016" kor="데몬 사이드를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule{N}Wenn du diese Capsule öffnest, erhältst du aus jeder Kategorie ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item." eng="The Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule.{N}The Death Scythe of Skeleton weapon can be acquired. Use this Capsule and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Death Scythe of Skeleton kapsülü {N}Bu kapsülü açarak her kategori dahilinde yer alan aşağıdaki öğeleri rasgele edinebileceksin." fre="La Caspule du Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule {N}Vous recevrez aléatoirement des objets des catégories suivantes en ouvrant cette Capsule." spa="La Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule {N}Abriendo esta Capsule, podrás obtener al azar los artículos a continuación dentro de cada categoría." ita="La Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule {N}Aprendo questa capsula, otterrai gli oggetti qui sotto per ogni categoria e casualmente." rus="The Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule.{N}Из этой капсулы можно получить смертельный серп скелета. Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить несколько случайных предметов." cns="死神之镰的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="HP+30膠囊" jap="HP+30カプセル"/>
	<string key="N4060017" kor="I의 파워 데몬 사이드 캡슐" ger="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" eng="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" tur="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" fre="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" spa="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" ita="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" rus="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" ame="I's Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" cns="I的强力死神之镰扭蛋" twn="友誼之劍膠囊" jap="フレンドリープラズマカプセル"/>
	<string key="T4060017" kor="데몬 사이드를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule{N}Wenn du diese Capsule öffnest, erhältst du aus jeder Kategorie ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item." eng="The Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule.{N}The Death Scythe of Skeleton weapon can be acquired. Use this Capsule and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Death Scythe of Skeleton kapsülü {N}Bu kapsülü açarak her kategori dahilinde yer alan aşağıdaki öğeleri rasgele edinebileceksin." fre="La Caspule du Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule {N}Vous recevrez aléatoirement des objets des catégories suivantes en ouvrant cette Capsule." spa="La Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule {N}Abriendo esta Capsule, podrás obtener al azar los artículos a continuación dentro de cada categoría." ita="La Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule {N}Aprendo questa capsula, otterrai gli oggetti qui sotto per ogni categoria e casualmente." rus="The Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule.{N}Из этой капсулы можно получить смертельный серп скелета. Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить несколько случайных предметов." cns="死神之镰的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="友誼之劍膠囊" jap="フレンドリープラズマカプセル"/>
