	<string key="N1070032" kor="매드 래빗" ger="Mad Rabbit" eng="Mad Rabbit" tur="Mad Rabbit" fre="Mad Rabbit" spa="Mad Rabbit" ita="Mad Rabbit" rus="Mad Rabbit" cns="魔法兔" twn="瘋狂兔" jap="EXP+30％カプセル"/>
	<string key="T1070032" kor="작은 일에도 방방 뛰며 사나워지는 소심한 성격의 매드 래빗!" ger="Ein wilder, aber sehr schüchterner und niedlicher verrückter Hase" eng="Wild but very timid cute mad rabbit" tur="Vahşi ama ürkek, sevimli, çılgın bir tavşan" fre="Un lapin fou, sauvage mais très timide" spa="Salvaje pero muy tímido conejo loco" ita="Un grazioso coniglio pazzo selvatico, ma timido." rus="Дикий, но прирученный злой кролик." cns="有着强大法力的兔子。{N}屁股下的杯子是它的飞行道具。" twn="小事情就會氣呼呼的計較性格瘋狂兔!" jap="EXP+30％カプセル"/>
	<string key="N4030139" kor="매드 래빗 펫 캡슐" ger="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" eng="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" tur="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" fre="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" spa="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" ita="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" rus="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule" cns="魔法兔宠物扭蛋" twn="瘋狂兔膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4030139" kor="매드 래빗을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule{N}Du erhältst ein Item aus jeder Zone. Du erhältst also ingesamt 3 Items aus einer Capsule!" eng="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="La Capsule du familier Mad Rabbit{N}Vous pouvez obtenir un objet pour chaque zone, soit un total de 3 objets dans une seule Capsule !" spa="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule{N}Puedes obtener un artículo de cada zona, así que podrás ganar 3 artículos en total de una Capsule!" ita="Mad Rabbit Pet Capsule{N}Puoi trovare un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale avrai 3 oggetti con una Capsule!" rus="Capsule с питомцем Mad Rabbit{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" cns="可以获得魔法兔的宠物扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="可獲得瘋狂兔的膠囊。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N2010031" kor="나이트 스매쉬 라이플" ger="Knight Smash Rifle" eng="Knight Smash Rifle" tur="Knight Smash Rifle" fre="Knight Smash Rifle" spa="Knight Smash Rifle" ita="Knight Smash Rifle" rus="Knight Smash Rifle" ame="Knight Smash Rifle" cns="骑士粉碎步枪" twn="騎士團爆裂步槍"/>
	<string key="T2010031" kor="넷스피어의 AI 데이터를 패턴화해서 개량한 스매쉬 라이플" ger="Verbesserte Smash Rifle mit NetSphere's AI Daten" eng="Enhanced Smash Rifle with NetSphere's AI data" tur="NetSphere'in yapay zeka verisiyle geliştirilmiş Smash Rifle" fre="Smash Rifle amélioré grâce aux données de l'I.A. de la NetSphere." spa="Smash Rifle optimizado con datos AI de Netsphere" ita="Smash Rifle potenziato con i dati dell'AI della NetSphere." rus="Улучшенная Smash Rifle с данными AI из Net-Sphere." cns="以防守闯关中的骑士为原型设计的特典粉碎步枪。" twn="高貴的騎士團員所配戴的爆裂步槍"/>
	<string key="N4030138" kor="G의 나이트 스매쉬 라이플 캡슐" ger="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" eng="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" tur="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" fre="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" spa="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" ita="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" rus="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" ame="G's Knight Smash Rifle Capsule" cns="G的骑士粉碎步枪扭蛋" twn="G的騎士團爆裂步槍"/>
	<string key="T4030138" kor="더욱 멋스럽게 돌아온 나이트 스매쉬 라이플 캡슐 입니다{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Verbesserte Smash Rifle. {N} Das folgende Item wird per Zufall bei Benutzung der Capsule ausgegeben." eng="Enhanced version of the Smash Rifle. {N} The following item is randomly given out upon using the caspule." tur="Smash Rifle'ın geliştirilmiş versiyonu. {N} Kapsül kullanıldıktan sonra şu eşya Rasgele verilir." fre="La version améliorée du Smash Rifle. {N} Les objets suivants peuvent être contenus dans la Capsule." spa="Versión optimizada del Smash Rifle. {N} Cuando se use la Capsule, se suministrarán los siguientes artículos al azar." ita="Versione potenziata dello Smash Rifle.{N}Il seguente oggetto si può trovare in modo casuale usando la Capsule." rus="Улучшенная версия Smash Rifle.{N}Открыв капсулу, будет получен один случайный предмет." cns="可以获得骑士粉碎步枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="變得更?力的騎士團爆裂步槍膠囊{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N2000024" kor="크리스탈 플라즈마 스워드" ger="Crystal Plasma Sword" eng="Crystal Plasma Sword" tur="Kristal Plazma Kılıç" fre="Crystal Plasma Sword" spa="Crystal Plasma Sword" ita="Crystal Plasma Sword" rus="Crystal Plasma Sword" cns="水晶重剑" twn="水晶電漿劍"/>
	<string key="T2000024" kor="정제된 크리스탈로 더욱 강화된 유니크 플라즈마 스워드" ger="Einzigartiges Plasma Sword, das aus gehärteten Kristallen gefertigt wurde." eng="Unique Plasma Sword, the enhanced sword made out of hardened crystals." tur="Eşsiz Plazma Kılıç, sertleştirilmiş kristallerden yapılan geliştirilmiş kılıç." fre="Une Plasma Sword unique, forgée dans les cristaux les plus solides." spa="Un Plasma Sword exclusivo; esta espada optimizada está hecha de cristales fortalecidos." ita="Unica spada al plasma: spada potenziata fatta di cristalli induriti" rus="Уникальный Plasma Sword, улучшенная версия выполнена из закаленных кристаллов." cns="用精制的水晶来进行强化的特典离子重剑" twn="以精緻的水晶做成的強力特殊電漿劍"/>
	<string key="N4030140" kor="G의 크리스탈 플라즈마 스워드 캡슐" ger="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" eng="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" tur="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" fre="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" spa="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" ita="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" rus="G's Crystal Plasma Sword Capsule" cns="G的水晶重剑扭蛋" twn="G的水晶電漿劍膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4030140" kor="더욱 강력해진 크리스탈 플라즈마 스워드 캡슐 입니다{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="更加强大的水晶重剑扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="更強力的水晶電漿劍膠囊。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
