	<string key="N4110023" kor="아케이드 노멀 캡슐" ger="Arcade Nomal Capsule" eng="Arcade Nomal Capsule" tur="Arcade Nomal Capsule" fre="Arcade Nomal Capsule" spa="Arcade Nomal Capsule" ita="Arcade Nomal Capsule" rus="Arcade Nomal Capsule" ame="Arcade Nomal Capsule" cns="普通人机模式扭蛋" tha="Arcade Nomal Capsule" twn="普通任務膠囊" jap="アーケードノーマルカプセル" idn="Arcade Nomal Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110023" kor="아케이드 노멀 모드의 모든 스테이지 클리어 시 주는 캡슐 아이템{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule gibt es als Belohnung beim Abschluß aller Abschnitte im Normalen Mode.{N}Wenn du sie nutzt, erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Normal Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" tur="Normal Modun tüm aşamaları geçilince verilen kapsül.{N}Kapsülü kullanırsan şu eşyalardan birini alırsın:" fre="Capsule pouvant être obtenue en terminant tous les stages du Normal Mode.{N}Si tu utilises la Capsules, tu pourras obtenir une récompense au hasard{N}dans 3 catégories différentes comportant les items suivants." spa="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Normal Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" ita="La Capsule assegnata al completamento di tutte le fasi del Normal Mode.{N}Utilizzandola, ottieni i seguenti oggetti." rus="Capsule выдается за прохождение всех этапов в Нормальном режиме.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь один из следующих предметов:" ame="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Normal Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}eSper Chip: HP +1, EXP Up+5%{N}Pirate Jacket, Open Shoulder Gown, Captain Guard Upper Suits, Space Suit: None{N}and PEN(800~50000)" cns="完成人机模式普通难度的所有章节时，可以获得该道具{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลที่มอบให้คุณ เมื่อคุณเคลียร์ฉากทั้งหมดใน normal mode ได้ {N} เมื่อคุณกดใช้ คุณจะได้รับหนึ่งในไอเทม จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="在完成Arcade普通模式的所有關卡後所支付的膠囊道具{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="アーケードモード(ノーマル)の全てのステージをクリアするともらえるカプセルアイテム{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、シナリオアーケードモードに出現するキャラクターのコスチュームがランダムで獲得できます。" idn="Kapsul yang akan diberikan jika kamu menyelesaikan semua stage Mode Normal.{N}Jika kamu menggunakan kapsul, salah satu barang berikut akan diberikan padamu:"/>
	<string key="N4110024" kor="아케이드 하드 캡슐" ger="Arcade Hard Capsule" eng="Arcade Hard Capsule" tur="Arcade Hard Capsule" fre="Arcade Hard Capsule" spa="Arcade Hard Capsule" ita="Arcade Hard Capsule" rus="Arcade Hard Capsule" ame="Arcade Hard Capsule" cns="困难人机模式扭蛋" tha="Arcade Hard Capsule" twn="困難任務膠囊" jap="アーケードハードカプセル" idn="Arcade Hard Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110024" kor="아케이드 하드 모드의 모든 스테이지 클리어 시 주는 캡슐 아이템{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule gibt es als Belohnung beim Abschluß aller Abschnitte im Hard Mode.{N}Wenn du sie nutzt, erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Hard Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" tur="Hard Modun tüm aşamaları geçilince verilen kapsül.{N}Kapsülü kullanırsan şu eşyalardan birini alırsın:" fre="Capsule pouvant être obtenue en terminant tous les stages du Hard Mode.{N}Si tu utilises la Capsules, tu pourras obtenir une récompense au hasard{N}dans 3 catégories différentes comportant les items suivants." spa="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Hard Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" ita="La Capsule assegnata al completamento di tutte le fasi dell'Hard Mode.{N}Utilizzandola, ottieni i seguenti oggetti." rus="Capsule выдается за прохождение всех этапов в Сложном режиме.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь один из следующих предметов:" ame="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of Hard Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}eSper Chip: HP +2, EXP Up+8%{N}Pirate Jacket, Open Shoulder Gown, Captain Guard Upper Suits, Space Suit: All weapons +3{N}and PEN(800~50000)" cns="完成人机模式困难难度的所有章节时，可以获得该道具{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลที่มอบให้คุณ เมื่อคุณเคลียร์ฉากทั้งหมดใน Hard mode ได้ {N} เมื่อคุณกดใช้ คุณจะได้รับหนึ่งในไอเทม จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="在完成Arcade困難模式的所有關卡後所支付的膠囊道具{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="アーケードモード(ハード)の全てのステージをクリアするともらえるカプセルアイテム{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、シナリオアーケードモードに出現するキャラクターのコスチュームがランダムで獲得できます。" idn="Kapsul yang akan diberikan jika kamu menyelesaikan semua stage Mode Susah.{N}Jika kamu menggunakan kapsul, salah satu barang berikut akan diberikan padamu:"/>
	<string key="N4110025" kor="아케이드 에스퍼 캡슐" ger="Arcade Esper Capsule" eng="Arcade Esper Capsule" tur="Arcade Esper Capsule" fre="Arcade Esper Capsule" spa="Arcade Esper Capsule" ita="Arcade Esper Capsule" rus="Arcade Esper Capsule" ame="Arcade Esper Capsule" cns="绝境人机模式扭蛋" tha="Arcade Esper Capsule" twn="S4任務膠囊" jap="アーケードエキスパートカプセル" idn="Arcade Esper Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110025" kor="아케이드 에스퍼 모드의 모든 스테이지 클리어 시 주는 캡슐 아이템{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule gibt es als Belohnung beim Abschluß aller Abschnitte im eSper Mode.{N}Wenn du sie nutzt, erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of eSper Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" tur="ESper Modunun tüm aşamaları geçilince verilen kapsül.{N}Kapsülü kullanırsan şu eşyalardan birini alırsın:" fre="Capsule pouvant être obtenue en terminant tous les stages de l'eSper Mode.{N}Si tu utilises la Capsules, tu pourras obtenir une récompense au hasard{N}dans 3 catégories différentes comportant les items suivants." spa="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of eSper Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:" ita="La Capsule assegnata al completamento di tutte le fasi dell'eSper Mode.{N}Utilizzandola, ottieni i seguenti oggetti." rus="Capsule выдается за прохождение всех этапов в eSper режиме.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь один из следующих предметов:" ame="The Capsule which is given when you clear all stages of eSper Mode.{N}If you use the Capsule, one of the following items will be given to you:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}eSper Chip: HP +3, EXP Up+10%{N}Pirate Jacket, Open Shoulder Gown, Captain Guard Upper Suits, Space Suit: All weapons +3{N}and PEN(800~50000)" cns="完成人机模式绝境难度的所有章节时，可以获得该道具{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลที่มอบให้คุณ เมื่อคุณเคลียร์ฉากทั้งหมดใน eSper mode ได้ {N} เมื่อคุณกดใช้ คุณจะได้รับหนึ่งในไอเทม จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="在完成Arcade艱深模式的所有關卡後所支付的膠囊道具{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="アーケードモード(エキスパート)の全てのステージをクリアするともらえるカプセルアイテム{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、シナリオアーケードモードに出現するキャラクターのコスチュームがランダムで獲得できます。" idn="Kapsul yang akan diberikan jika kamu menyelesaikan semua stage Mode eSper.{N}Jika kamu menggunakan kapsul, salah satu barang berikut akan diberikan padamu:"/>
	<string key="N4110026" kor="이스터 캡슐" ger="Easter Egg" eng="Easter Egg" tur="Easter Egg" fre="Easter Egg" spa="Easter Egg" ita="Easter Egg" rus="Easter Egg" ame="Easter Egg" cns="复活节扭蛋" tha="Easter Egg" twn="復活節膠囊" jap="イースターカプセル" idn="Easter Egg"/>
	<string key="T4110026" kor="부활절 이벤트용 캡슐" ger="Aus dieser Osterkapsel könnt ihr mit etwas Glück den Osterfumbi bekommen.{N}Die folgenden Items können in der Kapsel enthalten sein:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Osterfumbi mit Smart Pack Effekt (1/7/30 Tage/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 Tage){N}PEN(300PEN~50.000PEN)." eng="Easter Capsule which can give you the Egg Fumbi.{N} Following items will be randomly given to you.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi with Smart Pack(1/7/30days/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30days){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." tur="Egg Fumbi veren bir Easter Capsule.{N} Şu eşyalar Rasgele verilecek.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi ve Smart Pack(1/7/30gün/Kalıcı){N}Kıskançlık Bekçisi SP+6 (1/30gün){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." fre="Une Easter Capsule qui te fera peut-être obtenir l'Egg Fumbi.{N} Les items suivants peuvent être obtenus aléatoirement.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi avec Smart Pack(1/7/30jours/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30jours){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." spa="Easter Capsule que puede darte el Egg Fumbi.{N} Los siguientes ítems serán dados al azar:{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi con Smart Pack(1/7/30días/Permanente){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30días){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." ita="Una Capsule di Pasqua con cui puoi ottenere un Egg Fumbi.{N}Sono assegnati in modo casuale i seguenti oggetti.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi con Smart Pack (1/7/30 giorni/permanente){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 giorni){N}PEN (300 PEN~50.000 PEN)." rus="Из этой Пасхальной капсулы можно получить питомца Egg Fumbi.{N}Ты получишь следующие случайные предметы.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Питомец Egg Fumbi со Smart Pack (1/7/30 дней/бессрочн.){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 дней){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." ame="Easter Capsule which can give you the Egg Fumbi.{N} Following items will be randomly given to you.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi with Smart Pack(1/7/30days/Permanent){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30days){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)." cns="复活节活动用扭蛋" tha="Easter Capsule which can give you the Egg Fumbi.{N} Following items will be randomly given to you." twn="復活節活動用膠囊" jap="復活祭イベント用カプセル" idn="Kapsul Paskah yang akan memberikan Egg Fumbi padamu.{N}Barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Egg Fumbi dengan Smart Pack(1/7/30 hari/Permanen){N}Envy Ranger SP+6 (1/30 hari){N}PEN(300PEN~50,000PEN)."/>
	<string key="N4110027" kor="성 패트릭의 날 기념 무기 캡슐" ger="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" eng="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" tur="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" fre="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" spa="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" ita="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" rus="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" ame="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" cns="圣帕特里克节武器扭蛋" tha="St. Patrick's Day Green Weapon Capsule" twn="聖派翠克日紀念武器膠囊" jap="セイントパトリックデー記念武器カプセル" idn="St. Patrick Day Green Weapon Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110027" kor="성 패트릭 데이를 기념하기 위해 발매된 초록빛 가득한 무기 캡슐! 캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." eng="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." tur="St. Patrick Günü'ne özel yeşil silah kapsülü. Kapsülden şu eşyalar Rasgele şekilde verilir." fre="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." spa="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." ita="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." rus="Capsule с зеленым оружием в честь дня Святого Патрика. Использовав капсулу, ты получишь следующие случайные предметы." ame="Green weapon Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Green Sub Machine Gun(Attack +6), Green Semi Rifle(Attack +6), Green Smash Rifle(Attack +6): 1day/7days/30days.{N}PEN(300PEN~50000PEN)" cns="为纪念圣帕特里克节而推出的武器扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="Green weapon Capsule สำหรับการเฉลิมฉลองวันนักบุญ Patricks  คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมแบบสุ่มได้จากรายชื่อดังนี้:" twn="為紀念聖佩特利之日所發行的充滿綠光的武器膠囊！使用膠囊道具時，如下道具會隨機獲得。" jap="セイントパトリックデーを記念し発売された、緑色いっぱいの武器カプセル！カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul senjata hijau untuk merayakan hari St. Patrick, barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak dari kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4110028" kor="성 패트릭의 날 기념 코스튬 캡슐(남)" ger="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" eng="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" tur="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" fre="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" spa="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" ita="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" rus="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(мужской)" ame="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" cns="圣帕特里克节男性套装扭蛋" tha="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(male)" twn="聖派翠克日紀念服飾膠囊(男)" jap="セイントパトリックデー記念コスチュームカプセル(男)" idn="St. Patrics Day Green Costume Capsule (laki-laki)"/>
	<string key="T4110028" kor="성 패트릭 데이를 기념하기 위해 발매된 초록빛 가득한 남자 코스튬 캡슐! 캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." eng="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." tur="St. Patrick Günü'ne özel yeşil erkek kostümü kapsülü. Kapsülden şu eşyalar Rasgele şekilde verilir." fre="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." spa="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." ita="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." rus="Capsule с зеленым мужским костюмом в честь дня Святого Патрика. Использовав капсулу, ты получишь следующие случайные предметы." ame="Green male Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Green Guardian Armor(Attack +8 for all weapons), Green Activity Suit(Attack +8 for all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}Green Guardian Plate(Defense +9 against all weapons), Green Activity Pants(Defense +9 against all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}PEN(300PEN~50000PEN)" cns="为纪念圣帕特里克节而推出的男性套装扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="Green male Costume Capsule สำหรับการเฉลิมฉลองวันนักบุญ Patricks  คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมแบบสุ่มได้จากรายชื่อดังนี้" twn="為紀念聖佩特利之日所發行的充滿綠光的男性服飾膠囊！使用膠囊道具時，如下道具會隨機獲得。" jap="セイントパトリックデーを記念し発売された、緑色いっぱいの男性コスチュームカプセル！カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul kostum  hijau laki-laki untuk merayakan hari St. Patrick, barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak dari kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4110029" kor="성 패트릭의 날 기념 코스튬 캡슐(여)" ger="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" eng="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" tur="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" fre="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" spa="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" ita="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" rus="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(женский)" ame="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" cns="圣帕特里克节女性套装扭蛋" tha="St. Patrick's Day Green Costume Capsule(female)" twn="聖派翠克日記念服飾膠囊(女)" jap="セイントパトリックデー記念コスチュームカプセル" idn="St. Patrick Day Green Costume Capsule (perempuan)"/>
	<string key="T4110029" kor="성 패트릭 데이를 기념하기 위해 발매된 초록빛 가득한 여자 코스튬 캡슐! 캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." eng="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." tur="St. Patrick Günü'ne özel yeşil kadın kostümü kapsülü. Kapsülden şu eşyalar Rasgele şekilde verilir." fre="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." spa="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." ita="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule." rus="Capsule с зеленым женским костюмом в честь дня Святого Патрика. Использовав капсулу, ты получишь следующие случайные предметы." ame="Green female Costume Capsule for celebrating St’ Patricks Day. Following items are randomly given to you from the Capsule.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Green Indian Shirt(Attack +8 for all weapons), Green Sentimental Corset(Attack +8 for all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}Green Indian Mode Pants(Defense +9 against all weapons), Green Sentimental Pleats(Defense +9 against all weapons): 1day/7days/30days.{N}PEN(300PEN~50000PEN)" cns="为纪念圣帕特里克节而推出的女性套装扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="Green female Costume Capsule สำหรับการเฉลิมฉลองวันนักบุญ Patricks  คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมแบบสุ่มได้จากรายชื่อดังนี้:" twn="為紀念聖佩特利之日所發行的充滿綠光的女性服飾膠囊！使用膠囊道具時，如下道具會隨機獲得。" jap="セイントパトリックデーを記念し発売された、緑色いっぱいの女性コスチュームカプセル！カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul kostum  hijau perempuan untuk merayakan hari St. Patrick, barang berikut ini akan diberikan padamu secara acak dari kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4110030" kor="G의 메탈 스톰 캡슐" ger="G's Metal Storm Capsule" eng="G's Metal Storm Capsule" tur="G's Metal Storm Capsule" fre="G's Metal Storm Capsule" spa="G's Metal Storm Capsule" ita="G's Metal Storm Capsule" rus="G's Metal Storm Capsule" ame="G's Metal Storm Capsule" cns="G的金属风暴扭蛋" tha="G's Metal Storm Capsule" twn="G的金屬風暴膠囊" jap="【G】「メタルストーム」カプセル" idn="G Metal Storm Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110030" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得金属风暴的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
