	<string key="N4110117" kor="G의 번 시그마 블레이드 캡슐" ger="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" eng="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" tur="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" fre="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" spa="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" ita="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" rus="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" ame="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" cns="G的日轮之刃扭蛋" tha="G's Burn Sigma Blade Capsule" twn="G的業火變形刀膠囊" idn="G Burn Sigma Blade Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110117" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得日轮之刃的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4110118" kor="G의 진 카타나 캡슐" ger="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" eng="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" tur="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" fre="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" spa="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" ita="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" rus="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" ame="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" cns="G的日轮太刀扭蛋" tha="G's Zin-Katana Capsule" twn="G的日輪武士刀膠囊" idn="G Zin-Katana Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4110118" kor="넷스피어 전설의 해커 G가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel vom legendären Net-Sphere Hacker G. Sie enthält aus jeder Kategorie ein Item. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Efsanevi Net-Sphere Hacker'ı G tarafından sağlanan benzersiz bir kapsül eşyası. Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Item Capsule unique fourni par le légendaire Hacker G de la Net-Sphere. Tu peux obtenir un item pour chaque zone, alors tu vas gagner 3 items en tout avec une Capsule!" spa="Ítem cápsula único provisto por el legendario Net-Sphere Hacker G. Puedes obtener un item de  cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una cápsula!" ita="Capsula particolare fornita dal leggendario hacker G della Net-Sphere. Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale vincerai 3 oggetti con una sola Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная легендарными Hacker G из Net-Sphere. Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule item provided by the legendary Net-Sphere Hacker G. You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone 1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon.{N} 1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack (permanent).{N} (Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed +3%, HP+5, SP+5){N} 2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N} Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip (permanent or periodic).{N} 1. eSper chip : Magazine plus 1,2 or Reload speed up 1,2 (1hour or permanent).{N} 2. Weapon: attack+5/+6 (1day) or attack+1 (permanent){N} * If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N} Zone 3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000." cns="可以获得日轮太刀的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง จัดหาโดย  Net-Sphere Hacker G ในตำนาน คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมต่อไปนี้จากแต่ละ zone หมายความว่าแคปซูลเดียว ได้ไอเทมถึง 3 อัน!" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="伝説のハッカーGが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Barang kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker G legendaris Net Sphere. Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4110119" kor="비스티 보이 세트  캡슐" ger="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" eng="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" tur="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" fre="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" spa="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" ita="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" rus="Beasty Boy Set Capsule" cns="野兽男孩套装扭蛋" twn="狂心獸王膠囊" idn="Beasty Boy Set Capsule"/>
