	<string key="T4110127" kor="G의 코그휠 시그마 블레이드 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" eng="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 4 items in total from one Capsule!" spa="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 5 items in total from one Capsule!" ita="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 6 items in total from one Capsule!" rus="Capsule с Cogwheel Sigma Blade.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="G's Cogwheel sigma blade Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 8 items in total from one Capsule!" cns="可以获得极光之刃的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="NetSphere傳說的駭客 G所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N4110128" kor="G의 파이로트 에이스 세트 캡슐" ger="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule" eng="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule" tur="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule" fre="Casule Set Pirate Ace de G" spa="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule" ita="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule" rus="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule" cns="G的海盗王套装扭蛋" twn="G的海賊之星膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4110128" kor="G의 파이로트 에이스 세트 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule{N}Du erhältst ein Item aus jeder Zone. Insgesamt bekommst du aus einer Capsule also 3 Items!" eng="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Casule Set Pirate Ace de G{N}Vous pouvez recevoir un objet pour chaque partie, soit au total 3 objets dans une seule Capsule !" spa="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule{N}Puedes obtener un artículo de cada zona, así que podrás ganar 3 artículos en total de una Capsule!" ita="G's Pirate Ace Set Capsule{N}Puoi ricevere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale avrai 3 oggetti con una Capsule!" rus="G's Capsule Pirate Ace Set{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" cns="可以获得海盗王套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="G的海賊之星膠囊。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
