	<string key="T4110131" kor="두개의 유니크가 들어있는 G의 코그휠 더블 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" eng="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 2 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" spa="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" ita="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" rus="G's 2x Capsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 2 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="G's 2xCapsule Sigma &amp; Assault{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 2 items in total from one Capsule!" cns="装有两种特典武器的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="G的極光系雙武器膠囊內含兩種特殊版武器。{N}使用膠囊時可隨機獲得以下道具。"/>
	<string key="N4110132" kor="G의 체스코드 킹 캡슐" ger="G's Chess Code King Capsule" eng="G's Chess code King Capsule" tur="G's Chess code King Capsule" fre="G's Chess Code King Capsule" spa="G's Chess Code King Capsule" ita="G's Chess Code King Capsule" rus="G's Chess code King Capsule" cns="G的国际象棋国王扭蛋" twn="G的西洋棋紅國王膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4110132" kor="거울나라의 왕 체스코드 킹 펫 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Chess Code King Capsule{N}Du erhältst ein Item jeder Zone. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Capsule!" eng="Chess code king Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Chess code king Capsule{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="La Capsule de Chess Code King{N}" spa="Chess code king Capsule{N}Puedes obtener un artículo de cada zona, así que podrás ganar 3 artículos en total de una Capsule!" ita="Chess Code King Capsule{N}Puoi avere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi otterrai 3 oggetti totali con una Capsule!" rus="Capsule с Chess code King {N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" cns="可以获得国际象棋国王的宠物扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="鏡中屋內的紅國王寵物膠囊。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
