	<string key="T4111161" kor="아이템 사용시 7000펜이 지급 됩니다." cns="使用该道具可获得7000金币" twn="使用後可獲得7000 P幣"/>
	<string key="T4111162" kor="아이템 사용시 7500펜이 지급 됩니다." cns="使用该道具可获得7500金币" twn="使用後可獲得7500 P幣"/>
	<string key="T4111163" kor="아이템 사용시 10000펜이 지급 됩니다." cns="使用该道具可获得10000金币" twn="使用後可獲得10000 P幣"/>
	<string key="T4111164" kor="아이템 사용시 20000펜이 지급 됩니다." cns="使用该道具可获得20000金币" twn="使用後可獲得20000 P幣"/>
	<string key="T4120001" kor="해커 G의 무기에 대항하기 위해 해커 I가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel, hergestellt von Hacker I zum Kampf gegen die Waffen von Hacker G.{N}Du erhältst aus jeder Kategorie einen Gewinn, insgesamt also 3 Gewinne aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!." tur="Hacker G'nin silahlarına karşı Hacker I tarafından geliştirilen benzersiz kapsül.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Capsule unique que Hacker I fournit pour se battre contre les armes de Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir cet objet dans chaque zone, donc vous gagnerez trois objets au total à partir d'une captule!." spa="Capsule exclusiva que ofrece Hacker I para luchar contra las armas de Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un item de cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una Capsule!." ita="Capsule unica fornita da un Hacker per combattere contro le armi dell'Hacker G.{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi vincerai 3 oggetti in totale con una Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная Hacker I для борьбы с оружием от Hacker G.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon{N}1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack(permanent)(Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed+3%, HP+5%, SP+5){N}2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N}Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip(permanent or periodic){N}1. eSper chip Magazine plus 1/2 or Reload speed up 1/2(1hour or permanent){N}2. Weapon: attack+5/+6(1day) or attack+1(permanent){N}*If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N}Zone3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000" cns="可以获得小狗左轮的扭蛋。{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง ที่  Hacker I จัดหามาใช้ในการต่อสู้ต่อต้านกับอาวุธของHacker G.{N}คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมได้ 1 ชนิดจากแต่ละโซน หมายความว่าคุณจะได้รับถึง 3 ชนิดจากแคปซูลเดียว!" twn="為對抗駭客G的武器，是駭客 I所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="ハッカー【G】武器に対抗するためにハッカーIが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker I untuk bertarung melawan senjata Hacker G.{N}Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4120006" kor="I의 서브 머신건 화이트 캡슐" ger="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" eng="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" tur="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" fre="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" spa="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" ita="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" rus="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" ame="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" cns="I的白色速射双枪扭蛋" tha="I's Sub Machine Gun White Capsule" twn="的白色雙槍膠囊" jap="【I】「サブマシンガン・ホワイト」カプセル" idn="I Sub Machine Gun White Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4120002" kor="해커 G의 무기에 대항하기 위해 해커 I가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel, hergestellt von Hacker I zum Kampf gegen die Waffen von Hacker G.{N}Du erhältst aus jeder Kategorie einen Gewinn, insgesamt also 3 Gewinne aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!." tur="Hacker G'nin silahlarına karşı Hacker I tarafından geliştirilen benzersiz kapsül.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Capsule unique que Hacker I fournit pour se battre contre les armes de Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir cet objet dans chaque zone, donc vous gagnerez trois objets au total à partir d'une captule!." spa="Capsule exclusiva que ofrece Hacker I para luchar contra las armas de Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un item de cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una Capsule!." ita="Capsule unica fornita da un Hacker per combattere contro le armi dell'Hacker G.{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi vincerai 3 oggetti in totale con una Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная Hacker I для борьбы с оружием от Hacker G.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon{N}1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack(permanent)(Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed+3%, HP+5%, SP+5){N}2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N}Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip(permanent or periodic){N}1. eSper chip Magazine plus 1/2 or Reload speed up 1/2(1hour or permanent){N}2. Weapon: attack+5/+6(1day) or attack+1(permanent){N}*If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N}Zone3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000" cns="可以获得金色左轮手枪的扭蛋。{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง ที่  Hacker I จัดหามาใช้ในการต่อสู้ต่อต้านกับอาวุธของHacker G.{N}คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมได้ 1 ชนิดจากแต่ละโซน หมายความว่าคุณจะได้รับถึง 3 ชนิดจากแคปซูลเดียว!" twn="為對抗駭客G的武器，是駭客 I所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="ハッカー【G】武器に対抗するためにハッカーIが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker I untuk bertarung melawan senjata Hacker G.{N}Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4120007" kor="I의 아야! 라이플 캡슐" ger="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" eng="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" tur="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" fre="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" spa="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" ita="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" rus="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" ame="I's AYA Rifle Capsule" cns="I的超大号针筒扭蛋" twn="I的AYA!Rifle膠囊" jap="【I】「ホスピタルライフル」カプセル" idn="I AYA Rifle Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4120003" kor="해커 G의 무기에 대항하기 위해 해커 I가 제공하는 유니크 캡슐 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Einzigartige Kapsel, hergestellt von Hacker I zum Kampf gegen die Waffen von Hacker G.{N}Du erhältst aus jeder Kategorie einen Gewinn, insgesamt also 3 Gewinne aus einer Kapsel!" eng="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!." tur="Hacker G'nin silahlarına karşı Hacker I tarafından geliştirilen benzersiz kapsül.{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Capsule unique que Hacker I fournit pour se battre contre les armes de Hacker G.{N}Vous pouvez obtenir cet objet dans chaque zone, donc vous gagnerez trois objets au total à partir d'une captule!." spa="Capsule exclusiva que ofrece Hacker I para luchar contra las armas de Hacker G.{N}Puedes obtener un item de cada zona, así que ganarás 3 ítems en total de una Capsule!." ita="Capsule unica fornita da un Hacker per combattere contro le armi dell'Hacker G.{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi vincerai 3 oggetti in totale con una Capsule!" rus="Уникальная Capsule, предоставленная Hacker I для борьбы с оружием от Hacker G.{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" ame="Unique Capsule that Hacker I provides to fight against the weapons of Hacker G.{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}Zone1: Permanent weapon or Event coupon{N}1. A unique weapon item with Force Pack(permanent)(Force Pack info: Attack power+7, Movement Speed+3%, HP+5%, SP+5){N}2. Event coupon: This Coupon can be used in the Coupon Shop.{N}Zone 2: Weapons or eSper chip(permanent or periodic){N}1. eSper chip Magazine plus 1/2 or Reload speed up 1/2(1hour or permanent){N}2. Weapon: attack+5/+6(1day) or attack+1(permanent){N}*If you get more than one item of the same kind, the item duration will be accumulated.{N}Zone3: You can get PEN according to the probability from 1,000 to 100,000" cns="可以获得超大号针筒的扭蛋道具。{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="แคปซูลไอเทมสุดเจ๋ง ที่  Hacker I จัดหามาใช้ในการต่อสู้ต่อต้านกับอาวุธของHacker G.{N}คุณสามารถได้รับไอเทมได้ 1 ชนิดจากแต่ละโซน หมายความว่าคุณจะได้รับถึง 3 ชนิดจากแคปซูลเดียว!" twn="為對抗駭客G的武器，是駭客 I所提供的獨特膠囊道具。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。" jap="ハッカー【G】武器に対抗するためにハッカーIが開発したユニークカプセルアイテム。{N}カプセルアイテムを使用すると、次のようなアイテムをランダムで入手できます。" idn="Kapsul unik yang disediakan oleh Hacker I untuk bertarung melawan senjata Hacker G.{N}Kamu bisa mendapatkan satu barang di setiap wilayah, jadi kamu bisa memenangkan maksimal 3 barang dari 1 kapsul."/>
	<string key="N4120008" kor="I의 세미 라이플 골드 캡슐" ger="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" eng="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" tur="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" fre="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" spa="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" ita="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" rus="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" ame="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" cns="I的金色半自动步枪扭蛋" tha="I's Semi Rifle Gold Capsule" twn="I的黃金半自動狙擊膠囊" jap="【I】「セミライフル・ゴールド」カプセル" idn="I Semi Rifle Gold Capsule"/>
