	<string key="N2010033" kor="네오 스페이드 서브머신건" ger="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" eng="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" tur="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" fre="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" spa="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" ita="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" rus="Neo Spade Submachine Gun" cns="黑桃"/>
	<string key="T2010033" kor="이상한 나라에서 더 힘을 발휘하게 될 스페이드 문양의 서브머신건" ger="Pik-förmige Submachine Gun, die im Wonderland noch stärker wird" eng="Spade shaped Submachine Gun which becomes more powerful in Wonderland" tur="Spade shaped Submachine Gun which becomes more powerful in Wonderland" fre="Un Submachine Gun en forme de pique qui devient encore plus puissant au Pays des Merveilles" spa="Espada en forma de Submachine Gun que se hace más poderosa en Wonderland" ita="Submachine Gun a forma di pala che diventa più potente nel Paese delle Meraviglie." rus="Этот Submachine Gun в Стране чудес станет еще сильнее." cns="特典速射双枪。{N}在枪的末端装有黑桃标志。{N}拿着这把枪时，总觉得自己能摸到一把黑桃同花顺。"/>
	<string key="N1070040" kor="체셔 캣" ger="Cheshire Cat" eng="Cheshire Cat" tur="Cheshire Cat" fre="Cheshire Cat" spa="Cheshire Cat" ita="Cheshire Cat" rus="Cheshire Cat" cns="柴郡猫"/>
	<string key="T1070040" kor="어디서 무엇을 해야 할지 모르는 갈림길에서 유일하게 힌트를 건네줄 항상 이상한 웃음을 짓고 있는 체셔 고양이" ger="An einer Weggabelung gibt dir Cheshire Cat mit ihrem wundersamen Lächeln einen Hinweis" eng="Cheshire Cat has weird smile on its face seemingly drops a hint in forked road" tur="Cheshire Cat has weird smile on its face seemingly drops a hint in forked road" fre="Le Chat du Chesire aborde un sourire si étrange qu'il semble presque révéler une route scabreuse." spa="Cheshire Cat tiene una sonrisa extraña en su rostro y al parecer deja una pista en un camino bifurcado." ita="Il Cheshire Cat ha un sorriso strambo stampato in viso. Sembra sappia qualcosa su che strada scegliere." rus="У чеширского кота очень странная улыбка, наверное, он делает намек на раздвоенную дорогу." cns="当你站在不知通向何方的十字路口时，唯一能指引道具的，就是那只有着奇怪微笑的柴郡猫。"/>
	<string key="N4030164" kor="G의 네오 스페이드 서브머신건 캡슐" ger="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" eng="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" tur="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" fre="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" spa="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" ita="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" rus="G's Neo Spade Submachine Gun Capsule" cns="G的黑桃扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030164" kor="네오 스페이드 서브머신건을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Enthält die Neo Spade Submachine Gun.{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um eins der folgenden Items zu erhalten:" eng="A Capsule to get Neo Spade Submachine Gun{N}Use this Capsule to randomly get one of following items" tur="A Capsule to get Neo Spade Submachine Gun{N}Use this Capsule to randomly get one of following items" fre="Une Capsule qui contient peut-être le Neo Spade Submachine Gun{N}Utilisez cette Capsule pour obtenir l'un des objets suivants au hasard" spa="Cápsula para obtener la Neo Spade Submachine Gun{N}Usa esta  Capsule para obtener al azar uno de los siguientes objetos" ita="Una Capsule per avere la Neo Spade Submachine Gun.{N}Usa questa Capsule per ottenere in modo casuale uno dei seguenti oggetti." rus="Capsule, из которой можно получить Neo Spade Submachine Gun.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить по одному из случайных предметов." cns="可获得黑桃的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4030148" kor="클락 래빗 보이 세트 캡슐" ger="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" eng="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" tur="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" fre="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" spa="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" ita="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" rus="Clock Rabbit Boy Set Capsule" cns="兔子先生套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030148" kor="클락 래빗 보이 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule enthält das Clock Rabbit Boy Set.{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um folgende Items zu erhalten:" eng="You can get the Clock Rabbit Boy Set from this Capsule.{N}Use this Capsule to receive one of following items randomly" tur="You can get the Clock Rabbit Boy Set from this Capsule.{N}Use this Capsule to receive one of following items randomly" fre="Vous pourrez recevoir la panoplie du Clock Rabbit pour homme dans cette Capsule.{N}Utilisez la Capsule pour recevoir aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants." spa="De esta Capsule podrás obtener el Clock Rabbit Boy Set.{N}Usa esta Capsule para recibir uno de los siguientes objetos al azar." ita="In questa Capsule puoi trovare il Clock Rabbit Boy Set.{N}Usala per ricevere uno dei seguenti oggetti in modo casuale." rus="Capsule, из которой можно получить Clock Rabbit Boy Set.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить по одному из случайных предметов." cns="可以获得兔子先生套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
