	<string key="T4030167" kor="큐브 디펜스를 클리어한 S4리거에게 드리는 선물입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Belohnung für die Verteidigung des Cubes{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um eins der folgenden Items zu erhalten:" eng="A reward for defending the cube. {N}Use the Capsule to receive randomly one of the following items." tur="A reward for defending the cube. {N}Use the Capsule to receive randomly one of the following items." fre="Une récompense pour avoir protégé le cube. {N}Utilisez la Capsule pour recevoir une des objets suivants au hasard." spa="Recompensa por defender el cubo. {N}Usa la Capsule para recibir al azar uno de los siguientes objetos." ita="Una ricompensa per aver difeso il cubo.{N}Usa la Capsule per ricevere in modo casuale uno dei seguenti oggetti." rus="Награда за победу в кубе.{N}Используй капсулу, чтобы получить один из случайных предметов." cns="通关防守闯关后，可以获得该扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="完成方塊防禦的玩家獎品。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N4111065" kor="G의 로빈 훈트 캡슐" ger="G's Wastl Capsule" eng="G's Wastl Capsule" tur="G's Wastl Capsule" fre="G's Wastl Capsule" spa="G's Wastl Capsule" ita="G's Wastl Capsule" rus="G's Wastl Capsule" cns="G的猎犬罗宾宠物扭蛋" twn="G的羅賓亨特膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4120019" kor="PEN+50％ 캡슐" cns="金币+50％扭蛋" twn="PEN+50％膠囊" jap="PEN+50％カプセル"/>
	<string key="N1070047" kor="타우러스 펫" ger="Taurus Pet" eng="Taurus Pet" tur="Taurus Pet" fre="Familier du Taureau" spa="Taurus Pet" ita="Taurus Pet" rus="Taurus Pet" cns="金牛座" twn="金牛座的米諾"/>
	<string key="T1070047" kor="조디악 펫 컬렉션의 네 번째! 황소자리의 수호성" ger="Der vierte Teil der Zodiac Pet Collection: der Stier!" eng="The Fourth of the Zodiac Pet collection! Taurus" tur="The Fourth of the Zodiac Pet collection! Taurus" fre="Le quatrième familier de la collection du Zodiaque ! Le Taureau" spa="¡Número cuatro de la colección Zodiac Pet! Taurus" ita="Il quarto pet della collezione dello zodiaco: Taurus." rus="Номер четыре в коллекции питомцев зодиака! Телец." cns="十二星座宠物！金牛座！" twn="星座寵物系列！金牛座守護星"/>
	<string key="N4111066" kor="G의 나이트 카운터 스워드 캡슐" ger="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" eng="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" tur="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" fre="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" spa="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" ita="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" rus="G's Knight Counter Sword Capsule" cns="G的骑士角斗卫士扭蛋" twn="G的騎士魂護甲刀膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4120020" kor="EXP+30％ 캡슐" cns="经验值+30％扭蛋" twn="EXP+30％膠囊" jap="EXP+30％カプセル"/>
	<string key="N2000028" kor="후라이팬 스톰배트" ger="Frying Pan Stormbat" eng="Frying Pan Stormbat" tur="Frying Pan Stormbat" fre="Frying Pan Stormbat" spa="Frying Pan Stormbat" ita="Frying Pan Stormbat" rus="Frying Pan Stormbat" cns="平底锅"/>
	<string key="T2000028" kor="잘 숙련된 요리사의 솜씨처럼 강력한 손맛을 느끼고 싶다면 후라이팬 스톰배트가 제격!" ger="Diese Waffe verleiht dir das Gefühl von Macht und Stärke!" eng="If use this Weapon, You Can Feeling power and strength!" tur="If use this Weapon, You Can Feeling power and strength!" fre="Ressentez la puissance et la force avec cette nouvelle arme de destruction massive… ou pas !" spa="Si puedes usaa el poder y la fuerza del Weapon Feeling!" ita="Se ci riesci, usa il potere e la forza di quest'arma!" rus="Используй это оружие, чтобы почувствовать его вкус и силу!" cns="平底锅造型的特典蝙蝠风暴。{N}别以为一只手就能举起来，这家伙可是超乎想象的沉。{N}标签上写着不粘锅，但是上面的煎蛋却粘得牢牢的。"/>
	<string key="N4031004" kor="G의 DHa-41 서브머신건 캡슐(1+1)" ger="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" eng="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" tur="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" fre="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" spa="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" ita="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" rus="G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" cns="G的咸鱼双枪速射双枪扭蛋（1+1）"/>
	<string key="T4031004" kor="신규 서브머신건 유니크 출시 기념으로 한정 기간동안 풀리는 상품 등장! G의 Dha-41 서브머신건 캡슐을 1개 더 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Ein neues, limitiertes Event, mit dem die neue Serve Machine Gun Unique gefeiert wird! Als Bonus kannst du eine zusätzliche G's Dha-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule erhalten." eng="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's Dha-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule." tur="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's Dha-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule." fre="Un nouvel évènement à l'occasion de la sortie d'un &quot;Serve Machine Gun&quot; exclusif, valable pour une durée limitée ! Vous pourrez recevoir une G's Dha-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule bonus." spa="¡Un nuevo evento celebrando la nueva &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; por tiempo limitado! Podrás obtener una G's DHa-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." ita="Un nuovo evento celebra per poco tempo la nuova &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot;! Puoi ricevere una G's Dha-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." rus="Новое ограниченное событие в честь «обслуживания уникальных автоматов»! Ты можешь получить дополнительную G's Dha-41 Serve Machine Gun Capsule." cns="为了纪念新推出的特典速射双枪，够买此道具可以额外获得一个“G的咸鱼双枪扭蛋”"/>
	<string key="N4031009" kor="G의 화이트 서브머신건 캡슐(1+1)" ger="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" eng="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" tur="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" fre="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" spa="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" ita="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" rus="G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" cns="G的白色速射双枪扭蛋（1+1）"/>
	<string key="T4031009" kor="신규 서브머신건 유니크 출시 기념으로 한정 기간동안 풀리는 상품 등장! G의 화이트 서브머신건 캡슐을 1개 더 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Ein neues, limitiertes Event, mit dem die neue Serve Machine Gun Unique gefeiert wird! Als Bonus kannst du eine zusätzliche G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule erhalten." eng="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule." tur="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule." fre="Un nouvel évènement à l'occasion de la sortie d'un &quot;Serve Machine Gun&quot; exclusif, valable pour une durée limitée ! Vous pourrez recevoir une G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule bonus." spa="¡Un nuevo evento celebrando la nueva &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; por tiempo limitado! Podrás obtener una G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." ita="Un nuovo evento celebra per poco tempo la nuova &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot;! Puoi ricevere una G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." rus="Новое ограниченное событие в честь «обслуживания уникальных автоматов»! Ты можешь получить дополнительную G's White Serve Machine Gun Capsule." cns="为了纪念新推出的特典速射双枪，够买此道具可以额外获得一个“G的白色速射双枪扭蛋”"/>
	<string key="N4031052" kor="G의 샤크 서브머신건 캡슐(1+1)" ger="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" eng="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" tur="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" fre="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" spa="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" ita="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" rus="G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" cns="G的白鲨扭蛋（1+1）"/>
	<string key="T4031052" kor="신규 서브머신건 유니크 출시 기념으로 한정 기간동안 풀리는 상품 등장! G의 샤크 서브머신건 캡슐을 1개 더 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Ein neues, limitiertes Event, mit dem die neue Serve Machine Gun Unique gefeiert wird! Als Bonus kannst du eine zusätzliche G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule erhalten." eng="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule." tur="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule." fre="Un nouvel évènement à l'occasion de la sortie d'un &quot;Serve Machine Gun&quot; exclusif, valable pour une durée limitée ! Vous pourrez recevoir une G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule bonus." spa="¡Un nuevo evento celebrando la nueva &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; por tiempo limitado! Podrás obtener una G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." ita="Un nuovo evento celebra per poco tempo la nuova &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot;! Puoi ricevere una G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." rus="Новое ограниченное событие в честь «обслуживания уникальных автоматов»! Ты можешь получить дополнительную G's Shark Serve Machine Gun Capsule." cns="为了纪念新推出的特典速射双枪，够买此道具可以额外获得一个“G的白鲨扭蛋”"/>
	<string key="N4032164" kor="G의 네오 스페이드 서브머신건(1+1)" ger="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" eng="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" tur="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" fre="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" spa="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" ita="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" rus="G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule (1+1)" cns="G的黑桃（1+1）"/>
	<string key="T4032164" kor="신규 서브머신건 유니크 출시 기념으로 한정 기간동안 풀리는 상품 등장! G의 네오 스페이드 서브머신건 캡슐을 1개 더 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Ein neues, limitiertes Event, mit dem die neue Serve Machine Gun Unique gefeiert wird! Als Bonus kannst du eine zusätzliche G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule erhalten." eng="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule." tur="A new event celebrating the new &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; for a limited time! You can get an extra G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule." fre="Un nouvel évènement à l'occasion de la sortie d'un &quot;Serve Machine Gun&quot; exclusif, valable pour une durée limitée ! Vous pourrez recevoir une G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule bonus." spa="¡Un nuevo evento celebrando la nueva &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot; por tiempo limitado! Podrás obtener una G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." ita="Un nuovo evento celebra per poco tempo la nuova &quot;Serve Machine Gun Unique&quot;! Puoi ricevere una G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule extra." rus="Новое ограниченное событие в честь «обслуживания уникальных автоматов»! Ты можешь получить дополнительную G's Neo Spade Serve Machine Gun Capsule." cns="为了纪念新推出的特典速射双枪，够买此道具可以额外获得一个“G的黑桃扭蛋”"/>
	<string key="N4030172" kor="에리즈 펫 캡슐" ger="Aries Pet Capsule" eng="Aries Pet Capsule" tur="Aries Pet Capsule" fre="Capsule du Bélier" spa="Aries Pet Capsule" ita="Aries Pet Capsule" rus="Aries Pet Capsule" cns="白羊座宠物扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030172" kor="에리즈 펫을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Enthält das Aries Pet.{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um eins der folgenden Items zu erhalten:" eng="With this Capsule you can get the Aries Pet.{N}If the Capsule Item is used, you will get the following items." tur="With this Capsule you can get the Aries Pet.{N}If the Capsule Item is used, you will get the following items." fre="Vous pourrez recevoir le familier du Bélier dans cette Capsule.{N}En utilisant la Capsule, vous recevrez l'un des objets suivants." spa="Con esta Capsule, podrás obtener el Aries Pet.{N}Si se usa la Capsule, recibirás los siguientes artículos." ita="In questa Capsule puoi trovare il Pet Aries.{N}Usandola, riceverai i seguenti oggetti." rus="Из этой капсулы с питомцем можно получить овна.{N}Открыв капсулу, ты получишь следующие предметы." cns="可以获得白羊座宠物的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N3070002" kor="비엔나 소시지 바인드" ger="Vienna Sausage Bind" eng="Vienna Sausage Bind" tur="Vienna Sausage Bind" fre="Laisse Saucisse de Vienne" spa="Vienna Sausage Bind" ita="Vienna Sausage Bind" rus="Vienna Sausage Bind" cns="维也纳香肠"/>
	<string key="T3070002" kor="쫄깃쫄깃, 탱글탱글 보기만 해도 군침도는 비엔나 소시지! 나만 먹지말고 상대에게도 시원하게 먹여주자!{N}직선에 놓인 적을 사슬로 묶는 스킬. 묶인 상대방은 3초간 그 자리에 고정된다. 단, 바인드에 걸린 상대라도 공격 및 스킬 사용은 가능하다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}SP사용량 감소(-20%),사용거리 증가(+20%)" ger="Eine sehr leckere Wurst! Fessle deinen Gegner mit Ketten. Gefesselte Spieler können sich 3 Sekunden lang nicht bewegen, aber Skills benutzen und angreifen.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Reduzierter SP-Verbrauch(-20%), erhöhte Reichweite(+20%)" eng="Very delicious sausage! Tie up the enemy with chains. Bounded players cannot move for 3 seconds but able to use skills and attack.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}SP Reduced consumption(-20%)),Use distance Increase(+20%)" tur="Very delicious sausage! Tie up the enemy with chains. Bounded players cannot move for 3 seconds but able to use skills and attack.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}SP Reduced consumption(-20%)),Use distance Increase(+20%)" fre="De délicieuses saucisses ! Enchaînez vos adversaires grâce à cette ribambelle de saucisses. Les joueurs ainsi capturés sont incapables de se déplacer pendant 3 secondes mais peuvent continuer d'attaquer.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Réduction du coût en SP(-20%),Augmentation du rayon d'attaque(+20%)" spa="¡Una salchicha muy deliciosa! Encadena a los enemigos. Los jugadores atados no pueden moverse durante 3 segundos pero pueden usar habilidades y atacar.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Reducción en el consumo de SP(-20%)),Incremento en la distancia de uso(+20%)" ita="Un'ottima salsiccia! Incatena il nemico. I giocatori bloccati non possono muoversi per 3 secondi, ma possono usare skill e attaccare.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Consumo degli SP -20%, distanza d'uso +20%." rus="Очень вкусная сосиска! Охвати врага цепями! Пойманный игрок не сможет двигаться 3 секунды, но сможет использовать умения и атаковать.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Снижен расход SP (-20%), повышена дальность действия (+20%)." cns="劲道可口的维也纳香肠做成的特典禁锢锁链！{N}不要光顾自己吃，也要照顾敌人哦！{N}被绑住的敌人会固定在原地3秒钟。但是，被禁锢锁链困住的敌人也能攻击和使用技能。{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}能量消耗-20%,使用距离+20%"/>
	<string key="N2000027" kor="어쌔신 스파이대거" ger="Assassin Spy Dagger" eng="Assassin Spy Dagger" tur="Assassin Spy Dagger" fre="Spy Dagger Assassine" spa="Assassin Spy Dagger" ita="Assassin Spy Dagger" rus="Assassin Spy Dagger" cns="暗夜匕首" twn="刺客匕首"/>
	<string key="Rule_Dagger" kor="어쌔신 스파이대거" ger="Assassin Spy Dagger" eng="Rule Dagger" tur="Assassin Spy Dagger" fre="Spy Dagger Assassine" spa="Assassin Spy Dagger" ita="Assassin Spy Dagger" rus="Assassin Spy Dagger" cns="暗夜匕首" twn="刺客匕首"/>	
	<string key="T2000027" kor="어두움 속에 감춰진 암살자의 포스를 느껴보자! 어쌔신 스파이대거!" ger="Spüre die Macht des Attentäters, der sich in der Dunkelheit versteckt! Assassin Spy Dagger!" eng="Feel the force of the assassin hidden in the darkness! Assassin Spy Dagger!" tur="Feel the force of the assassin hidden in the darkness! Assassin Spy Dagger!" fre="Ressentez la puissance dévastatrice dissimulée dans l'obscurité avec cette Spy Dagger assassine !" spa="¡Siente el poder de un asesino oculto en la oscuridad! ¡Assassin Spy Dagger!" ita="Senti la forza di un assassino nascosto nell'oscurità con l'Assassin Spy Dagger!" rus="Почувствуй силу наемника из темноты! Assassin Spy Dagger!" cns="暗夜杀手使用的特典战术匕首。让我们感受一下隐藏在黑暗，杀人于无形的武器！" twn="隱身在黑暗之中的刺客匕首！"/>
	<string key="N4030173" kor="G의 어쌔신 스파이대거 캡슐" ger="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" eng="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" tur="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" fre="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" spa="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" ita="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" rus="G's Assassin Spy Dagger Capsule" cns="G的暗夜匕首扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030173" kor="어쌔신 스파이대거를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Enthält den Assassin Spy Dagger. {N}Benutze diese Capsule, um eins der folgenden Items zu erhalten:" eng="With this Capsule you can get the Assassin Spy Dagger.{N}If the Capsule Item is used, you will get the following items." tur="With this Capsule you can get the Assassin Spy Dagger.{N}If the Capsule Item is used, you will get the following items." fre="Vous pourrez recevoir la Spy Dagger assassine grâce à cette Capsule.{N}En utilisant la Capsule, vous recevrez l'un des objets suivants." spa="Con esta Capsule, podrás obtener la Assassin Spy Dagger.{N}Si se usa la Capsule, recibirás los siguientes artículos." ita="In questa Capsule puoi trovare l'Assassin Spy Dagger.{N}Aprendo la Capsule, puoi ottenere i seguenti oggetti." rus="Из этой капсулы можно получить Assassin Spy Dagger.{N}Открыв капсулу, ты получишь следующие предметы." cns="暗夜匕首的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
