	<string key="T4050347" kor="러블리 쿡 복장 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Lovely Cook Costume Set {N}Benutze dieses Set-Item, um folgende Items zu erhalten:" eng="Lovely Cook Costume Set.{N}Use this set item and you will receive the following items." tur="Lovely Cook Costume Set.{N}Use this set item and you will receive the following items." fre="L'adorable Costume de Cuisinière.{N}En utilisant le set, vous recevrez aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants." spa="Lovely Cook Costume Set. {N}Usa este set y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos:" ita="Lovely Cook Costume Set.{N}Usalo per ricevere i seguenti oggetti." rus="Костюм Lovely Cook.{N}Используй этот набор, чтобы получить следующие предметы." cns="可爱的厨娘套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4050348" kor="러블리 쿡 복장 세트(내구제)" ger="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Permanent)" eng="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Permanent)" tur="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Permanent)" fre="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Permanent)" spa="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Permanent)" ita="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Permanent)" rus="Lovely Cook Costume Set (Бессрочн.)" cns="可爱的厨娘套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="T4050348" kor="러블리 쿡 복장 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Lovely Cook Costume Set {N}Benutze dieses Set-Item, um folgende Items zu erhalten:" eng="Lovely Cook Costume Set.{N}Use this set item and you will receive the following items." tur="Lovely Cook Costume Set.{N}Use this set item and you will receive the following items." fre="L'adorable Costume de Cuisinière.{N}En utilisant le set, vous recevrez aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants." spa="Lovely Cook Costume Set. {N}Usa este set y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos:" ita="Lovely Cook Costume Set.{N}Usalo per ricevere i seguenti oggetti." rus="Костюм Lovely Cook.{N}Используй этот набор, чтобы получить следующие предметы." cns="可爱的厨娘套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4050349" kor="비엔나 소시지 바인드(캡슐)" ger="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" eng="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" tur="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" fre="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" spa="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" ita="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" rus="Vienna Sausage Bind Capsule" cns="维也纳香肠扭蛋" twn="心心腸膠囊"/>
	<string key="T4050349" kor="비엔나 소시지 바인드를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}비엔나 소시지 바인드(내구제/SP사용량 감소(-20%),사용거리 증가(+20%)){N}비엔나 소시지 바인드(7일/SP사용량 감소(-20%),사용거리 증가(+20%)){N}비엔나 소시지 바인드(30일/SP사용량 감소(-20%),사용거리 증가(+20%))" ger="Enthält das Vienna Sausage Bind.{N}Benutze dieses Capsule-Item, um zufällig eins der folgenden Items zu erhalten:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Vienna Sausage Bind(Permanent/verringerter SP-Verbrauch (-20%),{N}erhöhte Reichweite (+20%)){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(7Tage/verringerter SP-Verbrauch (-20%),{N}erhöhte Reichweite (+20%)){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(30Tage/verringerter SP-Verbrauch (-20%), erhöhte Reichweite (+20%))" eng="Vienna Sausage Bind can be acquired.{N}Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Vienna Sausage Bind(Permanent/SP Reduced consumption(-20%)),{N}Use distance Increase(+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(7days/SP Reduced consumption(-20%)),{N}Use distance Increase(+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(30Days/SP Reduced consumption(-20%),Use distance Increase(+20%))" tur="Vienna Sausage Bind can be acquired.{N}Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Vienna Sausage Bind(Permanent/SP Reduced consumption(-20%)),{N}Use distance Increase(+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(7days/SP Reduced consumption(-20%)),{N}Use distance Increase(+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(30Days/SP Reduced consumption(-20%),Use distance Increase(+20%))" fre="Vous pourrez obtenir la laisse Saucisse de Vienne dans cette Capsule.{N}En utilisant la Capsule, vous recevrez aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Laisse Saucisse de Vienne (Permanent/Consommation de SP réduite(-20%)),{N}Distance d'utilisation augmentée(+20%){N}Laisse Saucisse de Vienne (7jours/Consommation de SP réduite(-20%)),{N}Distance d'utilisation augmentée(+20%){N}Laisse Saucisse de Vienne (30 jours/Consommation de SP réduite(-20%),{N}Distance d'utilisation augmentée(+20))" spa="El Vienna Sausage Bind puede ser adquirido. {N}Usa esta Capsule y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos al azar.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Vienna Sausage Bind(Permanent/consumo de SP Reducido(-20%)),{N}Distancia de uso Incrementada(+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(7days/consumo de SP Reducido(-20%)),{N}Distancia de uso Incrementada(+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind(30Days/consumom de SP reducido(-20%),Distancia de uso incrementada(+20%))" ita="Si può ottenere il Vienna Sausage Bind.{N}Usa questa Capsule per ricevere in modo casuale alcuni degli oggetti seguenti.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Vienna Sausage Bind Permanent / consumo degli SP -20%),{N}distanza d'uso +20%{N}Vienna Sausage Bind (7 giorni / consumo degli SP -20%),{N}distanza d'uso +20%{N}Vienna Sausage Bind (30 giorni / consumo degli SP -20%, distanza d'uso +20%)" rus="Можно получить цепь из венских сосисок.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Vienna Sausage Bind (бессрочн./снижен расход SP (-20%)),{N}повышена дальность действия (+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind (7 дней/снижен расход SP (-20%)),{N}повышена дальность действия (+20%){N}Vienna Sausage Bind (30 дней/снижен расход SP (-20%), повышена дальность действия (+20%))" cns="可以获得维也纳香肠的扭蛋。{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得下列道具：{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}维也纳香肠（永久/能量消耗-20%，使用距离+20%）{N}维也纳香肠（7日/能量消耗-20%，使用距离+20%）{N}维也纳香肠（30日/能量消耗-20%，使用距离+20%）" twn="可獲得心心腸的膠囊。{N}使用膠囊道具時，會隨機獲得如下道具。{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}心心腸(耐久制/SP使用量減少(-20%),使用距離增加(+20%)){N}心心腸(7天/SP使用量減少(-20%),使用距離增加(+20%)){N}心心腸(30天/SP使用量減少(-20%),使用距離增加(+20%))"/>
	<string key="N3010002" kor="서핑 보드 앵커링" ger="surfingboard anchoring" eng="surfingboard anchoring" tur="surfingboard anchoring" fre="surfingboard anchoring" spa="surfingboard anchoring" ita="surfingboard anchoring" rus="surfingboard anchoring" cns="动力冲浪板" twn="立體機動衝浪板"/>
	<string key="T3010002" kor="무더운 여름의 기운을 말끔히 해소해줄 시원한 수상 스포츠! 유니크형 앵커링!.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%)" ger="Kühle dich ab und surfe durch die Lüfte mit dem Surfboard Anchoring {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Reduzierter SP-Verbrauch(-5%), erhöhte Reichweite(+5%)" eng="Give the energy of the hot summer clean up the cool water sports! Anchoring unique type!{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}SP Reduced consumption(-5%),Use distance Increase(+5%)" tur="Give the energy of the hot summer clean up the cool water sports! Anchoring unique type!{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}SP Reduced consumption(-5%),Use distance Increase(+5%)" fre="Donner l'énergie de l'été chaud nettoyer les sports d'eau fraîche! Ancrage type unique!{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Réduction du coût en SP(-5%),Augmentation du rayon d'attaque(+5%)" spa="Dale la energía del verano caliente limpiar los deportes de agua fría! Anclaje tipo único!{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Reducción en el consumo de SP(-5%),Incremento en la distancia de uso(+5%)" ita="Dare l'energia della calda estate ripulire gli sport d'acqua fresca! Ancoraggio tipo unico!{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Consumo degli SP -5%, distanza d'uso +5%." rus="Высвободи свою энергию в освежающем летнем спорте! Теперь с уникальным якорем!{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Снижен расход SP (-5%), повышена дальность действия (+5%)." cns="为冲浪爱好者提供的特典飞索滑板！{N}踩在冲浪板上，可以将炎热的空气一扫而光！{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}能量消耗-5%，使用距离+5%" twn="特製的衝浪板 ! 不止能在海邊破浪，還能強化機動性 !"/>
	<string key="N3020002" kor="데스 윙" ger="Wings of Death" eng="Wings of Death" tur="Wings of Death" fre="Wings of Death" spa="Wings of Death" ita="Wings of Death" rus="Wings of Death" ame="Wings of Death" cns="路西法之翼"/>
	<string key="T3020002" kor="기존 플라잉의 강화 버전! 바이러스로 감염 된 악마의 날개를 이용하여 공중으로 이동하는 스킬. 시전 시 빠르게 상승해 높은 곳으로 이동하여 점령할 수 있으며, 기존 플라잉보다 빠른 이동이 가능하다. .{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%),이동속도(+10%)" ger="Neu verbesserte Dämonenflügel! Spüre ihre Geschwindigkeit und sei schneller an einer guten Position als deine Gegner.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(-5% SP-Verbrauch, +10% Movement Speed)" eng="Newly enhanced Demon wings! Feel the speed of demon wings and get better position before your enemy. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP usage -5%, MoveSpeed +10%)" tur="Yeniden elden geçirilmiş Demon Wings! Şeytanın kanatlarının hızını hissedin ve düşmanınızdan daha iyi bir pozisyona sahip olun.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Kalıcı/ -%5 SP kullanım oranı, MoveSpeed +%10)" fre="Des Ailes de Démon améliorées ! Bénéficiez de la vitesse des ailes de Démon pour vous déplacer encore plus rapidement que vos ennemis.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Utilisation du SP (-10%), MoveSpeed (+10%))" spa="¡Nuevas alas de demonio mejoradas! Siente la velocidad de las alas de demonio y consigue una mejor posición ante el enemigo.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(uso de SP (-5%), Defensa (+5%))" ita="Nuove ali di demone ancora più potenti! Prova l'agilità di queste ali e conquista una posizione migliore prima del nemico. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(utilizzo di SP (-10%), MoveSpeed (+10%))" rus="Новые улучшенные демонические крылья! Почувствуй всю мощь демонических крыльев и получи преимущество над врагом.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Расход SP -5%, скорость передвижения +10%)" cns="传说中的堕落天使——路西法的翅膀！比一般的零式羽翼更强大！可以更快地占领制高点，移动速度也更快。{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}持续能量消耗-10%，移动速度+10%"/>
	<string key="N3060003" kor="아이스 블록" ger="Ice Block" eng="Ice Block" tur="Ice Block" fre="Ice Block" spa="Ice Block" ita="Ice Block" rus="Ice Block" cns="寒冰纳米掩体"/>
	<string key="T3060003" kor="더 월드에서 개량한 블록. 얼음 결정의 견고함을 더해 더욱 단단한 블록 생성이 가능하다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}아이스 블록(SP사용량 감소(-10%), HP 증가(+10%))" ger="Block, der von The World verbessert wurde. Seine Festigkeit ist durch Eiskristalle erhöht. Ice Block {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP-Verbrauch -16%, HP +7%)" eng="Block that is upgraded by The World. Increase the solidity of the Block by using ice crystals. Ice Block {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP Usage (-16%), HP (+7%)" tur="The World tarafından yükseltilen Block. Block'un sağlamlığını buz kristaller kullanarak artırır. Ice Block {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP Kullanımı (%-16), HP (+%7)" fre="Un Bloc qui a été amélioré par The World. Vous pouvez augmenter la solidité du Bloc en utilisant des cristaux de glace. Ice Block {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Utilisation des SP (-16%), HP (+7%))" spa="Bloque actualizado por The World. Incrementa la solidez del bloque usando cristales de hielo. Ice Block {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Uso de SP (-16%), HP (+7%)" ita="Blocco migliorato da The World. Aumenta la solidità del blocco utilizzando cristalli di ghiaccio. Ice Block {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Uso SP (-16%), HP (+7%)" rus="Улучшенный блок от компании The World. Специальные кристаллы льда увеличили прочность блока. Ice Block{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Расход SP -16%, HP +7%)" cns="经过艾斯波科技改良的纳米掩体。艾斯波科技往里面添加了冰块结晶分子后，坚硬度提升了一个等级。{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}能量消耗-10%，生命+10%"/>
	<string key="N3080002" kor="골든 메탈릭" ger="Golden Metallic" eng="Golden Metallic" tur="Golden Metallic" fre="Golden Metallic" spa="Golden Metallic" ita="Golden Metallic" rus="Golden Metallic" cns="强化合金护甲"/>
	<string key="T3080002" kor="기존 메탈릭의 강화 버전! 신체를 더욱 단단한 금빛 강철로 바꾸어 탄환을 팅겨내는 방어형 스킬. 사용 중에는 이동할 수 없다. 메탈릭 상태에서는 체력이 서서히 회복되며 방어력이 상승함과 동시에 받은 데미지의 일부분을 공격한 사람에게 되돌려준다..{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}지속 SP사용량 감소(-5%),방어력 증가(+5%)" ger="Dieser defensive Skill verwandelt den Körper in harten Stahl, wodurch Kugeln abprallen. Während dieser Skill aktiv ist, kann der Charakter nicht bewegt werden. Im Metallic-Status erhält der Charakter kontinuierlich HP und die Verteidigung wird erhöht. Gleichzeitig wird Schaden auf den Angreifer zurückreflektiert.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(-5% SP-Verbrauch, +5% Verteidigung)" eng="Defensive skill bounces off bullets by changing the character’s body to hard steel. The character cannot move while he uses the skill. On Metallic status, a character gets his HP gradually and defensive power increases as well. At the same time, it gives the damage back to the attacker. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP usage -5%, Defense +5%)" tur="Karakterin vücudunu sert bir çeliğe dönüştürerek mermileri sektiren bir savunma becerisi. Karakter bu beceriyi kullanırken hareket edemez. Metallic durumdayken karakter savunma gücünü ve HP'sini yavaş yavaş yeniler. Ayrıca bu beceri, hasarı tekrar saldıran kişiye gönderir.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP Kullanımı (-%5), Savunma (+%5))" fre="Skill défensif qui fait rebondir les balles en transformant le corps du personnage en acier résistant. Le  personnage ne peut pas bouger pendant qu'il utilise le skill. Pendant le statut Metallic, le personnage obtient régulièrement des HP et sa défense augmente aussi. En même temps, il renvoit les dégats aux attaquants.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Utilisation du SP (-5%), Défense (+5%))" spa="Skill defensivo que rebota las balas convirtiendo  el cuerpo del personaje en  acero  duro. El personaje no puede moverse mientras usa el skill. En el estado Metallico, el  personaje recupera su HP gradualmente y su poder defensivo aumenta también. Al mismo tiempo  devuelve el daño de vuelta al atacante,{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(uso de SP (-5%), Defensa (+5%))" ita="Skill difensiva che fa rimbalzare i proiettili rendendo d'acciaio il corpo del personaggio. Con Metallic, il personaggio recupera gradualmente gli HP e aumenta la difesa. Allo stesso tempo, restitusce il danno al nemico che lo attacca.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(utilizzo di SP (-5%), Difesa (+5%))" rus="Оборонительное умение способное отбросить пули, превратив персонажа в сталь. Во время использования персонаж не может двигаться. В состоянии Metallic постепенно восполняется HP и увеличивается сила защиты, а любой нанесенный урон отражается обратно на атакующего.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(Расход SP -5%, защита +5%)" cns="特典合金护甲！可以把身体变为更坚固的金色钢铁。使用中无法移动。在合金护甲发动时，生命会慢慢恢复，防御伤害的同时，能将一部分伤害反弹给攻击的人。{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}持续能量消耗-5%，防御力+5%"/>
	<string key="N4130001" kor="MP FILL (숙련도 고정수치 증가)" ger="MP Fill" eng="MP Fill" tur="MP Fill" fre="Charge MP" spa="MP Fill" ita="MP Fill" rus="MP Fill" cns="增加熟练度"/>
	<string key="T4130001" kor="숙련도가 부여된 아이템에 사용 시에 일정 고정 수치의 숙련도를 채워주는 횟수제 아이템입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}사용방법: 사용 시에 마우스 커서 모양이 활성화되며 아이템 슬롯에 직접 클릭하여 사용할 수 있습니다.{N}마우스 오른쪽 클릭 또는 ESC 버튼 입력 시 사용이 취소됩니다." ger="Mit diesem Item wird die MP-Leiste aufgefüllt. {N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Anwendung: Wird direkt im Itemslot per Mausklick aktiviert.{N} Abbrechen mit rechter Maustaste oder der ESC-Taste." eng="Certain MP gauge will be filled if the item is used. {N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}How to use: Mouse cursor activated and It can be used directly in the item slot {N}, will be cancel when Mouse Right click or ESC to cancel" tur="Certain MP gauge will be filled if the item is used. {N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}How to use: Mouse cursor activated and It can be used directly in the item slot {N}, will be cancel when Mouse Right click or ESC to cancel" fre="La jauge de MP sera rechargée d'un certain montant. {N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Utilisation : peut être activé avec un simple clic ou directement dans l'emplacement réservé{N}, peut être annulé avec un clic-droit ou en appuyant sur la touche ESC" spa="Si se usa este artículo, el indicador de MP se llenará hasta cierta cantidad. {N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Cómo usarlo: Con el cursor del ratón activado, puede ser usado directamente en la ranura del artículo {N}, y se cancelará cuando se pulse el botón derecho o el botón ESC." ita="Usando l'oggetto, sarà ricaricata una certa quantità di MP. {N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Come si usa: con il cursore del mouse attivo, si può usare direttamente nello slot dell'oggetto.{N}Si annulla cliccando col tasto destro del mouse o col bottone ESC." rus="Заполняет определенное количество шкалы MP.{N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Применение: нажать на «использовать» и навести курсором мыши на ячейку с предметом.{N}Чтобы отменить действие нажми на ПКМ или ESC клавишу." cns="使用该道具时，增加一定量的道具熟练度。{N}{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}使用方法：直接点击需要增加熟练度的道具。{N}取消方法：单击鼠标右键或按ESC按钮。"/>
	<string key="N4031169" kor="G의 체스코드 킹 캡슐" ger="G's Chess Code King Capsule" eng="G's Chess code King Capsule" tur="G's Chess code King Capsule" fre="G's Chess Code King Capsule" spa="G's Chess Code King Capsule" ita="G's Chess Code King Capsule" rus="G's Chess code King Capsule" cns="G的国际象棋国王扭蛋"/>
