	<string key="N1070048" kor="제미니 펫" ger="Gemini Pet" eng="Gemini Pet" tur="Gemini Pet" fre="Gemini Pet" spa="Gemini Pet" ita="Gemini Pet" rus="Gemini Pet" cns="双子座" twn="雙子的瑪吉力"/>
	<string key="T1070048" kor="조디악 펫 컬렉션의 다섯번째! 쌍둥이 자리의 수호성" ger="Der fünfte Teil der Zodiac Pet Collection: Zwillinge!" eng="The Fifth of the Zodiac Pet collection! Gemini" tur="The Fifth of the Zodiac Pet collection! Gemini" fre="Le cinquième familier de la collection du Zodiaque! Gémeaux" spa="quinto de la colección Zodiac Pet! Géminis" ita="Il quinto pet della collezione dello zodiaco: Gemelli." rus="Пятый питомец из коллекции зодиака! Близнецы." cns="十二星座宠物！双子座！" twn="星座寵物系列首發! 雙子座守護星"/>
	<string key="N2020008" kor="엄브렐러 라이트 머신 건" ger="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" eng="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" tur="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" fre="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" spa="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" ita="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" rus="Umbrella Light Machine Gun" cns="雨伞轻机枪" twn="傘彈槍"/>
	<string key="T2020008" kor="요인 암살을 위해 중국에 파견된 해커집단이 우산속에 몰래 숨겨 반입한 무기, 평화롭게 우산을 펼치고 있다가도 순식간에 소나기와 같은 총알을 쏟아내는 라이트 머신건 유니크." ger="Dieses einzigartige Maschinengewehr wurde von einer Gruppe Hacker heimlich nach China gebracht. Ursprünglich sollten mit ihr Agenten ausgeschaltet werden." eng="This unique machinegun was secretly imported to China by the group of hackers. It was orginally designed to assasinate agents." tur="This unique machinegun was secretly imported to China by the group of hackers. It was orginally designed to assasinate agents." fre="Ce Machine Gun unique a été importé en Chine illégalement par un groupe de hackers. Il fut à l'origine crée pour assassiner des agents." spa="Esta exclusiva ametralladora fue importada en secreto a China por un grupo de hackers. Fue originalmente diseñada para asesinar agentes." ita="Questa Machine Gun unica è stata importata in segreto in Cina dal gruppo di hacker. In origine, era stata ideata per assassinare degli agenti." rus="Этот уникальный пулемет группа хакеров тайно импортировала в Китай. Его первоначальным предназначением было убийство спецагентов." cns="功夫少女使用的特典轻机枪。{N}既可以拗造型，又可以在危急关头向敌人倾泻子弹。{N}伞下的少女……想想就让人心动。" twn="為了暗殺重要人物，而讓駭客集團藏匿在傘中偷渡進中國的武器。將傘打開便能瞬間發射出如驟雨般的子彈，是十大暗器之一。"/>
	<string key="N4030180" kor="제미니 펫 캡슐" ger="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" eng="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" tur="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" fre="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" spa="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" ita="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" rus="G's Gemini Pet Capsule" cns="双子座宠物扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030180" kor="제미니 펫을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Enthält das Gemini Pet.{N}Benutze dieses Capsule-Item, um ein zufälliges Item aus folgenden Items zu erhalten:" eng="Gemini Pet can be acquired.{N}Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Gemini Pet can be acquired.{N}Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly." fre="Vous pourrez obtenir le familier Gémeaux dans cette Capsule.{N}En utilisant la Capsule, vous recevrez aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants." spa="El Gemini Pet puede ser adquirido.{N}Usa esta Capsule y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos al azar:" ita="Puoi trovare il pet Gemini.{N}Usa questa Capsule per ricevere in modo casuale alcuni dei seguenti oggetti." rus="Можно получить близнецов в питомцы.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得双子座宠物的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4030181" kor="G의 엄브렐러 라이트 머신건 캡슐" ger="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" eng="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" tur="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" fre="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" spa="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" ita="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" rus="G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun" cns="G的雨伞轻机枪扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030181" kor="엄브렐러 라이트 머신건을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Enthält die G's Umbrella Light Machine Gun.{N}Benutze dieses Capsule-Item, um ein zufälliges Item aus folgenden Items zu erhalten:" eng="Umbrella Light Machine Gun can be acquired.{N}Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Umbrella Light Machine Gun can be acquired.{N}Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly." fre="Vous pourrez obtenir le Umbrella Light Machine Gun dans cette Capsule.{N}En utilisant la Capsule, vous recevrez aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants." spa="La Umbrella Light Machine Gun puede ser adquirida. {N}Usa esta Capsule y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos al azar:" ita="Puoi trovare l'Umbrella Light Machine Gun.{N}Usa questa Capsule per ricevere in modo casuale alcuni dei seguenti oggetti." rus="Можно получить Umbrella Light Machine Gun.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得雨伞轻机枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
