	<string key="N4050366" kor="서핑보드 앵커링(캡슐)" ger="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" eng="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" tur="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" fre="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" spa="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" ita="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" rus="Surfingboard Anchoring Capsule" cns="动力冲浪板扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4050366" kor="서핑보드 앵커링을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}서핑보드 앵커링(내구제/SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%)){N}서핑보드 앵커링(7일/SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%)){N}서핑보드 앵커링(30일/SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%))" ger="Mit dieser Capsule kannst du den Surfingboard Anchoring Skill bekommen.{N}Wenn du diese Capsule benutzt, hast du die Chance, folgende Items zu gewinnen: {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfingboard Anchoring (permanent/SP-Verbrauch -5%/Reichweite +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7Tage/SP-Verbrauch -5%/Reichweite +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (30Tage/SP-Verbrauch -5%/Reichweite +5%)" eng="With this Capsule, you might able to earn the surfingboard achoring skill. {N}If the Capsule is used, you will have the chance to win the item below. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfing Board Anchoring (Permanent/ SP usage -5%, Range increased by +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7 days/ SP Usage -5%, Range increased by +5%){N} Surfingboard Anchoring (30 days/ SP usage -5%, Range increased by +5%)" tur="With this Capsule, you might able to earn the surfingboard achoring skill. {N}If the Capsule is used, you will have the chance to win the item below. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfing Board Anchoring (Permanent/ SP usage -5%, Range increased by +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7 days/ SP Usage -5%, Range increased by +5%){N} Surfingboard Anchoring (30 days/ SP usage -5%, Range increased by +5%)" fre="Vous recevrez peut-être la compétence Surfingboard Achoring dans cette Capsule. {N}En utilisant la Capsule, vous recevrez peut-être l'un des objets suivants. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfing Board Anchoring (Permanent/SP/Utilisation du SP -5%, Rayon augmenté de +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7 jours/Utilisation du SP -5%, Rayon augmenté de +5){N} Surfingboard Anchoring (30 jours/Utilisation du SP -5%, Rayon augmenté de +5%)" spa="Con estas Capsule, podrás ganar el Surfing Board Anchoring Skill. {N}Si se usa la Capsule, tendrás la chance de ganar el artículo a continuación. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfing Board Anchoring (Permanente/Uso del SP -5%, Incremento del rango +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7 días/ Uso del SP -5%, Incremento del rango +5%){N} Surfingboard Anchoring (30 días/ Uso del SP -5%, Incremento del rango +5%)" ita="Con questa Capsule, puoi ottenere la skill Surfingboard Anchoring.{N}Utilizzando la Capsule, hai la possibilità di avere uno degli oggetti seguenti. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfingboard Anchoring (permanente / consumo degli SP -5%, distanza +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7 giorni / consumo degli SP -5%, distanza +5%){N} Surfingboard Anchoring (30 giorni / consumo degli SP -5%, distanza +5%)." rus="Из этой капсулы можно получить анкерное умение в виде доски для серфинга.{N}Использовав капсулу, можно получить один из следующих предметов.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Surfing Board Anchoring (Бессрочн./ расход SP -5%, увеличена дистанция +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (7 дней/ расход SP -5%, увеличена дистанция +5%){N}Surfingboard Anchoring (30 дней/ расход SP -5%, увеличена дистанция +5%)" cns="可以获得动力冲浪板的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}动力冲浪板（永久/能量消耗-5%，使用距离+5%）{N}动力冲浪板（7日/能量消耗-5%，使用距离+5%）{N}动力冲浪板（30日/能量消耗-5%，使用距离+5%）"/>
	<string key="N2010035" kor="골든 기어 스매쉬 라이플" ger="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" eng="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" tur="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" fre="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" spa="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" ita="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" rus="Golden Gear Smash Rifle" cns="金色齿轮"/>
	<string key="T2010035" kor="S4 의 탐정들이 고대 유물울 탐험할 때 사용하는 스매쉬 라이플. 반짝이는 스매쉬 라이플을 통해  어두운 지역 탐사에 유용하다!" ger="Diese Smash Rifle wird von Detektiven benutzt. Die goldenen Reflektoren erhellen selbst die dunkelsten Orte." eng="A Smash Rifle that has been originally used by an adventurer in S4. The reflected light from the Smash Rifle helps the adventurers when they explore in the darkness." tur="Bu smash rifle dedektifler tarafından kullanılır. Altın yansımalar en karanlık yeri bile aydınlatır." fre="Ce Smash Rifle est utilisé par les détectives. Ses reflets d'or permettent d'illuminer même les endroits les plus sombres." spa="Este Smash Rifle es usado por detectives. Los reflejos dorados iluminan incluso los lugares más oscuros." ita="Questo fucile è usato dai detective. I riflessi dorati propagano la luce anche nei posti più bui." rus="Smash Rifle, изначально использовалась путешественниками в S4. Отражающий свет винтовки помогал путешественникам ориентироваться в темноте." cns="神探夏洛克使用的特典粉碎步枪。既能看时间，又能通过耀眼的金光照亮黑暗！{N}好家伙，手电筒都省了！"/>
	<string key="N2050006" kor="스컬 어스 봄버" ger="Skull Earth Bomber" eng="Skull Earth Bomber" tur="Skull Earth Bomber" fre="Skull Earth Bomber" spa="Skull Earth Bomber" ita="Skull Earth Bomber" rus="Skull Earth Bomber" cns="骷髅炸弹"/>
	<string key="T2050006" kor="네트워크를 항해하는 넷해적들이 개량한 어스 봄버. 더욱 강력한 폭발력으로 적은 물론 아군에게도 강한 타격을 줄 수 있기 때문에 사용 시 주의할 것!" ger="Schädel Gemusterte Erde Bomber" eng="Skull Patterned Earth Bomber" tur="Kafatası Desenli Dünya Bombacı" fre="Crâne modelé la Terre Bomber" spa="Cráneo modelado Tierra Bomber" ita="Skull Patterned Terra Bomber" rus="Earth Bomber в виде черепа" cns="铁钩船长爱使用的特典核爆手雷。{N}比一般的手雷更具破坏力，使用的时候一定要当心，不然会误伤友军的！"/>
