	<string key="T1061089" kor="정부 집단 &quot;더 월드&quot; 에서 파견한 헌터 다르텐이 즐겨 입은 복장 모자" ger="Hunter Dartens Lieblingshut" eng="Hunter Darten's favorite hat" tur="Avcı Darten'ın favori şapkası" fre="Le chapeau préféré du Chasseur Darten" spa="El sombrero favorito favorito de Hunter Darten." ita="Hunter Darten's favorite hat" rus="Любимая шляпа охотника Дартена" cns="臭名……啊不……威名远播的赏金猎人——达斯坦的帽子"/>
	<string key="N1061090" kor="헌터 다미아 챙모자" ger="Hunter Damia's Hat" eng="Hunter Damia's Hat" tur="Avcı Damia Şapkası" fre="Hunter Damia's Hat" spa="Hunter Damia's Hat" ita="Hunter Damia's Hat" rus="Hunter Damia's Hat" cns="猎人达米安牛仔帽"/>
	<string key="T1061090" kor="&quot;더 월드&quot; 에서 파견한 어썰트 헌터 다미아가 즐겨 입은 복장 모자" ger="Hunter Damias Lieblingshut" eng="Hunter Damia's favorite hat" tur="Avcı Damia'nın favori şapkası" fre="Le chapeau préféré de la Chasseresse Damia" spa="El sombrero favorito de Damia." ita="Hunter Damia's favorite hat" rus="Любимая шляпа охотницы Дамии" cns="喜欢使用狙击枪而不是左轮的赏金猎人——达米安的帽子"/>
	<string key="N1070051" kor="레오 펫" ger="Leo Pet" eng="Leo Pet" tur="Leo Pet" fre="Leo Pet" spa="Leo Pet" ita="Leone cucciolo" rus="Leo Pet" cns="狮子座"/>
	<string key="T1070051" kor="조디악 펫 컬렉션의 일곱번째! 사자자리의 수호성" ger="Leo Zodiac Pet. Das siebente Zodiac Pet in S4 League." eng="Leo Zodiac. The 7th Zodiac Pet in S4 League" tur="Leo Zodiac. S4 Liginde 7. Zodyak Hayvanı." fre="Zodiaque Leo. Le 7ème familier du Zodiaque d'S4 League" spa="Zodíaco Leo El 7° Pet del zodíaco en S4 League" ita="Leone Zodiaco. Il 7° cucciolo dello Zodiaco in S4 League" rus="Зодиак лев. 7-ой питомец зодиака в S4 League" cns="十二星座宠物！狮子座！"/>
	<string key="N6000017" kor="오리지널 펌비" ger="Fumbi the Original" eng="Fumbi the Original" tur="Orijinal Fumbi" fre="Fumbi l'Original" spa="Fumbi, el original" ita="Fumbi l'originale" rus="Fumbi the Original" cns="波比"/>
	<string key="T6000017" kor="S4의 마스코트 펌비가 돌아왔어요! 여러분! 저는 찾기 힘드실거에요" ger="Die Rückkehr des Maskottchens: Fumbi ist wieder zurück im Spiel! Sammelt ihn, wenn ihr es wagt!" eng="The return of Mascot: Fumbi is back in game once again! Collect him, if you dare." tur="Maskotun Dönüşü: Fumbi yeniden oyunda! Cesaretin varsa al." fre="Le retour de la mascotte : Fumbi est de retour ! Retrouve-le si tu l'oses." spa="El retorno de la mascota: ¡Fumbi vuelve al juego una vez más! Atrápalo, si puedes." ita="Il ritorno della mascotte: Fumbi è tornato ancora una volta in gioco! Raccoglilo, se ne hai coraggio." rus="Возвращение талисмана: Fumbi снова в игре! Получи его, если сможешь." cns="极限战境的吉祥物——波比回来了！"/>
	<string key="N6000018" kor="파이로트 펌비" ger="Pirate Fumbi" eng="Pirate Fumbi" tur="Korsan Fumbi" fre="Pirate Fumbi" spa="Pirate Fumbi" ita="Fumbi pirata" rus="Pirate Fumbi" cns="飞行员波比"/>
	<string key="T6000018" kor="펌비가 다음시즌에 나올 코스튬을 미리 훔쳐입었어요! 나는야 해적왕!" ger="Der König aller Piraten! Zumindest in S4… Würdet ihr um ihn kämpfen?" eng="The king of all Pirates! Well, at least in S4… would you fight for him?" tur="Tüm korsanların kralı! Eh, en azından S4'te… onun için savaşacak mısın?" fre="Le roi de tous les piates ! Enfin du moins dans S4… vous batteriez-vous pour lui ?" spa="¡El rey de todos los piratas! Bueno, al menos en S4...¿lucharías por él?" ita="Il re di tutti i pirati! Beh, almeno di S4… combatteresti per lui?" rus="Король всех пиратов! Или, по крайней мере, в S4… ты сразишься с ним?" cns="波比偷穿了下一季的服装！我是海贼王！"/>
	<string key="N6000019" kor="셜록 펌비" ger="Fumbi the Detective" eng="Fumbi the Detective" tur="Dedektif Fumbi" fre="Fumbi le Détective" spa="Fumbi the Detective" ita="Fumbi detective" rus="Fumbi the Detective" cns="夏洛克波比"/>
	<string key="T6000019" kor="펌비가 탐정으로 변신했네요.. 과연 무얼 추적하려고?" ger="Mr. Fumbi Holmes ermittelt! Würdet ihr ihn anheuern?" eng="Mr. Fumbi Holmes is investigating! Would you hire him?" tur="Bay Fumbi Holmes araştırma yapıyor! Onu kiralar mıydın?" fre="M. Fumbi Holmes mène l'enquête ! Feriez-vous appel à ses services ?" spa="¡El Sr. Fumbi Holmes se dedica a investigar! ¿Lo contratarías?" ita="Mister Fumbi Holmes sta investigando! Vuoi assumerlo?" rus="Расследование ведет мистер Fumbi Холмс! Ты наймешь его?" cns="波比变身为侦探，究竟要跟踪什么呢?"/>
	<string key="N6000020" kor="헌터 펌비" ger="Fumbi the Hunter" eng="Fumbi the Hunter" tur="Avcı Fumbi" fre="Fumbi le Chasseur" spa="Fumbi the Hunter" ita="Fumbi il cacciatore" rus="Fumbi the Hunter" cns="猎人波比"/>
	<string key="T6000020" kor="탕!탕! 나는야 무법자! 덤벼 모두!" ger="Bamm! Bamm! Fumbi wird euch zur Strecke bringen!" eng="Bang! Bang! Fumbi is going to hunt you down!" tur="Bang! Bang! Fumbi sizin içi ava gidiyor!" fre="Pan ! Pan ! Fumbi ne vous laissera pas une minute de repos !" spa="¡Bang! ¡Bang! ¡Fumbi te atrapará!" ita="Bang! Bang! Fumbi ti verrà a cacciare!" rus="Пиф! Паф! На тебя охотится Fumbi!" cns="嗙！嗙！我是不法分子！全部都上啊！"/>
	<string key="N6000021" kor="마술사 펌비" ger="Fumbi the Magician" eng="Fumbi the magician" tur="Sihirbaz Fumbi" fre="Fumbi le Magicien" spa="Fumbi the magician" ita="Fumbi il mago" rus="Fumbi the magician" cns="魔术师波比"/>
	<string key="T6000021" kor="헤헴! 수리수리 마수리 얍! 당신을 S4리그 세계로 초대합니다!" ger="Kartentricks und Hasen aus Hüten! Fumbi kennt alle magischen Tricks!" eng="Card tricks and rabbits out of hats! Fumbi can do all the magic!" tur="Kart numaraları ve şapkadan tavşan çıkarmalar! Fumbi her türlü sihirbazlığı yapabiliyor!" fre="Magie des cartes et lapins blanc qui sortent du chapeau ! Fumbi connait tous les tours de passe-passe !" spa="¡Trucos con cartas y conejos de galeras! ¡Fumbi hará toda la magia!" ita="Trucchi con le carte e conigli dai cappelli! Fumbi è un vero mago!" rus="Карточные трюки и кролики из шляпы! Fumbi стал волшебником!" cns="哈哈！我来邀请你加入极限战境！"/>
	<string key="N6000022" kor="주술사 펌비" ger="Fumbi the Fortune Teller" eng="Fumbi the fortune teller!" tur="Falcı Fumbi!" fre="Fumbi le Voyant" spa="Fumbi the fortune teller!" ita="Fumbi il veggente" rus="Fumbi the fortune teller!" cns="巫师波比"/>
	<string key="T6000022" kor="아브라카다브라! 수리수리 얍! 나는..S4의 미래를 알고 있다." ger="Ich habe gerade deine Zukunft gesehen… Du wirst ein großartiges Leben haben!" eng="I just saw your future… you will have great life!" tur="Geleceğini gördüm... harika bir hayatın olacak!" fre="J'ai eu une vision… vous aurez la belle vie !" spa="Acabo de ver tu futuro...¡tendrás una vida estupenda!" ita="Ho visto il tuo futuro… avrai una vita bellissima!" rus="Я вижу твое будущее… у тебя будет прекрасная жизнь!" cns="阿巴拉卡达巴拉！耶！我看到了……极限战境的未来"/>
	<string key="N4050367" kor="어드벤쳐 펌비 캡슐" ger="Fumbi the Adventure Capsule" eng="Fumbi the Adventure Capsule" tur="Macera Kapsülü Fumbi" fre="Capsule Aventure Fumbi" spa="Fumbi the Adventure Capsule" ita="Fumbi la Adventure Capsule" rus="Fumbi the Adventure Capsule" cns="冒险波比扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4050367" kor="2013 시즌 어드벤쳐 프로모션 아이템.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다{N}아이템을 획득하여 컬렉팅 북으로!{N}이벤트 기간동안 모든 컬렉션의 펌비를 수집할 경우 컬렉팅 북 보상과 함께!{N}이벤트 기간 종료 후 시즌 어드벤쳐 관련 아이템을 지급해 드립니다!" ger="Promo-Items für die bevorstehende Season.{N}Du erhältst ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item von der untenstehenden Liste.{N}Hol dir dein Item!{N}Die Belohnung erhältst du, wenn du alle Fumbis gesammelt hast!{N}Die Belohnung erhältst du automatisch nach Eventende." eng="Promotional item for the upcoming season.{N}You will be able to randomly obtain an item from below list{N}Get the item!{N}The reward will be given if all fumbies are collected!{N}After the event, the reward will be given to you automatically." tur="Önümüzdeki sezon için promosyon öğesi.{N}Aşağıdaki listeden bir öğeyi rasgele edinebileceksin{N}Öğeyi al!{N}Ödül, tüm fumbiler toplanırsa verilecek!{N}Etkinlikten sonra ödül otomatik olarak verilecek." fre="Objet exclusif pour la nouvelle saison.{N}Vous pourrez recevoir un objet de la liste suivante au hasard.{N}Recevez votre objet !{N}Vous recevrez la récompense en récupérant tous les Fumbis !{N}La récompense sera envoyée automatiquement à la fin de l'évènement." spa="Artículo promocional para la próxima temporada.{N}Podrás obtener al azar un artículo de la lista a continuación{N}¡Consigue el artículo!{N}La recompensa se entregará si se logran recolectar todos los fumbies!{N}Luego del evento, la recompensa se entregará en forma automática." ita="Oggetto promozionale per la stagione in arrivo.{N}Potrai ottenere in modo del tutto casuale un oggetto della lista qui sotto{N}Prendi l'oggetto!{N}Ricevi la ricompensa se raccogli tutti i Fumbi!{N}Dopo l'evento riceverai automaticamente la ricompensa." rus="Рекламный предмет в преддверии нового сезона.{N}Ты можешь получить случайный предмет из нижеуказанного списка.{N}Получи предмет!{N}Награда будет получена, если собраны все Fumbi!{N}Награда будет зачислена автоматически после завершения события." cns="2013赛季冒险促销道具{N}使用扭蛋时，，可随机获得下列道具{N}获得道具到图鉴吧！{N}在活动期间收集到所有收集的波比时，与图鉴奖励一起！{N}结束活动后，赠送有关赛季冒险道具！"/>
	<string key="N4030192" kor="G의 스컬 어스 봄버 캡슐" ger="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule" eng="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule" tur="Kafatası Dünya Bombalayıcı Kapsülü" fre="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule" spa="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule" ita="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule" rus="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule" cns="G的骷髅炸弹扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030192" kor="스컬 어스 봄버를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule{N}Wenn du diese Capsule öffnest, erhältst du aus jeder Kategorie ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item." eng="The skull earth bomber Capsule {N}By opening this Capsule, you will be able to obtain below items within each category randomly." tur="Kafatası dünya bombalayıcı kapsülü {N}Bu kapsülü açarak her kategori dahilinde yer alan aşağıdaki öğeleri rasgele edinebileceksin." fre="La Caspule du Skull Earth Bomber {N}Vous recevrez aléatoirement des objets des catégories suivantes en ouvrant cette Capsule." spa="La Skull Earth Bomber Capsule {N}Abriendo esta Capsule, podrás obtener al azar los artículos a continuación dentro de cada categoría." ita="La skull earth bomber Capsule {N}Aprendo questa capsula, otterrai gli oggetti qui sotto per ogni categoria e casualmente." rus="Skull Earth Bomber Capsule.{N}Открыв эту капсулу, ты получишь по случайному предмету из каждой категории." cns="可以获得骷髅炸弹的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4030188" kor="후크 복장 세트 캡슐" ger="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" eng="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" tur="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" fre="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" spa="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" ita="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" rus="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule" cns="铁钩船长套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030188" kor="후크 복장 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule{N}Wenn du diese Capsule öffnest, erhältst du aus jeder Kategorie ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item." eng="The Pirate Costume(M) Capsule.{N}By opening this Capsule, you will be able to obtain the items below randomly for each category." tur="Korsan kostümü(E) kapsülü. (E) {N}Bu kapsülü açarak her kategori dahilinde yer alan aşağıdaki öğeleri rasgele edinebileceksin." fre="La Capsule du Costume Pirate (H) {N}Vous recevrez aléatoirement des objets des catégories suivantes en ouvrant cette Capsule." spa="La Pirate Costume(M) Capsule. (M) {N}Abriendo esta Capsule, podrás obtener al azar los artículos a continuación dentro de cada categoría." ita="La Pirate Costume Capsule {N}Aprendo questa capsula, otterrai gli oggetti qui sotto per ogni categoria e casualmente." rus="The Pirate Costume(F) Capsule.{N}Открыв эту капсулу, ты получишь по случайному предмету из каждой категории." cns="可以获得铁钩船长套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4030189" kor="브리간티스 복장 세트 캡슐" ger="Pirate Costume (F) Capsule" eng="The Pirate Costume(F) Capsule" tur="Korsan kostümü(K) kapsülü." fre="Pirate Costume (F) Capsule" spa="La Pirate Costume(F) Capsule" ita="Pirate Costume(F) Capsule" rus="The Pirate Costume(F) Capsule" cns="海盗大副套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4030189" kor="브리간티스 복장 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Pirate Costume (F) Capsule{N}Wenn du diese Capsule öffnest, erhältst du aus jeder Kategorie ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item." eng="The Pirate Costume(F) Capsule. {N}By opening this Capsule, you will be able to obtain the items below randomly for each category." tur="Korsan kostümü(K) kapsülü. {N}Bu kapsülü açarak her kategori dahilinde yer alan aşağıdaki öğeleri rasgele edinebileceksin." fre="La Capsule du Costume Pirate (F) {N}Vous recevrez aléatoirement des objets des catégories suivantes en ouvrant cette Capsule." spa="La Pirate Costume(F) Capsule. {N}Abriendo esta Capsule, podrás obtener al azar los artículos a continuación dentro de cada categoría." ita="La Pirate Costume Capsule {N}Aprendo questa capsula, otterrai gli oggetti qui sotto per ogni categoria e casualmente." rus="The Pirate Costume(F) Capsule.{N}Открыв эту капсулу, ты получишь по случайному предмету из каждой категории." cns="可以获得海盗大副套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4050368" kor="후크 복장 세트(1일)" ger="The Pirate Costume(M) Set (1Tag)" eng="The Pirate Costume(M) Set (1 Day)" tur="The Pirate Costume(M) Seti (1 Günlük)" fre="The Pirate Costume(M) Set (1 jour)" spa="El The Pirate Costume(M) Set (1 Day)" ita="The Pirate Costume(M) Set (1 giorno)" rus="The Pirate Costume(M) Set (1 день)" cns="铁钩船长套装（1日）"/>
	<string key="T4050368" kor="후크 복장 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Das The Pirate Costume(M) Set. {N}Die Capsule enthält folgende Items:" eng="The Pirate Costume(M) Set. {N}This Capsule includes below items." tur="Korsan kostümü(E) Seti. {N}Bu kapsül aşağıdaki öğeleri içerir." fre="The Pirate Costume(M) complet. {N} Cette Capsule contient les objets suivants." spa="El Pirate Costume(M) Set. {N}Esta Capsule incluye los artículos a continuación." ita="Il Pirate Costume(M) Set. {N}Questa capsula include gli oggetti qui sotto." rus="The Pirate Costume(M) Set.{N}Включены следующие предметы." cns="铁钩船长套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
