	<string key="T7000000" kor="에스퍼 칩 중 하나를 랜덤하게 지급합니다." ger="Du erhältst einen zufällig ausgewählten eSper Chip." eng="Randomly able to acquire esperchip." tur="Rastgele esperchip alabilme." fre="Permet d'obtenir un eSper Chip au hasard." spa="Podrás adquirir al azar un eSperchip." ita="Possibilità di ottenere casualmente esperchip." rus="Можно получить случайный eSper чип." cns="随机获得超能芯片中1个"/>
	<string key="N4051322" kor="골든 메탈릭 캡슐" ger="Golden Metallic Capsule" eng="Golden Metallic Capsule" tur="Altın Metal Kapsülü" fre="Golden Metallic Capsule" spa="Golden Metallic Capsule" ita="Golden Metallic Capsule" rus="Golden Metallic Capsule" cns="强化合金护甲扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4051322" kor="골든 메탈릭을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}골든 메탈릭(내구제/지속 SP사용량 감소(-5%),방어력 증가(+5%)){N}골든 메탈릭(7일/지속 SP사용량 감소(-5%),방어력 증가(+5%)){N}골든 메탈릭(30일/지속 SP사용량 감소(-5%),방어력 증가(+5%))" ger="Mit dieser Capsule hast du die Chance, Golden Metallic zu erhalten. {N} Wenn du diese Capsule benutzt, erhältst du ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item aus folgender Liste:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Golden Metallic (permanent/-5% SP-Verbrauch, +5% Verteidigung){N}Golden Metallic (7Tage/-5% SP-Verbrauch, +5% Verteidigung){N}Golden Metallic (30Tage/-5% SP-Verbrauch, +5% Verteidigung)" eng="Golden Metallic Skill can be acquired. Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Golden Metallic (Permanent / SP usage -5%, Defense +5%), {N}Golden Metallic (7 Days / SP usage -5%, Defense +5%), {N}Golden Metallic (30 Days / SP usage -5%, Defense +5%)." tur="Bu kapsül bir Altın Metal alma şansı verir. {N} Bu kapsülü kullanırsan aşağıdaki öğelerden birini rastgele alabilirsin.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Altın Metal (Kalıcı/ -%5 SP kullanım oranı, Savunma +%5)){N}Altın Metal (7 Gün/SP kullanımı (-%5),Savunma (+5%)){N}Altın Metal (30 Gün/ SP Kullanımı (-%5), Savunma (+%5))" fre="Cette Capsule vous offre la chance de recevoir un Golden Metallic. {N} En utilisant cette Capsule, vous recevrez un des objets suivants au hasard.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Golden Metallic (Permanent/Utilisation du SP (-5%), Défense (+5%)){N}Golden Metallic (7 jours/Utilisation du SP (-5%),Défense (+5%)){N}Golden Metallic (30 jours/Utilisation du SP (-5%), Défense (+5%))" spa="Esta Capsule te da la posibilidad de obtener un Golden Metallic. {N} Si usas esta Capsule, podrás adquirir al azar uno de los artículos a continuación.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Golden Metallic (Permanente/ -5 % de tasa de uso de SP, Defensa +5%)){N}Golden Metallic (7 días/uso de SP (-5%),Defensa (+5%)){N}Golden Metallic (30 días/ uso de SP (-5%), Defensa (+5%))" ita="Con questa capsula ottieni una Golden Metallic. {N} Se usi questa capsula, puoi casualmente acquisire uno degli oggetti elencati.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Golden Metallic (permanente/ -5 % di frequenza di utilizzo di SP, Difesa +5%)){N}Golden Metallic (7 giorni/utilizzo di SP (-5%), Difesa (+5%)){N}Golden Metallic (30 giorni/utilizzo di SP (-5%), Difesa (+5%))" rus="Можно получить умение золотой металлики. Использовав капсулу, ты получишь следующие случайные предметы.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Golden Metallic (бессрочн./ потребление SP -5%, защита +5%),{N} Golden Metallic (7 дней/ потребление SP -5%, защита +5%),{N}Golden Metallic (30 дней/ потребление SP -5%, защита +5%)." cns="可以获得强化合金护甲扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}强化合金护甲（永久/持续能量消耗-5%，防御力+5%）{N}强化合金护甲（7日/持续能量消耗-5%，防御力+5%）{N}强化合金护甲（30日/持续能量消耗-5%，防御力+5%）"/>
	<string key="N2000029" kor="데몬 사이드" ger="Death Scythe of Skeleton" eng="Death Scythe of Skeleton" tur="Death Scythe of Skeleton" fre="Death Scythe of Skeleton" spa="Death Scythe of Skeleton" ita="Death Scythe of Skeleton" rus="Death Scythe of Skeleton" cns="死神之镰"/>
	<string key="T2000029" kor="릴리트가 발생 시킨 바이러스의 힘을 받아 더욱 강력해진 데스 사이드. 무시무시한 스켈레톤 장식이 되어 있으며, 무기를 장착하는 순간 죽음의 기운이 펼쳐진다." ger="Vom Lilith Virus verbessertes Death Scythe. Du spürst die Macht des Todes schon, wenn du es nur in deiner Hand hältst." eng="Death scythe that has been enhanced by Lilith Virus. By simply holding this weapon, you can feel the power of death." tur="Lilith Virus ile yükseltilmiş Death Scythe. Bu silahı sadece tutarak ölümün gücünü hissedebilirsiniz." fre="La faux de la Mort imprégnée du Virus Lilith. Le simple fait de la tenir dans votre main vous fera ressentir la puissance de la Mort." spa="Guadaña mortal mejorada por Lilith Virus.  Simplemente sosteniendo esta arma, podrás sentir el poder de la muerte..." ita="Death scythe, reso più potente dal virus Lilith. Nel tenere in mano quest'arma, puoi percepire il potere della morte." rus="Смертельная коса, улучшенная вирусом Lilith. Ты сможешь почувствовать смерть, просто держа это оружие в руках." cns="被莉莉丝病毒感染之后变得更加强大的特典收割者，骇人的装饰让每一招都散发出浓烈的死亡气息。"/>
	<string key="N4051323" kor="랜덤 에스퍼칩 캡슐" ger="Random eSper Chip Capsule" eng="Random Esperchip Capsule" tur="Rastgele Esperchip Kapsülü" fre="Random Esperchip Capsule" spa="Random Esperchip Capsule" ita="Random Esperchip Capsule" rus="Random Esperchip Capsule" cns="随机超能芯片扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4051323" kor="캡슐 사용시 랜덤으로 1 종의 에스퍼칩을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Du erhältst einen zufällig ausgewählten eSper Chip." eng="Chance to acquire a random eSper chip!" tur="Rastgele esperchip alabilme." fre="Permet d'obtenir un eSper Chip au hasard." spa="Podrás adquirir al azar un eSperchip." ita="Ottieni casualmente esperchip." rus="Возможность получить случайный eSper чип!" cns="使用扭蛋可随机获得1种超能芯片"/>
