	<string key="T1070057" kor="릴리트 바이러스로 인하여 탄생한 펫! 데스 주니어!" ger="Death Jr. Lilith Virus infizierten PET" eng="Death Jr. Lilith virus infected PET" tur="Death Jr Lilith virüs bulaşmış PET" fre="Death Jr. Lilith virus PET infecté" spa="Death Jr. lilith virus PET infectada" ita="Morte Jr. Lilith virus animale infetto" rus="Death Jr., питомец инфицированный вирусом Lilith." cns="诞生于莉莉丝病毒感染后的极限战境，充满了死亡气息的人偶宠物。"/>
	<string key="N2000030" kor="타키온 아이언 부츠" ger="Tachyon Iron Boots" eng="Tachyon Iron Boots" tur="Tachyon Iron Boots" fre="Tachyon Iron Boots" spa="Tachyon Iron Boots" ita="Tachyon Iron Boots" rus="Tachyon Iron Boots" cns="超光速战靴"/>
	<string key="T2000030" kor="파워즈에 의해 강탈된 아이언부츠에 초광속 입자 타키온을 주입하여 완성시킨 파워즈 커스텀 아이언 부츠. 파워즈 슈트와의 상호작용으로 부스트사용 및 공격에 사용되는 SP를 크게 줄이는 것이 가능하다." ger="Maßgefertigte Iron Boots, die Tachyon enthalten. Werden sie zusammen mit dem Powerz Suit getragen, kann sich der SP-Verbrauch verringern." eng="Customized Iron Boots with Tachyon inside. Can decrease the use of SP if you wear it together with Powerz Suit." tur="İçinde Tachyon olan özelleştirilmiş Iron Boots. Powerz Suit ile birlikte giyerseniz SP kullanımını azaltabilir." fre="Des Iron Boots personnalisées qui contiennent du Tachyon. Elle vous permettront de diminuer l'utilisation des SP si vous les portez avec le Powerz Suit." spa="Iron Boots personalizados con Tachyon en su interior. Puede reducir el uso de SP si lo usas junto con Powerz Suit." ita="Iron Boots personalizzati con Tachyon all'interno. Può diminuire l'uso di SP se li indossi con il Powerz Suit." rus="Модернизированные Iron Boots с тахионами. Можно уменьшить потребление SP, если носить вместе с костюмом Powerz." cns="注入超光速粒子后制造而成的特典浮空战靴。速度越快的物体惯性越大，杀伤力越强。想想与一架飞机相撞会是什么后果。"/>
	<string key="N1070056" kor="브루노" ger="Bruno" eng="Bruno" tur="Bruno" fre="Bruno" spa="Bavarian Wastl" ita="Bavarian Wastl" rus="Bruno" ame="Bavarian Wastl" cns="猎犬布鲁诺" tha="Bavarian Wastl" twn="Bavarian Wastl"/>
	<string key="T1070056" kor="왈ㅇ뢍황르으르를으르라오클읔읔읔크르르응" ger="Grrrrrrrrr" eng="Grrrrrrrrr" tur="Grrrrrrrrr" fre="Grrrrrrrrr" spa="Un perrito de cintura ancha, pero veloz y hermoso." ita="Ha un corpo allungato, ma è un cagnolino adorabile e veloce." rus="Грррррр" cns="名叫布鲁诺的猎犬，罗宾的孪生弟弟~"/>
	<string key="N4031067" ger="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" eng="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" tur="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" fre="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" spa="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" ita="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" rus="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" ame="Bavarian Wastl Capsule" cns="G的猎犬布鲁诺宠物扭蛋" tha="Bavarian Wastl Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4031067" ger="Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl Capsule{N}Du erhältst ein Item aus jeder Zone. Du bekommst also insgesamt 3 Items aus einer Capsule!" eng="Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl Capsule{N}You can get one item from each zone, so you will win 3 items in total from one Capsule!" tur="Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl Capsule{N}Her bölgeden bir eşya alabilirsin, yani bir kapsülden toplam 3 eşya kazanırsın!" fre="Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl Capsule{N}Vous pouvez obtenir un objet pour chaque zone, soit au total 3 objets dans une seule Capsule !" spa="Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl Capsule{N}Puedes obtener un artículo de cada zona, así que podrás ganar 3 artículos en total de una Capsule!" ita="Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl Capsule{N}Puoi ottenere un oggetto per ogni area, quindi in totale avrai 3 oggetti con una Capsule!" rus="Capsule с Octoberfest Bavarian Wastl{N}Ты можешь получить по одному предмету из каждого раздела, так что ты получишь 3 предмета из одной капсулы!" cns="可以获得猎犬布鲁诺的宠物扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2000031" kor="엑소 사이드" ger="EXO Scythe" eng="EXO Scythe" tur="EXO Scythe" fre="EXO Scythe" spa="EXO Scythe" ita="EXO Scythe" rus="EXO Scythe" cns="收割者"/>
	<string key="icescythe" kor="엑소 사이드" ger="EXO Scythe" eng="Ice Scythe" tur="EXO Scythe" fre="EXO Scythe" spa="EXO Scythe" ita="EXO Scythe" rus="EXO Scythe" cns="收割者"/>
	<string key="T2000031" kor="릴리트에 의해 바이러스로 감염된 넷 스피어에 새롭게 생겨난 근접 무기. 경량화 된 사이드로 상대에게 빠르게 접근할 수 있으며, 적을 공중으로 띄워 제압이 가능하다." ger="Eine neu erschaffene Nahkampfwaffe vom Lilith Virus: EXO Scythe. Stürze dich schnell wie der Wind auf dein Ziel und überwältige es." eng="A newly created melee weapon by Lilith Virus &quot;EXO Scythe.&quot; Approach your target fast like a wind and dominate it." tur="Lilith Virus'den yeni yaratılmış yakın dövüş silahı ''EXO Scythe''. Hedefinize rüzgar kadan hızlı yaklaşın ve hakim olun." fre="Une nouvelle arme de mêlée créée à partir du Virus Lilith, la &quot;EXO Scythe&quot;. Glissez aussi vite que le vent vers votre ennemi pour l'éliminer." spa="Una nueva arma melee creada por Lilith Virus &quot;EXO Scythe.&quot; Acércate a tu objetivo tan rápido como el viento y derrota a tu adversario." ita="Un'arma melee &quot;EXO Scythe&quot; appena creata dal virus Lilith. Avvicinati al bersaglio rapido come il vento e sottomettilo." rus="«EXO Scythe» - новое оружие ближнего боя, созданное вирусом Lilith. Подкрадись к цели быстро как ветер и доминируй!" cns="莉莉丝病毒感染极限战网后，艾斯波科技通过研究被感染的数据，发明了一种全新的武器。{N}持有该武器可以快速接近敌人，并把他们扔向空中后收割其生命。"/>
	<string key="N4035254" kor="할로윈 쌉사름한 캔디 박스" ger="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" eng="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" tur="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" fre="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" spa="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" ita="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" rus="Sweet &amp; Sour Candy Box" ame="Bitter Candy Box" cns="万圣节苦涩糖果箱子"/>
	<string key="T4035254" kor="2013 할로윈 보상 박스 입니다. 개봉 시 아이템을 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Halloween Gift Box. Öffne die Box, um zu sehen, was darin ist!" eng="Halloween Gift Box. Open the box and see what's inside!" tur="Halloween Gift Box. Kutuyu açın ve içinde ne var bakın!" fre="Cadeau d'Halloween. Ouvrez-le pour découvrir ce qu'il contient !" spa="Halloween Gift Box. ¡Abre la caja y encontrarás una sorpresa!" ita="Halloween Gift Box. Apri la scatola e scopri quello che c'è dentro!" rus="Подарочная коробка на Хеллоуин. Открой коробку и узнай, что внутри!" ame="2020 Halloween Event Reward. {N}The following item can be obtained." cns="万圣节奖励，打开箱子可获得限时武器道具"/>
	<string key="N4035255" kor="할로윈 달콤한 캔디 박스" ger="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" eng="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" tur="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" fre="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" spa="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" ita="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" rus="Sugary Sweet Candy Box" ame="Sweet Candy Box" cns="万圣节甜蜜糖果箱子"/>
	<string key="T4035255" kor="2013 할로윈 보상 박스입니다. 개봉 시 아이템을 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Halloween Gift Box. Öffne die Box, um zu sehen, was darin ist!" eng="Halloween Gift Box. Open the box and see what's inside!" tur="Halloween Gift Box. Kutuyu açın ve içinde ne var bakın!" fre="Cadeau d'Halloween. Ouvrez-le pour découvrir ce qu'il contient !" spa="Halloween Gift Box. ¡Abre la caja y encontrarás una sorpresa!" ita="Halloween Gift Box. Apri la scatola e scopri quello che c'è dentro!" rus="Подарочная коробка на Хеллоуин. Открой коробку и узнай, что внутри!" ame="2020 Halloween Event Reward. {N}The following item can be obtained." cns="万圣节奖励，打开箱子可获得特典武器道具"/>
	<string key="N4035256" kor="데스 인펙터 세트 캡슐" ger="Death Impactor Set Capsule" eng="Death Impactor Set Capsule" tur="Death Impactor Set Capsule" fre="Death Impactor Set Capsule" spa="Death Impactor Set Capsule" ita="Death Impactor Set Capsule" rus="Death Impactor Set Capsule" cns="死神侍者套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035256" kor="데스 인펙터 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Mit dieser Capsule hast du die Chance, das Death Impactor Costume Set zu erhalten.{N} Das Set enthält folgende Items:" eng="Death Impactor Costume Set can be acquired.{N} Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Death Impactor Kostüm Seti {N} Öğelerin listesi aşağıdaki ile aynıdır." fre="Cette Capsule vous offre la chance de recevoir le Costume complet du Death Impactor {N} La liste des objets figure ci-dessous." spa="Esta Capsule te da la oportunidad de obtener el Death Impactor Costume Set {N} La lista de artículos es igual que a continuación." ita="Questa capsula ti dà la possibilità di ottenere un Death Impactor Costume Set. {N} La lista degli oggetti è in basso." rus="Можно получить костюм Death Impactor.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得死神侍者套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035257" kor="데스 퀸 세트 캡슐" ger="Death Queen Set Capsule" eng="Death Queen Set Capsule" tur="Death Queen Set Capsule" fre="Death Queen Set Capsule" spa="Death Queen Set Capsule" ita="Death Queen Set Capsule" rus="Death Queen Set Capsule" ame="Death Queen Set Capsule" cns="死亡女神套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035257" kor="데스 퀸 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Mit dieser Capsule hast du die Chance, das Death Queen Costume Set zu erhalten.{N} Das Set enthält folgende Items:" eng="Death Queen Costume Set can be acquired.{N} Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Death Queen Kostüm Seti {N} Öğelerin listesi aşağıdaki ile aynıdır." fre="Cette Capsule vous offre la chance de recevoir le Costume complet du Death Queen {N} La liste des objets figure ci-dessous." spa="Esta Capsule te da la oportunidad de obtener el Death Queen Costume Set {N} La lista de artículos es igual que a continuación." ita="Questa capsula ti dà la possibilità di ottenere un Death Queen Costume Set. {N} La lista degli oggetti è in basso." rus="Можно получить костюм Death Queen.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得死亡女神套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035258" kor="G의 데몬 사이드 캡슐" ger="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" eng="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" tur="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" fre="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" spa="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" ita="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" rus="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" ame="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule" cns="G的死神之镰扭蛋" tha="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4035258" kor="데몬 사이드를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule{N}Wenn du diese Capsule öffnest, erhältst du aus jeder Kategorie ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item." eng="The Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule.{N}The Death Scythe of Skeleton weapon can be acquired. Use this Capsule and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Death Scythe of Skeleton kapsülü {N}Bu kapsülü açarak her kategori dahilinde yer alan aşağıdaki öğeleri rasgele edinebileceksin." fre="La Caspule du Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule {N}Vous recevrez aléatoirement des objets des catégories suivantes en ouvrant cette Capsule." spa="La Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule {N}Abriendo esta Capsule, podrás obtener al azar los artículos a continuación dentro de cada categoría." ita="La Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule Capsule {N}Aprendo questa capsula, otterrai gli oggetti qui sotto per ogni categoria e casualmente." rus="The Death Scythe of Skeleton Capsule.{N}Из этой капсулы можно получить смертельный серп скелета. Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить несколько случайных предметов." cns="可以获得G的死神之镰的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035259" kor="스콜피우스 펫 캡슐" ger="Scorpio Pet Capsule" eng="Scorpio pet Capsule" tur="Scorpio pet Capsule" fre="Scorpio pet Capsule" spa="Scorpio pet Capsule" ita="Scorpio pet Capsule" rus="Scorpio pet Capsule" cns="天蝎座宠物扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035259" kor="오리온을 무찌른 동물! 스콜피우스 펫을 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Ein riesiger Skorpion, der Orion zu Tode gestochen hat! Schau, ob du ihn zu deinem treuen Begleiter machen kannst." eng="A huge scorpion which stung Orion to death! See if you can own this loyal pet." tur="Orion'u ölümüne ısıran dev bir akrep! Bu sadık pet'e elde edebilecek misin gör bakalım." fre="Un gigantesque scorpion qui piqua jadis Orion jusqu'à la mort ! Voyez si vous saurez apprivoiser ce fidèle compagnon." spa="Un enorme escorpión que picó a Orion y lo llevó a su muerte! Fíjate si puedes ser el amo de esta fiel mascota." ita="Un enorme scorpione, che punse Orione causandone la morte! Vedi se riesci a possedere questo fedele animaletto." rus="Огромный скорпион, смертельно ужаливший Ориона! Посмотрим, сможешь ли ты приручить этого преданного питомца." cns="可获得天蝎座的宠物扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035260" kor="다섯번째 시크릿 걸 - 오필리아" ger="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" eng="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" tur="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" fre="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" spa="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" ita="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" rus="Fifth Secret Girl - Ophelia" cns="第五个神秘女孩-奥菲利亚"/>
	<string key="T4035260" kor="비밀스러운 그녀 오필리아의 복장을 얻을 수 있는 캡슐" ger="Kostüm eines gewissen Mädchens namens Ophelia." eng="Costume of a certain girl, called Ophelia." tur="Ophelia isimli kızın kostümü." fre="Le costume d'une certaine jeune fille prénommée Ophélia." spa="Vestimenta de una chica llamada Ophelia." ita="Il costume di una certa ragazza, di nome Ophelia." rus="Костюм одной девушки известной как Ophelia." cns="可以获得神秘女子奥菲利亚服装的扭蛋"/>
	<string key="N4035261" kor="여섯번째 시크릿 걸 - 로즈 서큐버스" ger="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" eng="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" tur="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" fre="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" spa="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" ita="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" rus="Sixth Secret Girl - Rose Succubus" cns="第六个神秘女孩-玛丽玫瑰"/>
	<string key="T4035261" kor="비밀스러운 그녀 로즈 서큐버스의 복장을 얻을 수 있는 캡슐" ger="Kostüm eines gewissen Mädchens namens Rose Sucubus." eng="Costume of a certain girl, called Rose Sucubus." tur="Rose Sucubus isimli kızın kostümü." fre="Le costume d'une certaine jeune fille prénommée Rse Succubus" spa="Vestimenta de una chica llamada Rose Succubus." ita="Il costume di una certa ragazza, di nome Rose Succubus." rus="Костюм одной девушки известной как Rose Succubus." cns="可以获得神秘女子玛丽玫瑰服装的扭蛋"/>
	<string key="N4051332" kor="데스 윙 캡슐" ger="Wings of Death Capsule" eng="Wings of Death Capsule" tur="Wings of Death Capsule" fre="Wings of Death Capsule" spa="Wings of Death Capsule" ita="Wings of Death Capsule" rus="Wings of Death Capsule" cns="死亡之翼扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4051332" kor="데스 윙을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%),이동속도 증가(+10%){N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(7일, 30일, 내구제)" ger="Mit dieser Capsule hast du die Chance, Wings Of Death zu erhalten. {N} Wenn du diese Capsule benutzt, erhältst du ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item aus folgender Liste:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Wings Of Death (permanent/-5% SP-Verbrauch, +10% Movement Speed){N}Wings Of Death (7Tage/-5% SP-Verbrauch, +10% Movement Speed){N}Wings Of Death (30Tage/-5% SP-Verbrauch, +10% Movement Speed)" eng="Wings Of Death Skill can be acquired. Use this Capsule item and you will receive some of the following items randomly.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Wings Of Death (Permanent / SP usage -5%, MoveSpeed +10%), {N}Wings Of Death (7 Days / SP usage -5%, MoveSpeed +10%), {N}Wings Of Death (30 Days / SP usage -5%, MoveSpeed +10%)." tur="Bu kapsül bir Altın Metal alma şansı verir. {N} Bu kapsülü kullanırsan aşağıdaki öğelerden birini rastgele alabilirsin.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Altın Metal (Kalıcı/ -%5 SP kullanım oranı, MoveSpeed +%10){N}Altın Metal (Kalıcı/ -%5 SP kullanım oranı, MoveSpeed +%10){N}Altın Metal (Kalıcı/ -%5 SP kullanım oranı, MoveSpeed +%10)" fre="Cette Capsule vous offre la chance de recevoir un Wings Of Death. {N} En utilisant cette Capsule, vous recevrez un des objets suivants au hasard.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Wings Of Death (Permanent/Utilisation du SP (-10%), MoveSpeed (+10%)){N}Wings Of Death (7 jours/Utilisation du SP (-10%)), MoveSpeed (+10%){N}Wings Of Death (30 jours/Utilisation du SP (-10%), MoveSpeed (+10%))" spa="Esta Capsule te da la posibilidad de obtener un Wings Of Death. {N} Si usas esta Capsule, podrás adquirir al azar uno de los artículos a continuación.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Wings Of Death (Permanente/ -10 % de tasa de uso de SP, MoveSpeed +10%)){N}Wings Of Death (7 días/uso de SP (-10%),MoveSpeed (+10%)){N}Wings Of Death (30 días/ uso de SP (-5%), Defensa (+5%))" ita="Con questa capsula ottieni una Wings Of Death. {N} Se usi questa capsula, puoi casualmente acquisire uno degli oggetti elencati.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Wings Of Death (permanente/ -5 % di frequenza di utilizzo di SP, Velocità+10%)){N}Wings Of Death (7 giorni/utilizzo di SP (-5%), Velocità (+10%)){N}Wings Of Death (30 giorni/utilizzo di SP (-5%), Velocità (+10%))" rus="Можно получить умение Крылья смерти.{N}Использовав капсулу, ты получишь следующие случайные предметы.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Wings Of Death (бессрочн./ потребление SP -5%, скорость передвижения +10%){N}Wings Of Death (7 дней/ потребление SP -5%, скорость передвижения +10%){N}Wings Of Death (30 дней/ потребление SP -5%, скорость передвижения +10%)." cns="可以获得死亡之翼的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}持续能量消耗-10%,移动速度+10%{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}（7日,30日,永久）"/>
