	<string key="N4035267" kor="휴면 유저 패키지" ger="Returner's Package" eng="Returner's Package" tur="Returner's Package" fre="Returner's Package" spa="Returner's Package" ita="Returner's Package" rus="Returner's Package" cns="休眠用户包"/>
	<string key="T4035267" kor="돌아온 S4리거를 위해 준비한 특별한 선물!!{N}캡슐 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Ein spezielles Paket für Spieler, die zurückgekehrt sind!{N}Enthält folgende Items:" eng="Very special package for our returning users!{N}From this capsule you can obtain the items below." tur="Geri dönen kullanıcılarımız için çok özel bir paket!{N}Bu capsule'den aşağıdaki eşyaları alabilirsin" fre="Un pack très spécial pour nos anciens joueurs !{N}Vous pourrez recevoir les objets ci-dessous" spa="Un paquete muy especial para los usuarios que regresan{N}De esta capsule podrás obtener los siguientes artículos" ita="Un pacchetto davvero speciale per gli utenti che ritornano!{N}Da questa capsule puoi ottenere gli oggetti seguenti." rus="Особый набор для вернувшихся игроков!{N}Из этой капсулы можно получить следующие предметы." cns="为重新回归极限战境的用户准备的特别礼物！！{N}使用扭蛋可获得下列道具。"/>
	<string key="N4051349" kor="데스 퀸 세트(복귀)" ger="Death Queen Set (Returner)" eng="Death Queen Set (Returner)" tur="Death Queen Set (Returner)" fre="Death Queen Set (Returner)" spa="Death Queen Set (Returner)" ita="Death Queen Set (Returner)" rus="Death Queen Set (Возвращение)" cns="死亡女神套装（重置版）"/>
	<string key="N4051350" kor="데스 인펙터 세트 (복귀)" ger="Death Impactor Set (Returner)" eng="Death Impactor Set (Returner)" tur="Death Impactor Set (Returner)" fre="Death Impactor Set (Returner)" spa="Death Impactor Set (Returner)" ita="Death Impactor Set (Returner)" rus="Death Impactor Set (Возвращение)" cns="死神侍者套装（重置版）"/>
	<string key="N4051351" kor="아이스 블록 캡슐" ger="Ice Block Capsule" eng="Ice Block Capsule" tur="Ice Block Capsule" fre="Ice Block Capsule" spa="Ice Block Capsule" ita="Ice Block Capsule" rus="Ice Block Capsule" cns="寒冰纳米掩体扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4051351" kor="아이스 블록을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}아이스 블록(내구제/지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%), HP 증가(+10%)){N}아이스 블록(7일/지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%), HP 증가(+10%)){N}아이스 블록(30일/지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%), HP 증가(+10%))" ger="Diese Capsule enthält den Ice Block.{N} Aus dieser Capsule erhältst du eins der folgenden Items:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Ice Block (Permanent / SP-Verbrauch -16%, HP +7%){N}Ice Block (7 Tage / SP-Verbrauch -16%, HP +7%){N}Ice Block (30 Tage / SP-Verbrauch -16%, HP +7%)" eng="Capsule from which you can acquire Ice Block.{N} From this capsule, you can obtain the following items randomly.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Ice Block (Permanent / SP Usage (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(7days / SP Usage (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(30days / SP Usage (-16%), HP (+7%))" tur="İçinden Ice Block alabileceğiniz capsule.{N} Bu capsule'den, şu eşyaları rasgele alabilirsiniz.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Ice Block (Kalıcı / SP Kullanımı (-%10), HP (+%10)){N}Ice Block(7gün / SP Kullanımı (-%10), HP (+%10)){N}Ice Block(30gün / SP Kullanımı (-%10), HP (+%10))" fre="Grâce à cette Capsule, vous obtiendrez peut-être un Ice Block.{N} En ouvrant cette Capsule, vous obtiendrez aléatoirement l'un des objets suivants. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Ice Block (Permanent / Utilisation des SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(7jours / Utilisation des SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(30jours / Utilisation des SP (-16%), HP (+7%))" spa="Capsule de la que puedes adquirir el Ice Block.{N} De esta capsule, podrás obtener los siguientes artículos al azar.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Ice Block (Permanente / Uso de SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(7días / Uso de SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(30días / Uso de SP (-16%), HP (+7%))" ita="Capsule da cui puoi ricavare Ice Block.{N}Da questa capsule, puoi ottenere gli oggetti seguenti in maniera casuale.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Ice Block (permanente/Uso SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(7 giorni/Uso SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block(30 giorni/Uso SP (-16%), HP (+7%))" rus="Capsule, из которой можно получить Ice Block. Из этой капсулы ты можешь получить следующие случайные предметы. Ice Block (бессрочн./ расход SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block (7 дней / расход SP (-16%), HP (+7%)){N}Ice Block (30 дней / расход SP (-16%), HP (+7%))" cns="可以获得寒冰纳米掩体的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}寒冰纳米掩体（永久/持续能量消耗-10%，生命+10%）{N}寒冰纳米掩体（7日/持续能量消耗-10%，生命+10%）{N}寒冰纳米掩体（30日/持续能量消耗-10%，生命+10%）"/>
	<string key="N1021108" kor="프로스트 리더 어퍼슈트" ger="Upper Suit of Frost Leader" eng="Upper Suite of Frost Leader" tur="Upper Suite of Frost Leader" fre="Upper Suite of Frost Leader" spa="Upper Suite of Frost Leader" ita="Upper Suite of Frost Leader" rus="Upper Suite of Frost Leader" cns="冰霜领主上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021108" kor="오직 전투만을 위해 존재하는 냉혹한 마음의 지휘자를 위한 슈트 상의" ger="Der Anzug eines echten Kriegstreibers. Sei stylish, sei schnell!" eng="The suite of a real warmonger. Be stylish, be fast!" tur="Gerçek bir savaş çığırtkanının giysisi. Tarz sahibi olun, hızlı olun!" fre="Le haut d'un véritable belliciste. Soyez stylé, soyez rapide !" spa="Un conjunto para un verdadero belicista. ¡Ten estilo y sé rápido!" ita="La suite di un vero guerrafondaio. Sarai veloce ed elegante!" rus="Костюм настоящего поджигателя войны. Будь стильным, будь быстрым!" cns="于冰霜之中从天而降的王者，只闻其声便能感到寒意侵袭的冰霜领主上衣"/>
	<string key="N1021109" kor="프로즌 릴리트 어퍼슈트" ger="Upper Suit of Frozen Lilith" eng="Upper Suit of Frozen Lilith" tur="Upper Suit of Frozen Lilith" fre="Upper Suit of Frozen Lilith" spa="Upper Suite of Frozen Lilith" ita="Upper Suite of Frozen Lilith" rus="Upper Suit of Frozen Lilith" cns="冰霜莉莉丝上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021109" kor="얼음처럼 차가운 영혼의 소유자 릴리트의 슈트 상의" ger="Der Anzug der herzlosen Lilith." eng="The suit of heartless Lilith." tur="Heartless Lilith'in giysisi." fre="Le haut de Lilith la sans cœur." spa="Un conjunto para la despiadada Lilith." ita="La suite della spietata Lilith." rus="Верхняя часть костюма бессердечной Lilith." cns="于冰霜之中重生的复仇者，意图将所有敌人冰封在仇恨之中的冰霜莉莉丝上衣"/>
