	<string key="T4035272" kor="콜드 피스톨 매그넘을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule enthält den Snow Drop Dual Magnum.{N}Aus dieser Capsule erhältst du per Zufall eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Snow Drop Dual Magnum can be acquired through this Capsule.{N}Use this Capsule and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Snow Drop Dual Magnum bu Capsule ile elde edilebilir.  {N} Bu kapsülü kullanın ve aşağıdaki eşyalardan bazılarını rastgele edinin." fre="Cette Capsule peut contenir le Snow Drop Dual Magnum.{N}En ouvrant cette capsule, vous pouvez obtenir les objets ci-dessous." spa="El Snow Drop Dual Magnum puede ser adquirido a través de esta Capsule. {N}Usa esta Capsule y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos al azar:" ita="Il Snow Drop Dual Magnum può essere ottenuto con questa Capsule.{N}Utilizza questa Capsule e riceverai alcuni dei seguenti oggetti in maniera casuale." rus="Из этой капсулы можно получить Snow Drop Dual Magnum.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得雪花莲的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035273" kor="캐프리코너스 펫 캡슐" ger="Capricornus Pet Capsule" eng="Capricornus Pet Capsule" tur="Capricornus Pet Capsule" fre="Capricornus Pet Capsule" spa="Capricornus Pet Capsule" ita="Capricornus Pet Capsule" rus="Capricornus Pet Capsule" cns="摩羯座宠物扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035273" kor="바다염소로 변신한 가축의 신! 캐프리코너스를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐!{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Mit dem Kopf und den Vorderbeinen einer Ziege und dem Schwanz eines Fisches ist Capricornus eine sehr bemerkenswerte Kreatur.{N}Versuch dein Glück und finde heraus, ob du dieses liebenswerte Pet bekommst." eng="Capricornus is a special looking creature, with the head and forelegs of a goat and the tail of a fish.{N}Test your luck and see if you can get this lovely pet." tur="Capricornus, bir keçinin kafasıyla ön ayaklarına ve bir balığın kuyruğuna sahip olan özel görünümlü bir yaratıktır.{N}Şansını dene ve bu sevimli pet’i alabilecek misin gör." fre="Le Capricorne est une créature intrigante qui possède la tête et les jambes d'une chèvre et dont la queue est celle d'un poisson.{N}Tentez votre chance et vous obtiendrez peut-être cet adorable familier." spa="Capricornus es una criatura de aspecto especial, con la cabeza y las patas traseras de una cabra y la cola de un pescado.{N}Prueba tu suerte para ver si puedes conseguir esta adorable mascota." ita="Capricornus è una creatura dall'aspetto singolare, con la testa e gli arti di una capra e la coda di un pesce.{N}Tenta la fortuna e vedi se riesci ad accaparrarti questo delizioso animale." rus="Козерог это особое существо с телом козла и хвостом рыбы.{N}Испытай свою удачу и может быть этот милый питомец станет твоим." cns="可以获得摩羯座的宠物扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4060026" kor="I의 콜드 피스톨 매그넘 캡슐" ger="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" eng="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" tur="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" fre="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" spa="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" ita="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" rus="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" ame="I's Snow Drop Dual Magnum Capsule" cns="I的雪花莲扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4060026" kor="콜드 피스톨 매그넘을 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Capsule enthält den Snow Drop Dual Magnum.{N}Aus dieser Capsule erhältst du per Zufall eins der folgenden Items:" eng="The Snow Drop Dual Magnum can be acquired through this Capsule.{N}Use this Capsule and you will receive some of the following items randomly." tur="Snow Drop Dual Magnum bu Capsule ile elde edilebilir.  {N} Bu kapsülü kullanın ve aşağıdaki eşyalardan bazılarını rastgele edinin." fre="Cette Capsule peut contenir le Snow Drop Dual Magnum.{N}En ouvrant cette capsule, vous pouvez obtenir les objets ci-dessous." spa="El Snow Drop Dual Magnum puede ser adquirido a través de esta Capsule. {N}Usa esta Capsule y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos al azar:" ita="Il Snow Drop Dual Magnum può essere ottenuto con questa Capsule.{N}Utilizza questa Capsule e riceverai alcuni dei seguenti oggetti in maniera casuale." rus="Из этой капсулы можно получить Snow Drop Dual Magnum.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得雪花莲的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2000034" kor="타이치 트윈 블레이드" ger="Taichi Twin Blade" eng="Taichi Twin Blade" tur="Taichi Twin Blade" fre="Taichi Twin Blade" spa="Taichi Twin Blade" ita="Taichi Twin Blade" rus="Taichi Twin Blade" cns="太极"/>
	<string key="T2000034" kor="태초에 뜨거운 것과 차가운 것이 있었으니 이 둘이 부딪혀 땅, 물, 불, 바람과 하늘을 만들었다. 넷스피어 생성의 비밀이 담긴 타이치 트윈 블레이드" ger="Erzeugt ein Magnetfeld mit einer (+)- und einer (-)-Klinge. Weite Entfernung und weiträumig." eng="Creates a magnetic field with a (+) blade and (-) blade. Long and wide range." tur="Pozitif ve negatif bir bıçakla manyetik alan oluşturur. Menzili uzundur." fre="Crée un lame accompagnée d'un champ magnétique. Longue et courte portée." spa="Crea un campo magnético con una cuchilla (+) y una cuchilla (-). Un rango Ancho y Largo." ita="Genera un campo magnetico con una lama (+) e una (-). Ampio raggio." rus="Создает магнетическое поле с помощью (+) меча и (-) меча. Длинный и обширный диапазон действия." ame="Creates a magnetic field with a (+) blade and (-) blade. Long and wide range." cns="蕴含着极限战网最高机密的特典锁链双刃。{N}初有道分阴阳，阴阳生万物，掌控阴阳者掌控世界。" tha="สร้างสนามแม่เหล็กด้วยใบมีดขั้วบวกและขั้วลบในบริเวณกว้าง {N}{CB-0,255,0,255}[Control]{N}Left Click: Slash {N}Left click while jump: Air Attack {N}Right Click: Wide Attack (Charge, Nullify Guard)"/>
	<string key="N4031174" kor="1000 PEN" cns="1000金币"/>
	<string key="T4031174" kor="캡슐 사용시 1000PEN 을 획득할 수 있습니다." cns="使用扭蛋时可以获得1000金币"/>
