	<string key="N4020010" kor="미니펜 캡슐" ger="Mini Pen Capsule" eng="Mini Pen Capsule" tur="Mini Pen Capsule" fre="Mini Pen Capsule" spa="Mini Pen Capsule" ita="Mini Pen Capsule" rus="Mini Pen Capsule" cns="迷你金币扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020010" kor="사용 시 아이템과 최대 1,500,000 PEN이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-0,255,0,255}또한, 카드 1장을 랜덤하게 얻을 수 있습니다." ger="Du bekommst bis zu 300.000 PEN und einige Zufallsitems." eng="You have a chance to win up to 300.000 PEN from this capsule." tur="300.000 PEN'e kadar PEN ve birkaç Rasgele eşya alabilirsin." fre="Vous pouvez obtenir un maximum de 300 000 PEN ainsi que quelques items." spa="Puedes obtener por lo menos 300,000 de PEN y algunos items al Azar." ita="Puoi ottenere al massimo 300.000 PEN e alcuni oggetti casuali." rus="Из этой капсулы можно выиграть до 300,000 PEN." cns="使用时随机获赠金币，金币数量最高可达300,000"/>
	<string key="N6000028" kor="크리스마스 카드" ger="2013 X-mas Card" eng="2013 X-mas Card" tur="2013 X-mas Card" fre="2013 X-mas Card" spa="2013 X-mas Card" ita="2013 X-mas Card" rus="2013 X-mas Card" cns="圣诞节卡片"/>
	<string key="T6000028" kor="이번 크리스마스에도 S4리그와 함께!!{N}카드를 사용하면 다양한 아이템을 얻을 수 있습니다." ger="X-mas Event Item" eng="X-mas Event Item" tur="X-mas Event Item" fre="X-mas Event Item" spa="X-mas Event Item" ita="X-mas Event Item" rus="Рождественский предмет события" cns="这次的圣诞节，极限战境也与您同在！！{N}使用卡片可以获得多种多样的道具"/>
	<string key="N1021110" kor="마샬아츠 마스터 상의" ger="Martial Arts Master Top" eng="Martial Arts Master Top" tur="Martial Arts Master Top" fre="Martial Arts Master Top" spa="Martial Arts Master Top" ita="Martial Arts Master Top" rus="Martial Arts Master Top" cns="武术少年上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021110" kor="S4리그의 숨겨진 고수. 수련에만 매진하던 그가 돌아왔다.{N}숨은 고수 마샬아츠 마스터의 상의" ger="Der Meister von S4 League ist jetzt bereit für die Show! {N}Martial Arts Master Top" eng="The Master of S4 League is now ready for the show. {N}Martial Arts Master Top" tur="S4 League Master'ı şimdi şov için hazır. {N}Martial Arts Master Top" fre="Le Maître d'S4 League est prêt à faire son show. {N}Haut de Maître d'Arts Martiaux" spa="El maestro de S4 League ya está listo para el show. {N}Martial Arts Master Top" ita="Il master di S4 League è pronto per lo spettacolo. {N}Martial Arts Master Top" rus="Учитель S4 League готов к представлению.{N}Верх костюма учителя боевых искусств." cns="擅长拳脚，重新回归极限战网的少年武者。"/>
	<string key="N1021111" kor="마샬아츠 레이디 상의" ger="Martial Arts Lady Top" eng="Martial Arts Lady Top" tur="Martial Arts Lady Top" fre="Martial Arts Lady Top" spa="Martial Arts Lady Top" ita="Martial Arts Lady Top" rus="Martial Arts Lady Top" cns="武术女孩上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021111" kor="S4리그의 숨겨진 고수. 수련에만 매진하던 그녀가 돌아왔다.{N}숨은 고수 마샬아츠 레이디의 상의" ger="Die Meisterin von S4 League ist jetzt bereit für die Show! {N}Martial Arts Lady Top" eng="The Master of S4 League is now ready for the show. {N}Martial Arts Lady Top" tur="S4 League Master'ı şimdi şov için hazır. {N}Martial Arts Lady Top" fre="Le Maître d'S4 League est prêt à faire son show. {N}Haut de Maîtresse d'Arts Martiaux" spa="El maestro de S4 League ya está listo para el show. {N}Martial Arts Lady Top" ita="Il master di S4 League è pronto per lo spettacolo. {N}Martial Arts Lady Top" rus="Учитель S4 League готова к представлению.{N}Верх костюма учителя боевых искусств." cns="擅长拳脚，重新回归极限战网的女武者。"/>
