	<string key="T1031110" kor="S4리그의 숨겨진 고수. 수련에만 매진하던 그가 돌아왔다.{N}숨은 고수 마샬아츠 마스터의 하의" ger="Der Meister von S4 League ist jetzt bereit für die Show! {N}Martial Arts Master Pants" eng="The Master of S4 League is now ready for the show. {N}Martial Arts Master Pants" tur="S4 League Master'ı şimdi şov için hazır. {N}Martial Arts Master Pants" fre="Le Maître d'S4 League est prêt à faire son show. {N}Pantalon de Maître d'Arts Martiaux" spa="El maestro de S4 League ya está listo para el show. {N}Martial Arts Master Pants" ita="Il master di S4 League è pronto per lo spettacolo. {N}Martial Arts Master Pants" rus="Учитель S4 League готов к представлению.{N}Низ костюма учителя боевых искусств." cns="擅长拳脚，重新回归极限战网的少年武者。"/>
