	<string key="T6010003" kor="넷스피어의 비밀이 담겨있는 정체모를 부품. 넷스피어에 사용 되는 모든 무기에 이 부품이 사용 되었다고 전해진다." ger="Unbekanntes Material, das Gerüchten zufolge das Herzstück der Waffen der Netsphere bilden soll." eng="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. These materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons." tur="Materiales no identificados que se están utilizando en secreto por el grupo de la Netsphere. Estos materiales son muy reconocidos como los principales materiales para construir sus armas." fre="Des matériaux non-identifiés secrètement utilisés par le groupe de la Netsphere. On dit qu'ils entrent en première ligne dans la fabrication de leurs armes." spa="Materiali non identificati che sono stati segretamente utilizzati dal gruppo di Netsphere. Ben noti come materiali principali con cui costruire le loro armi" ita="Netsphere grubu tarafından gizlice kullanılan tanımlanamayan malzemeler. Bu malzemeler silahlarını yapmak için kullandıkları ana malzemeler olarak tanınır." rus="Неопознанные материалы, секретно используемые группировкой из Netsphere. Известно, что эти материалы используются для разработки их оружий." ame="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. This materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons" cns="可以组合道具的材料。" tha="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. This materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons" twn="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. This materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons" jap="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. This materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons"/>
