	<string key="T6010004" kor="넷스피어의 비밀이 담겨있는 정체모를 부품. 넷스피어에 사용 되는 모든 무기에 이 부품이 사용 되었다고 전해진다." ger="Unbekanntes Material, das Gerüchten zufolge das Herzstück der Waffen der Netsphere bilden soll." eng="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. These materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons." tur="Materiales no identificados que se están utilizando en secreto por el grupo de la Netsphere. Estos materiales son muy reconocidos como los principales materiales para construir sus armas." fre="Des matériaux non-identifiés secrètement utilisés par le groupe de la Netsphere. On dit qu'ils entrent en première ligne dans la fabrication de leurs armes." spa="Materiali non identificati che sono stati segretamente utilizzati dal gruppo di Netsphere. Ben noti come materiali principali con cui costruire le loro armi" ita="Netsphere grubu tarafından gizlice kullanılan tanımlanamayan malzemeler. Bu malzemeler silahlarını yapmak için kullandıkları ana malzemeler olarak tanınır." rus="Неопознанные материалы, секретно используемые группировкой из Netsphere. Известно, что эти материалы используются для разработки их оружий." ame="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. This materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons" cns="可以组合道具的材料。" tha="Unidentified materials that are being secretly used by the group of Netsphere. This materials are well known as main materials to build their weapons"/>
	<string key="N6010101" kor="셀" ger="Cell" eng="Cell" tur="Cell" fre="Cell" spa="Cell" ita="Cell" rus="Cell" cns="电池"/>
	<string key="T6010101" kor="넷스피어에 존재하는 무기를 강화하기 위한 부품. 셀을 장착한 무기는 기본 무기보단 한층 더 강력한 성능을 갖게 된다." ger="Material zur Verbesserung von Waffen. Waffen, in die eine Cell eingebaut wurde, sind leistungsfähiger als normale Waffen." eng="Unidentified materials, used secretly by the Netsphere group, to enhance their weapons. The Core inserted weapons have better performance compared to non-inserted weapons." tur="Estos materiales se están utilizando para mejorar sus armas.  Las armas con Cell tienen mejor desempeño en comparación con las armas sin Cell." fre="Ces matériaux sont utilisés pour améliorer les armes. Une arme sertie d'une Cellule sera plus puissante qu'une arme classique." spa="Questi materiali vengono utilizzati per potenziare le loro armi. Le armi inserite in Cell presentano prestazioni migliori rispetto alle armi non inserite" ita="Bu malzemeler silahlarını güçlendirmek için kullanılır. Cell yerleştirilmiş silahlar yerleştirilmemiş silahlara oranla daha iyi performansa sahiptir" rus="Неопознанные материалы, секретно используемые группировкой из Netsphere для зачарования оружий. Оружия со вставленным Core имеют более высокую производительность, чем оружия без модификаций." ame="This materials are being used to enhance their weapon.  The Cell inserted weapons has better performance compares to non-inserted weapons" cns="可以组合道具的特殊材料。" tha="This materials are being used to enhance their weapon.  The Cell inserted weapons has better performance compares to non-inserted weapons" twn="This materials are being used to enhance their weapon.  The Cell inserted weapons has better performance compares to non-inserted weapons" jap="This materials are being used to enhance their weapon.  The Cell inserted weapons has better performance compares to non-inserted weapons"/>
	<string key="N6010102" kor="코어" ger="Core" eng="Core" tur="Core" fre="Core" spa="Core" ita="Core" rus="Core" cns="处理器"/>
	<string key="T6010102" kor="넷스피어에 존재하는 무기를 강화하기 위한 부품. 코어를 장착한 무기는 그 어떤 무기보다 강력한 성능을 보인다고 전해진다." ger="Material zur Verbesserung von Waffen. Waffen, in die ein Core eingebaut wurde, sind leistungsfähiger als normale Waffen." eng="Unidentified materials, used secretly by the Netsphere group, to enhance their weapons. The Core inserted weapons have better performance compared to non-inserted weapons." tur="Estos materiales se están utilizando para mejorar sus armas.  Las armas con Core tienen mejor desempeño en comparación con las armas sin Core." fre="Ces matériaux sont utilisés pour améliorer les armes. Une arme sertie d'un Noyau sera plus puissante qu'une arme classique." spa="Questi materiali vengono utlizzati per potenziare le loro armi. Le armi inserite in Core presentano prestazioni migliori rispetto alle armi non inserite" ita="Bu malzemeler silahlarını güçlendirmek için kullanılır. Core yerleştirilmiş silahlar yerleştirilmemiş silahlara oranla daha iyi performansa sahiptir" rus="Неопознанные материалы, секретно используемые группировкой из Netsphere для зачарования оружий. Оружия со вставленным Core имеют более высокую производительность, чем оружия без модификаций." ame="This materials are being used to enhance their weapon.  The Core inserted weapons has better performance compares to non-inserted weapons" cns="可以组合道具的特殊材料。"/>
