	<string key="T4035301" kor="아마존 퀸 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um folgende Zufallsitems zu erhalten:" eng="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." tur="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Bu capsule'yi kullanın, aşağıdaki eşyaları rasgele alacaksınız." fre="La panoplie complète de la Reine Amazone.{N}Ouvrez cette Capsule pour recevoir les objets suivants au hasard." spa="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Usando esta cápsula recibirás los siguientes artículos al azar." ita="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Usa questa capsule e riceverai gli oggetti seguenti in maniera casuale." rus="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." ame="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." cns="可以获得亚马逊女王套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具" tha="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." twn="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." jap="Amazon Queen Set.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly."/>
