	<string key="T4020029" kor="아이템 분해 조합 업데이트 기념 체험 키트.{N}키트를 사용하면 가우스라이플MK2(1일) 아이템을 조합할 수 있는 재료를 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." eng="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." tur="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." fre="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." spa="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." ita="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." rus="Экспериментальный набор для создания и разборки предметов.{N}Используй этот набор, чтобы получить предметы для создания Gauss Rifle MK2(1 день)." ame="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." cns="道具组合体验套件{N}使用套件，可获得新版高斯步枪（1日）的组合材料" tha="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." twn="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." jap="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." idn="Item Dismentling/Crafting Experiential Kit.{N}Use this kit, you will receive items for crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)."/>
	<string key="N4020035" kor="아이템 조합 재료 캡슐 - 기본팩" ger="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" eng="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" tur="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" fre="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" spa="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" ita="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" rus="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" ame="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" cns="材料扭蛋-普通包" tha="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" twn="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" jap="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)" idn="Crafting Elements Capsule(Light)"/>
	<string key="T4020035" kor="아이템 조합 재료 저가형 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Crafting Elements Capsule.{N}Diese Capsule enthält folgende Items:{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}Du erhältst ein zufällig ausgewähltes Element für den Bat Rabbit." eng="Crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You can receive a Bat Rabbit Piece randomly." tur="el sanatı elementleri capsule'si.{N}Bu capsule'yi kullanın, aşağıdaki eşyaları alacaksınız." fre="Une Capsule d'objets de fabrication .{N}Ouvrez cette Capsule et recevez les objets suivants." spa="Crafting elements Capsule.{N}Usando esta cápsula, recibirás los siguientes artículos." ita="Crafting elements capsule.{N}Usa questa capsule e riceverai gli oggetti seguenti." rus="Capsule с компонентами для создания.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие предметы.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}Можно получить случайную частицу от Bat Rabbit." ame="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items." cns="可以获得普通材料的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得下列道具" tha="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th." twn="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th." jap="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th." idn="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th."/>
	<string key="N4020030" kor="남성 페이스 오프 캡슐" ger="Male Face-off Capsule" eng="Male Face-off Capsule" tur="Male Face-off Capsule" fre="Male Face-off Capsule" spa="Male Face-off Capsule" ita="Male Face-off Capsule" rus="Male Face-off Capsule" ame="Male Face-off Capsule" cns="男性脸的扭蛋" tha="Male Face-off Capsule" twn="Male Face-off Capsule" jap="Male Face-off Capsule" idn="Male Face-off Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4020030" kor="남성 얼굴 3종 세트 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 아래 아이템 중 1가지가 랜덤으로 지급됩니다." ger="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." eng="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." tur="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." fre="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." spa="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." ita="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." rus="Capsule с тремя разными мужскими лицами.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить один из случайных предметов." ame="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." cns="男性脸3种套装扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得下列道具中的1个。" tha="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." twn="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." jap="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." idn="Capsule for 3 kinds of male face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly."/>
	<string key="N4020031" kor="여성 페이스 오프 캡슐" ger="Female Face-off Capsule" eng="Female Face-off Capsule" tur="Female Face-off Capsule" fre="Female Face-off Capsule" spa="Female Face-off Capsule" ita="Female Face-off Capsule" rus="Female Face-off Capsule" ame="Female Face-off Capsule" cns="女性脸的扭蛋" tha="Female Face-off Capsule" twn="Female Face-off Capsule" jap="Female Face-off Capsule" idn="Female Face-off Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4020031" kor="여성 얼굴 3종 세트 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 아래 아이템 중 1가지가 랜덤으로 지급됩니다." ger="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." eng="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." tur="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." fre="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." spa="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." ita="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." rus="Capsule с тремя разными женскими лицами.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить один из случайных предметов." ame="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." cns="女性脸3种套装扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得下列道具中的1个。" tha="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." twn="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." jap="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly." idn="Capsule for 3 kinds of female face.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items randomly."/>
	<string key="N6010005" kor="배트레빗 조각" ger="Bat Rabbit Piece" eng="Bat Rabbit Piece" tur="Bat Rabbit Piece" fre="Bat Rabbit Piece" spa="Bat Rabbit Piece" ita="Bat Rabbit Piece" rus="Bat Rabbit Piece" ame="Bat Rabbit Piece" cns="棒球兔零件" tha="Bat Rabbit Piece" twn="Bat Rabbit Piece" jap="Bat Rabbit Piece" idn="Bat Rabbit Piece"/>
	<string key="T6010005" kor="아이템 분해, 조합 업데이트 기념 한정판 슈퍼 배트래빗 조합 조각입니다.{N}{N}조합시 한정판 슈퍼 배트래빗을 획득할 수 있으며 4월 8일 점검 이후 조각은 일괄 삭제됩니다." ger="Limitiertes Element für den Bat Rabbit, mit dem die Einführung der Itemherstellung und -zerlegung gefeiert wird.{N}{N}Benutze dieses Item, um die limitierte Edition des Super Bat Rabbit herzustellen." eng="Limited edition of Bat Rabbit Piece to celebrate the implementation of the item dismantling/crafting system.{N}{N}Use this to craft the limited edition of Stormbat Rabbit. At the end of the event, all Bat Rabbit pieces will be removed." tur="Eşya parçalama/yapma güncellemesini kutlama amaçlı sınırlı edisyon Bat Rabbit Piece.{N}{N}Sınırlı edisyon Super Bat Rabbit yapmak için bunu kullanın." fre="Une pièce en édition limitée de la Bat Rabbit à l'occasion des nouvelles fonctionnalités de Démantèlement/Fabrication.{N}{N}Utilisez-la pour fabriquer l'édition limitée de la Super Bat Rabbit." spa="Edición limitada de la Bat Rabbit Piece para celebrar la actualización del desmontaje/producción del artículo.{N}{N}Úsalo para producir la edición limitada del Super Bat Rabbit. todas las piezas del Bat Rabbit serán quitadas del juego durante el  mantenimiento." ita="Edizione limitata del Bat Rabbit Piece per festeggiare l'aggiornamento della distruzione/costruzione dell'oggetto.{N}{N}Usalo per costruire l'edizione limitata del Super Bat Rabbit. tutti i pezzi del Bat Rabbit verranno rimossi con la manutenzione." rus="Ограниченный выпуск частиц от Bat Rabbit в честь введения системы по созданию и разборки предметов.{N}{N}Используй эти частицы, чтобы создать Stormbat Rabbit. После окончания события все имеющиеся частицы от Bat Rabbit будут удалены." ame="Limited edition of Bat Rabbit Piece for celebrating the update of item dismantling/crafting.{N}{N}Use this for crafting the limited edition of Super Bat Rabbit. On April 8th, all Bat Rabbit pieces will be removed with the maintenence." cns="通过该道具可以在强化界面组合宠物——棒球兔。{N}只有拥有该道具，才能组合出棒球兔。{N}仅限4月8日前使用，到期后道具将会被删除。" tha="Limited edition of Bat Rabbit Piece for celebrating the update of item dismantling/crafting.{N}{N}Use this for crafting the limited edition of Super Bat Rabbit. On April 8th, all Bat Rabbit pieces will be removed with the maintenence." twn="Limited edition of Bat Rabbit Piece for celebrating the update of item dismantling/crafting.{N}{N}Use this for crafting the limited edition of Super Bat Rabbit. On April 8th, all Bat Rabbit pieces will be removed with the maintenence." jap="Limited edition of Bat Rabbit Piece for celebrating the update of item dismantling/crafting.{N}{N}Use this for crafting the limited edition of Super Bat Rabbit. On April 8th, all Bat Rabbit pieces will be removed with the maintenence." idn="Limited edition of Bat Rabbit Piece for celebrating the update of item dismantling/crafting.{N}{N}Use this for crafting the limited edition of Super Bat Rabbit. On April 8th, all Bat Rabbit pieces will be removed with the maintenence."/>
	<string key="N4035307" kor="G의 가우스라이플 MK2 캡슐" ger="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" eng="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" tur="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" fre="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" spa="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" ita="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" rus="G's Gauss Rifle MK2 Capsule" cns="G的新版高斯步枪扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035307" kor="가우스라이플 MK2를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Gauss Rifle MK2 inklusive Items.{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um folgende Zufallsitems zu erhalten:" eng="Gauss Rifle MK2 with items.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." tur="Gauss Rifle MK2 eşyalarla.{N}Bu capsule'yi kullanın, aşağıdaki eşyaları rasgele alacaksınız." fre="Le célèbre Gauss Rifle MK2.{N}Ouvrez cette Capsule et recevez les objets suivants au hasard." spa="Gauss Rifle MK2 con artículos.{N}Usando esta cápsula, recibirás los siguientes artículos al azar:" ita="Gauss Rifle MK2 con oggetti.{N}Usa questa capsule e riceverai gli oggetti seguenti in maniera casuale." rus="Gauss Rifle MK2 с предметами.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="新版高斯步枪的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2020010" kor="로켓런쳐" ger="Rocket Launcher" eng="Rocket Launcher" tur="Rocket Launcher" fre="Rocket Launcher" rus="Rocket Launcher" cns="火箭发射器"/>
	<string key="T2020010" kor="S4 리그의 수수께끼에 가려진 해커 집단 Mad 'M'. 항상 강력한 무기를 만들어내는 그들이 새롭게 개발한 탄두형 무기. 연사와 강력한 한방 모두가 가능하다. 또한 Mad 'M' 의 취향대로 특별한 기능이 여러가지 추가 되어 있다." ger="Der Rocket Launcher wurde von einer ominösen Hackergruppe namens Mad 'M' entwickelt. Schnelle Raketensalven oder konzentrierte Feuerstöße – Diese Waffe kann haut richtig rein! Dazu kommen noch spezielle Sonderfunktionen - typisch Mad 'M' eben." eng="Newly invented weapon by enigmatic hacker group, Mad 'M', of S4 League. Can use for rapid fires and a big strong shot. Also, has various special functions according to the style of Mad 'M'." tur="S4 League'in esrarengiz hacker grubu Mad 'M' tarafından yeni icat edilmiş bir silah. Sürekli ateş ve büyük güçlü atışlar için tasarlandı. Aynı zamanda Mad 'M' tarzına uygun olarak çeşitli özelliklere de sahip." fre="Nouvelle arme inventée par le mystérieux groupe de hackers de S4 League, Mad 'M'. Possibilité d'effectuer un tir en rafale ou un tir puissant. Dispose également d'une multitude de fonctions spéciales à la Mad 'M&quot;." rus="Новое оружие от загадочной группировки хакеров именуемых Mad «M». Можно использовать как для быстрой стрельбы, так и для больших взрывов. Основываясь на поведении Mad «M» у этого оружия есть и другие особые функции." cns="神秘黑客根据现实中的火箭发射器进行仿制的武器。{N}可以进行弹道预测，也可以对敌人进行范围打击。"/>
	<string key="N2020011" kor="로켓 런쳐 By Mad 'M'" ger="Rocket Launcher By Mad 'M'" eng="Rocket Launcher by Mad 'M'" tur="Rocket Launcher By Mad 'M' Capsule" fre="Rocket Launcher By Mad 'M'" rus="Rocket Launcher by Mad 'M'" cns="疯狂火箭筒"/>
	<string key="T2020011" kor="Mad 'M'이 개량한 로켓런쳐 더욱 커진 무기와 더불어 강력한 화력을 자랑한다. 2단 압축 방식이 사용이 되어 좀 더 화려한 조작이 가능하다. 또한 Mad 'M'의 취향대로 특별한 기능이 여러가지 추가 되어 있다." ger="Ein Rocket Launcher mit einem Upgrade von Mad 'M'. Er ist größer und hat mehr Feuerkraft. Er funktioniert mit Zwei-Schritt-Kompression und garantiert somit mehr Action. Außerdem hat die Waffe viele Spezialfunktionen - typisch Mad 'M' eben!" eng="A Rocket Launcher upgraded by Mad 'M'. It's bigger and comes with more firepower. It uses a two-step compression, allowing for actioned-packed control. It also has lots of special functions, just the way Mad 'M' likes it." tur="Mad 'M' Capsule tarafından geliştirilen bir Rocket Launcher Daha büyük ve daha güçlü ateş eder. Heyecanlı bir kontrol sağlayan iki adımlı sıkıştırma özelliği var. Aynı Mad 'M'nin seveceği gibi bir çok özel fonksiyona da sahip." fre="Rocket Launcher conçu par Mad 'M'. Encore plus gros pour encore plus de puissance. Arme à air comprimé qui permet une meilleure maîtrise. De nombreuses fonctions spéciales, dont Mad 'M' seul a le secret, sont également présentes." rus="Улучшенная версия Rocket Launcher от Mad «M». Теперь оружие стало больше и с повышенной огневой мощью. В оружии используется двухступенчатое сжатие для полного контроля действий в бою. Оно также имеет и другие функции, как и ожидалось от Mad «M»." cns="经过改造的特典火箭发射器。{N}使用最新的两极压缩技术。可以对敌人进行范围打击。"/>
	<string key="N7028005" kor="에스퍼칩 - 무기 공격력 3%" cns="超能芯片-武器攻击力3%"/>
	<string key="T7028005" kor="무기에 장착 가능한 에스퍼칩.{N}이식 후에는 에스퍼칩의 이펙트 효력이 추가 적용됩니다. 이식된 에스퍼칩은 사용가능한 기간이 끝나면 자동으로 파괴됩니다." cns="可安装在武器的超能芯片。{N}移植后，额外增加超能芯片的影响效应。被移植的超能芯片通过现有的期限就会自动销毁。"/>
	<string key="N1070058" kor="모란 앵무" ger="Peony Parrot" eng="Peony Parrot" tur="Peony Parrot" fre="Peony Parrot" rus="Peony Parrot" cns="企鹅绅士"/>
	<string key="T1070058" kor="사랑스러운 모란 앵무. 졸졸 따라다니며 뒤에서 사랑을 속삭입니다." ger="A lovely peony parrot. It follows you whispering sweet nothings in your ear." eng="Ein hübscher Papagei. Er krächzt dir liebevoll ins Ohr." tur="Sevimli bir şakayık papağanı. Kulağına tatlı nağmeler fısıldayarak seni takip eder." fre="Un joli perroquet couleur pivoine. Il vous suivra partout en vous murmurant de jolies choses à l'oreille." rus="Красивый попугай, мило каркающий на ухо своего хозяина." cns="可爱的企鹅绅士。紧紧伴随在你身后悄悄说着爱的私语。"/>
	<string key="N4020036" kor="아이템 조합 재료 캡슐 - 고급팩" ger="Crafting Elements Capsule" eng="Crafting Elements Capsule" tur="Crafting Elements Capsule" fre="Crafting Elements Capsule" spa="Crafting Elements Capsule" ita="Crafting Elements Capsule" rus="Crafting Elements Capsule" ame="Crafting Elements Capsule" cns="材料扭蛋-高级包" tha="Crafting Elements Capsule" twn="Crafting Elements Capsule" jap="Crafting Elements Capsule" idn="Crafting Elements Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4020036" kor="아이템 조합 재료 고가형 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Crafting Elements Capsule.{N}Diese Capsule enthält folgende Items:{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}Du erhältst ein zufällig ausgewähltes Element für den Bat Rabbit." eng="Crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You can receive a Bat Rabbit Piece randomly." tur="el sanatı elementleri capsule'si.{N}Bu capsule'yi kullanın, aşağıdaki eşyaları alacaksınız." fre="Une Capsule d'objets de fabrication .{N}Ouvrez cette Capsule et recevez les objets suivants." spa="Crafting elements Capsule.{N}Usando esta cápsula, recibirás los siguientes artículos." ita="Crafting elements capsule.{N}Usa questa capsule e riceverai gli oggetti seguenti." rus="Capsule с компонентами для создания.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие предметы.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}Можно получить случайную частицу от Bat Rabbit." ame="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items." cns="可以获得高级材料的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得下列道具" tha="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th." twn="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th." jap="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th." idn="Low-priced crafting elements capsule.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items.{CB-0,255,0,255}{N}{N}You will receive 1 piece of Bat Rabbit randomly if the capsule is used before April 8th."/>
	<string key="N6000034" kor="춘장" cns="甜面酱"/>
	<string key="T6000034" kor="S4 리그에 찾아온 블랙데이. 사탕, 초콜렛을 못받았다고 슬퍼하지 마세요. 여러분을 위한 짜장면을 준비했습니다." cns="迎接黑色日的极限战境联赛。不要因为没收到巧克力、糖果而伤心。为大家准备了好吃的炸酱面。"/>
	<string key="N6010006" kor="레스큐건 MK2 부품" ger="Crafting Piece" eng="Crafting Piece" tur="Crafting Piece" fre="Crafting Piece" spa="Crafting Piece" ita="Crafting Piece" rus="Crafting Piece" ame="Crafting Piece" cns="新版救援枪零件" tha="Crafting Piece" twn="Crafting Piece" jap="Crafting Piece" idn="Crafting Piece"/>
	<string key="T6010006" kor="DJ 레스큐건을 보유했던 리거를 위한 특수 부품. 부품을 사용하여 레스큐건 MK2를 제작하실 수 있습니다." ger="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." eng="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." tur="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." fre="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." spa="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." ita="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." rus="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2 (1 день)" ame="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." cns="新版救援枪的零件。使用该零件可以制作新版救援枪。" tha="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." twn="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)." jap="Crafting Gauss Rifle MK2(1day)."/>
	<string key="N2020040" kor="가우스라이플 MK2 (체험용)" ger="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Experiential)" eng="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Experiential)" tur="Gauss Rifle MK3 (Experiential)" fre="Gauss Rifle MK4 (Experiential)" spa="Gauss Rifle MK5 (Experiential)" ita="Gauss Rifle MK6 (Experiential)" rus="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Экспериментальный)" ame="Gauss Rifle MK8 (Experiential)" cns="新版高斯步枪（体验版）" tha="Gauss Rifle MK10 (Experiential)" twn="Gauss Rifle MK11 (Experiential)" jap="Gauss Rifle MK12 (Experiential)" idn="Gauss Rifle MK13 (Experiential)"/>
	<string key="T2020040" kor="새롭게 만들어진 가우스 라이플 MK2. 가우스 라이플의 단점을 보완한 새로운 무기의 탄생. 한층 더 업그레이드 된 가우스라이플 MK2로 넷스피어를 장악하세요." ger="Neu hergestellte und verbesserte Gauss Rifle MK2. Mit dieser Waffe rockst du die Netsphere!" eng="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." tur="Yeni yaratılmış Gauss Rifle MK2. Yükseltilmiş Gauss Rifle MK2 ile Net Sphere'i ele geçir." fre="Un Gauss Rifle MK2 flambant neuf. Prenez d'assaut la NetSphere avec votre Gauss Rifle MK2 amélioré." spa="Gauss Rifle MK2 recientemente creado. Ocupa la Net Sphere con el Gauss Rifle MK2 actualizado." ita="Gauss Rifle MK2 creato di recente. Occupa Net Sphere con Gauss Rifle MK2 migliorato." rus="Новое созданное оружие Gauss Rifle MK2. Захвати Net-Sphere с помощью улучшенного Gauss Rifle MK2." ame="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." cns="改良后的特典高斯步枪。{N}装弹量有所提升。" tha="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." twn="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." jap="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2."/>
	<string key="N2020041" kor="가우스라이플 MK2 (이벤트)" ger="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" eng="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" tur="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" fre="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" spa="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" ita="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" rus="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" ame="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" cns="新版高斯步枪（活动）" tha="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" twn="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" jap="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)" idn="Gauss Rifle MK2 (Event)"/>
	<string key="T2020041" kor="새롭게 만들어진 가우스 라이플 MK2. 가우스 라이플의 단점을 보완한 새로운 무기의 탄생. 한층 더 업그레이드 된 가우스라이플 MK2로 넷스피어를 장악하세요." ger="Neu hergestellte und verbesserte Gauss Rifle MK2. Mit dieser Waffe rockst du die Netsphere!" eng="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." tur="Yeni yaratılmış Gauss Rifle MK2. Yükseltilmiş Gauss Rifle MK2 ile Net Sphere'i ele geçir." fre="Un Gauss Rifle MK2 flambant neuf. Prenez d'assaut la NetSphere avec votre Gauss Rifle MK2 amélioré." spa="Gauss Rifle MK2 recientemente creado. Ocupa la Net Sphere con el Gauss Rifle MK2 actualizado." ita="Gauss Rifle MK2 creato di recente. Occupa Net Sphere con Gauss Rifle MK2 migliorato." rus="Новое созданное оружие Gauss Rifle MK2. Захвати Net-Sphere с помощью улучшенного Gauss Rifle MK2." ame="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." cns="改良后的特典高斯步枪。{N}装弹量有所提升。" tha="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." twn="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2." jap="Newly created Gauss Rifle MK2. Occupy Net Sphere with upgraded Gauss Rifle MK2."/>
	<string key="N4020037" kor="레벨업 부품 캡슐" ger="Piece Capsule for Level Up" eng="Piece Capsule for Level Up" tur="Piece Capsule for Level Up" fre="Piece Capsule for Level Up" spa="Piece Capsule for Level Up" ita="Piece Capsule for Level Up." rus="Piece Capsule for Level Up" ame="Piece Capsule for Level Up" cns="材料扭蛋" tha="Piece Capsule for Level Up" twn="Piece Capsule for Level Up" jap="Piece Capsule for Level Up"/>
	<string key="T4020037" kor="레벨업 기념 부품 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 아래 아이템 중 한가지를 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N}Benutze diese Capsule, um eins der folgenden Zufallsitems zu erhalten:" eng="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N} Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items." tur="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N}Bu capsule'yi kullanın, aşağıdaki eşyalardan birini alacaksınız." fre="Piece Capsule pour Level Up.{N}Utilisez cette Capsule pour recevoir l'un des objets suivants." spa="Pieza de cápsula para subir de nivel.{N} Usando esta cápsula, recibirás los siguientes artículos:" ita="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N} Usa questa capsule e riceverai uno degli oggetti seguenti." rus="Piece Capsule для повышения уровня.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить один из случайных предметов." ame="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N} Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items." cns="可以获得组合装备所需材料的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可获得下列道具中的任意1个" tha="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N} Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items." twn="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N} Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items." jap="Piece Capsule for Level Up.{N} Use this capsule and you will receive one of the following items."/>
	<string key="N1061091" kor="펌비네 짜짱면" cns="波比家的炸酱面"/>
	<string key="T1061091" kor="2014년 블랙데이 이벤트. 초콜렛, 사탕 못받았다고 슬퍼하지마세요. 더 맛있는 짜장면을 준비했습니다." cns="2014年黑色日活动。不要因为没收到巧克力、糖果而伤心。准备了更好吃的炸酱面。"/>
	<string key="N4051422" kor="실크 레이스 세트(내구제)" cns="蕾丝花边套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="T4051422" kor="실크 레이스 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." cns="蕾丝花边套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4020038" kor="1,000,000PEN 캡슐" cns="1,000,000金币扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020038" kor="1,000,000PEN 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 1,000,000PEN을 획득하실 수 있습니다." cns="1,000,000金币扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时可以获得1,000,000金币"/>
	<string key="N4051423" kor="[EVENT] 로카이유 세트 (365일)" cns="[活动]优雅淑女套装（365日）"/>
	<string key="T4051423" kor="로카이유 세트 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." cns="优雅淑女套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4020039" kor="[EVENT] 특별 GIFT 캡슐" cns="[活动]特别礼物扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020039" kor="복장 구매를 하신 특별한 고객을 위한 선물{N}캡슐 사용시 아래와 같은 아이템이 랜덤으로 지급됩니다." cns="为购买服装的特别顾客的礼物{N}使用扭蛋时可随机获得下列道具。"/>
	<string key="N4020040" kor="Mini Pen 250 캡슐" cns="迷你金币250扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020040" kor="미니 펜 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 랜덤으로 펜을 획득하실 수 있습니다." cns="迷你金币扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得金币"/>
	<string key="N4020041" kor="Mini Pen 450 캡슐" cns="迷你金币450扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020041" kor="미니 펜 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 랜덤으로 펜을 획득하실 수 있습니다." cns="迷你金币扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得金币"/>
	<string key="N4020042" kor="슈퍼 플러스 캡슐" cns="超级加扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020042" kor="모든 걸 더 얻을 수있는 슈퍼 플러스 캡슐입니다. 한정적으로 판매하니 놓치지 마세요{N}캡슐 사용시 아래의 아이템이 지급됩니다." cns="可获得全部的超级加扭蛋。限量销售，请不要错过。{N}使用扭蛋可获得下列道具。"/>
	<string key="N4020043" kor="인챈트 세트 캡슐" cns="强化套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020043" kor="더욱 강해지고 싶은 리거를 위한 인챈트 캡슐입니다. 한정적으로 판매하니 놓치지 마세요{N}캡슐 사용시 아래의 아이템이 지급됩니다." cns="想要变得更加强大的联赛准备的强化扭蛋。限量销售，请不要错过。{N}使用扭蛋可获得下列道具。"/>
	<string key="N4020044" kor="Reborn 세트 캡슐" cns="重生套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020044" kor="새롭게 출발 하고 싶은 리거를 위한 캡슐입니다. 한정적으로 판매하니 놓치지 마세요{N}캡슐 사용시 아래의 아이템이 지급됩니다." cns="想要重新开始的联赛准备的扭蛋。限量销售，请不要错过。{N}使用扭蛋可获得下列道具。"/>
	<string key="N4035308" kor="베스 베리 복장 캡슐" ger="Beth/Berry Costume Capsule" eng="Beth/Berry Costume Capsule" tur="Beth/Berry Costume Capsule" fre="Beth/Berry Costume Capsule" rus="Beth/Berry Costume Capsule" cns="极限佣兵（女）套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035308" kor="베스 베리 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Du suchst Beth/Berrys Kostümset? Dann ist diese Kapsel genau das, was du brauchst! Nach Benutzung der Kapsel erhältst du zufällige Items aus der folgenden Liste." eng="Beth/Berry costume set can be acquired. Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." tur="Beth/Berry kostüm seti alınabilir. Bu kapsülü kullandığında şu eşyalara rastgele sahip olacaksın." fre="Il est possible d'obtenir la parure Beth/Berry. Utilisez cette capsule pour recevoir les objets suivants au hasard." rus="Можно получить Beth/Berry костюм. Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得极限佣兵（女）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035309" kor="로이 복장 캡슐" ger="Roy Costume Capsule" eng="Roy Costume Capsule" tur="Roy Costume Capsule" fre="Roy Costume Capsule" rus="Roy Costume Capsule" cns="极限佣兵（男）套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035309" kor="로이 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Auf der Suche nach Roys Kostümset? In dieser Kapsel wirst du fündig! Nach Benutzung der Kapsel erhältst du zufällige Items aus der folgenden Liste," eng="Roy costume set can be acquired. Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." tur="Roy kostüm seti alınabilir. Bu kapsülü kullandığında şu eşyalara rastgele sahip olacaksın." fre="Il est possible d'obtenir la parure de Roy. Utilisez cette capsule pour recevoir les objets suivants au hasard." rus="Можно получить Roy костюм. Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得极限佣兵（男）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4051424" kor="베스 베리 세트 (1일)" ger="Beth/Berry Set (1 Tag)" eng="Beth/Berry Set (1 Day)" tur="Beth/Berry Set (1 Day)" fre="Beth/Berry Set (1 jour)" rus="Beth/Berry Set (1 день)" cns="极限佣兵（女）套装（1日）"/>
