	<string key="T4051473" kor="섹시 스트라이커 세트입니다. {N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Sexy Striker Set{N}Enthält folgende Items:" eng="Sexy Striker Set.{N}Use this set item and you will receive the following items." tur="Sexy Striker Set.{N}Bu set eşyasını kullanınca aşağıdaki eşyaları alacaksınız." fre="Panoplie de la buteuse sexy.{N}Utilisez cette panoplie pour recevoir les objets suivants." spa="Sexy Striker Set.{N}Usa este artículo de set y recibirás algunos de los siguientes artículos:" ita="Sexy Striker Set.{N}Utilizzando questo set, riceverai gli oggetti seguenti." rus="Sexy Striker Set.{N}Используй этот набор, чтобы получить следующие предметы." cns="禁区灵狐套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="T1061118" kor="세계인의 터치다운 축제 응원에 사용되는 남성용 뿔장식" ger="Hörner-Accessoire (M) für das Touchdown Festival." eng="Male Horns accessory for cheering Touchdown festival" tur="Touchdown festivalini kutlamak için Male Horn aksesuarı" fre="Corne de brume masculine pour soutenir les équipes au festival du Touchdown" spa="Cuerno masculino para animar el festival de Touchdown." ita="Corno da ragazzo per fare il tifo al Touchdown festival" rus="Мужской аксессуар в виде рогов для болельщиков Touchdown фестиваля." cns="拥有可以比拟闪电的速度，谁也无法阻挡他冲向球门的闪电前锋饰品。"/>
	<string key="T1061119" kor="세계인의 터치다운 축제 응원에 사용되는 여성용 뿔장식" ger="Hörner-Accessoire (F) für das Touchdown Festival." eng="Female Horns accessory for cheering Touchdown festival" tur="Touchdown festivalini kutlamak için Female Horn aksesuarı" fre="Corne de brume féminine pour soutenir les équipes au festival du Touchdown" spa="Cuerno femenino para animar el festival de Touchdown." ita="Corno da ragazza per fare il tifo al Touchdown festival" rus="Женский аксессуар в виде рогов для болельщиц Touchdown фестиваля." cns="身手矫健如灵狐，一旦身处禁区，就必定能得分的禁区灵狐饰品。"/>
	<string key="T1011118" kor="세계인의 터치다운 축제 응원을 위해 해커G 가 직접 페인팅한 페이스" ger="Gesichtsbemalung von Hacker G für das Touchdown Festival." eng="Face painting by Hacker G for cheering Touchdown festival" tur="Touchdown festivalini kutlamak için Hacker G tarafından bir boyalı yüz maskesi" fre="Maquillage du Hackeur G pour soutenir les équipes au festival du Touchdown" spa="Pintura de cara por Hacker G para animar el festival de Touchdown." ita="Volto pitturato da Hacker G per fare il tifo al Touchdown festival" rus="Раскраска на лицо от Hacker G для болельщиков Touchdown фестиваля." cns="拥有可以比拟闪电的速度，谁也无法阻挡他冲向球门的闪电前锋脸型。"/>
	<string key="T1011119" kor="세계인의 터치다운 축제 응원을 위해 해커G 가 직접 페인팅한 페이스" ger="Gesichtsbemalung von Hacker G für das Touchdown Festival." eng="Face painting by Hacker G for cheering Touchdown festival" tur="Touchdown festivalini kutlamak için Hacker G tarafından bir boyalı yüz maskesi" fre="Maquillage du Hackeur G pour soutenir les équipes au festival du Touchdown" spa="Pintura de cara por Hacker G para animar el festival de Touchdown." ita="Volto pitturato da Hacker G per fare il tifo al Touchdown festival" rus="Раскраска на лицо от Hacker G для болельщиков Touchdown фестиваля." cns="身手矫健如灵狐，一旦身处禁区，就必定能得分的禁区灵狐脸型。"/>
	<string key="N1061118" kor="펌비볼 스트라이커 혼" ger="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" eng="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" tur="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" fre="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" spa="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" ita="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" rus="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" ame="Fumbi Ball Striker Horns" cns="闪电前锋饰品"/>
	<string key="N1061119" kor="섹시 스트라이커 혼" ger="Sexy Striker Horns" eng="Sexy Striker Horns" tur="Sexy Striker Horns" fre="Sexy Striker Horns" spa="Sexy Striker Horns" ita="Sexy Striker Horns" rus="Sexy Striker Horns" ame="Sexy Striker Horns" cns="禁区灵狐饰品"/>
	<string key="N1011118" kor="펌비볼 페이스 프린팅" ger="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" eng="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" tur="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" fre="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" spa="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" ita="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" rus="Cheer-up Face Painting (M)" cns="闪电前锋脸型"/>
	<string key="N1011119" kor="섹시 페이스 프린팅" ger="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" eng="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" tur="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" fre="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" spa="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" ita="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" rus="Cheer-up Face Painting (F)" cns="禁区灵狐脸型"/>
	<string key="N4035233" kor="펌비볼 스트라이커 캡슐" ger="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" eng="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" tur="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" fre="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" spa="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" ita="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" rus="Fumbi Ball Striker Capsule" cns="闪电前锋套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035233" kor="펌비볼 스트라이커 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Enthält das Fumbi Ball Striker Set.{N}Benutze dieses Capsule-Item, um ein zufällig ausgewähltes Item aus folgender Liste zu erhalten:" eng="Fumbi Ball Striker Set.{N}Use this capsule and you will receive the following items randomly." tur="Fumbi Ball Striker Set.{N}Bu capsule'yi kullanınca aşağıdaki eşyaları rasgele alacaksınız." fre="Panoplie de buteur Fumbi.{N}Utilisez cette capsule et vous recevrez aléatoirement les objets suivants." spa="Fumbi Ball Striker Set.{N}Usando esta capsule, recibirás los siguientes artículos al azar:" ita="Fumbi Ball Striker Set.{N}Utilizzando questa capsule, riceverai gli oggetti seguenti in maniera casuale." rus="Fumbi Ball Striker Set.{N}Используй эту капсулу, чтобы получить следующие случайные предметы." cns="可以获得闪电前锋套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4020056" kor="미션 보상 - 펜" ger="Mission Reward - PEN" eng="Mission Reward - PEN" tur="Görev Ödülü - PEN" fre="Récompense de mission - PEN" rus="Mission Reward - PEN" cns="任务奖励-金币"/>
	<string key="T4020056" kor="일일 미션 보상 펜 캡슐입니다. 사용시 3000PEN을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um 3.000 PEN zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward PEN Capsule. Receive 3000 PEN when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, PEN Kapsülü. Aç ve 3000 PEN kazan." fre="Voici la capsule PEN de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez 3000 PEN en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с PEN за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь 3000 PEN." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可获得3000金币"/>
	<string key="N4020057" kor="미션 보상 - 쿠폰" ger="Mission Reward - Coupon" eng="Mission Reward - Coupon" tur="Görev Ödülü - Kupon" fre="Récompense de mission - Coupon" rus="Mission Reward - Coupon" cns="任务奖励-兑换券"/>
	<string key="T4020057" kor="일일 미션  보상 쿠폰 캡슐입니다. 사용시 30 쿠폰을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um 30 Coupons zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward Coupon Capsule. Receive 30 coupons when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Kupon Kapsülü. Aç ve 30 kupon kazan." fre="Voici la capsule coupon de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez 30 coupons en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с купонами за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь 30 купонов." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可获得30兑换券"/>
	<string key="N4020058" kor="미션 보상 - 에스퍼칩" ger="Mission Reward - Esper Chip" eng="Mission Reward - Esper Chip" tur="Görev Ödülü - Esper Chip" fre="Récompense de mission -  eSper chip" rus="Mission Reward - Esper Chip" cns="任务奖励-超能芯片"/>
	<string key="T4020058" kor="일일 미션 보상 에스퍼칩 캡슐입니다. 사용시 1/3/7일 에스퍼칩을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um eSper-Chips (1, 3 oder 7 Tage) zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward Esper Chip Capsule. Receive 1, 3, or 7-Day Esper Chips when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Kupon Esper Chip Kapsülü. Aç ve 1, 3 ya da 7 günlük Esper Chip kazan." fre="Voici la capsule eSper chip de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez des eSper chips (1, 3 ou 7 jours) en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с eSper чипами за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь eSper чип на 1, 3 или 7 дней." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可获得1/3/7日超能芯片"/>
	<string key="N4020059" kor="미션 보상 - 복장" ger="Mission Reward - Costume" eng="Mission Reward - Costume" tur="Görev Ödülü - Kostüm" fre="Récompense de mission - Costume" rus="Mission Reward - Costume" cns="任务奖励-服装"/>
	<string key="T4020059" kor="일일 미션 보상 프리시즌 복장 캡슐입니다. 사용시 기존 S4에 출시 된 복장 캡슐 1종을 획득하실 수 있습니다. 남자, 여자 복장 중 무작위로 1종 획득이 가능합니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um ein Kostüm zu erhalten. So eine Kostüm-Capsule kann sowohl ein Kostüm für Frauen, als auch für Kerle enthalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward  Costume Capsule. Receive one Costume from S4 League when you open it. This Costume Capsule has an equal chance of containing a Male or Female Costume." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Bedava Sezon Kostüm Kapsülü. Aç ve S4 League'den bir Kostüm kazan. Bu Kostüm Kapsülünden Erkek ya da Kadın Kostümü çıkma şansı eşittir." fre="Voici la capsule costume  de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez un costume de S4 League en l'ouvrant. Cette capsule costume a autant de chances de contenir une tenue pour homme que pour femme." rus="Capsule с костюмом за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь один костюм из S4 League. Из костюмной капсулы можно с одинаковым шансом получить как мужской, так и женский костюм." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可获得任意1种已推出的服装（性别不限）"/>
	<string key="N4020060" kor="미션 보상 - 무기" ger="Mission Reward - Weapon" eng="Mission Reward - Weapon" tur="Görev Ödülü - Silah" fre="Récompense de mission - Arme" rus="Mission Reward - Weapon" cns="任务奖励-武器"/>
	<string key="T4020060" kor="일일 미션 보상 프리시즌 무기 캡슐입니다. 사용시 기존 S4에 출시 된 무기 캡슐 1종을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um eine Waffe zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward  Weapon Capsule. Receive one Weapon from S4 League when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Bedava Sezon Silah Kapsülü. Aç ve S4 League'den bir Silah kazan." fre="Voici la capsule arme  de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez une arme de S4 League en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с оружием за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь одно оружие из S4 League." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得1种武器"/>
	<string key="N4020061" kor="미션 보상 - 펫" ger="Mission Reward - Pet" eng="Mission Reward - Pet" tur="Görev Ödülü - Evcil Hayvan" fre="Récompense de mission - Familier" rus="Mission Reward - Pet" cns="任务奖励-宠物"/>
	<string key="T4020061" kor="일일 미션 보상 프리시즌 펫 캡슐입니다. 사용시 기존 S4에 출시 된 펫 캡슐 1종을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um einen Begleiter zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward  Pet Capsule. Receive one Pet from S4 League when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Bedava Sezon Evcil Hayvan Kapsülü. Aç ve S4 League'den bir Evcil Hayvan kazan." fre="Voici la capsule familier  de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez un familier de S4 League en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с питомцем за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь одного питомца из S4 League." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得1种宠物"/>
	<string key="N4020062" kor="미션 보상 - 스킬" ger="Mission Reward - Skill" eng="Mission Reward - Skill" tur="Görev Ödülü - Yetenek" fre="Récompense de mission - Compétence" rus="Mission Reward - Skill" cns="任务奖励-技能"/>
	<string key="T4020062" kor="일일 미션 보상 스킬 캡슐입니다. 사용시 유니크 스킬 캡슐 1종을 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um einen einzigartigen Skill zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward Skill Capsule. Receive one Unique Skill from S4 League when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Yetenek Kapsülü. Aç ve S4 League'den bir Özel Yetenek kazan." fre="Voici la capsule compétence de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez une compétence unique de S4 League en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с умениями за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь одно уникальное умение из S4 League." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得1种技能"/>
	<string key="N4020063" kor="미션 보상 - 소모품" ger="Mission Reward - Supplies" eng="Mission Reward - Supplies" tur="Görev Ödülü - Erzak" fre="Récompense de mission - Ravitaillement" rus="Mission Reward - Supplies" cns="任务奖励-消耗品"/>
	<string key="T4020063" kor="일일 미션 보상 소모품 캡슐입니다. 사용시 소모품 1종을 랜덤으로 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um ein zufälliges Item zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward Supply Capsule. Receive one random supply item when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Erzak Kapsülü. Aç ve S4 League'den rastgele bir Erzak eşyası kazan." fre="Voici la capsule ravitaillement de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez un objet de ravitaillement aléatoire de S4 League en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule со вспомогательными предметами за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь один случайный вспомогательный предмет." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得1种消耗品"/>
	<string key="N4020064" kor="미션 보상 - 재료 캡슐" ger="Mission Reward - Materials" eng="Mission Reward - Materials" tur="Görev Ödülü - Malzemeler" fre="Récompense de mission - Matériel" rus="Mission Reward - Materials" cns="任务奖励-材料扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020064" kor="일일 미션 보상 재료 캡슐 입니다. 사용시 재료 1종을 랜덤으로 획득하실 수 있습니다." ger="Eine glänzende Capsule, verliehen als Belohnung für den Abschluss der Täglichen Mission. Öffnen, um ein zufälliges Material zu erhalten." eng="This is the Daily Mission Reward Material Capsule. Receive one random material item when you open it." tur="Bu Günlük Görev Ödülü, Malzeme Kapsülü. Aç ve S4 League'den rastgele bir Malzeme eşyası kazan." fre="Voici la capsule matériel de récompense de mission quotidienne. Vous recevrez un objet de matériel aléatoire de S4 League en l'ouvrant." rus="Capsule с материями за выполнение ежедневных миссий. Открыв ее, ты получишь одну случайную материю." cns="日常任务奖励。{N}使用扭蛋可随机获得1种材料"/>
	<string key="N2000037" kor="마하3 스파이대거" ger="Mach 3 Spy Dagger" eng="Mach 3 Spy Dagger" tur="Mach 3 Spy Dagger" fre="Mach 3 Spy Dagger" rus="Mach 3 Spy Dagger" cns="极速马赫"/>
	<string key="T2000037" kor="마하3 스파이대거로 치면 총탄을 비껴나가게 하는 것 정도는 간단해! -벚꽃 사중주: 꽃의 노래 -" ger="Mach 3 Spy Dagger kann Kugeln aus  Waffen  abwehren! - Cherry Blossom Quartet: Song of Flower -" eng="The Mach 3 Spy Dagger lets you dodge a speeding bullet! - Cherry Blossom Quartet: Flower Melody -" tur="Mach3 Spy Dagger bir silahtan atılmış mermiden çok kolay kaçabilir! -Cherry Blossom Quartet: Song of Flower -" fre="Mach3 Spy Dagger peut facilement éviter une balle d'une arme à feu ! -Cherry Blossom Quartet : Song of Flower -" rus="С Mach 3 Spy Dagger можно уклониться даже от самых скоростных пуль! - Квартет цветущей вишни: Мелодия цветов -" cns="拥有超音速能力的特典战术匕首。{N}刀刃一分为三，就像飞机的机翼一样一张一合。{N}对于极速马赫来说，躲避子弹都是小菜一碟！"/>
	<string key="N4020065" kor="오션 패키지 - 남성" cns="海洋套包-男性"/>
	<string key="T4020065" kor="2014년 무더운 여름을 차갑게 식혀줄 패키지가 출시 되었습니다.{N}캡슐 사용시 아래와 같은 아이템을 얻으실 수 있습니다." cns="2014年推出了冷却炎热夏天的礼包。{N}使用扭蛋可获得下列道具。"/>
	<string key="N4020066" kor="오션 패키지 - 여성" cns="海洋套包-女性"/>
