	<string key="T2000041" kor="골드 체인 카운터 스워드 리미티드 버전!{N}화려한 체인과 스파이크로 장식된 유니크 카운터 스워드" ger="Limitierte Edition des Gold Chain Counter Swords! {N}Unique Counter Sword mit extavaganten Ketten und Spikes." eng="Gold Chain Counter Sword Limited Version!{N} Unique counter sword decorated with extravagant chains and spikes." tur="Gold Chain Counter Sword Limited Version!{N} Unique Counter Sword Decorated with Extravagant Chains and Spikes" fre="Gold Chain Counter Sword en édition limité !{N}Counter Sword unique ornée de chaines et de pics." rus="Ограниченный выпуск Gold Chain Counter Sword!{N}Уникальный меч для контратак с декорациями из экстравагантных цепей и шипов." cns="华丽的限量版特典角斗卫士！{N}古埃及守护神阿努比斯的武器，亡者的守护神、灵魂的审判官。"/>
