	<string key="N1021144" kor="스트릿보이 스타디움 자켓" ger="Street Boy Stadium Jacket" eng="Street Style Stadium Jacket" tur="Street Style Stadium Jacket" fre="Street Boy Stadium Jacket" rus="Street Style Stadium Jacket" cns="运动男孩夹克"/>
	<string key="T1021144" kor="패션 피플들에게 사랑 받는 최신 스트릿 패션!{N}시크한 스타디움 자켓과 캐주얼한 후드 티셔츠를 믹스매치!" ger="Street Fashion für modebewusste Spieler!{N}Verbindet eine schicke Sportjacke mit einem lässigen Kapuzenshirt! " eng="Trendy street fashion for stylish combatants!{N}The perfect combo: a chic stadium jacket with a casual hoodie." tur="Stil sahibi savaşçıların çok sevdiği trendi sokak modası!{N}Şık bir stadium jacket ve günlük kapüşonlu tişört ile kombinleyin! " fre="Une tenue super trendy qui fera craquer tous les fashionistas !{N}Un savant mélange entre une veste de sport et un hoodie casu ! " rus="Уличная мода для стильных бойцов!{N}Идеальная комбинация: стадионная куртка с повседневной толстовкой." cns="最新流行的街头服饰，运动与时尚相结合的嘻哈风服装！{N}只有你想不到，没有你做不到的运动男孩夹克！"/>
	<string key="N1031144" kor="스트릿보이 조거 팬츠" ger="Street Boy Jogger Pants" eng="Street Style Jogging Pants" tur="Street Style Jogging Pants" fre="Street Boy Jogger Pants" rus="Street Style Jogging Pants" cns="运动男孩裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031144" kor="패션 피플들에게 사랑 받는 최신 스트릿 패션!{N}시크함과 함께 활동성을 높인 조거 팬츠" ger="Street Fashion für modebewusste Spieler!{N}Schicke und gleichzeitig sportliche Jogginghose!" eng="Trendy street fashion for stylish combatants!{N}Activewear that lets you move freely without sacrificing style." tur="Stil sahibi savaşçıların çok sevdiği trendi sokak modası!{N}Şık fakat sportif koşucu pantalonu" fre="Un pantalon super trendy qui fera craquer tous les fashionistas !{N}Une tenue de sport confortable mais très chic." rus="Уличная мода для стильных бойцов!{N}Спортивная одежда позволит свободно двигаться без каких-либо препятствий." cns="最新流行的街头服饰，运动与时尚相结合的嘻哈风服装！{N}只有你想不到，没有你做不到的运动男孩裤子！"/>
	<string key="N1041144" kor="스트릿보이 실버 링" ger="Street Boy Silver Ring" eng="Street Style Silver Ring" tur="Street Style Silver Ring" fre="Street Boy Silver Ring" rus="Street Style Silver Ring" cns="运动男孩银环"/>
	<string key="T1041144" kor="심플한 디자인의 실버 링" ger="Ein einfach gestalteter Silberring." eng="A simple but elegant silver ring." tur="Basit tasarımlı bir gümüş yüzük" fre="Un anneau en argent de designer." rus="Простое, но элегантное серебряное кольцо." cns="最新流行的街头服饰，运动与时尚相结合的嘻哈风服装！{N}只有你想不到，没有你做不到的运动男孩银环！"/>
