	<string key="N1001162" kor="히트맨 버즈컷" ger="Hitman Buzz-cut" eng="Hitman Buzz-cut" tur="Hitman Buzz-cut" fre="Hitman Buzz-cut" rus="Hitman Buzz-cut" cns="黑手党（男）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001162" kor="최근 네덴 지역에서 유행중인 반삭발{N}쿨마초의 매력이 폭발!!" ger="Dieser Kurzhaarschnitt ist der letzte Schrei in Neden.{N}Sehr maskulin!" eng="A half-shaved look which is all the rage these days in Neden.{N}A real tough guy's cut!" tur="Bu aralar Neden'de çok meşhur olan yarı dazlak saç stili. {N}Gerçek bir maço kesimi!!" fre="Une coupe de cheveux qui fait fureur sur Neden en ce moment :{N}À moitié rasé !" rus="Наполовину сбритый вид сейчас в тренде моды на Neden локациях.{N}Прическа по-настоящему крутого парня!" cns="在男性黑手党之间非常流行的寸头。{N}让你深陷硬汉的魅力不可自拔！"/>
	<string key="N1021162" kor="시스루 퍼 코트" ger="Transparent Fur Coat" eng="Transparent Fur Coat" tur="Transparent Fur Coat" fre="Transparent Fur Coat" rus="Transparent Fur Coat" cns="黑手党（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021162" kor="속이 비치는 셔츠와 두꺼운 퍼 코트의 조합{N}추운지 더운지 알 수 없는 신비로운 패션" ger="Eine wunderschöne Kombination aus durchsichtigem Shirt und fluffigem Pelzmantel.{N}Lässt sich bei Hitze wie auch Kälte tragen." eng="A trendy combination of a see-through shirt plus added fur coat.{N}It looks both warm and cool at the same time." tur="İç gösteren gömlek ve kalın kürk montun güzel kombinasyonu{N}Hem sıcak hem de havalı gözüküyor" fre="La combinaison d'une chemise transparente et d'un manteau en fourrure :{N}chaud et classe à la fois." rus="Модная комбинация прозрачной рубашки и меховой куртки.{N}Выглядит тепло и стильно одновременно." cns="玩世不恭的男性黑手党爱穿的上衣。{N}透视衬衫和厚毛外套的组合。"/>
	<string key="N1031162" kor="빅 버클 부츠컷" ger="Big-Buckle Bootcuts" eng="Big-Buckle Bootcuts" tur="Big-Buckle Bootcuts" fre="Big-Buckle Bootcuts" rus="Big-Buckle Bootcuts" cns="黑手党（男）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031162" kor="커다란 버클 장식의 벨트가 눈에띄는 팬츠{N}고전적인 느낌의 부츠컷 라인도 포인트!" ger="Der Gürtel mit der großen Schnalle ist ein echter Blickfang.{N}Und der lässige Schnitt ist auch nicht zu verachten." eng="An eye catching belt with a gaudy buckle.{N}The classic bootcut pants ain't bad either!" tur="Büyük bir tokaya sahip kemer göz kamaştırıyor{N}Bir başka çekici noktası ise klasik çizme paçalar!" fre="Une ceinture décorée avec une grosse boucle qui attire l'œil.{N}Le pantalon moulant est pas mal non plus !" rus="Привлекательный пояс с яркой пряжкой.{N}Широкие классические штаны не такие уж и плохие!" cns="玩世不恭的男性黑手党爱穿的裤子。{N}正中间的皮带扣特别晃眼。"/>
	<string key="N1041162" kor="바이커 글러브" ger="Biker Gloves" eng="Biker Gloves" tur="Biker Gloves" fre="Biker Gloves" rus="Biker Gloves" cns="黑手党（男）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041162" kor="무난한 스타일의 바이커 글러브" ger="Diese Bikerhandschuhe sind schlicht, sehen aber trotzdem cool aus." eng="Nothing special, but these biker gloves look cool." tur="Sade bisikletçi eldivenleri iyi duruyor" fre="Des gants de moto tout à fait classiques." rus="Ничего особенного, но эти байкерские перчатки отлично смотрятся." cns="玩世不恭的男性黑手党爱用的手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051162" kor="레더스트랩 앵클 부츠" ger="Leather Strap Ankle Boots" eng="Leather Strap Ankle Boots" tur="Leather Strap Ankle Boots" fre="Leather Strap Ankle Boots" rus="Leather Strap Ankle Boots" cns="黑手党（男）皮靴"/>
	<string key="T1051162" kor="버클과 스트랩 장식으로 포인트를 준 앵클 부츠{N}키높이 효과 있음" ger="Stiefeletten mit Riemen und Schnallen.{N}Damit siehst du gleich etwas größer aus." eng="Ankle Boots covered in buckles and straps{N}These boots make you look taller." tur="Toka ve kayış ile süslenmiş yarım bot{N}Bu botlar seni daha uzun gösterdi" fre="Des bottines avec une boucle et des sangles{N}qui vous grandiront." rus="Ботильоны, покрытые пряжками и ремнями.{N}В этой обуви ты будешь выглядеть выше." cns="玩世不恭的男性黑手党爱穿的皮靴。{N}穿上后觉得自己仿佛高了几厘米。"/>
	<string key="N1061162" kor="히트맨 선글라스" ger="Hitman Sunglasses" eng="Hitman Sunglasses" tur="Hitman Sunglasses" fre="Hitman Sunglasses" rus="Hitman Sunglasses" cns="黑手党（男）太阳镜"/>
	<string key="T1061162" kor="그라데이션이 들어간 스퀘어 선글라스" ger="Rechteckige Sonnenbrille mit abgestufter Tönung." eng="A pair of gradient lens sunglasses with squared frames." tur="Kare şekilli değişken camlı güneş gözlüğü" fre="Des lunettes carrées aux verres polarisés." rus="Солнечные очки с градиентной линзой и квадратной оправой." cns="方形框架的渐进色太阳镜，可以更好地保护眼睛。"/>
	<string key="N1001163" kor="미니햇 사이드 테일" ger="Mini Hat Side-Tail" eng="Mini Hat Side-Tail" tur="Mini Hat Side-Tail" fre="Mini Hat Side-Tail" rus="Mini Hat Side-Tail" cns="黑手党（女）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001163" kor="고딕풍의 미니햇을 얹은 사이드 포니테일" ger="Ein seitlicher Pferdeschwanz mit klassischem Hütchen." eng="A chic side ponytail with a classy mini hat." tur="Şık bir mini şapka ile yandan kuyruk stili" fre="Une queue de cheval de côté agrémentée d'un petit chapeau." rus="Шикарный конский хвостик с классической шляпкой." cns="哥特式的迷你帽子发带配上斜马尾。"/>
	<string key="N1011163" kor="벤데타 스타일" ger="Vendetta Style" eng="Vendetta Style" tur="Vendetta Style" fre="Vendetta Style" rus="Vendetta Style" cns="黑手党（女）脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011163" kor="앳된 인상을 메이크업으로 숨긴 듯한 페이스{N}보일듯 말듯한 매력점이 포인트" ger="Sexy Makeup für ein junges Gesicht.{N}An einer Stelle ist es etwas verlaufen, aber das unterstreicht nur die Coolness." eng="A young-looking face liberally layered with alluring makeup.{N}The spot under her eye captures your attention." tur="Seksi makyaja sahip genç görünen bir yüz{N}Gözünün altındaki belli belirsiz nokta onun en çekici yanı" fre="Un maquillage sophistiqué{N}soulignant un regard mystérieux." rus="Молодое лицо со щедро нанесенным макияжем.{N}Выразительные глаза так и привлекают внимание." cns="用妆容掩饰了青涩的面庞。{N}眼里有些若隐若现的光芒。"/>
	<string key="N1021163" kor="시스루 퍼 자켓" ger="Transparent Fur Jacket" eng="Transparent Fur Jacket" tur="Transparent Fur Jacket" fre="Transparent Fur Jacket" rus="Transparent Fur Jacket" cns="黑手党（女）夹克"/>
	<string key="T1021163" kor="파격적인 노출의 시스루탑과 럭셔리한 퍼 자켓의 조합" ger="Eine wunderschöne Kombination aus durchsichtigem Top und flauschiger Pelzjacke." eng="A stunningly sexy see-through top paired with a luxurious fur jacket." tur="Seksi iç gösteren bir üst ile lüks kürk montun güzel kombinasyonu" fre="Un top tout à fait transparent combiné avec une luxueuse veste en fourrure." rus="Обворожительный вид прозрачной майки в комбинации с меховой курткой." cns="性感危险的女性黑手党爱穿的夹克。{N}大胆裸露的透视装上衣和华丽的毛夹克相结合。"/>
	<string key="N1031163" kor="체인 핫 팬츠" ger="Hot Pants with Chain" eng="Hot Pants with Chain" tur="Hot Pants with Chain" fre="Hot Pants with Chain" rus="Hot Pants with Chain" cns="黑手党（女）超短裤"/>
	<string key="T1031163" kor="벨트와 체인, 가터벨트가 선보이는 위험한 매력의 일직선" ger="Gürtel, Kette und Strumpfhalter machen aus den Shorts ein richtig heißes Höschen!" eng="The combination of the belt, chain and garter belt make these short shorts even hotter." tur="Kemer, zincir ve jartiyer bantının kombinasyonu bu kısa pantalonu olduğundan daha ateşli gösteriyor" fre="L'ajout d'une ceinture, de chaînes et de jarretelles compléteront parfaitement ce short." rus="Комбинация из ремня, цепочки и подвязки делают эти короткие шорты еще обворожительнее." cns="性感危险的女性黑手党爱穿的超短裤。{N}谁不喜欢丝袜呢！"/>
	<string key="N1041163" kor="레더 리스트밴드" ger="Leather Wristband" eng="Leather Wristband" tur="Leather Wristband" fre="Leather Wristband" rus="Leather Wristband" cns="黑手党（女）手链"/>
	<string key="T1041163" kor="손목 보호대 형태의 가죽 팔찌" ger="Ein Handgelenksschützer aus robustem Leder." eng="A leather fashion gauntlet." tur="Bilekleri korumak için deri bileklik " fre="Un bracelet de force en cuir." rus="Модные кожаные перчатки." cns="性感危险的女性黑手党爱戴的手链。{N}用皮质手链取代了护腕。"/>
	<string key="N1051163" kor="스터드 스트랩 힐" ger="Rockstud Heels" eng="Rockstud Heels" tur="Rockstud Heels" fre="Rockstud Heels" rus="Rockstud Heels" cns="黑手党（女）高跟鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051163" kor="발목에서 발끝으로 이어지는 장식이 성숙한 느낌을 주는 힐" ger="Mit Nieten und Riemchen sind diese Schuhe das Richtige für Rockerbräute!" eng="These sandal style heels glint with studs on caged straps, the perfect way to complete your sexy style." tur="Bantların arasından çıkan parlak çiviler seksi stilinizi tamamlayacak" fre="Des clous dorés sur des lanières qui colleront à merveille à votre style." rus="Клетчатые сандалии на высоких каблуках со сверкающими шпильками идеально дополняют сексуальный вид." cns="性感危险的女性黑手党爱穿的高跟鞋。{N}脚腕到脚尖连接的装饰，带来成熟感的高跟鞋"/>
	<string key="N1001164" kor="언더보스 댄디 컷" ger="UnderBoss Dandy Cut" eng="UnderBoss Dandy Cut" tur="UnderBoss Dandy Cut" fre="UnderBoss Dandy Cut" rus="UnderBoss Dandy Cut" cns="霸道总裁发型"/>
	<string key="T1001164" kor="과거 네덴 지역에서 유행했던 미디움 컷의 변형. 전통을 중시하면서도 혁신을 놓치지 않는 젊은 보스에게 어울리는 스타일" ger="Eine noch stylischere Variante des Medium Cuts, der in Neden sehr beliebt ist. Der perfekte Haarschnitt für junge Männer die wissen, was sie wollen." eng="Upgraded version of a style which was very popular in Neden. It's perfectly suited to ambitious underbosses who see the value in both fashionability and tradition." tur="Neden'de popüler olan Medium Cut'ın gelişmiş versiyonu. Hem yeniliğe açık hem de geleneklerine değer veren bosslar için iyi bir tercih." fre="Une version plus tendance de la Medium Cut qui était populaire à Neden. Elle est appropriée pour un jeune patron ayant à la fois le sens de l'innovation et le respect des traditions." rus="Модернизированный стиль, ставший популярным в Neden. Он отлично подходит для амбициозных заместителей боссов, которые чтят моду и традиции." cns="拥有完美外形、冷峻气质、强大家世的霸道总裁发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021164" kor="퍼 칼라 더블 코트" ger="Fur Collar Duffle Coat" eng="Fur Collar Duffle Coat" tur="Fur Collar Duffle Coat" fre="Fur Collar Duffle Coat" rus="Fur Collar Duffle Coat" cns="霸道总裁毛领外套"/>
	<string key="T1021164" kor="고급스러운 퍼 칼라가 돋보이는 더블 코트. 고전적이지만 세련미를 느낄 수 있는 클래식 스타일" ger="Ein Kunstfellmantel, zeitlos und edel." eng="This heavy coat is fitted with a luxurious fur collar. As a fashion statement, it's both classic and stylish." tur="Lüks kürk yakalı, kalın yün ceket. Klasik ama çok şık." fre="Un manteau doté d'un magnifique col en fourrure : classique mais chic." rus="Эта утепленная куртка снабжена роскошным меховым воротником. Согласно модному приговору, она классическая и стильная." cns="拥有完美外形、冷峻气质、强大家世的霸道总裁上衣。"/>
	<string key="N1031164" kor="레더 패치 슬랙스" ger="Leather Patch Slacks" eng="Leather Patch Slacks" tur="Leather Patch Slacks" fre="Leather Patch Slacks" rus="Leather Patch Slacks" cns="霸道总裁西装裤"/>
	<string key="T1031164" kor="사이드 포켓과 힙 포켓에 가죽을 덧대어 반항적인 이미지를 부여한 슬랙스" ger="Eine Hose voller Lederflicken und Taschen. Wenn eine Hose 'Rebellion' ausstrahlt, dann diese." eng="These patched leather trousers project a stylish and rebellious image. Hot stuff!" tur="Yan ve arka ceplerindeki yamalı deri ile çok asi görünüyor." fre="Un pantalon à pince à l'allure rebelle grâce à ses pièces en cuir au niveau des poches." rus="Потрепанные кожаные брюки проецируют стильный и мятежный образ. Горячая вещь!" cns="拥有完美外形、冷峻气质、强大家世的霸道总裁裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041164" kor="레더 버클 글러브" ger="Leather Buckle Gloves" eng="Leather Buckle Gloves" tur="Leather Buckle Gloves" fre="Punk Rock Buckle Gloves" rus="Leather Buckle Gloves" cns="霸道总裁手套"/>
	<string key="T1041164" kor="손등의 버클로 조이는 독특한 형태의 가죽 글러브" ger="Diese Lederhandschuhe lassen sich dank der Schnallen individuell anpassen." eng="Luxurious leather gloves which can be cinched with the high-quality buckles on the back." tur="Arka kısmındaki tokası ile sıkılabilen deri eldivenler." fre="Des gants en cuir ajustables grâce aux boucles de réglage." rus="Роскошные кожаные перчатки с высококачественными пряжками." cns="拥有完美外形、冷峻气质、强大家世的霸道总裁手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051164" kor="클래식 클리퍼" ger="Classic Clipper" eng="Classic Clipper" tur="Classic Clipper" fre="Classic Clipper" rus="Classic Clipper" cns="霸道总裁皮鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051164" kor="개성을 중시하는 매니아 층에게 인기있는 신발. 두꺼운 러버 솔은 키높이 효과도 강력" ger="Die perfekten Schuhe für stilbewusste Spieler. Die dicke Gummisohle lässt dich größer erscheinen." eng="These are the go-to shoes for anyone who has an elevated sense of fashion and style. As a bonus, the thick soles make you look taller!" tur="Görüntüye önem veren ünlü kişilerin kullandığı ayakkabılar. Tabandaki kalın kauçuk seni daha da uzun gösterecek." fre="Des chaussures faites pour ceux qui aiment avoir un style unique. Leurs semelles épaisses en caoutchouc vous donneront de la hauteur." rus="Туфли для тех, у кого повышенное чувство моды и стиля. В качестве бонуса утолщенная подошва сделает тебя чуть выше!" cns="拥有完美外形、冷峻气质、强大家世的霸道总裁皮鞋。"/>
	<string key="N1021165" kor="맙 레이디 슬리브리스 셔츠" ger="Mob Lady Sleeveless Shirt" eng="Mob Lady Sleeveless Shirt" tur="Mob lady Sleeveless Shirt" fre="Mob lady Sleeveless Shirt" rus="Mob Lady Sleeveless Shirt" cns="性感秘书衬衫"/>
	<string key="T1021165" kor="라이프 드레스의 상의. 맙 레이디 슬릿 미니 스커트와 함께 입는 것을 권장" ger="Ein gestreiftes Top. Es passt perfekt zum Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt." eng="Make it an outfit they can't refuse! This striped top matches perfectly with the Mobstress Mini." tur="Çizgili elbise üstü. Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt ile giyilmesi tavsiye edilir." fre="Un petit haut rayé qui ira parfaitement avec la Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt." rus="Наряд, от которого никто не сможет отказаться! Полосатый верх отлично сочетается с Mobstress Mini." cns="任何事都以霸道总裁为中心进行考虑的性感秘书衬衫。"/>
	<string key="N1031165" kor="맙 레이디 슬릿 미니 스커트" ger="Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt" eng="Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt" tur="Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt" fre="Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt" rus="Mob Lady Slit Mini Skirt" cns="性感秘书迷你裙"/>
	<string key="T1031165" kor="스트라이프 드레스의 하의. 맙 레이디 슬리브리스 셔츠와 함께 입는 것을 권장" ger="Ein gestreifter Minirock. Er passt perfekt zum Mob Lady Sleeveless Shirt." eng="Make it an outfit they can't refuse! This striped skirt is the ideal pairing for the Mobstress Camisole." tur="Çizgili elbise altı. Mob Lady Sleeveless Shirt ile giyilmesi tavsiye edilir." fre="Une petite jupe rayée qui ira parfaitement avec le Mob Lady Sleeveless Shirt." rus="Наряд от которого никто не сможет отказаться! Полосатая юбка отлично сочетается с Mobstress Camisole." cns="任何事都以霸道总裁为中心进行考虑的性感秘书裙子。"/>
	<string key="N1041165" kor="다이아몬드 링 커프 글러브" ger="Diamond Ring Cuff Gloves" eng="Diamond Ring Cuff Gloves" tur="Diamond Ring Cuff Gloves" fre="Diamond Ring Cuff Gloves" rus="Diamond Ring Cuff Gloves" cns="性感秘书钻石手套"/>
	<string key="T1041165" kor="오른 손에서 반짝이는 부의 상징" ger="Ein strahlend schöner Ring der am rechten Handschuh angebracht wurde." eng="The dazzling ring on the right-hand glove leaves no doubt as to your elevated social status." tur="Sağ elinde parlayan, zinginlik gösteren parıltılı yüzük." fre="Brillez de mille feux avec ces gants ornés d'un anneau diamanté à la main droite." rus="Ослепительное кольцо на правой руке не оставит сомнений насчет высокого социального статуса." cns="任何事都以霸道总裁为中心进行考虑的性感秘书手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051165" kor="스트랩 펌프스" ger="Strap Pumps" eng="Strap Pumps" tur="Strap Pumps" fre="Strap Pumps" rus="Strap Pumps" cns="性感秘书高跟鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051165" kor="발목을 감싸는 스트랩이 단정한 느낌을 주는 펌프스. 도회적인 이미지를 연출하기 위한 필수품" ger="Diese Schnürstiefel schmeicheln deinen Beinen sehr. Ein Must-have, um deinen Style zu perfektionieren." eng="These charming heels won't budge with those straps wrapped snugly around your ankles. They're a must-have for your urban chic wardrobe!" tur="Bileklerini saran bu bantlar hem zarif hem de çekici. Urban chic tarzını tamamlamak için olmazsa olmaz." fre="Ces chevillères vous donnerons un style à la fois soigné et séduisant. C'est l'objet indispensable pour compléter votre look urbain-chic." rus="Эти очаровательные туфли с ремнями будут крепко сидеть на ногах. Они необходимы для твоего городского гардероба!" cns="任何事都以霸道总裁为中心进行考虑的性感秘书鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N1061165" kor="리본 버클 페도라" ger="Ribbon Buckle Fedora" eng="Ribbon Buckle Fedora" tur="Ribbon Buckle Fedora" fre="Ribbon Buckle Fedora" rus="Ribbon Buckle Fedora" cns="性感秘书爵士帽"/>
	<string key="T1061165" kor="고전적인 형태에 리본과 버클장식으로 여성스러운 포인트를 가미한 페도라" ger="Ein klassischer Filzhut mit einer Schleife und Schnallen verziert, um ihm einen Hauch von Weiblichkeit zu geben." eng="Old-school style and feminine appeal in one! This one definitely stands the test of time." tur="Üzerindeki kurdela ve toka süslemeleri ile hem klasik, hem de kadınsı." fre="Un accessoire classique mais féminin grâce aux boucles et aux rubbans qui décorent le galon du chapeau." rus="Старый школьный стиль и женственность в одной комбинации! Результат определенно проверен временем." cns="任何事都以霸道总裁为中心进行考虑的性感秘书帽子。"/>
