	<string key="N1021170" kor="넷 샤먼 루나M 오픈 베스트" ger="Net Shaman Luna M Open Vest" eng="Net Shaman Luna M Open Vest" tur="Net Shaman Luna M Open Vest" fre="Net Shaman Luna M Open Vest" rus="Net Shaman Luna M Open Vest" cns="未来战士（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021170" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 남성형 아바타 상의.{N}살짝 보이는 허리라인의 옆트임에 주목" ger="Security Android Net Shaman's Shirt (Male){N}Der einzigartige Schnitt lässt auf außergewöhnliche Qualität dieses Items schließen." eng="Security Android Net Shaman's Shirt (Male){N}The subtle taper at the waistline is a sign of this item's exquisite quality." tur="Security Android Net Shaman's Shirt (Male){N}Bilek kısmındaki zekice düşünülmüş sivri tasarım, eşyanın ne kadar kaliteli olduğunu gösteriyor." fre="T-shirt Security Android Net Shaman (H){N}Ce vêtement délicatement cintré mettra en valeur votre carrure !" rus="Мужская рубашка Security Android Net Shaman{N}Приталенный силуэт говорит о высочайшем качестве." cns="将狂野元素与未来风格相融合的男性未来战士上衣。{N}让人感到了科幻与魔法的杂糅。"/>
