	<string key="T1051170" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 남성형 아바타 신발.{N}발목의 장식은 발을 보호하기 위한 발찌의 일종" ger="Security Android Net Shaman's Shoes (Male){N}Die angebrachte Schnalle sieht nicht nur schick aus – sie bietet auch Schutz!" eng="Security Android Net Shaman's Shoes (Male){N}The integrated anklet is more than just decoration - it actually provides added protection!" tur="Security Android Net Shaman's Shoes (Male){N}Kısa çoraplar sadece süs için değil, aynı zamanda koruma da sağlıyorlar!" fre="Pieds Security Android Net Shaman (H){N}Son bracelet de cheville n'est pas là que pour faire joli : il vous protègera aussi des coups durs !" rus="Мужские ботинки Security Android Net Shaman{N}Ножной браслет не только украшает, но и защищает!" cns="将狂野元素与未来风格相融合的男性未来战士鞋子。{N}脚腕上的链子不仅仅是装饰，更有不错的保护作用。"/>
	<string key="N1061170" kor="넷 샤먼 루나M 마스크" ger="Net Shaman Luna M Mask" eng="Net Shaman Luna M Mask" tur="Net Shaman Luna M Mask" fre="Net Shaman Luna M Mask" rus="Net Shaman Luna M Mask" cns="未来战士（男）口罩"/>
	<string key="T1061170" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 마스크{N}앞을 가린 것 처럼 보이지만 카메라가 달린 헤드 마운트 디스플레이의 일종" ger="Security Android Net Shaman's Mask{N}Auf den ersten Blick scheint der Träger dieser Maske nichts sehen zu können. Glücklicherweise sorgt das eingebaute Display für Sicht, während der Träger gleichzeitig den Rundumschutz einer Maske genießen kann." eng="Security Android Net Shaman's Mask{N}At first glance, you might think the wearer wouldn't be able to see anything. Luckily, the interior display makes it possible to see while enjoying the protection of a closed mask." tur="Security Android Net Shaman's Mask{N}İlk bakışta bunu giyen kişi hiçbir şey göremez sanıyorsun. Halbuki iç tasarımı, kapalı bir maskenin koruma hissini yaşatırken aynı zamanda görüş imkanı da sağlıyor." fre="Masque Security Android Net Shaman{N}Vous risquez de penser qu'on n'y voit rien avec ce masque. Détrompez-vous, vous bénéficierez d'une protection optimale sans rien rater du beau paysage !" rus="Маска Security Android Net Shaman{N}На первый взгляд кажется, что из-под этой маски ничего не разглядеть. К счастью, все можно видеть на встроенном экране, а защита остается на высшем уровне." cns="将狂野元素与未来风格相融合的男性未来战士口罩。{N}拥有内部显示屏的高科技口罩。"/>
	<string key="N1001171" kor="넷 샤먼 루나W 와일드 스타일" ger="Net Shaman Luna W Wild Style" eng="Net Shaman Luna W Wild Style" tur="Net Shaman Luna W Wild Style" fre="Net Shaman Luna W Wild Style" rus="Net Shaman Luna W Wild Style" cns="未来战士（女）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001171" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 여성형 아바타 헤어 스타일" ger="Security Android Net Shaman's Hairstyle (Female)" eng="Security Android Net Shaman's Hairstyle (Female)" tur="Security Android Net Shaman's Hairstyle (Female)" fre="Coiffure Security Android Net Shaman (F)" rus="Женская прическа Security Android Net Shaman" cns="将狂野元素与未来风格相融合的女性未来战士发型。{N}有点像金毛狮王的发型。"/>
