	<string key="T1021171" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 여성형 아바타 상의.{N}보안에는 신경쓰지 않은 맨살의 과격한 디자인" ger="Security Android Net Shaman's Top (Female){N}Dieses Oberteil bietet kaum Schutz, fasziniert aber mit seinem wilden Stil." eng="Security Android Net Shaman's Top (Female){N}This item sacrifices coverage and protection for its wildly stylish cut." tur="Security Android Net Shaman's Top (Female){N}Bu eşya vahşi bir kesime sahip olup, vücudu örtmeden ve korumadan ödün veriyor." fre="Torse Security Android Net Shaman (F){N}Une tenue qui saura vous mettre en valeur. Vos ennemis en resteront bouche-bée." rus="Женская кофта Security Android Net Shaman{N}Защищает не слишком хорошо, зато выглядит на все сто." cns="将狂野元素与未来风格相融合的女性未来战士上衣。{N}一V到底的开放式设计，没点勇气的人还真不敢穿。"/>
