	<string key="T1031171" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 여성형 아바타 하의.{N}길이가 매우 짧지만 바지라서 안심" ger="Security Android Net Shaman's Pants (Female){N}Nicht so kurz wie die meisten Röcke und super bequem!" eng="Security Android Net Shaman's Pants (Female){N}While these are not quite as short as your typical skirt, they're infinitely more comfortable to move around in!" tur="Security Android Net Shaman's Pants (Female){N}Tipik bir etek kadar kısa olmasa da giyip dolaşması çok rahat!" fre="Jambes Security Android Net Shaman (F){N}Ce short a beau ne pas être aussi court que votre mini-jupe préférée, il est quand même beaucoup plus confortable !" rus="Женские штаны Security Android Net Shaman{N}Пусть они не такие короткие, как юбка, зато ходить в них бесконечно удобнее!" cns="将狂野元素与未来风格相融合的女性未来战士裤子。{N}超级迷你短裤，不过好在还有点遮挡。"/>
