	<string key="T1070065" kor="보안 안드로이드 넷 샤먼의 펫{N}푸른 불꽃 형태를 하고있지만 뜨겁지는 않다고 한다." ger="Security Android Net Shaman's pet.{N}Obwohl es aus einer blauen Flamme besteht, fühlt es sich bei Berührung doch eher kühl an." eng="Security Android Net Shaman's pet.{N}Even though it looks to be made of pure blue flame, this creature is cool to the touch." tur="Security Android Net Shaman's pet.{N}Saf mavi ateşten yapılmış gibi gözükse de dokununca ele bir serinlik hissi veriyor." fre="Familier Security Android Net Shaman{N}Cette créature de flammes d'un bleu pur est froide au toucher." rus="Питомец Security Android Net Shaman.{N}Выглядит так, как будто соткан из голубого пламени, но очень приятный на ощупь." cns="未来战士的小跟班。{N}还未变成火焰的小火苗，摸起来不会烫手。"/>
