	<string key="T1001172" kor="포멀한 스타일에 어울리면서도 나이들어보이지 않는 깔끔한 헤어스타일." ger="Passt gut zum eher seriösen Stil und lässt dich trotzdem jung wirken." eng="It goes well with formal attire, with styling that keeps you looking youthful." tur="Resmi kıyafetlere yakışıyor ve tarzı ile seni genç gösteriyor." fre="Un style raffiné qui vous rajeunit grandement." spa="Funciona muy bien con un atuendo formal sin afectar lo juvenil que te ves." rus="Отлично подходит к строгим костюмам и делает тебя куда моложе на вид." cns="显示出高贵气质的英伦贵族发型。{N}正式又不显老，有成熟、稳定的感觉。"/>
	<string key="N1021172" kor="마틴 롱 블레이저" ger="Martin's Long Blazer" eng="Martin's Long Blazer" tur="Martin's Long Blazer" fre="Martin's Long Blazer" spa="Blazer Largo Martin" rus="Martin's Long Blazer" cns="英伦贵族长西装外套"/>
	<string key="T1021172" kor="단정한 셔츠와 타이에 단추가 없는 롱 블레이저를 매치한 세련된 의상 조합." ger="Das Jackett ohne Knöpfe sieht mit dem weißen Hemd besonders elegant aus." eng="This buttonless blazer looks even more sophisticated paired with a white shirt." tur="Bu düğmesiz blazer ceket, beyaz gömlek ile daha da sofistike duruyor." fre="La combinaison de la chemise blanche et de la veste ouverte est exquise." spa="Este blazer sin botones se ve aún mas sofisticado con una camiseta blanca." rus="Если надеть этот блейзер без пуговиц на белую рубашку, выйдет еще лучше." cns="显示出高贵气质的英伦贵族外套。{N}端正的衬衫和领带，配上长西装外套，给人一种十分干练的感觉。"/>
	<string key="N1031172" kor="마틴 스키니 슬랙스" ger="Martin's Skinny Slacks" eng="Martin's Skinny Slacks" tur="Martin's Skinny Slacks" fre="Martin's Skinny Slacks" spa="Pantalones Ajustados Martin" rus="Martin's Skinny Slacks" cns="英伦贵族紧身休闲裤"/>
	<string key="T1031172" kor="슬림한 라인을 살린 스키니 타입의 바지." ger="Schmale Hosen mit schmalen Streifen." eng="Skinny slacks, patterned with slimming stripes." tur="İnce çizgilerle bezenmiş dar pantalon." fre="La tenue vous donne un air faussement négligé. C'est le comble du chic." spa="Unos pantalones ajustados que harán que tus piernas luzcan como nunca antes." rus="Узкие брюки в полоску, которые всех стройнят." cns="显示出高贵气质的英伦贵族休闲裤。{N}可以突出苗条曲线的紧身裤。"/>
	<string key="N1041172" kor="마틴 골든 타임" ger="Martin's Gold Watch" eng="Martin's Gold Watch" tur="Martin's Gold Watch" fre="Martin's Gold Watch" spa="Reloj de oro Martin" rus="Martin's Gold Watch" cns="英伦贵族金色手表"/>
	<string key="T1041172" kor="고급진 금색 손목시계.{N}나이가 들어보이지 않도록 조심!" ger="Wuchtige Golduhr.{N}Lässt dich allerdings älter aussehen, als du bist." eng="A luxurious gold watch.{N}Wearing it might even make you look a bit sophisticated." tur="Luxurious Gold Watch.{N}Bu saati takarken daha sofistike bile gösterebilir." fre="Une montre magnifique{N}qui vous donne l'air très sérieux." spa="Un lujoso reloj de oro.{N}Utilizarlo te hara parecer muy sofisticado." rus="Роскошные золотые часы.{N}Такие на ком угодно смотрятся первоклассно." cns="显示出高贵气质的英伦贵族手表。{N}高档手表体现了佩戴者的地位。"/>
	<string key="N1051172" kor="마틴 캔버스 부츠" ger="Martin's Canvas Boots" eng="Martin's Canvas Boots" tur="Martin's Canvas Boots" fre="Martin's Canvas Boots" spa="Botas de Martin" rus="Martin's Canvas Boots" cns="英伦贵族帆布鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051172" kor="천소재를 활용한 앵클부츠.{N}젊은 신사들의 잇 아이템." ger="Canvas-Stiefel.{N}Der letzte Schrei bei den jungen Herren." eng="Ankle-high boots made of sturdy canvas.{N}A hot item among stylish young gentlemen." tur="Bilek boyunda kanvas ayakkabı.{N}Tarzına düşkün delikanlılar arasında çok popüler bir nesne." fre="Ces bottes sont faites de toile.{N}C'est un accessoire qui fait fureur chez la gente masculine." spa="Unas botas altas fabricadas con materiales muy resistentes.{N}Un objeto muy popular entre los hombres elegantes." rus="Высокие ботинки из прочной парусины.{N}Такой стиль обожают стильные молодые люди." cns="显示出高贵气质的英伦贵族帆布鞋。{N}帆布制作的鞋子，年轻绅士的最爱。"/>
	<string key="N1021173" kor="마린 메딕 원피스 탑" ger="Marine Medic Dress Top" eng="Marine Medic Dress Top" tur="Marine Medic Dress Top" fre="Marine Medic Dress Top" spa="Vestido Marine superior" rus="Marine Medic Dress Top" cns="专属护士上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021173" kor="간호복 스타일의 원피스.{N}차이나 칼라 베스트와 원피스가 합쳐진 독특한 디자인" ger="Kleidchen im Krankenschwester-Look.{N}Der chinesische Kragen gibt ihm den letzten Schliff." eng="Nurse-style clothing.{N}Its Eastern-looking collar makes it even more unique." tur="Hemşire tarzı elbise.{N}Doğu usulü yakalı yelek elbiseyi daha özel gösteriyor." fre="Cette tenue d'infirmière{N}est rehaussée d'un col à la mode orientale." spa="Ropa de estilo enfermerita.{N}Su collar lo hace aún más unico." rus="Наряд в стиле «медсестра».{N}А восточный воротник делает его еще уникальнее." cns="朴素的服装也无法掩饰其魅力的专属护士上衣。{N}结合东方元素设计的上衣。"/>
	<string key="N1031173" kor="마린 메딕 원피스 스커트" ger="Marine Medic Dress Skirt" eng="Marine Medic Dress Skirt" tur="Marine Medic Dress Skirt" fre="Marine Medic Dress Skirt" spa="Falda medica Marine" rus="Marine Medic Dress Skirt" cns="专属护士裙子"/>
	<string key="T1031173" kor="간호복 스타일의 원피스.{N}한계에 다다른 길이감과 니 삭스의 황금비율에 주목!" ger="Kleidchen im Krankenschwester-Look.{N}Heißes Röckchen mit züchtigen Kniestrümpfen." eng="Nurse-style clothing.{N}A miniskirt with knee-high socks - this look can't be beat!" tur="Hemşire tarzı elbise.{N}Mini etek ve diz boyu çorap - bundan iyi görüneni yoktur!" fre="Cette tenue d'infirmière{N}est composée d'une mini-jupe et de chaussettes hautes." spa="Ropa de estilo enfermerita.{N}Nada puede superar la sensualidad de esta falda." rus="Наряд в стиле «медсестра».{N}Мини-юбка и носки до колен – что может быть лучше!" cns="朴素的服装也无法掩饰其魅力的专属护士裙子。{N}按黄金比例设计的裙子和袜子！"/>
	<string key="N1041173" kor="마린 롱 글러브" ger="Marine's Long Gloves" eng="Marine's Long Gloves" tur="Marine's Long Gloves" fre="Marine's Long Gloves" spa="Guantes Largos Marine" rus="Marine's Long Gloves" cns="专属护士手套"/>
	<string key="T1041173" kor="수술장갑을 연상케하는 타이트한 느낌의 롱 글러브.{N}수술 시 착용은 금지." ger="Lange Handschuhe im Look von OP-Handschuhen.{N}Sollten bei Operationen aber besser nicht getragen werden." eng="Long, tight-fitting gloves with a military aesthetic.{N}Can't be worn during operations." tur="Askeri görünüşe sahip uzun, dar eldivenler.{N}Operasyon sırasında kullanılamaz." fre="De longs gants serrés d'apparat.{N}Il est déconseillé de les utiliser pour une opération." spa="Unos guantes largos con cierto aspecto militar.{N}No puede ser utilizado en operaciones." rus="Длинные узкие перчатки в стиле «милитари».{N}Но на операции их носить нельзя." cns="朴素的服装也无法掩饰其魅力的专属护士手套。{N}相比起手术手套，更像是礼服手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051173" kor="마린 플랫폼 펌프스" ger="Marine Flat Form Pumps" eng="Marine Flat Formal Pumps" tur="Marine Flat Form Pumps" fre="Marine Flat Form Pumps" spa="Zapatos formales Marine" rus="Marine Flat Formal Pumps" cns="专属护士厚底高跟鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051173" kor="다리의 매력을 살려주는 포멀한 스타일의 플랫폼 펌프스." ger="Klassische Pumps, die gleichzeitig seriös und verführerisch aussehen." eng="These formal pumps are sure to show off your legs." tur="Bacaklarını öne çıkaran resmi topuklu ayakkabılar." fre="Ces élégants escarpins mettront vos jambes en valeur. " spa="Estos zapatos formales permiten mostrar tus piernas de una manera muy sexy." rus="Строгие туфли оставляют ноги открытыми." cns="朴素的服装也无法掩饰其魅力的专属护士高跟鞋。{N}突出了腿部魅力的厚底高跟鞋。"/>
