	<string key="T1061173" kor="미니 사이즈의 너스캡.{N}귀여운 양갈래는 덤." ger="Schwesternhaube{N}Die Zöpfe sind das Tüpfelchen auf dem i." eng="A mini-sized nurse cap.{N}Cute pigtails lend it even more charm." tur="Mini-boy hemşire şapkası.{N}Tatlı örgüleri ekstra çekici." fre="Ce mini-chapeau d'infirmière{N}est agrémenté d'adorables couettes bouclées." spa="Un pequeño gorro de enfermerita.{N}El tierno corte de cabello aumenta su encanto." rus="Миниатюрная шапочка медсестры.{N}Милые косички придадут еще больше очарования." cns="朴素的服装也无法掩饰其魅力的专属护士帽子。{N}辫子配护士帽~卡哇伊~"/>
	<string key="N1001174" kor="블러디 헌터 컷" ger="Bloody Hunter Cut" eng="Bloody Hunter Cut" tur="Bloody Hunter Saç Stili" fre="Bloody Hunter Cut" rus="Bloody Hunter Cut" cns="赤焰猎手（男）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001174" kor="블러디 헌터의 헤어스타일.{N}길게 내려온 앞머리와 투톤 컬러가 특징." ger="Frisur des Bloody Hunter.{N}Zweifarbig mit langem Pony." eng="Bloody Hunter's hair style. {N}Two-toned hair with long bangs." tur="Bloody Hunter'ın saç stili.{N}İki tona boyanmış, uzun kahküllü saç." fre="Coiffure de Bloody Hunter.{N}Ses deux couleurs de cheveux et ses longues mèches lui donnent un air mystérieux." rus="Прическа Кровавого охотника. {N}Длинная челка и два оттенка волос." cns="红蜂帝国秘密特工——男性赤焰猎手发型。"/>
