	<string key="T1051175" kor="주력 향상의 효과가 있는 특수 제작된 신발." ger="Diese Schuhe erhöhen die Magie ihrer Trägerin." eng="Shoes designed to increase your magic powers." tur="Büyü gücünü arttırmak için özelleştirilmiştir." fre="Ces chaussures décuplent la puissance magique." rus="Ботинки, повышающие твои магические способности." cns="红蜂帝国秘密特工——女性赤焰猎手鞋子"/>
	<string key="N4020091" kor="점령전 1위 보상" cns="占领战第1名奖励"/>
	<string key="T4020091" kor="점령전 1위 보상 박스입니다.{N}박스 개봉시 아래의 아이템이 지급됩니다.{N}점령전 1위를 진심으로 축하드립니다." cns="占领战第1名奖励箱子{N}打开箱子时，可以获得下列道具。{N}恭喜占领战第1名"/>
	<string key="N4020092" kor="점령전 2위 보상" cns="占领战第2名奖励"/>
	<string key="T4020092" kor="점령전 2위 보상 박스입니다.{N}박스 개봉시 아래의 아이템이 지급됩니다.{N}점령전 1위를 진심으로 축하드립니다." cns="占领战第2名奖励箱子{N}打开箱子时，可以获得下列道具。{N}恭喜占领战第2名"/>
	<string key="N4020093" kor="점령전 3위 보상" cns="占领战第3名奖励"/>
	<string key="T4020093" kor="점령전 3위 보상 박스입니다.{N}박스 개봉시 아래의 아이템이 지급됩니다.{N}점령전 1위를 진심으로 축하드립니다." cns="占领战第3名奖励箱子{N}打开箱子时，可以获得下列道具。{N}恭喜占领战第3名"/>
	<string key="N4020094" kor="10,000PEN" cns="10,000金币"/>
	<string key="T4020094" kor="캡슐 사용시 10,000PEN 을 획득할 수 있습니다." cns="使用扭蛋可获得10,000金币"/>
	<string key="N4020095" kor="랜덤 무기 캡슐" ger="Random Weapon Capsule" eng="Random Weapon Capsule" tur="Random Weapon Capsule" fre="Random Weapon Capsule" rus="Random Weapon Capsule" cns="随机武器扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020095" kor="랜덤 무기 캡슐입니다.{N}사용시 기존에 출시 되었던 무기 캡슐 중 1종을 무작위로 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="Die Kapsel enthält eine seltene Waffe.{N}Bei Benutzung erhältst du eine zufällige Waffe." eng="A capsule containing a rare weapon.{N}When used, you'll acquire 1 random weapon." tur="Nadir bir silah içeren bir kapsül.{N}Kullanıldığında rastgele 1 silah elde edersiniz." fre="Cette capsule contient une arme rare.{N}Ouvrez-la pour obtenir une arme aléatoire." rus="Капсула со случайным редким оружием.{N}При использовании ты получишь 1 случайное оружие." cns="使用随机武器扭蛋时{N}可随机获得原来推出的武器扭蛋中1种"/>
	<string key="N4020096" kor="랜덤 복장 캡슐" ger="Random Costume Capsule" eng="Random Costume Capsule" tur="Random Costume Capsule" fre="Random Costume Capsule" rus="Random Costume Capsule" cns="随机套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4020096" kor="랜덤 복장 캡슐입니다.{N}사용시 기존에 출시 되었던 복장 캡슐 중 1종을 무작위로 획득할 수 있습니다.{N}무작위 복장은 성별에 구분 없이 지급됩니다. " ger="Die Kapsel enthält ein seltenes Kostüm.{N}Bei Benutzung erhältst du ein zufälliges Kostüm.{N}Zufallskostüme werden ohne Rücksicht auf das Geschlecht des Charakters vergeben. " eng="A capsule containing a rare costume.{N}When used, you'll acquire 1 random costume.{N}Random costumes will be awarded regardless of character's gender. " tur="Nadir bir kostüm içeren bir kapsül.{N}Kullanıldığında rastgele 1 kostüm elde edersiniz.{N}Rastgele kostümler karakter cinsiyetine bakmaksızın verilir. " fre="Cette capsule contient un costume rare.{N}Ouvrez-la pour obtenir un costume aléatoire.{N}Les costumes ne correspondent pas forcément au genre de votre personnage. " rus="Капсула со случайным редким костюмом.{N}При использовании ты получишь 1 случайный костюм.{N}Костюмы выдаются случайно, без учета пола персонажа. " cns="使用随机套装扭蛋时{N}可随机获得原来推出的套装扭蛋中1种{N}赠送随机服装时没有性别区分"/>
	<string key="N4020097" kor="원더풀 무기 박스" ger="Wonderful Weapon Box" eng="Wonderful Weapon Box" tur="Wonderful Weapon Box" fre="Wonderful Weapon Box" rus="Wonderful Weapon Box" cns="精彩武器箱子"/>
	<string key="T4020097" kor="원더풀 무기 박습니다.{N}박스 개봉시 내구제 무기 1종을 무작위로 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="In dieser Box steckt eine großartige Waffe.{N}Nach dem Öffnen erhältst du eine zufällige Waffe (Permanent)." eng="A box containing a wonderful weapon.{N}When opened, you'll acquire 1 random Permanent weapon." tur="Harika bir silah içeren bir kutu.{N}Açıldığında, rastgele bir Permanent silah elde edersiniz." fre="Cette boîte contient une arme exceptionnelle.{N}Ouvrez-la pour obtenir une arme permanente aléatoire." rus="Ящик с чудесным оружием.{N}Открыв его, ты получишь 1 случайное Бессрочное оружие." cns="是精彩武器箱子{N}打开箱子时，可随机获得永久武器1种"/>
	<string key="N4020098" kor="원더풀 복장 박스" ger="Wonderful Costume Box" eng="Wonderful Costume Box" tur="Wonderful Costume Box" fre="Wonderful Costume Box" rus="Wonderful Costume Box" cns="精彩服装箱子"/>
	<string key="T4020098" kor="원더풀 무기 박습니다.{N}박스 개봉시 내구제 복장 1세트를 무작위로 획득할 수 있습니다." ger="In dieser Box steckt ein großartiges Kostüm.{N}Nach dem Öffnen erhältst du ein zufälliges Kostüm (Permanent)." eng="A box containing a wonderful costume.{N}When opened, you'll acquire 1 random Permanent costume." tur="Harika bir kostüm içeren bir kutu.{N}Açıldığında, rastgele bir Permanent kostüm elde edersiniz." fre="Cette boîte contient un costume exceptionnel.{N}Ouvrez-la pour obtenir un costume permanent aléatoire." rus="Ящик с чудесным костюмом.{N}Открыв его, ты получишь 1 случайный Бессрочный костюм." cns="是精彩武器箱子{N}打开箱子时，可随机获得永久服装1套"/>
	<string key="N4020099" kor="100,000PEN" cns="100,000金币"/>
	<string key="T4020099" kor="캡슐 사용시 100,000PEN 을 획득할 수 있습니다." cns="使用扭蛋可获得100,000金币"/>
	<string key="N4020100" kor="Blueberry" ger="Blueberry" eng="Blueberry" tur="Blueberry" fre="Blueberry" rus="Blueberry" cns="蓝莓"/>
	<string key="N4020101" kor="Apple" ger="Apple" eng="Apple" tur="Apple" fre="Apple" rus="Apple" cns="苹果"/>
	<string key="N4020102" kor="Plum" ger="Plum" eng="Plum" tur="Plum" fre="Plum" rus="Plum" cns="李子"/>
	<string key="N4020103" kor="Grape" ger="Grape" eng="Grape" tur="Grape" fre="Grape" rus="Grape" cns="葡萄"/>
	<string key="N4020104" kor="Lychee" ger="Lychee" eng="Lychee" tur="Lychee" fre="Lychee" rus="Lychee" cns="荔枝"/>
	<string key="N4020105" kor="Banana" ger="Banana" eng="Banana" tur="Banana" fre="Banana" rus="Banana" cns="香蕉"/>
	<string key="T4020100" kor="Small like the blueberry, this box will get you those tiny things you're missing" ger="Small like the blueberry, this box will get you those tiny things you're missing" eng="Small like the blueberry, this box will get you those tiny things you're missing" tur="Small like the blueberry, this box will get you those tiny things you're missing" fre="Small like the blueberry, this box will get you those tiny things you're missing" rus="В маленькой как ягода черники коробке найдутся мелочи, которых тебя так не хватает" cns="这个盒子会让你得到那些你曾经失去的东西。"/>
	<string key="T4020101" kor="Like the apple, one of these a day will keep the doctor away and will give you all you need." ger="Like the apple, one of these a day will keep the doctor away and will give you all you need." eng="Like the apple, one of these a day will keep the doctor away and will give you all you need." tur="Like the apple, one of these a day will keep the doctor away and will give you all you need." fre="Like the apple, one of these a day will keep the doctor away and will give you all you need." rus="Совсем как яблоко: одна коробочка на ужин – и врач не нужен. В ней все, что нужно для здоровья." cns="一天一个苹果，医生远离我。"/>
	<string key="T4020102" kor="Give your face a lift with the power of the plum box!" ger="Give your face a lift with the power of the plum box!" eng="Give your face a lift with the power of the plum box!" tur="Give your face a lift with the power of the plum box!" fre="Give your face a lift with the power of the plum box!" rus="В сливовой коробке все, что нужно твоему лицу!" cns="用一盒李子给你的脸部一个大转型！"/>
	<string key="T4020103" kor="Mastering the grape box will give you all the skills you need to achieve grapeness." ger="Mastering the grape box will give you all the skills you need to achieve grapeness." eng="Mastering the grape box will give you all the skills you need to achieve grapeness." tur="Mastering the grape box will give you all the skills you need to achieve grapeness." fre="Mastering the grape box will give you all the skills you need to achieve grapeness." rus="Виноградная коробка: каждый будет рад тем умениям, которые ждут тебя в этой коробке." cns="掌握葡萄盒子里的技能，你的水平将实现质的飞跃。"/>
	<string key="T4020104" kor="Get through the hard skin of the Lychee box and grab the sweet perm's inside." ger="Get through the hard skin of the Lychee box and grab the sweet perm's inside." eng="Get through the hard skin of the Lychee box and grab the sweet perm's inside." tur="Get through the hard skin of the Lychee box and grab the sweet perm's inside." fre="Get through the hard skin of the Lychee box and grab the sweet perm's inside." rus="Кто продерется через жесткую шкуру коробки личи, получит самую мякотку." cns="坚硬的外壳只是为了保护里面的甜果仁。"/>
	<string key="T4020105" kor="Peel it and open up the best box of our summer event!" ger="Peel it and open up the best box of our summer event!" eng="Peel it and open up the best box of our summer event!" tur="Peel it and open up the best box of our summer event!" fre="Peel it and open up the best box of our summer event!" rus="Открой для себя лучшую коробку нашего летнего события!" cns="打开夏日活动获得的最好的盒子！"/>
	<string key="N6000038" kor="Hot Summer Coin" ger="Summer Token" eng="Summer Token" tur="Summer Token" fre="Summer Token" rus="Летний жетон" cns="炎热夏日硬币"/>
	<string key="T6000038" kor="Hot Summer Coin" ger="Collect these Summer Tokens to exchange for various Event Boxes." eng="Collect these Summer Tokens to exchange for various Event Boxes." tur="Collect these Summer Tokens to exchange for various Event Boxes." fre="Collect these Summer Tokens to exchange for various Event Boxes." rus="Собирай летние жетоны и меняй их на коробки события." cns="炎热夏日硬币"/>
	<string key="N4035238" kor="샤크 프로텍터 세트(내구제)" ger="Shark Saviour Set (Permanent)" eng="Shark Savior Set (Permanent)" tur="Shark Savior Set (Permanent)" fre="Shark Savior Set (permanent)" rus="Shark Savior Set (Бессрочн.)" cns="鲨鱼守护者套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="T4035238" kor="샤크 프로텍터 세트입니다. {N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Shark Saviour Set. {N}Set beinhaltet folgende Items:" eng="Shark Savior Set. {N}The set contains the following items" tur="Shark Saviour Set. {N}Set şu eşyaları içerir:" fre="Shark Savior Set. {N}Le set contient les objets suivants :" rus="Shark Savior Set. {N}В набор входят предметы:" cns="可以获得鲨鱼守护者套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4051477" kor="샤크 슬레이어 세트(내구제)" ger="Shark Slayer Set (Permanent)" eng="Shark Slayer Set (Permanent)" tur="Shark Slayer Set (Permanent)" fre="Shark Slayer Set (permanent)" rus="Shark Slayer Set (Бессрочн.)" cns="鲨鱼猎手套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="T4051477" kor="샤크 슬레이어 세트입니다. {N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Shark Slayer Set. {N}Set beinhaltet folgende Items:" eng="Shark Slayer Set. {N}The set contains the following items" tur="Shark Slayer Set. {N}Set şu eşyaları içerir:" fre="Shark Slayer Set. {N}Le set contient les objets suivants :" rus="Shark Slayer Set. {N}В набор входят предметы:" cns="鲨鱼猎手套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2000055" kor="버츄얼 쉴드" ger="Virtual Shield" eng="Virtual Shield" tur="Virtual Shield" fre="Virtual Shield" rus="Virtual Shield" cns="虚拟护盾"/>
	<string key="T2000055" kor="넷 샤먼 루나의 전용 장비인 유니크 카운터 스워드{N}루나의 테스트 단계에서부터 동시에 개발된 전용 장비로{N}공격 형태와 방어 형태의 자유로운 변형을 통한 공방일체의 역할수행을 목표로 제작되었다.{N}EU Community Workshop 당선작.{N}수상자 : Krayds" ger="Net Shaman Luna's exclusive Counter Sword.{N}Diese einzigartige Waffe, wurde in Lunas Testphase entwickelt.{N}Sie ist sowohl als Offensiv- als auch als Defensivwaffe bestens geeignet.{N}Gewinner des EU Community Workshop: Krayds" eng="Net Shaman Luna's exclusive Counter Sword.{N}This unique weapon was developed during Luna's test phase.{N}With the ability to switch freely between offensive and defensive modes, it's an extremely effective and flexible weapon.{N}Winner of the EU Community Workshop contest: Krayds" tur="Net Shaman Luna's exclusive Counter Sword.{N}Bu benzersiz silah Luna'nın test aşamasında geliştirildi.{N}Ofansif ve defansif modlar arasında rahatça geçiş yapabilen, son derece etkili ve değişken bir silahtır.{N}AB Topluluğu Atölyesi Galibi [Kazanan: Krayds]" fre="La Counter Sword exclusive de Net Shaman Luna.{N}Cette arme unique a été fabriquée pendant la phase de test de Luna.{N}Grâce à sa capacité à passer aisément du mode offensif au mode défensif, elle est d'une incroyable efficacité.{N}Gagnant du EU Community Workshop : Krayds" rus="Эксклюзивная защита от Net Shaman Luna.{N}Уникальное оружие было разработано в ходе тестовой фазы Luna.{N}Чрезвычайно эффективное и гибкое оружие с возможностью переключения между атакующим и защитным режимом.{N}Победитель конкурса EU Community Workshop: Krayds" cns="未来战士使用的特典角斗卫士。{N}在未来战士受训期间就为他们量身定做的专属道具。{N}攻击防御自成一体，防不胜防，让你无法预测。"/>
	<string key="N3020004" kor="버츄얼 윙" ger="Virtual Wing" eng="Virtual Wing" tur="Virtual Wing" fre="Virtual Wing" rus="Virtual Wing" cns="虚拟之翼"/>
	<string key="T3020004" kor="넷 샤먼 루나의 전용 장비인 버츄얼 윙{N}루나의 테스트 단계에서부터 동시에 개발된 전용 장비로,{N}평상시엔 간편하게 접을 수 있는 독수리의 날개와 같은 형태로 제작되었다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%),이동속도(+10%)" ger="Net Shaman Luna's exclusive Virtual Wing.{N}Diese einzigartige Ausrüstung wurde in Lunas Testphase entwickelt.{N}Es ist den Schwingen eines Adlers nachempfunden und kann platzsparend zusammengefaltet werden." eng="Net Shaman Luna's exclusive Virtual Wing.{N}This unique equipment was developed during Luna's test phase.{N}Fashioned after a set of eagle's wings, it was designed to fold for easy storage." tur="Net Shaman Luna's exclusive Virtual Wing.{N}Bu benzersiz ekipman Luna'nın test aşamasında geliştirildi.{N}Kartal kanatlarından esinlenilerek, kolay saklama için bükülebilir şekilde tasarlandı." fre="La Virtual Wing exclusive de Net Shaman Luna.{N}Cette pièce unique en son genre a été développée pendant la phase de test de Luna.{N}Fabriquée à partir des ailes d'un aigle, elle est très facile à replier." rus="Эксклюзивное виртуальное крыло от Net Shaman Luna.{N}Уникальное снаряжение было разработано в ходе тестовой фазы Luna.{N}Напоминает орлиные крылья; складывается для удобства хранения." cns="未来战士使用的特典零式羽翼。{N}在未来战士受训期间就为他们量身定做的专属道具。{N}不使用时像老鹰的翅膀一样收缩起来，比一般的零式羽翼更便利，不容易遮挡视线。{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}持续能量消耗-10%,移动速度+10%"/>
	<string key="N4035374" kor="G의 버츄얼 쉴드 캡슐" ger="G's Virtual Shield Capsule" eng="G's Virtual Shield Capsule" tur="G's Virtual Shield Capsule" fre="G's Virtual Shield Capsule" rus="G's Virtual Shield Capsule" cns="G的虚拟护盾扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035374" kor="G의 버츄얼 쉴드 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Kapsel enthält G's Virtual Shield.{N}Kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="Capsule containing G's Virtual Shield. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="G's Virtual Shield içeren kapsül. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule G's Virtual Shield{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула содержит G's Virtual Shield.{N}Cодержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得G的虚拟护盾的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4051964" kor="버츄얼 윙 캡슐" ger="Virtual Wing Capsule" eng="Virtual Wing Capsule" tur="Virtual Wing Capsule" fre="Virtual Wing Capsule" rus="Virtual Wing Capsule" cns="虚拟之翼扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4051964" kor="버츄얼 윙 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}지속 SP사용량 감소(-10%),이동속도 증가(+10%){N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(7일, 30일, 내구제)" ger="Diese Kapsel enthält das Item Virtual Wing.{N}Kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="Capsule containing a Virtual Wing. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="G's Virtual Wing içeren kapsül. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule Virtual Wing{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула содержит Virtual Wing.{N}Cодержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得虚拟之翼的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}持续能量使用量减少（-10%）,移动速度增加（+10%）{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}（7日,30日,永久）"/>
	<string key="N4035376" kor="넷 샤먼 루나M 복장 캡슐" ger="Net Shaman Luna M Costume Capsule" eng="Net Shaman Luna M Costume Capsule" tur="Net Shaman Luna M Costume Capsule" fre="Net Shaman Luna M Costume Capsule" rus="Net Shaman Luna M Costume Capsule" cns="未来战士（男）套装扭蛋"/>
