	<string key="N1021176" kor="엔비레인저 슈트 상의" ger="Envy Ranger Suit Top" eng="Envy Ranger Suit Top" tur="Envy Ranger Suit Top" fre="Envy Ranger Suit Top" rus="Envy Ranger Suit Top" cns="假面超人（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021176" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}가슴 근육을 강조하기 위해 심플하게 디자인 되었다.{N}가슴장식이 포인트!" ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Das Design hebt die Brustmuskulatur extra hervor.{N}Das Herzstück des Kostüms ist das kunstvolle Ornament auf der Brust." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Features a stripped-down design to show off your muscles, as well as an eye-catching chest ornament." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Sadece göğüs kaslarını öne çıkarmak için tasarlanmış.{N}Göğüsteki süs, bu kostümün çekici noktası!" fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Met les muscles pectoraux en valeur.{N}Ses ornements attirent inévitablement le regard !" rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Облегченный дизайн поможет покрасоваться мускулатурой. Привлекающий внимание орнамент на груди." cns="男性假面超人穿的上衣。{N}强调胸肌的简单设计。"/>
	<string key="N1031176" kor="엔비레인저 슈트 하의" ger="Envy Ranger Suit Bottom" eng="Envy Ranger Suit Bottom" tur="Envy Ranger Suit Bottom" fre="Envy Ranger Suit Bottom" rus="Envy Ranger Suit Bottom" cns="假面超人（男）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031176" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}갈라진 허벅지 근육을 강조하기 위하여 맞춤 디자인 되었다." ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Das Design hebt die Beinmuskulatur extra hervor." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Features a stripped-down design to show off your leg muscles." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Uyluklardaki güçlü kaslara dikkat çekmek için biçimlendirilmiş." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Souligne agréablement les courbes musclées des cuisses." rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Облегченный дизайн поможет покрасоваться мускулатурой ног." cns="男性假面超人穿的裤子。{N}为展示强健的大腿肌肉而量身定做的裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041176" kor="엔비레인저 글러브" ger="Envy Ranger Gloves" eng="Envy Ranger Gloves" tur="Envy Ranger Gloves" fre="Envy Ranger Gloves" rus="Envy Ranger Gloves" cns="假面超人（男）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041176" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 글러브.{N}순결한 화이트와 고결한 골드 컬러가 고급스럽다." ger="Handschuhe der Envy Ranger.{N}Die Kombination aus reinem Weiß und schimmendem Gold passt perfekt zum Rest des Outfits." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's gloves.{N}Features an elegant combination of pure white and luxurious gold." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Gloves.{N}Saf beyaz ve lüks altının mükemmel bir kombini." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Gloves.{N}L'or intense et le blanc immaculé se marient parfaitement sur ces gants." rus="Перчатки Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Элегантное сочетание белоснежного и золотого цветов." cns="男性假面超人戴的手套。{N}纯洁的白色和冷峻的黑色相辉映。"/>
	<string key="N1051176" kor="엔비레인저 부츠" ger="Envy Ranger Boots" eng="Envy Ranger Boots" tur="Envy Ranger Boots" fre="Envy Ranger Boots" rus="Envy Ranger Boots" cns="假面超人（男）靴子"/>
	<string key="T1051176" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 부츠.{N}드롭킥을 자유롭게 날릴 수 있도록 가벼운 소재로 제작되었다.{N}굽 안에 특수 장치가 장착되어있다는 소문이 있다." ger="Stiefel der Envy Ranger.{N}Das leichte Material ermöglicht selbst komplizierte Dropkicks.{N}Man munkelt, im Absatz befinde sich außerdem eine Geheimwaffe." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's boots.{N}Light enough for flying drop kicks,{N}these boots are rumored to have a special device in the heel." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Boots.{N}Malzeme, düşürme vuruşlar için yeterli hafiflikte.{N}Topuklara özel bir cihaz eklendiği söylentisi var." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Boots.{N}Le matériaux est assez léger pour permettre les coups de pied sautés.{N}La rumeur dit qu'un gadget est inséré dans les talons." rus="Ботинки Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Достаточно легкие, чтобы делать{N}в них вертушки. По слухам, в каблуке у них еще и особое устройство." cns="男性假面超人穿的靴子。{N}用可以自由反弹的轻质材料制作而成。{N}据说鞋跟内装有特殊装置。"/>
	<string key="N1061176" kor="엔비레인저 헬멧" ger="Envy Ranger Helmet" eng="Envy Ranger Helmet" tur="Envy Ranger Helmet" fre="Envy Ranger Helmet" rus="Envy Ranger Helmet" cns="假面超人（男）头盔"/>
	<string key="T1061176" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 헬멧.{N}자신의 실체를 가리고 활동하는 엔비레인저에게는 필수 아이템!{N}기분에 따라 다양한 헬멧을 착용한다." ger="Helm der Envy Ranger.{N}Ein Muss für die Undercover-Arbeit als Envy Ranger.{N}Der Spieler kann aus verschiedenen Designs wählen." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's helmet.{N}A must-have item for Envy Rangers who want to remain incognito, this helmet is available in a variety of styles." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Helmet.{N}Gerçek kimliğini bir elbisenin ardında gizleyen Envy Rangers için elzem bir eşya.{N}Oyuncu zevkine göre çeşitli miğferlerden birini seçebilir." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Helmet.{N}Un incontournable pour les Envy Rangers qui veulent cacher leur identité.{N}Le joueur pourra choisir son préféré dans un assortiment." rus="Шлем Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Обязательный предмет снаряжения для Envy Rangers, которые хотят оставаться неузнанными, доступный в нескольких исполнениях." cns="男性假面超人戴的头盔。{N}隐藏真实身份行侠仗义的假面超人所佩戴的头盔。{N}可以根据心情选择不同颜色的头盔。"/>
	<string key="N1021177" kor="엔비걸즈 슈트 상의" ger="Envy Girls Suit Top" eng="Envy Girls Suit Top" tur="Envy Girls Suit Top" fre="Envy Girls Suit Top" rus="Envy Girls Suit Top" cns="假面超人（女）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021177" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}활동이 편하도록 최대한 심플하게 디자인 되었다.{N}가슴의 하트장식이 포인트!" ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Schlichtes Design für maximale Beweglichkeit.{N}Das Herzstück des Kostüms ist das herzförmige Ornament auf der Brust." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Features a stripped-down design for maximum mobility, as well as an eye-catching chest ornament." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Çevik hareketlere imkan sağlamak için olabildiğince basit tasarlanmış.{N}Göğüste bulunan kalp şeklindeki süs bu kostümün çekici noktası!" fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Son design simple permet des mouvements fluides.{N}L'ornement en forme de cœur attire inévitablement le regard." rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Облегченный дизайн для максимальной подвижности. Привлекающий внимание орнамент на груди." cns="女性假面超人穿的上衣。{N}为了方便活动，采用了简洁的设计。{N}胸前的爱心装饰是亮点！"/>
	<string key="N1031177" kor="엔비걸즈 슈트 하의" ger="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" eng="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" tur="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" fre="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" rus="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" cns="假面超人（女）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031177" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}슈트 위에 레이어드 된 스커트로 여성스러움을 강조하였다." ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Das mehrlagige Röckchen ist besonders feminin." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Dominate the match in style with this attractive, pleated skirt." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Katmanlı etek dişiliği vurgular." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Jupe personnalisée qui saura vous mettre en valeur." rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Стань королевой поля боя в гофрированной юбке." cns="女性假面超人穿的裤子。{N}分层的裙子提升了女人味。"/>
	<string key="N1041177" kor="엔비걸즈 글러브" ger="Envy Girls Gloves" eng="Envy Girls Gloves" tur="Envy Girls Gloves" fre="Envy Girls Gloves" rus="Envy Girls Gloves" cns="假面超人（女）手套"/>
