	<string key="T1021184" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}가슴 근육을 강조하기 위해 심플하게 디자인 되었다.{N}가슴의 금장식이 포인트!" ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Das Design hebt die Brustmuskulatur extra hervor.{N}Das Herzstück des Kostüms ist das goldene Ornament auf der Brust." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Features a stripped-down design to show off your muscles, as well as an eye-catching chest ornament." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Sadece göğüs kaslarını öne çıkarmak için tasarlanmış.{N}Göğüsteki altın süs bu kostümün çekici noktası!" fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Mets les muscles pectoraux en valeur.{N}Ses ornements dorés attirent inévitablement le regard !" rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Облегченный дизайн поможет покрасоваться мускулатурой. Привлекающий внимание орнамент на груди." cns="男性假面超人穿的上衣。{N}强调胸肌的简单设计。{N}胸部装饰是亮点！"/>
