	<string key="T1021185" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}활동이 편하도록 최대한 심플하게 디자인 되었다.{N}가슴의 하트장식이 포인트!" ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Schlichtes Design für maximale Beweglichkeit.{N}Das Herzstück des Kostüms ist das herzförmige Ornament auf der Brust." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Features a stripped-down design for maximum mobility, as well as an eye-catching chest ornament." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Çevik hareketlere imkan sağlamak için olabildiğince basit tasarlanmış.{N}Göğüste bulunan kalp şeklindeki süs bu kostümün çekici noktası!" fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Son design simple permet des mouvements fluides.{N}L'ornement en forme de cœur attire inévitablement le regard." rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Облегченный дизайн для максимальной подвижности. Привлекающий внимание орнамент на груди." cns="女性假面超人穿的上衣。{N}为了方便活动，采用了简洁的设计。{N}胸前的爱心装饰是亮点！"/>
	<string key="N1031185" kor="엔비걸즈 슈트 하의" ger="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" eng="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" tur="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" fre="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" rus="Envy Girls Suit Bottom" cns="赤星假面（女）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031185" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 활동복.{N}슈트 위에 레이어드 된 스커트로 여성스러움을 강조하였다." ger="Herzensbrecher-Uniform der Envy Ranger.{N}Das mehrlagige Röckchen ist besonders feminin." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's uniform.{N}Dominate the match in style with this attractive, pleated skirt." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Katmanlı etek dişiliği vurgular." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Uniform.{N}Jupe personnalisée qui saura vous mettre en valeur." rus="Униформа Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Стань королевой поля боя в гофрированной юбке." cns="女性假面超人穿的裤子。{N}分层的裙子提升了女人味。"/>
	<string key="N1041185" kor="엔비걸즈 글러브" ger="Envy Girls Gloves" eng="Envy Girls Gloves" tur="Envy Girls Gloves" fre="Envy Girls Gloves" rus="Envy Girls Gloves" cns="赤星假面（女）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041185" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 글러브.{N}순결한 화이트와 고결한 골드 컬러가 고급스럽다." ger="Handschuhe der Envy Ranger.{N}Die Kombination aus reinem Weiß und schimmendem Gold passt perfekt zum Rest des Outfits." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's gloves.{N}Features an elegant combination of pure white and luxurious gold." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Gloves.{N}Saf beyaz ve lüks altının mükemmel bir kombini." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Gloves.{N}L'or intense et le blanc immaculé se marient parfaitement sur ces gants." rus="Перчатки Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Элегантное сочетание белоснежного и золотого цветов." cns="女性假面超人戴的手套。{N}纯洁的白色和高贵的金色显得十分典雅。"/>
	<string key="N1051185" kor="엔비걸즈 부츠" ger="Envy Girls Boots" eng="Envy Girls Boots" tur="Envy Girls Boots" fre="Envy Girls Boots" rus="Envy Girls Boots" cns="赤星假面（女）靴子"/>
	<string key="T1051185" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 부츠.{N}드롭킥을 자유롭게 날릴 수 있도록 가벼운 소재로 제작되었다.{N}굽 안에 특수 장치가 장착되어있다는 소문이 있다." ger="Stiefel der Envy Ranger.{N}Das leichte Material ermöglicht selbst komplizierte Dropkicks.{N}Man munkelt, im Absatz befinde sich außerdem eine Geheimwaffe." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's boots.{N}Light enough for flying drop kicks,{N}these boots are rumored to have a special device in the heel." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Boots.{N}Malzeme, düşürme vuruşlar için yeterli hafiflikte.{N}Topuklara özel bir cihaz eklendiği söylentisi var." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Boots.{N}Le matériau est assez léger pour permettre les coups de pied sautés.{N}La rumeur dit qu'un gadget est inséré dans les talons." rus="Ботинки Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Достаточно легкие, чтобы делать{N}в них вертушки. По слухам, в каблуке у них еще и особое устройство." cns="女性假面超人穿的靴子。{N}用可以自由反弹的轻质材料制作而成。{N}据说鞋跟内装有特殊装置。"/>
	<string key="N1061185" kor="엔비걸즈 헬멧" ger="Envy Girls Helmet" eng="Envy Girls Helmet" tur="Envy Girls Helmet" fre="Envy Girls Helmet" rus="Envy Girls Helmet" cns="赤星假面（女）头盔"/>
	<string key="T1061185" kor="커플 브레이킹 전대 엔비레인저의 헬멧.{N}자신의 실체를 가리고 활동하는 엔비레인저는 필수 아이템!{N}기분에 따라 다양한 헬멧을 착용한다." ger="Helm der Envy Ranger.{N}Ein Muss für die Undercover-Arbeit als Envy Ranger.{N}Der Spieler kann aus verschiedenen Designs wählen." eng="Anti-Couple Envy Ranger's helmet.{N}A must-have item for Envy Rangers who want to remain incognito, this helmet is available in a variety of styles." tur="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Helmet.{N}Kendisini bir elbisenin ardında gizleyen Envy Ranger için elzem bir eşya.{N}Oyuncu zevkine göre çeşitli miğferlerden birini seçebilir." fre="Couple Breaking Group Envy Ranger's Helmet.{N}Un incontournable pour les Envy Rangers qui veulent cacher leur identité.{N}Vous pourrez même choisir votre préféré." rus="Шлем Anti-Couple Envy Ranger.{N}Обязательный предмет снаряжения для Envy Rangers, которые хотят оставаться неузнанными, доступный в нескольких исполнениях." cns="女性假面超人戴的头盔。{N}隐藏真实身份行侠仗义的假面超人所佩戴的头盔。{N}可以根据心情选择不同颜色的头盔。"/>
	<string key="N2000056" kor="T.O.D. 사이드" ger="T.O.D. Scythe" eng="T.O.D. Scythe" tur="T.O.D. Scythe" fre="T.O.D. Scythe" rus="T.O.D. Scythe" cns="塔纳托斯"/>
	<string key="T2000056" kor="블러디 헌터, 블러디 헌트리스의 유니크 엑소사이드.{N}흘러내리는 피를 굳혀 만들어낸 듯한 독특한 형태가 특징.{N}휘두를 때마다 사용자의 피를 흡수하는 저주에 걸려있다고 하지만 큰 의미가 없는 것 같다.{N}풀네임은 Thanatos Of Death Scythe" ger="Einzigartige EXO Scythe für Bloody Hunter und Bloody Huntress.{N}Blut scheint von ihr herabzurinnen.{N}Es heißt, sie fordert das Blut ihres Besitzers für jeden Hieb. Offenbar sind das aber nur Gerüchte.{N}Der vollständige Name ist Thanatos Of Death Scythe." eng="Bloody Hunter and Bloody Huntress's Unique EXO Scythe.{N}Its shape is reminiscent of dripping blood,{N}It is said to have a thirst for blood, but this appears to be merely apocryphal.{N}Its full name is the &quot;Thanatos of Death&quot; Scythe." tur="Bloody Hunter ve Bloody Huntress's Unique Exo Scythe{N}Şekli damlayan kanı anımsatıyor.{N}Kana susamış olduğu söyleniyor ama bunun doğruluğu şüpheli.{N}Tam adı Thanatos Of Death Scythe." fre="Unique Exo Scythe de Bloody Hunter et de Bloody Huntress.{N}Sa lame évoque le sang de ses victimes.{N}On raconte même qu'elle s'en nourrirait pour décupler sa puissance. Mais ce ne sont que des histoires...{N}On l'appelle Thanatos Of Death Scythe." rus="Уникальная EXO-коса Кровавой охотницы и Кровавого охотника.{N}Формой напоминает брызки крови.{N}Говорят, что она жаждет крови, но скорее всего это просто слухи.{N}Полное название косы – «Танатос Смертоносный»." cns="赤焰猎手的特典收割者。{N}由鲜血凝固而成的武器，上面附有嗜血咒语。{N}全称是塔纳托斯的死亡长镰。"/>
	<string key="N2010051" kor="엔비 스파크" ger="Envy Spark" eng="Envy Spark" tur="Envy Spark" fre="Envy Spark" rus="Envy Spark" cns="假面星火步枪"/>
	<string key="T2010051" kor="스파크 라이플의 엔비레인저 버전{N}엔비레인저의 주무기.{N}터지는 탄환으로 커플들을 괴롭힌다." ger="Envy-Ranger-Version der Spark Rifle.{N}Die Hauptwaffe der Envy Ranger.{N}Bedroht Pärchen mit explodierender Munition." eng="The Envy Ranger version of the Spark Rifle.{N}The primary weapon of the Envy Rangers,{N}its bursting bullets are the bane of lovebirds everywhere." tur="Envy Ranger versiyonunda Spark Rifle.{N}Envy Ranger'ın ana silahı.{N}Çiftleri patlayan mermilerle korkutur." fre="Spark Rifle version Envy Ranger.{N}L'arme de prédilection des Envy Rangers.{N}Menace les couples avec des balles explosives." rus="Исполнение Spark Rifle для Envy Rangers.{N}Основное оружие Envy Rangers.{N}Его пули настигают влюбленных повсюду." cns="假面超人使用的特典星火步枪。{N}据说射出去的子弹还会爆炸哦！"/>
	<string key="N2010052" kor="엔비 브레스" ger="Envy Breath" eng="Envy Breath" tur="Envy Breath" fre="Envy Breath" rus="Envy Breath" cns="假面炮"/>
	<string key="T2010052" kor="에어건의 엔비레인저 버전{N}엔비레인저의 필살 무기.{N}딱 달라붙어있는 커플들을 날려버릴 때 사용한다." ger="Envy-Ranger-Version der Air Gun.{N}Tödliche Waffe der Envy Ranger.{N}Wir dazu benutzt, um kuschelnde Pärchen auseinanderzureißen." eng="The Envy Ranger version of the Air Gun.{N}A deadly weapon of the Envy Rangers,{N}its blast is enough to send lovebirds scattering." tur="Envy Ranger versiyonunda Air gun{N}Envy Ranger'ın ölümcül silahı.{N}Birbirine sıkıca sarılan çiftleri havaya uçurmak için kullanılabilir." fre="Air Gun version Envy Ranger{N}Une arme létale des Envy Rangers.{N}Elle est capable de séparer les couples les plus collants." rus="Исполнение Air Gun для Envy Rangers.{N}Смертоносное оружие Envy Rangers.{N}Его выстрелы сражают влюбленных." cns="假面超人使用的特典空气炮。{N}假面超人的绝杀武器。{N}你可以在双十一对着大街上的情侣来一发。"/>
	<string key="N2060006" kor="파워 오브 솔로" ger="Power of Solo" eng="Power of Solo" tur="Power of Solo" fre="Power of Solo" rus="Power of Solo" cns="单身汪之怒"/>
	<string key="T2060006" kor="마인드 쇼크의 엔비레인저 버전{N}파오후!!!!!……..아…아니 파오솔!!!{N}맛좀봐라 NB POWER!!!!!!" ger="Envy-Ranger-Version der Mind Shock.{N}Für die totale Envy Power!" eng="The Envy Ranger version of the Mind Shock.{N}Feel the power of envy!" tur="Envy Ranger versiyonunda Mind Shock{N}İşte, Envy Gücü!!!!!" fre="Mind Shock version Envy Ranger.{N}Prends ça, Envy Power !!!!!" rus="Исполнение Mind Shock для Envy Rangers.{N}Почувствуй силу ревности!" cns="假面超人使用的特典心灵冲击。{N}嘭！！！！{N}尝一尝单身汪的愤怒吧！"/>
	<string key="N4035380" kor="G의 T.O.D 사이드 캡슐" ger="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule" eng="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule" tur="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule" fre="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule" rus="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule" cns="G的塔纳托斯扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035380" kor="G의 T.O.D 사이드 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule. {N}Kapsül şu nesneleri rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule G's T.O.D. Scythe. {N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="G's T.O.D. Scythe Capsule.{N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得塔纳托斯的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035381" kor="블러디 헌터 복장 캡슐" ger="Bloody Hunter Costume Capsule" eng="Bloody Hunter Costume Capsule" tur="Bloody Hunter Costume Capsule" fre="Bloody Hunter Costume Capsule" rus="Bloody Hunter Costume Capsule" cns="赤焰猎手（男）套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035381" kor="블러디 헌터 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Kapsel enthält das Bloody Hunter Set.{N}Kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule containing a Bloody Hunter Set.{N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Bloody Hunter Set içeren kapsül.{N}Kapsül şu nesneleri rastgele içerir:" fre="Une capsule contenant un Bloody Hunter Set.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула содержит Bloody Hunter Set.{N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得赤焰猎手（男）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035382" kor="블러디 헌트리스 복장 캡슐" ger="Bloody Huntress Costume Capsule" eng="Bloody Huntress Costume Capsule" tur="Bloody Huntress Costume Capsule" fre="Bloody Huntress Costume Capsule" rus="Bloody Huntress Costume Capsule" cns="赤焰猎手（女）套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035382" kor="블러디 헌트리스 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Kapsel enthält das Bloody Huntress Set.{N}Kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule containing a Bloody Huntress Set.{N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Bloody Huntress Set içeren kapsül.{N}Kapsül şu nesneleri rastgele içerir:" fre="Une capsule contenant un Bloody Huntress Set.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула содержит Bloody Huntress Set.{N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得赤焰猎手（女）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4051977" kor="블러디 헌터 세트 (1일)" ger="Bloody Hunter Set (1 Day)" eng="Bloody Hunter Set (1 Day)" tur="Bloody Hunter Set (1 Day)" fre="Bloody Hunter Set (1 Day)" rus="Bloody Hunter Set (1 день)" cns="赤焰猎手（男）套装（1日）"/>
	<string key="T4051977" kor="블러디 헌터 세트입니다. {N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Bloody Hunter Set. {N} Enthält folgende Items:" eng="Bloody Hunter Set. {N}Set contains the following items:" tur="Bloody Hunter Set. {N}Set şu nesneleri içerir:" fre="Bloody Hunter Set. {N}Le set contient l'un des objets suivants :" rus="Bloody Hunter Set. {N}В набор входят предметы:" cns="赤焰猎手（男）套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4051978" kor="블러디 헌터 세트 (7일)" ger="Bloody Hunter Set (7 Days)" eng="Bloody Hunter Set (7 Days)" tur="Bloody Hunter Set (7 Days)" fre="Bloody Hunter Set (7 Days)" rus="Bloody Hunter Set (7 дней)" cns="赤焰猎手（男）套装（7日）"/>
