	<string key="T4020114" kor="It's alive, it's moving, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, IT'S ALIVE!" ger="&quot;It's alive, it's moving, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, IT'S ALIVE!&quot;" eng="&quot;It's alive, it's moving, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, IT'S ALIVE!&quot;" tur="&quot;It's alive, it's moving, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, IT'S ALIVE!&quot;" fre="&quot;It's alive, it's moving, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, it's alive, IT'S ALIVE!&quot;" rus="«Оно живое. Оно движется. Оно живое. ОНО ЖИВОЕ!»" cns="它是活的！它在移动！弗兰肯斯坦的怪物！"/>
	<string key="T4020115" kor="When the wolfsbane blooms and the autumn moon is high, even a pretty face may become cursed" ger="When the wolfsbane blooms and the autumn moon is high, even a pretty face may become cursed!" eng="When the wolfsbane blooms and the autumn moon is high, even a pretty face may become cursed!" tur="When the wolfsbane blooms and the autumn moon is high, even a pretty face may become cursed!" fre="When the wolfsbane blooms and the autumn moon is high, even a pretty face may become cursed!" rus="Когда полная луна высоко, даже самые красивые люди могут стать жертвой проклятия!" cns="当月圆之夜你听到一阵狼嚎，不要回头！赶紧跑！"/>
	<string key="T4020116" kor="The Order of the Dragon has a gift for you." ger="The Order of the Dragon has a gift for you." eng="The Order of the Dragon has a gift for you." tur="The Order of the Dragon has a gift for you." fre="The Order of the Dragon has a gift for you." rus="У Ордена дракона для тебя подарок." cns="长生不死的吸血鬼给你的礼物，你敢要吗？"/>
	<string key="T4020117" kor="Malediction awaits for those who steal the treasure, better rely on a good firewall" ger="Malediction awaits for those who steal the (PENSTAT) treasure, better rely on a good firewall." eng="Malediction awaits for those who steal the (PENSTAT) treasure, better rely on a good firewall." tur="Malediction awaits for those who steal the (PENSTAT) treasure, better rely on a good firewall." fre="Malediction awaits for those who steal the (PENSTAT) treasure, better rely on a good firewall." rus="Проклятие падет на того, кто позарится на сокровище (PENSTAT). От такого не защититься." cns="法老的愤怒已经觉醒！诅咒那些盗墓者！"/>
	<string key="T4020118" kor="Star or Ghost - Let's turn on the juice and see what shakes loose." ger="Star or Ghost - Let's turn on the juice (FP) and see what shakes loose." eng="Star or Ghost - Let's turn on the juice (FP) and see what shakes loose." tur="Star or Ghost - Let's turn on the juice (FP) and see what shakes loose." fre="Star or Ghost - Let's turn on the juice (FP) and see what shakes loose." rus="Star или Ghost – включаемся помощнее (FP) и посмотрим, что из этого выйдет." cns="来自遥远星系的礼物，打开看一看吧！"/>
