	<string key="T4052037" kor="ep. 글리치 M 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Episode Diese Kapsel enthält das Glitch Set (M){N}Kann folgende Items enthalten:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Hinweis:{CB-255,255,255,255} 100% Unique Booster kann für diese Kapsel nicht genutzt werden. " eng="A capsule containing a Glitch Episode Set (M){N}The capsule contains the following items at random:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} the 100% Unique Booster cannot be used on this capsule." tur="ep. Glitch Set (M)'ni içeren kapsül.{N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir: {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Not:{CB-255,255,255,255} 100% Unique Booster bu kapsülde geçerli değildir." fre=" Une capsule contenant un Glitch Episode M Set.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} Les 100% Unique Boosters ne peuvent pas être utilisés sur cette capsule." spa="Una capsula que contiene el Set de objetos buggeados (M){N}Esta capsula contiene los siguientes objetos al azar:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Importante:{CB-255,255,255,255} los 100% Unique Booster no pueden ser utilizados en esta capsula." rus="Капсула содержит Glitch Episode Set (M){N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Внимание:{CB-255,255,255,255} с этой капсулой нельзя использовать 100% Unique Booster." cns="可以获得ep.电玩傀儡（男）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4052038" kor="ep.글리치 W 캡슐" ger="Glitch Episode W Capsule" eng="Glitch Episode (F) Capsule" tur="ep.Glitch Set (W) Kapsülü" fre="Capsule Glitch Episode W" spa="Capsula de Episodio: Buggeados Femenina" rus="Glitch Episode (F) Capsule" cns="ep.电玩傀儡（女）套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4052038" kor="ep. 글리치 W 세트를 얻을 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Episode Diese Kapsel enthält das Glitch Set (F){N}Kann folgende Items enthalten: {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Hinweis:{CB-255,255,255,255} 100% Unique Booster kann für diese Kapsel nicht genutzt werden. " eng="A capsule containing a Glitch Episode Set (F){N}The capsule contains the following items at random:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} the 100% Unique Booster cannot be used on this capsule." tur="ep. Glitch Set (W)'ni içeren kapsül.{N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir: {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Not:{CB-255,255,255,255} 100% Unique Booster bu kapsülde geçerli değildir." fre=" Une capsule contenant un Glitch Set (F){N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} Les 100% Unique Boosters ne peuvent pas être utilisés sur cette capsule." spa="Una capsula que contiene el Set de objetos buggeados (F){N}Esta capsula contiene los siguientes objetos al azar:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Importante:{CB-255,255,255,255} los 100% Unique Booster no pueden ser utilizados en esta capsula." rus="Капсула содержит Glitch Episode Set (F){N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Внимание:{CB-255,255,255,255} с этой капсулой нельзя использовать 100% Unique Booster." cns="可以获得ep.电玩傀儡（女）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
