	<string key="N4059000" kor="EC's 100% Unique Booster Capsule" ger="EC's 100% Unique Booster Capsule" eng="EC's 100% Unique Booster Capsule" tur="EC's 100% Unique Booster Capsule" fre="EC's 100% Unique Booster Capsule" rus="EC's 100% Unique Booster Capsule" cns="EC的特典概率提升扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4059000" kor="Get this awesome Enigma Capsule now! Win one of the amazing prizes listed below! {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} the 100% Unique Booster cannot be used on this capsule." ger="Holt jetzt die großartige Enigma Kapsel! Gewinnt eines der folgenden, tollen Preisen! {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Hinweis:{CB-255,255,255,255} 100% Unique Booster kann für diese Kapsel nicht genutzt werden. " eng="Get this awesome Enigma Capsule now! Win one of the amazing prizes listed below! {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} the 100% Unique Booster cannot be used on this capsule." tur="Bu harika Enigma Kapsülünü şimdi alın! Aşağıdaki inanılmaz ödüllerden birini kazanın! {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Not:{CB-255,255,255,255} 100% Unique Booster bu kapsülde geçerli değildir." fre="Obtenez cette Capsule Enigma maintenant ! Gagnez l'un des superbes prix ci-dessous ! {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Note:{CB-255,255,255,255} Les 100% Unique Boosters ne peuvent pas être utilisés sur cette capsule." rus="Получи крутую Enigma Capsule! Выиграй один из указанных ниже отличных призов! {N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}Внимание:{CB-255,255,255,255} с этой капсулой нельзя использовать 100% Unique Booster." cns="不知道制造者的神秘扭蛋！打开它能随机获得下列奖励！{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}注意:{CB-255,255,255,255}特典概率提升的增益效果，无法使用在这个扭蛋上"/>
