	<string key="N4035416" kor="리벨리어스 세트 캡슐 (X2)" eng="Rebellious Set Capsule (X2)" spa="Rebellious Set Capsule (X2)" rus="Rebellious Set Capsule (X2)" cns="叛逆套装扭蛋（x2）"/>
	<string key="T4035416" kor="구속을 거부하는 남자를 위한 복장 세트 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." eng="Costume Set Capsule for the rebellious guys of S4 League. Bonus EXP +5%{N}Following items are included." spa="Cápsula de Ropa para los chicos rebeldes de S4 League. Bonus de EXP +5%{N}Los siguientes items están incluidos." rus="Капсула с костюмом для игроков-бунтарей в S4 League. Бонус EXP +5%{N}Включены следующие предметы." cns="可以获得叛逆套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035417" kor="릴리트 세트 캡슐 (X2)" eng="Lilith Set Capsule (X2)" spa="Lilith Set Capsule (X2)" rus="Lilith Set Capsule (X2)" cns="莉莉丝套装扭蛋（x2）"/>
	<string key="T4035417" kor="감추고 싶은 과거가 있는 이를 위한 복장 세트 캡슐입니다.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." eng="Mysterious Lilith Costume Capsule. Bonus EXP +5%{N}Following items are included." spa="Misteriosa Capsula de Ropa de Lilith. Bonus de EXP +5%{N}Los siguientes items están incluidos." rus="Таинственная капсула с костюмом Lilith. Бонус EXP +5%{N}Включены следующие предметы." cns="可以获得莉莉丝套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035418" kor="언더웨이 세트 캡슐 (X2)" eng="Underway Set Capsule (X2)" spa="Underway Set Capsule (X2)" rus="Underway Set Capsule (X2)" cns="潮人套装扭蛋（x2）"/>
	<string key="T4035418" kor="어디에서나 튀고 싶은 당신을 위한 복장 세트 캡슐입니다!{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." eng="The Costume Set Capsule for the one who goes his own way. Bonus EXP +5%{N}Following items are included." spa="Esta Capsula del Set de Traje es para aquellos que hacen su propio Camino. Bonus de EXP +5%{N}Los siguientes items están incluidos." rus="Капсула с костюмом для тех, кто всегда следует своему пути. Бонус EXP +5%{N}Включены следующие предметы." cns="可以获得潮人套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035419" kor="오필리아 세트 캡슐 (X2)" eng="Ophelia Set Capsule (X2)" spa="Ophelia Set Capsule (X2)" rus="Ophelia Set Capsule (X2)" cns="魅惑套装扭蛋（x2）"/>
	<string key="T4035419" kor="시즌1의 히로인, 묘한 매력을 가진 오필리아로 변신해 보세요.{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." eng="Ophelia's Costume Set Capsule: The heroine of Dark Lightning. Bonus EXP +5%{N}Following items are included." spa="Capsula de Set de Traje de  Ophelia: La heroina de Dark Lightning. Bonus de EXP +5%{N}Los siguientes items están incluidos." rus="Капсула с костюмом Офелии, героини из Dark Lightning. Бонус EXP +5%{N}Включены следующие предметы." cns="可以获得魅惑套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4020141" kor="Ice" ger="Ice" eng="Ice" tur="Ice" fre="Ice" rus="Ice" cns="冰块"/>
	<string key="T4020141" kor="All the things you need to stay warm and cozy in the winter times." ger="All the things you need to stay warm and cozy in the winter times." eng="All the things you need to stay warm and cozy in the winter times." tur="All the things you need to stay warm and cozy in the winter times." fre="All the things you need to stay warm and cozy in the winter times." rus="Все, что нужно для тепла и уюта холодным зимним днем." cns="这里面有能让你在冬天也觉得温暖的东西！"/>
	<string key="N4020142" kor="Mistletoe" ger="Mistletoe" eng="Mistletoe" tur="Mistletoe" fre="Mistletoe" rus="Mistletoe" cns="槲寄生"/>
	<string key="T4020142" kor="Decorate yourself this christmas with the accessories from this box!" ger="Decorate yourself this christmas with the accessories from this box!" eng="Decorate yourself this christmas with the accessories from this box!" tur="Decorate yourself this christmas with the accessories from this box!" fre="Decorate yourself this christmas with the accessories from this box!" rus="Украсьте себя к Рождеству аксессуарами из этой коробки!" cns="圣诞节到了！快打开盒子，用里面的饰品打扮起来吧！"/>
	<string key="N4020143" kor="Frozen" ger="Frozen" eng="Frozen" tur="Frozen" fre="Frozen" rus="Frozen" cns="雪花"/>
	<string key="T4020143" kor="Does the cold bother you?{N}With this box you won't mind. {N}PEN version" ger="Does the cold bother you?{N}With this box you won't mind. {N}PEN version" eng="Does the cold bother you?{N}With this box you won't mind. {N}PEN version" tur="Does the cold bother you?{N}With this box you won't mind. {N}PEN version" fre="Does the cold bother you?{N}With this box you won't mind. {N}PEN version" rus="Вам досаждает холод?{N}С этой коробкой он вам нипочем. {N}Версия PEN" cns="开始飘雪花了，天气要转冷了！{N}只要打开这个盒子，一切的寒冷都将不再是烦恼。{N}金币版"/>
	<string key="N4020144" kor="Tinsel" ger="Tinsel" eng="Tinsel" tur="Tinsel" fre="Tinsel" rus="Tinsel" cns="圣诞花环"/>
	<string key="T4020144" kor="Give someone a bear hug this Christmas! {N}PEN version" ger="Give someone a bear hug this Christmas! {N}PEN version" eng="Give someone a bear hug this Christmas! {N}PEN version" tur="Give someone a bear hug this Christmas! {N}PEN version" fre="Give someone a bear hug this Christmas! {N}PEN version" rus="Обними кого-нибудь на это Рождество! {N}Версия PEN" cns="用金属箔和冬青枝做的圣诞花环！{N}虽然还没有把花插上去……{N}金币版"/>
