	<string key="T4020146" kor="Reach for the stars, get the FP version now!" ger="Reach for the stars, get the FP version now!" eng="Reach for the stars, get the FP version now!" tur="Reach for the stars, get the FP version now!" fre="Reach for the stars, get the FP version now!" rus="Звезда в твоих руках: версия FP ждет!" cns="一闪一闪亮晶晶，满天都是小星星~"/>
