	<string key="N1070077" kor="더월드 펌비" ger="The World Fumbi Pet" eng="The World Fumbi Pet" tur="The World Fumbi Pet" fre="Familier The World Fumbi" rus="The World Fumbi Pet" cns="艾斯波科技波比"/>
