	<string key="N4170001" kor="럭키 에스퍼 UP" cns="超能芯片幸运概率提升"/>
	<string key="T4170001" kor="에스퍼 칩의 인챈트 성공 확률을 올려주는 아이템입니다. 해당 아이템은 에스퍼 칩 인챈트 페이지에서 사용 할 수 있습니다." cns="提高强化超能芯片的成功概率。该道具可在强化超能芯片页面使用。"/>
	<string key="N4170002" kor="럭키 에스퍼 100" ger="Lucky eSper 100" eng="Lucky eSper 100" tur="Lucky Esper 100" fre="Lucky eSper 100" rus="Lucky eSper 100" cns="超能芯片幸运概率100"/>
	<string key="T4170002" kor="에스퍼 칩의 인챈트를 100% 성공 시켜 주는 아이템입니다. 해당 아이템은 에스퍼 칩 인챈트 페이지에서 사용 할 수 있습니다." ger="Mit diesem Item verzauberst du eSper-Chips zu 100%. Kann auf der Enchant-Seite für eSper-Chips benutzt werden." eng="Guarantees eSper Chip enhancement. Can be used from the eSper Chip Enchant page." tur="Bu eşya Esper Chip'inin Güçlendirilmesini %100 garantiler. Bu eşya Esper Chip Güçlendirme sayfasında kullanılabilir." fre="Cet objet garantit la réussite d'un enchantement d'eSper Chip. Cet objet peut être utilisé sur la page d'enchantement eSper Chip." rus="Гарантирует усиление чипа eSper. Можно использовать на странице зачарования чипов eSper." cns="100%成功强化超能芯片的道具。该道具可在强化超能芯片页面使用。"/>
	<string key="N4180001" kor="에스퍼 파괴 방지" ger="eSper Insurance" eng="eSper Insurance" tur="eSper Insurance" fre="eSper Insurance" rus="eSper Insurance" cns="超能芯片保护盾"/>
	<string key="T4180001" kor="에스퍼 칩 인챈트 결과가 파괴일 때 이를 무시하는 아이템 입니다. 해당 아이템은 에스퍼 칩 인챈트 페이지에서 사용 할 수 있습니다." ger="Das Item schützt bei der eSper-Chip-Verzauberung vor Zerstörung. Kann auf der Enchant-Seite für eSper-Chips benutzt werden." eng="Counteracts failure of eSper Chip enhancement. Can be used in the eSper Chip Enchant page." tur="Bu eşya Esper Chip Güçlendirmesinin sonunda yok olacaksa bunu engeller. Bu eşya Esper Chip Güçlendirme sayfasında kullanılabilir." fre="Cet objet ignore le résultat destruction lors de l'enchantement eSper Chip. Cet objet peut être utilisé sur la page d'enchantement eSper Chip." rus="Нейтрализует неудачу при усилении чипа eSper. Можно использовать на странице зачарования чипов eSper." cns="当超能芯片强化失败时，可以防止超能芯片被破坏的道具。该道具可在强化超能芯片页面使用。"/>
	<string key="N1061188" kor="마르쉬 캣 헬멧" ger="Marsh Feline Helmet" eng="Marsh Feline Helmet" tur="Marsh Cat Helmet" fre="Marsh cat Helmet" rus="Marsh Feline Helmet" cns="太空喵（男）头盔"/>
	<string key="T1061188" kor="목이 간지러운데 벗으면 안되냥?" ger="Es juckt voll darunter. Darf ich ihn absetzen? Miau?" eng="It looks great, doesn't it? It's a little itchy, though... The things we do for fashion, huh?" tur="Boynumu kaşındırıyor, çıkarabilir miyim? Miyav?" fre="Il gratte un peu... Je peux l'enlever ? Miaou ?" rus="Отлично выглядит, не так ли? Правда, немного чешется... Но чего не сделаешь для моды!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的男性喵星人头盔。"/>
	<string key="N1021188" kor="마르쉬 캣 타이즈 상의" ger="Marsh Feline Tights Top" eng="Marsh Feline Tights Top" tur="Marsh Cat Tights Top" fre="Marsh cat Tights top" rus="Marsh Feline Tights Top" cns="太空喵（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021188" kor="더운데 벗으면 안되냥?" ger="Ich schwitze mich tot! Darf ich mich ausziehen? Miau?" eng="How do I look? Do I look hot? Because I feel like I'm roasting in this thing..." tur="Çok sıcak oldu, çıkarabilir miyim? Miyav?" fre="Ça tient bien trop chaud... Je peux l'enlever ? Miaou ?" rus="Ну, как я выгляжу? Горячо? Потому что я в этой штуке просто как на сковороде." cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的男性喵星人上衣。"/>
	<string key="N1031188" kor="마르쉬 캣 타이즈 하의" ger="Marsh Feline Tights Bottom" eng="Marsh Feline Tights Bottom" tur="Marsh Cat Tights Bottom" fre="Marsh cat Tights bottom" rus="Marsh Feline Tights Bottom" cns="太空喵（男）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031188" kor="역시 불편하니까 벗…왜 때리냥!" ger="Total unbequem! Echt ... Miau!" eng="They're not all that comfortable, but sometimes fashion comes at a purr-ice!" tur="Çok rahatsız edici... Miyav!" fre="Très peu seyants... Miaou !" rus="Не слишком удобно, но иногда за классный внешний вид приходится платить!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的男性喵星人裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041188" kor="마르쉬 캣 글러브" ger="Marsh Feline Gloves" eng="Marsh Feline Gloves" tur="Marsh Cat Gloves" fre="Marsh cat Gloves" rus="Marsh Feline Gloves" cns="太空喵（男）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041188" kor="이걸로 맞으면 아프냥?" ger="Tut's mit den Handschuhen mehr weh? Miau?" eng="Let's hope these gloves hurt your enemies more than they hurt you. Me-ouch!" tur="Bu eldivenlerle daha da rahatsız edici olur mu? Miyav?" fre="Mes doigts sont un peu compressés dans ces gants. Miaou ?" rus="Надеюсь, врагам от этих перчаток будет больнее, чем мне!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的男性喵星人手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051188" kor="마르쉬 캣 슈즈" ger="Marsh Feline Shoes" eng="Marsh Feline Shoes" tur="Marsh Cat Shoes" fre="Marsh cat Shoes" rus="Marsh Feline Shoes" cns="太空喵（男）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051188" kor="무슨 문제 있냥?" ger="Was ist denn los? Miau?" eng="What are mew looking at? This furry footwear is purrfect!" tur="Sorun nedir? Miyav?" fre="Quel est le problème ? Miaou ?" rus="Чего вы так смотрите? Прекрррасная обувка!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的男性喵星人鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N1061189" kor="멜로우 캣 헬멧" ger="Mallow Feline Helmet" eng="Mallow Feline Helmet" tur="Mallow Cat Helmet" fre="Mallow Cat Helmet" rus="Mallow Feline Helmet" cns="太空喵（女）头盔"/>
	<string key="T1061189" kor="너도 우주에서 왔냥!" ger="Kommst du auch aus dem Universum? Miau?" eng="This cat hat is out of this world! It'll be tough to get enough of strutting your stuff!" tur="Sen de evrenin bir parçası değil misin? Miyav?" fre="Vous venez de l'espace ? Miaou ?" rus="Шляпа просто космос! Такой придется просто на каждом шагу светить!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的男性喵星人头盔。"/>
	<string key="N1021189" kor="멜로우 캣 레오타드 탑" ger="Mallow Feline Leotard Top" eng="Mallow Feline Leotard Top" tur="Mallow Cat Leotard Top" fre="Mallow Cat Leotard top" rus="Mallow Feline Leotard Top" cns="太空喵（女）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021189" kor="우주에 데려가주면 안되냥?" ger="Knall mich ins All! Miau!" eng="Want to avoid a fashion cat-astrophe? This top is tabby-chic!" tur="Beni de geldiğin yere götür lütfen! Miyav!" fre="Emmenez-moi dans l'espace, s'il vous plaît. Miaou !" rus="Хочешь узнать, что такое настоящая мода? Попробуй этот топ!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的女性喵星人上衣。"/>
	<string key="N1031189" kor="멜로우 캣 레오타드 언더" ger="Mallow Feline Leotard Bottom" eng="Mallow Feline Leotard Bottom" tur="Mallow Cat Leotard Bottom" fre="Mallow Cat Leotard bottom" rus="Mallow Feline Leotard Bottom" cns="太空喵（女）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031189" kor="너도 입어봤냥? 그거보단 이게 더 편하지 않냥?" ger="Willst du das auch mal anziehen? Miau? Passt fast, haha. Miau ..." eng="Nothing quite like some fine feline fur to freshen up your fashion! Never mind that they're insanely uncomfortable— these bottoms are tops!" tur="Sen de bunu denedin mi? Miyav? Bu daha iyi değil mi? Miyav?" fre="Vous l'avez essayé ? Miaou ? N'est-ce pas mieux ? Miaou ?" rus="Ничто так не освежает твой облик, как кошачий мех! А то, что вещи из него жутко неудобные, не так уж и важно." cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的女性喵星人裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041189" kor="멜로우 캣 글러브" ger="Mallow Feline Gloves" eng="Mallow Feline Gloves" tur="Mallow Cat Gloves" fre="Mallow Cat Gloves" rus="Mallow Feline Gloves" cns="太空喵（女）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041189" kor="장갑 짱귀엽지 않냥?" ger="Super süß, oder? Miau ..." eng="Aren't they cute? They make it a little difficult to pick things up..." tur="Bu çok tatlı değil mi? Miyav?" fre="N'est-ce pas trop mignon ? Miaou ?" rus="Какие милые! Хотя что-то взять в них довольно затруднительно..." cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的女性喵星人手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051189" kor="멜로우 캣 슈즈" ger="Mallow Feline Shoes" eng="Mallow Feline Shoes" tur="Mallow Cat Shoes" fre="Mallow Cat Shoes" rus="Mallow Feline Shoes" cns="太空喵（女）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051189" kor="폭신폭신 너도 신어봤냥?" ger="Extrem bequem! Kennst du die? Miau ..." eng="They're so soft... I can move around almost silently! They would be purrfect for sneak attacks..." tur="Çok rahat! Bunu üzerinde denedin mi? Miyav?" fre="Carrément confortables. Vous les avez essayées ? Miaou ?" rus="Такие мягкие... В них можно ходить почти бесшумно! Отлично подойдут для атак из засады!" cns="从小梦想成为宇航员的女性喵星人鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N2000064" kor="로*캣 너클 2039" ger="Curious Cat Claw" eng="Curious Cat Claw" tur="Curious Cat Claw" fre="Curious Cat Claw" rus="Curious Cat Claw" cns="无敌喵喵爪"/>
	<string key="T2000064" kor="이거 유니크 너클이냥?{N}한 방에 우주까지 날아가는 최첨단 고양이 너클의 맛 좀 쬐끔만 볼테냥!" ger="Neugier ist der Katze Tod? Miau ...{N}Die Waffe verspricht eines garantiert: Mit einem Knall ist der Feind im All! Miau ..." eng="Curiosity killed the cat, huh? Well, these claws are just as deadly!{N}If you're looking for a great new way to shred your foes to ribbons, look no further. These claws will earn you applause!" tur="Bu eşi benzeri olmayan bir Knuckle mı? Miyav?{N} Seni evrene geri gönderecek olan en yeni kedi muştasını denemek ister misin? Miyav?" fre="Sont-ils uniques ? Miaou ?{N}Un uppercut vous enverra dans les étoiles. Miaou ?" rus="Любопытство убило кошку? С такими когтями она сама кого хочешь убьет!{N}Если вам нужен способ рвать врагов на кусочки, можете больше не искать. Это явный победитель!" cns="无敌少女喵变身而成的特典合金臂铠。{N}美猫不发威你当我好欺负，想尝尝无敌少女喵的厉害吗？！"/>
	<string key="N1070078" kor="펌냥이" ger="Nyan Fumbi" eng="Nyan Fumbi" tur="Nyan Fumbi" fre="Nyan Fumbi" rus="Nyan Fumbi" cns="波比喵"/>
	<string key="T1070078" kor="난 펌냥이다옹!" ger="Ich bin Nyan Fumbi." eng="I am Nyan Fumbi!" tur="Benim adım Nyan Fumbi!" fre="Je suis Nyan Fumbi !" rus="Меня зовут Nyan Fumbi!" cns="你好，我是波比喵！"/>
	<string key="N4035432" kor="마르쉬 캡슐" ger="Marsh Capsule" eng="Marsh Capsule" tur="Marsh Capsule" fre="Capsule Marsch" rus="Marsh Capsule" cns="太空喵（男）扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035432" kor="마르쉬 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Das ist DIE Marsh-Kapsel. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule which contains a Marsh set. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Bir Marsh Capsule'ü. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Une Capsule Marsch. {N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула содержит Marsh Set.{N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得太空喵（男）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
