	<string key="N4052203" kor="종이 미역" ger="Faux Seaweed" eng="Faux Seaweed" tur="Paper Seaweed" fre="Paper Seaweed" rus="Faux Seaweed" cns="纸海带"/>
	<string key="T4052203" kor="미역인줄 알았지만 흐느적거리는 종이 조각이었다.{N}먹을 순 없다고 한다." ger="Ich dachte, es wäre Seetang – dabei ist es nur ein lumpiges Stück Papier.{N}Nein, es ist NICHT essbar." eng="Looks exactly like seaweed, but it's actually made of paper.{N}It's not edible. Don't ask me how I know." tur="Yosun olduğunu sanmıştım fakat ince bir kağıt parçası olduğu ortaya çıktı.{N}Görünüşe göre yenilemiyor." fre="Je croyais que c'était des algues mais c'est en fait une page détrempée.{N}Définitivement pas comestible." rus="Похоже на водоросли, но только из бумаги.{N}Несъедобно. И не спрашивайте, откуда я знаю." cns="以为是海带，其实是摆动的纸片。{N}不能吃"/>
	<string key="N4052204" kor="장난감 물고기" ger="Toy Fish" eng="Toy Fish" tur="Toy Fish" fre="Toy Fish" rus="Toy Fish" cns="玩具鱼"/>
	<string key="T4052204" kor="자석으로 건져 올리는 물고기{N}누가 버렸을까…?" ger="Kennst du das Magnet-Angelspiel?{N}Da kommt der Fisch her." eng="This faux fish was picked up with a magnet. {N} I wonder who threw it away..." tur="Mıknatısla kaldırılmış olan bir balık. {N}Bunu kim çöpe atmış?" fre="Un jouet en forme de poisson.{N} Mais qui a pu le jeter là ?" rus="Рыбку-игрушку вытащили магнитом. {N} Интересно, кто ее выкинул..." cns="可以用磁铁捞起的鱼{N}到底是谁扔的···？"/>
	<string key="N4052205" kor="별모양 물고기" ger="Starfish" eng="Starfish" tur="Star-shaped Fish" fre="Star-shaped Fish" spa="" ita="" rus="Starfish" ame="" cns="星星鱼" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4052205" kor="마르쉬와 멜로우가 한눈에 반한 물고기.{N}나는 이 물고기 좀 별로.. 내 마음의 별로☆" ger="Auf diesen Sonderling haben es Marsh und Mallow abgesehen.{N}Wieso? Das steht in den Sternen!" eng="Marsh and Mallow are both enthralled with this water-breather.{N}I'm not convinced... I guess we'll have to agree to disagree." tur="Marsh ve Mallow'un dikkatini çeken bir balık. {N}Balık kısmından pek emin değilim... Bunu listeden çıkaralım." fre="Un poisson qui a attiré l'attention de Mallow et Marsch.{N} J'ai comme un mauvais pressentiment. Nous devrions être méfiants." rus="Marsh и Mallow очарованы этим морским жителем.{N}А я что-то не знаю... Ну, у каждого свое мнение." cns="太空喵饲养的鱼。{N}因为喜爱宇宙的一切，连鱼都是☆状的。"/>
	<string key="N4052206" kor="대게" ger="Scrumptious Crab " eng="Scrumptious Crab" tur="Crab" fre="Crab" spa="" ita="" rus="Scrumptious Crab" ame="" cns="大螃蟹" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4052206" kor="우와! 이 대게 되게 맛있다." ger="Wow! Dieses Teil schmeckt fantastisch!" eng="Delicious! This is the best crab you'll eat all year." tur="Vay canına! Bu yengecin tadı muhteşem." fre="Ça alors ! Ce crabe est vraiment délicieux !" rus="Вкуснятина! Краба лучше вы еще не пробовали." cns="哇！这个大螃蟹好好吃。"/>
	<string key="N4052207" kor="황금 거북이" ger="Gilded Turtle" eng="Gilded Turtle" tur="Gold Turtle" fre="Gold Turtle" spa="" ita="" rus="Gilded Turtle" ame="" cns="黄金乌龟" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4052207" kor="천년에 한번 나타난다는 황금 거북이.{N}프로포즈 할 때 사용하면 성공 확률 100%" ger="Eine solche Schildkröte wird nur ein Mal alle 1000 Jahre geboren.{N}Was für'n Glück." eng="This armored reptile glitters with gold and only appears every thousand years.{N}Who can possibly resist its charms?" tur="Bin yılda bir ortaya çık altın bir kaplumbağa. {N}Tekliflerde %100 ihtimalle evet alacaktır." fre="Une tortue qui n'apparaît qu'une fois par siècle.{N}un présage de bonheur pour les jeunes couples." rus="Позолоченная рептилия появляется раз в тысячу лет.{N}Как перед такой устоять?" cns="一千年出现一次的黄金乌龟。{N}求婚时使用，成功率100%"/>
	<string key="N4020159" kor="Water" ger="Water" eng="Water" tur="Water" fre="Water" rus="Water" cns="水"/>
	<string key="T4020159" kor="유럽 이벤트 아이템" ger="Like water, the most important thing for spring!" eng="Like water, the most important thing for spring!" tur="Like water, the most important thing for spring!" fre="Like water, the most important thing for spring!" rus="Самая важная вещь по весне!" cns="欧洲活动道具"/>
	<string key="N4020160" kor="Grass" ger="Grass" eng="Grass" tur="Grass" fre="Grass" rus="Grass" cns="草"/>
	<string key="T4020160" kor="유럽 이벤트 아이템" ger="The grass is growing and the rabbits are coming out. Grab yours before it runs away!" eng="The grass is growing and the rabbits are coming out. Grab yours before it runs away!" tur="The grass is growing and the rabbits are coming out. Grab yours before it runs away!" fre="The grass is growing and the rabbits are coming out. Grab yours before it runs away!" rus="Трава растет, кролики вылезают на солнце. Хватай, пока можешь!" cns="欧洲活动道具"/>
	<string key="N4020161" kor="Blossom" ger="Blossom" eng="Blossom" tur="Blossom" fre="Blossom" rus="Blossom" cns="繁花"/>
	<string key="T4020161" kor="유럽 이벤트 아이템" ger="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Female Pen version." eng="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Female Pen version." tur="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Female Pen version." fre="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Female Pen version." rus="Весна полна красок. Ваш новый образ на эту весну! Женская PEN-версия." cns="欧洲活动道具"/>
	<string key="N4020162" kor="Sakura" ger="Sakura" eng="Sakura" tur="Sakura" fre="Sakura" rus="Sakura" cns="樱花"/>
	<string key="T4020162" kor="유럽 이벤트 아이템" ger="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Male Pen version." eng="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Male Pen version." tur="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Male Pen version." fre="Spring is colorful and vibrant. Get a new look for this spring! Male Pen version." rus="Весна полна красок. Ваш новый образ на эту весну! Мужская PEN-версия." cns="欧洲活动道具"/>
	<string key="N4020163" kor="Rabbit" ger="Rabbit" eng="Rabbit" tur="Rabbit" fre="Rabbit" rus="Rabbit" cns="兔子"/>
	<string key="T4020163" kor="유럽 이벤트 아이템" ger="Easter is around and the rabbit has brought some great items! Female AP version. " eng="Easter is around and the rabbit has brought some great items! Female AP version. " tur="Easter is around and the rabbit has brought some great items! Female AP version. " fre="Easter is around and the rabbit has brought some great items! Female AP version. " rus="Скоро Пасха, и кролик принес отличные предметы! Женская AP-версия. " cns="欧洲活动道具"/>
