	<string key="T4050379" kor="치파오 걸 복장 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Chinese Dress Costume Set{N}Enthält folgende Items:" eng="Chinese dress Costume Set{N}includes following items" tur="Chinese dress Costume Set{N}includes following items" fre="Costume complet de la Robe Chinoise. {N}Contient les objets suivants" spa="Chinese Dress Costume Set. {N} Incluye los siguientes artículos:" ita="Chinese dress Costume Set. {N}Include i seguenti oggetti." rus="Набор китайских платьев{N}включает в себя предметы" cns="功夫少女套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="少女功夫套裝。{N}使用套裝道具時，將可獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N4050380" kor="쿵푸 파이터 복장 세트(내구제)" ger="Kung Fu Fighter Set (permanent)" eng="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Permanent)" tur="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Permanent)" fre="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Permanent)" spa="Kung Fu Fighter Set. (Permanent)" ita="Kung Fu Fighter Set. (Permanent)" rus="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Бессрочн.)" cns="功夫小子套装（永久）" twn="鐵拳無敵套裝(耐久制)"/>
	<string key="T4050380" kor="쿵푸 파이터 복장 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Kung Fu Fighter Set{N}Enthält folgende Items:" eng="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set{N}includes following items" tur="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set{N}includes following items" fre="Costume complet du Kung Fu Fighter. {N}Contient les objets suivants" spa="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set. {N} Incluye los siguientes artículos:" ita="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set. {N}Include i seguenti oggetti." rus="Набор костюмов бойца кунг фу{N}включает в себя предметы" cns="功夫小子套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="鐵拳無敵套裝。{N}使用套裝道具時，將可獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N4050381" kor="쿵푸 파이터 복장 세트(내구제)" ger="Kung Fu Fighter Set (permanent)" eng="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Permanent)" tur="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Permanent)" fre="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Permanent)" spa="Kung Fu Fighter Set. (Permanent)" ita="Kung Fu Fighter Set. (Permanent)" rus="Kung Fu Fighter Set (Бессрочн.)" cns="功夫小子套装（永久）" twn="鐵拳無敵套裝(耐久制)"/>
	<string key="T4050381" kor="쿵푸 파이터 복장 세트입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Kung Fu Fighter Set{N}Enthält folgende Items:" eng="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set{N}includes following items" tur="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set{N}includes following items" fre="Costume complet du Kung Fu Fighter. {N}Contient les objets suivants" spa="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set. {N} Incluye los siguientes artículos:" ita="Kung Fu Fighter Costume Set. {N}Include i seguenti oggetti." rus="Набор костюмов бойца кунг фу{N}включает в себя предметы" cns="功夫小子套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具" twn="鐵拳無敵套裝。{N}使用套裝道具時，將可獲得如下的道具。"/>
	<string key="N4340001" kor="하급 인챈트 추출칩" cns="低级强化提取芯片"/>
	<string key="T4340001"/>
	<string key="N4340002" kor="인챈트 추출칩" ger="Enchant Extractor" eng="Enchant Extractor" tur="Enchant Extractor" fre="Enchant Extractor" rus="Enchant Extractor" cns="强化提取芯片"/>
	<string key="T4340002" kor="장비에 장착된 인챈트를 추출할 수 있습니다." ger="Verzauberungseffekt von der Ausrüstung entfernen. Der von der Ausrüstung entfernte Verzauberungseffekt wurde zurückgesetzt." eng="Allows you to extract enchantments from equipment. Afterwards, the equipment's enchant stats will be reset." tur="Ekipman üzerinden güçlendirmeleri ayırın. Ekipmandan ayrılan güçlendirme sıfırlanır." fre="Permet d'extraire l'enchantement d'une pièce d'équipement. L'enchantement sera réinitialisé." rus="Позволяет извлекать чары из снаряжение. После этого параметры чар снаряжения сбрасываются." cns="可以提取出安装在装备上的强化"/>
	<string key="N4340003" kor="상급 인챈트 추출칩" cns="高级强化提取芯片"/>
	<string key="T4340003"/>
	<string key="N4190001" kor="인챈트칩 - 근접무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Melee" eng="Enchant Chip - Melee" tur="Enchant Chip - Melee" fre="Enchant Chip - Mêlée" rus="Enchant Chip - Melee" cns="强化芯片-近战武器"/>
	<string key="T4190001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}근접무기에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Nahkampf-Waffen geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Melee weapons only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Melee silahları için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Mêlée seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для оружия ближнего боя." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于近战武器"/>
	<string key="N4200001" kor="인챈트칩 - 연사무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Rifle" eng="Enchant Chip - Rifle" tur="Enchant Chip - Rifle" fre="Enchant Chip - Rifle" rus="Enchant Chip - Rifle" cns="强化芯片-连发武器"/>
	<string key="T4200001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}연사무기에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Gewehre geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Rifle weapons only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Rifle türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Rifle seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для ружей." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于连发武器"/>
	<string key="N4210001" kor="인챈트칩 - 단발무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Guns" eng="Enchant Chip - Guns" tur="Enchant Chip - Guns" fre="Enchant Chip - Guns" rus="Enchant Chip - Guns" cns="强化芯片-点射武器"/>
	<string key="T4210001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}단발무기에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Schusswaffen geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Guns only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Guns türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Guns seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для пистолетов." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于点射武器"/>
	<string key="N4220001" kor="인챈트칩 - 중화기" ger="Enchant Chip - Heavy Gun" eng="Enchant Chip - Heavy Gun" tur="Enchant Chip - Heavy Gun" fre="Enchant Chip - Heavy Gun" rus="Enchant Chip - Heavy Gun" cns="强化芯片-重型武器"/>
	<string key="T4220001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}중화기에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für schwere Waffen geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Heavy Guns only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Heavy Guns türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Heavy Gun seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для тяжелого оружия." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于重型武器"/>
	<string key="N4230001" kor="인챈트칩 - 저격무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Sniper" eng="Enchant Chip - Sniper" tur="Enchant Chip - Sniper" fre="Enchant Chip - Sniper" rus="Enchant Chip - Sniper" cns="强化芯片-狙击武器"/>
	<string key="T4230001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}저격무기에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Scharfschützen-Gewehre geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Sniper weapons only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Sniper türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Sniper seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для снайперского оружия." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于狙击武器"/>
	<string key="N4240001" kor="인챈트칩 - 설치무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Installation" eng="Enchant Chip - Installation" tur="Enchant Chip - Installation" fre="Enchant Chip - Installation" rus="Enchant Chip - Installation" cns="强化芯片-特殊武器"/>
	<string key="T4240001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}설치무기에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Installations-Waffen geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Installation weapons only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Installation türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Installation seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для устанавливаемого оружия." cns="可用于强化特殊武器的芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}在强化界面使用"/>
	<string key="N4350001" kor="인챈트칩 - 특수무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Special" eng="Enchant Chip - Special" tur="Enchant Chip - Special" fre="Enchant Chip - Spéciales" rus="Enchant Chip - Special" cns="强化芯片-特殊武器"/>
	<string key="T4350001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}특수무기에 사용 가능합니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}회복 계열 무기 -&gt; 공격력 = 회복력" ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Spezial-Waffen geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Special weapons only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Special türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Spéciales seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для особого оружия." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于特殊武器"/>
	<string key="N4250001" kor="인챈트칩 - 투척무기" ger="Enchant Chip - Throw" eng="Enchant Chip - Throw" tur="Enchant Chip - Throw" fre="Enchant Chip - Throw" rus="Enchant Chip - Throw" cns="强化芯片-投掷武器"/>
	<string key="T4250001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}투척무기에 사용 가능합니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}회복 계열 무기 -&gt; 공격력 = 회복력" ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Wurf-Waffen geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Throw weapons only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Throw türü silahlar için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les armes Throw seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для метательного оружия." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于投掷武器"/>
	<string key="N4260001" kor="인챈트칩 - 헤어" ger="Enchant Chip - Hair" eng="Enchant Chip - Hair" tur="Enchant Chip - Hair" fre="Enchant Chip - Hair" spa="" ita="" rus="Enchant Chip - Hair" ame="" cns="强化芯片-发型" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4260001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}헤어에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Frisur-Items geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Hair items only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Hair slotu eşyaları için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les cheveux seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для предметов категории «Прическа»." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于发型"/>
	<string key="N4270001" kor="인챈트칩 - 얼굴" ger="Enchant Chip - Face" eng="Enchant Chip - Face" tur="Enchant Chip - Face" fre="Enchant Chip - Face" spa="" ita="" rus="Enchant Chip - Face" ame="" cns="强化芯片-脸型" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4270001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}얼굴에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Gesicht-Items geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Face items only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Face slotu eşyaları için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les visages seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для предметов категории «Лицо»." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于脸型"/>
