	<string key="T4330001" kor="위의 인챈트를 적용 할 수 있는 인챈트칩입니다.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}펫에 사용 가능합니다." ger="Benutze diesen Chip, um ein Item zu verbessern.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Nur für Pets geeignet." eng="Use this Chip to enchant an item.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} For Pet items only." tur="Bu çiple eşya güçlendirin.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Sadece Petler için." fre="Utilisez cette Chip pour enchanter un objet.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Pour les familiers seulement." rus="Чип позволяет зачаровать предмет.{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255} Только для питомцев." cns="可以使用以上强化的强化芯片{N}{N}{CB-255,0,0,255}适用于宠物"/>
	<string key="N6000049" kor="Spring Coin" ger="Spring Coin" eng="Spring Coin" tur="Spring Coin" fre="Spring Coin" spa="Spring Coin" rus="Spring Coin" cns="春日硬币"/>
	<string key="T6000049" kor="2016 Spring Event Coin" ger="Collect these Spring Coins to exchange for various Event Boxes." eng="Collect these Spring Coins to exchange for various Event Boxes." tur="Collect these Spring Coins to exchange for various Event Boxes." fre="Collect these Spring Coins to exchange for various Event Boxes." spa="Collect these Spring Coins to exchange for various Event Boxes." rus="Собирай весенние монеты и меняй их на коробки события." cns="2016春日活动硬币"/>
	<string key="N1061190" kor="자허 레스피레이터" ger="Leo Gas Mask" eng="Leo Gas Mask" tur="Leo Gas Mask" fre="Leo Guard Mask" rus="Leo Gas Mask" cns="忍者喵（男）面具"/>
	<string key="T1061190" kor="쓰으읍- 후- 나는 네… 아, 이게 아니지." ger="Stylisch und nützlich: Mit dieser Maske siehst du cool aus und sie schützt vor tödlichem Gas.    " eng="The stylish way to keep toxins at bay!    " tur="Toksinleri uzak tutmak için şık bir yol.    " fre="La manière la plus stylée de ne pas s'empoisonner.    " rus="Модный способ защититься от ядов!    " cns="被强制进行了生化改造的男性忍者喵面具。"/>
	<string key="N1001190" kor="자허 투 바이 에잇" ger="Leo Two-Tone Hair" eng="Leo Two-Tone Hair" tur="Leo Two-Tone Hair" fre="Leo Two-tone Hair" rus="Leo Two-Tone Hair" cns="忍者喵（男）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001190" kor="저절로 이렇게 된단 말이지, 이게." ger="Damit gibt es keinen Bad Hair Day mehr!" eng="Looking good is easy with hair like this!" tur="Böyle bir saç ile iyi görünmek işten bile değil!" fre="Avec une coiffure pareille, pas besoin de peigne." rus="С такой прической ты смотришься на все сто!" cns="被强制进行了生化改造的男性忍者喵发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021190" kor="자허 스컬 라이더 재킷" ger="Leo Skullrider Jacket" eng="Leo Skullrider Jacket" tur="Leo Skullrider Jacket" fre="Leo Skullrider Jacket" rus="Leo Skullrider Jacket" cns="忍者喵（男）复古夹克"/>
	<string key="T1021190" kor="양갈래라니. 제법 미인이잖아? 아, 아니, 해골 얘기라고!" ger="Ganz schön wild! In dieser Jacke kämpft es sich noch besser!  " eng="Gear up for a ride... er, fight!  " tur="Yolculuk için hazır lan... Şey, savaşmak için yani!  " fre="En avant pour la balade... Euh, la bagarre !  " rus="Собирайся в поездку... то есть, в драку!  " cns="被强制进行了生化改造的男性忍者喵上衣。"/>
	<string key="N1031190" kor="자허 피스 스키니" ger="Leo Skinny Jeans" eng="Leo Skinny Jeans" tur="Leo Skinny Jeans" fre="Leo Skinny Jeans" rus="Leo Skinny Jeans" cns="忍者喵（男）修身皮裤"/>
	<string key="T1031190" kor="Peace!" ger="Die sind so eng, die sehen aus wie eine zweite Haut!" eng="They're practically painted on!" tur="Neredeyse yok gibiler!" fre="Ce pantalon pourrait être une œuvre d'art." rus="Такие тонкие, что как будто нарисованы!" cns="被强制进行了生化改造的男性忍者喵裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041190" kor="자허 숏 글러브" ger="Leo Short Gloves" eng="Leo Short Gloves" tur="Leo Short Gloves" fre="Leo Short Gloves" rus="Leo Short Gloves" cns="忍者喵（男）短手套"/>
	<string key="T1041190" kor="물러나! 그 녀석이… 나를 지배하려 하고 있어…!" ger="Kämpfen, ohne Fingerabdrücke zu hinterlassen? Und dann dieser coole Style? Genial!   " eng="Fight in style, and leave no fingerprints.   " tur="Şık bir şekilde savaş, ortalıkta parmak izi bırakma!   " fre="Le style des mitaines, la discrétion des gants.   " rus="И подраться можно, и отпечатков не останется.   " cns="被强制进行了生化改造的男性忍者喵手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051190" kor="자허 캣 슈즈" ger="Leo Feline Shoes" eng="Leo Feline Shoes" tur="Leo Feline Shoes" fre="Leo Feline Shoes" rus="Leo Feline Shoes" cns="忍者喵（男）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051190" kor="발소리도 나지 않고, 벽에 매달리기도 좋지. 어엉?{N}귀여워서 신고 있는게 아니라고!" ger="Auf leisen Katzenpfoten schleichst du dich heran und dann ... {N}findet dich keiner mehr knuffig." eng="This feline footwear allows you to sneak up on your enemies silently... {N}They'll never call you &quot;cute&quot; again!" tur="Bu kedigiller tarzındaki ayakkabılar düşmanlarına sinsice yaklaşmanı sağlar... {N}Sana bir daha asla &quot;sevimli&quot; diyemeyecekler!" fre="Ces chaussures trop classes vous octroieront la grâce du félin. {N}On ne risque plus de vous traiter de mignon." rus="В мягких кошачьих ботинках так удобно подкрадываться...{N}Враги узнают, что с кошками шутки плохи!" cns="被强制进行了生化改造的男性忍者喵鞋子。{N}穿上它可以轻松地飞檐走壁，而且悄无声息！"/>
	<string key="N1011191" kor="토르테 앙고라 스타일" ger="Violet Makeup" eng="Violet Makeup" tur="Violet Makeup" fre="Violet Makeup" rus="Violet Makeup" cns="忍者喵（女）脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011191" kor="흰 피부에 붉은 눈은 터키시 앙고라의 자부심이죠.{N}그런데 터키시 앙고라… 가 뭐죠?" ger="Blickt man einer Katze zu tief in ihre schöne Augen, hat das eine ganz hypnotische Wirkung.  " eng="Don't stare too long into a cat's eyes, lest you find yourself hypnotized...  " tur="Kedinin gözlerine çok uzun süre bakma, yoksa hipnotize olursun...  " fre="Ne la fixez pas trop longtemps, vous risqueriez d'y perdre un œil.  " rus="Нельзя смотреть кошке в глаза слишком долго, иначе она тебя загипнотизирует...  " cns="被强制进行了生化改造的女性忍者喵脸型。"/>
	<string key="N1001191" kor="토르테 트윈 테일" ger="Violet Twin Ponytail" eng="Violet Twin Ponytail" tur="Violet Twin Ponytail" fre="Violet Twin Ponytail" rus="Violet Twin Ponytail" cns="忍者喵（女）双马尾发型"/>
	<string key="T1001191" kor="그렇게 제 멋대로 만지면, 으, 기껏 정리한 머리가…" ger="Anschauen erlaubt, Anfassen nicht! Hast du eine Ahnung, wie lang es dauert, so einen Pony zu richten?!" eng="Look, but don't touch... This took forever to get right!" tur="Bak ama dokunma... Düzgünce şekillendirmesi çok uzun sürdü!" fre="Pas touche, minouche ! C'est tout un art de faire une tresse aussi belle." rus="Смотри, но не трогай! Это целую вечность заняло!" cns="被强制进行了生化改造的女性忍者喵发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021191" kor="토르테 벨 레오타드" ger="Violet Bell Leotard" eng="Violet Bell Leotard" tur="Violet Bell Leotard" fre="Violet Bell Leotard" rus="Violet Bell Leotard" cns="忍者喵（女）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021191" kor="방울? 역시 조금 무겁네요.{N}하지만 왠지 떼어버리면 안될 것 같은 느낌이…" ger="Schmeiß dich in diesen heißen Fummel und kämpfe ohne Extraballast! Wie befreiend sich das anfühlt ... " eng="Drop the extra baggage and fight in style with this form-fitting leotard. " tur="Fazlalıklardan kurtul ve bu sıkı dansçı giysisi ile şık bir şekilde savaş. " fre="Pas de fioriture, une tenue parfaite pour les acrobaties. " rus="Стильное трико для элегантной драки. " cns="被强制进行了生化改造的女性忍者喵上衣。{N}悄悄告诉你，脖子上的铃铛是为了防止她逃跑。"/>
	<string key="N1031191" kor="토르테 언더 타이즈" ger="Violet Leggings" eng="Violet Leggings" tur="Violet Leggings" fre="Violet Leggings" rus="Violet Leggings" cns="忍者喵（女）打底裤"/>
	<string key="T1031191" kor="역시 가리는건 조금 아깝죠?" ger="Leggins sind noch lange nicht out. Außerdem kannst du dich darin blitzschnell bewegen und hast die volle Beinfreiheit." eng="Stay at tip-top fighting speed with these form-fitting leggings." tur="Bu sıkı pantolonlarla çok hızlı bir şekilde savaşabilirsin." fre="Au top de la classe pendant les combats. Maniez la vitesse et l'élégance." rus="Совсем не сковывают движения – максимальная свобода в драке." cns="被强制进行了生化改造的女性忍者喵裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041191" kor="토르테 롱 글러브" ger="Violet Long Gloves" eng="Violet Long Gloves" tur="Violet Long Gloves" fre="Violet Long Gloves" rus="Violet Long Gloves" cns="忍者喵（女）长手套"/>
	<string key="T1041191" kor="더러운 손으로 함부로 잡지 말아요!" ger="Du willst Händchenhalten? Dann wasch dir erstmal die Pfoten, sonst werden meine stylischen Handschuhe dreckig!" eng="Take me by the hand... just make sure your hands are clean first!" tur="Elimden tut... Ellerinin temiz olduğundan emin ol!" fre="Prends ma main... Mais assure-toi qu'elle soit bien propre." rus="Возьми меня за руку... Только сначала руки помой!" cns="被强制进行了生化改造的女性忍者喵手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051191" kor="토르테 캣 슈즈" ger="Violet Feline Shoes" eng="Violet Feline Shoes" tur="Violet Feline Shoes" fre="Violet Feline Shoes" rus="Violet Feline Shoes" cns="忍者喵（女）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051191" kor="도주 방지용 방울? 장식이 아니었어요?" ger="Das Glöckchen ist nicht zur Zierde da ... Wofür es dann gut ist? Sagen wir einfach, wenn du es erklingen hörst, solltest du um dein Leben laufen ..." eng="The bell isn't just for show... By the time they hear you coming, it's too late!" tur="Çan sadece süs amaçlı değil... Yaklaştığını duydukları an çok geç olacak!" fre="La clochette n'est pas qu'une décoration. Quand vous l'entendrez, il sera déjà trop tard." rus="Когда они тебя услышат, будет уже поздно!" cns="被强制进行了生化改造的女性忍者喵鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N2000065" kor="바스테트 쇼크" ger="Vital Claw" eng="Vital Claw" tur="Vital Claw" fre="Vital claw" rus="Vital Claw" cns="太阳之女"/>
	<string key="T2000065" kor="자허의 유니크 바이탈 쇼크.{N}시범용으로 개발중이던 바이탈 쇼크의 데이터를 빼돌려 제작하였다. 제작자는 불명.{N}고양이 머리를 한 여신의 이름을 붙였다. 상징은 가족과 사랑." ger="Eine einzigartige Version der Vital Shock.{N}Diese Waffe wurde nach dem Vorbild{N}eines gestohlenen Prototyps konstruiert. " eng="A unique Leo Vital Shock.{N}Based on a stolen prototype of an unknown creator,{N}this Vital Shock is modeled after deadly feline claws. " tur="Benzersiz bir Leo Vital Shock.{N}Yaratıcısı bilinmeyen ve çalıntı bir prototipten esinlenilmiş{N}bu Vital Shock, efsanevi kedi başlı tanrıçadan ismini almıştır. " fre="Une Leo Vital Shock unique.{N}Modelée sur un prototype, dont le concepteur est inconnu.{N}Cette Vital Shock tire sa forme des griffes d'une déesse à tête de chat. " rus="Уникальный Leo Vital Shock.{N}Созданный на основе украденного прототипа неизвестного происхождения,{N}этот Vital Shock похож на кошачьи когти. " cns="忍者喵的特典死亡冲击。{N}在死亡冲击上添加了太阳之女的祝福，命中率翻倍哦！"/>
	<string key="N4035439" kor="자허 캡슐" ger="Leo Capsule" eng="Leo Capsule" tur="Leo Capsule" fre="Capsule Leo" rus="Leo Capsule" cns="忍者喵（男）扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035439" kor="자허 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Eine Kapsel mit Leo-Kostüm-Items. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule with Leo costume items. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Leo kostümü eşyalarının bulunduğu bir kapsül. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Une capsule qui contient un objet de costume de Leo. {N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула с предметами для костюма Leo.{N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得忍者喵（男）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035440" kor="토르테 캡슐" ger="Violet Capsule" eng="Violet Capsule" tur="Violet Capsule" fre="Capsule Violet" spa="" ita="" rus="Violet Capsule" ame="" cns="忍者喵（女）扭蛋" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4035440" kor="토르테 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Eine Kapsel mit Violet-Kostüm-Items. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule with Violet costume items. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Violet kostümü eşyalarının bulunduğu bir kapsül. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Une capsule qui contient un objet de costume de Violet. {N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула с предметами для костюма Violet.{N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得忍者喵（女）套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
