	<string key="T4035442" kor="G의 레드 크리스탈 플라즈마 스워드 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." cns="可以获得G的红色水晶重剑的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035443" kor="G의 레드 어쌔신 대거 캡슐" eng="" fre="" spa="" ita="" rus="" ame="" cns="G的红色刺客匕首扭蛋" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T4035443" kor="G의 레드 어쌔신 대거 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." cns="可以获得G的红色刺客匕首的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N1061192" kor="비트 세일러 베레" ger="Davy's Sailor Beret" eng="Davy's Sailor Beret" tur="Davy's Sailor Beret" fre="Davy's Sailor Beret" rus="Davy's Sailor Beret" cns="皇家水兵（男）贝雷帽"/>
	<string key="T1061192" kor="넷스피어의 항해사들이 애용하는 베레모.{N}실용적이진 않지만 멋있다!" ger="Eine Baskenmütze der Netsphere-Matrosen.{N}Nicht praktisch, aber ziemlich cool!" eng="A beret worn by Netsphere sailors.{N}It's not practical, but at least it looks cool!" tur="Netsphere denizcilerinin taktığı bir bere.{N}Kullanışlı değil fakat en azından havalı görünüyor!" fre="C'est un béret très prisé chez les marins de la Netsphere.{N}Il n'est pas très pratique, mais... vous avez l'air tellement cool !" rus="Берет, который носят моряки Netsphere.{N}Непрактичный, но зато как выглядит!" cns="梦想征服大海的男性皇家水兵帽子。{N}立正！敬礼！"/>
	<string key="N1021192" kor="비트 세일러 볼레로 " ger="Davy's Sailor Jacket " eng="Davy's Sailor Jacket " tur="Davy's Sailor Jacket " fre="Davy's Sailor Jacket " rus="Davy's Sailor Jacket " cns="皇家水兵（男）礼服"/>
	<string key="T1021192" kor="넷스피어의 남성 항해사들에게 지정되었었던 옛 제식 복장.{N}사실 제대로 소화할 수 있는 사람이 없어서 폐기되었었다." ger="Teil der männlichen Netsphere-Matrosen-Uniform.{N}Putze dich mit dieser eleganten Jacke heraus und setz die Segel für ein neues Abenteuer!" eng="Part of a uniform worn by male Netsphere sailors.{N}Deck yourself out in these dapper duds and set sail for a high-seas adventure!" tur="Netsphere erkek denizci üniformasının bir parçası.{N}Bu zarif ceketi giyip açık denizlerdeki maceralara yelken açabilirsin!" fre="C'est l'uniforme réglementaire des marins de la Netsphere.{N}Fringants moussaillons, c'est l'heure de mettre les voiles vers de nouvelles aventures !" rus="Часть униформы моряков Netsphere.{N}Тот, кто выходит в море, должен быть одет с иголочки!" cns="梦想征服大海的男性皇家水兵礼服。{N}根据旧式海军制服改造。"/>
	<string key="N1031192" kor="비트 세일러 팬츠" ger="Davy's Sailor Pants" eng="Davy's Sailor Pants" tur="Davy's Sailor Pants" fre="Davy's Sailor Pants" rus="Davy's Sailor Pants" cns="皇家水兵（男）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031192" kor="넷스피어의 남성 항해사들에게 지정되었었던 옛 제식 복장.{N}이쪽은 무난한 면바지로 시원한 컬러감이 인기가 높다." ger="Teil der männlichen Netsphere-Matrosen-Uniform.{N}Diese Hosen sind für das Leben auf dem Meer perfekt geeignet." eng="Part of a uniform worn by male Netsphere sailors.{N}Its bright, fade-resistant fabric is well suited to the salty sea air." tur="Netsphere erkek denizci üniformasının bir parçası.{N}Açık renkli ve solmayan kumaşı, tuzlu deniz havası için idealdir." fre="C'est l'uniforme réglementaire des marins de la Netsphere.{N}Son tissu méga flashy anti-décoloration est conçu pour résister aux agressions de l'air iodé." rus="Часть униформы моряков Netsphere.{N}Яркая ткань сохраняет свой цвет даже в соленом морском воздухе." cns="梦想征服大海的男性皇家水兵裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041192" kor="비트 세일러 글러브" ger="Davy's Sailor Gloves" eng="Davy's Sailor Gloves" tur="Davy's Sailor Gloves" fre="Davy's Sailor Gloves" rus="Davy's Sailor Gloves" cns="皇家水兵（男）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041192" kor="넷스피어의 항해사들이 애용하는 작업용 장갑." ger="Ein Paar Handschuhe männlicher Netsphere-Matrosen." eng="A pair of gloves worn by male Netsphere sailors." tur="Netsphere'in erkek denizcilerinin taktığı bir eldiven." fre="Ces gants sont très prisés chez les marins de la Netsphere." rus="Такие перчатки носят моряки Netsphere." cns="梦想征服大海的男性皇家水兵手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051192" kor="비트 세일러 보트슈즈" ger="Davy's Sailor Shoes" eng="Davy's Sailor Shoes" tur="Davy's Sailor Shoes" fre="Davy's Sailor Shoes" rus="Davy's Sailor Shoes" cns="皇家水兵（男）船鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051192" kor="넷스피어의 남성 항해사들에게 지정되었었던 옛 제식 구두.{N}깔끔한 디자인으로 인해 레어 아이템으로 급 부상 중." ger="Wasserdichte Schuhe der männlichen Netsphere-Matrosen.{N}Das einzigartige, nautische Design macht sie zu einem Hit für Jung und Alt." eng="A pair of waterproof shoes worn by male Netsphere sailors{N}Its unique, nautical design makes it a popular choice for young and old salts alike." tur="Netsphere'in erkek denizciklerin giydiği ayakkabılar{N}Benzersiz ve denizde kullanım için özel tasarımı sayesinde hem genç hem de yaşlı denizcilere severek kullanabiliyor." fre="Ces chaussures waterproof sont très prisées chez les marins de la Netsphere.{N}Grâce à leur design « navy-style », elles sont devenues un modèle de référence, tant chez les jeunes moussaillons que chez les vieux loups de mer." rus="Водостойкие ботинки моряков Netsphere{N}Морской дизайн делает их популярными и у старых морских волков, и у начинающих покорителей морей." cns="梦想征服大海的男性皇家水兵鞋子。{N}干净的设计是鞋子受欢迎的主要原因。"/>
	<string key="N1061193" kor="아쿠아 세일러 햇" ger="Nautica's Sailor Hat" eng="Nautica's Sailor Hat" tur="Nautica's Sailor Hat" fre="Nautica's Sailor Hat" rus="Nautica's Sailor Hat" cns="皇家水兵（女）帽子"/>
	<string key="T1061193" kor="넷스피어의 여성 항해사들이 애용하는 모자.{N}여러가지 장식을 달아서 리폼하는 것이 유행." ger="Der Hut der weiblichen Netsphere-Matrosen.{N}Simpel, aber dadurch umso eleganter!" eng="A hat worn by female Netsphere sailors.{N}Its elegant simplicity leaves room for further accessorizing, making it a popular summer choice." tur="Netsphere'in kadın denizciklerin giydiği ayakkabılar{N}Zarif sadeliği sayesinde başka aksesuarlarla kullanılabiliyor ve bu sayede yazın çok tercih ediliyor." fre="Les plus jolies corsaires de la Netsphere ADORENT cette coiffe.{N}Grâce à son design simple et indémodable, elle est très facile à personnaliser. C'est le must-have de l'été !" rus="Такую шляпку носят морячки Netsphere.{N}Простая и элегантная, она дает возможность добавить аксессуаров, что делает ее такой популярной летом." cns="梦想征服大海的女性皇家水兵帽子。"/>
	<string key="N1021193" kor="아쿠아 세일러 톱" ger="Nautica's Sailor Top" eng="Nautica's Sailor Top" tur="Nautica's Sailor Top" fre="Nautica's Sailor Top" rus="Nautica's Sailor Top" cns="皇家水兵（女）礼服"/>
	<string key="T1021193" kor="넷스피어의 항해사들이 입었던 옷을 귀엽고 깜찍하게 리폼한 버전." ger="Ein hübsches Top, wie es weibliche Netsphere-Matrosen tragen." eng="A cute, custom top worn by female Netsphere sailors." tur="Netsphere'in kadın denizcilerinin giydiği sevimli ve özel tasarım bir bluz." fre="Les plus jolies corsaires de la Netsphere ADORENT ce haut tout mignon." rus="Милая блуза, которую носят морячки Netsphere." cns="梦想征服大海的女性皇家水兵礼服。"/>
	<string key="N1031193" kor="아쿠아 세일러 숏" ger="Nautica's Sailor Shorts" eng="Nautica's Sailor Shorts" tur="Nautica's Sailor Shorts" fre="Nautica's Sailor Shorts" rus="Nautica's Sailor Shorts" cns="皇家水兵（女）短裤"/>
	<string key="T1031193" kor="넷스피어의 항해사들과는 관계없는 숏팬츠.{N}여름엔 역시 시원하고 귀여운 숏팬츠. 허벅지에 묶은 장식이 귀여움 업!업!" ger="Diese Shorts sind perfekt für den Sommer!{N}Sie kommen außerdem mit einem extra Strumpfband daher." eng="These shorts are a favorite choice for ladies lounging about on hot summer days.{N} Plus, it comes with a bonus thigh accessory that pushes cuteness to the limit!" tur="Bu şort, yazın güneşte vakit geçirmek isteyen hanımların favorisi.{N} Ayrıca, sevimliliği maksimuma çıkaran bir baldır aksesuarı da beraberinde geliyor!" fre="Rien de plus confortable pour faire sa bronzette sur la croisette.{N}En plus, ce petit ruban sur la cuisse est super craquant. Attention, vous allez repousser les limites de la mimitude !" rus="Такие шорты отлично подойдут тем, кто хочет прогуляться в жаркий летний день.{N} А украшение на бедре делает их просто неотразимыми!" cns="梦想征服大海的女性皇家水兵短裤。{N}夏天就是要穿凉爽可爱的短裤，腿上系的装饰大幅提升了可爱度！"/>
	<string key="N1041193" kor="아쿠아 세일러 핸드워머" ger="Nautica's Sailor Gloves" eng="Nautica's Sailor Gloves" tur="Nautica's Sailor Gloves" fre="Nautica's Sailor Gloves" rus="Nautica's Sailor Gloves" cns="皇家水兵（女）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041193" kor="넷스피어에서 가장 인기있는 오픈핑거 스타일의 핸드워머.{N}이름은 핸드워머지만 여름용 소재로 되어있어 오히려 시원하다." ger="Ein Paar Halbhandschuhe. Die sind in der Netsphere besonders beliebt.{N}Sie gewähren volle Bewegungsfreiheit  und büßen dabei nicht an Stil ein!" eng="A pair of open-finger gloves popular in the Netsphere.{N}Its unique design protects the hands while granting freedom of motion, a necessity on the high seas. Plus, it makes the wearer both look and feel cool!" tur="Netsphere denizcilerinin taktığı kesik parmaklı bir eldiven.{N}Eşsiz tasarımı bir yandan elleri korurken diğer yandan denizlerde çok önemli olan hareket özgürlüğünü sağlıyor. Aynı zamanda, giyen kişiyi hem rahat hem de havalı gösteriyor." fre="Les plus jolies corsaires de la Netsphere ADORENT ces petites mitaines.{N}Les mains sont protégées, mais on peut quand même bouger les doigts (ça alors !). Grâce à ce must-have pour les virées en haute-mer, vous aurez toujours la classe !" rus="Перчатки с открытыми пальцами, популярные в Netsphere.{N}Защищают руки, но дают свободу пальцам, что так важно на море. К тому же они приятные на ощупь и отлично выглядят!" cns="梦想征服大海的女性皇家水兵手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051193" kor="아쿠아 세일러 슈즈" ger="Nautica's Sailor Shoes" eng="Nautica's Sailor Shoes" tur="Nautica's Sailor Shoes" fre="Nautica's Sailor Shoes" rus="Nautica's Sailor Shoes" cns="皇家水兵（女）鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051193" kor="옛 선원들의 신발에서 모티브를 얻은 깜찍한 구두." ger="Ein Paar wasserdichter Schuhe. Sie erinnern an jene, die man früher in der Marine getragen hat." eng="A pair of trendy waterproof shoes with a design inspired by traditional navy footwear." tur="Geleneksel denizci ayakkabılarından esinlenilmiş bir tasarıma sahip, çok popüler ve su geçirmez ayakkabılar." fre="Ces chaussures waterproof au design navy-style se sont imposées comme la nouvelle référence de l'été 2016." rus="Модные водостойкие ботинки с дизайном, напоминающим о традиционной обуви моряков." cns="梦想征服大海的女性皇家水兵皮鞋。"/>
