	<string key="N1011194" kor="No.2 삽오 스타일" ger="Blue Revolution Styling" eng="Blue Revolution Styling" tur="Blue Revolution Styling" fre="Blue Revolution Styling" rus="Blue Revolution Styling" cns="科学怪人脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011194" kor="도스코 시즌2 남성 부문 1위 IWannaBeTheBoshy의 No.2 삽오 스타일 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}메이크업이 사람을 만든다… 알아?" ger="Das Blue Revolution Style von IWannaBeTheBoshy, dem Gewinner für Männeroutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Ich erkenne dich gar nicht wieder! Verstehste?" eng="Blue Revolution Styling by IWannaBeTheBoshy, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}Is that your real face? Or did you make it up?" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin erkek kazananı olan IWannaBeTheBoshy'den Blue Revolution Styling{N}{N}Kişiyi gösteren makyajıdır... Ne demek istediğimi anladın mı?" fre="Blue Revolution Styling, par IWannaBeTheBoshy, gagnant de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}Le maquillage, ça change absolument tout ! Vous ne trouvez pas ?" rus="Прическа Blue Revolution от IWannaBeTheBoshy, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Это твое настоящее лицо? Или грим?" cns="想法离奇、行为古怪的科学怪人脸型。{N}俊秀的五官不论搭配什么衣服，都显得十分迷人。"/>
	<string key="N1021194" kor="No.2 삽오 트렌치 코트" ger="Blue Revolution Trenchcoat" eng="Blue Revolution Trenchcoat" tur="Blue Revolution Trenchcoat" fre="Blue Revolution Trenchcoat" rus="Blue Revolution Trenchcoat" cns="科学怪人外套"/>
	<string key="T1021194" kor="도스코 시즌2 남성 부문 1위 IWannaBeTheBoshy의 No.2 삽오 트렌치 코트 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}오래된 자켓이지만, 클래식한 라인은 언제나 옳지." ger="Der Blue Revolution Trench Coat von IWannaBeTheBoshy, dem Gewinner für Männeroutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Ein Klassiker, mit dem man nichts falsch machen kann." eng="Blue Revolution Coat by IWannaBeTheBoshy, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}This jacket isn't old... it's classic!" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin erkek kazananı olan IWannaBeTheBoshy'den Blue Revolution Trenchcoat {N}{N}Eski bir ceket fakat klasik çizgiler klasik kesimler daima kalıcıdır." fre="Blue Revolution Trenchcoat, par IWannaBeTheBoshy, gagnant de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}On peut faire des miracles avec des coupes vintage !" rus="Пальто Blue Revolution от IWannaBeTheBoshy, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Оно не старое, оно винтажное!" cns="想法离奇、行为古怪的科学怪人外套。{N}高贵的皇家蓝外套，让他显得与众不同。"/>
