	<string key="T1041194" kor="도스코 시즌2 남성 부문 1위 IWannaBeTheBoshy의 No.2 삽오 글러브 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}눈에 잘 띄지 않는 부분까지도 신경을 써야 하는 법이지." ger="Die Blue Revolution Gloves von IWannaBeTheBoshy, dem Gewinner für Männeroutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Immer auf die Details achten!" eng="Blue Revolution Gloves by IWannaBeTheBoshy, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}Always pay attention to the details." tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin erkek kazananı olan IWannaBeTheBoshy'den Blue Revolution Gloves {N}{N}Ayrıntılara özen göstermelisin." fre="Blue Revolution Gloves, par IWannaBeTheBoshy, gagnant de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}Il faut faire attention à chaque petit détail." rus="Перчатки Blue Revolution от IWannaBeTheBoshy, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Все дело в деталях." cns="想法离奇、行为古怪的科学怪人手套。{N}高贵的皇家蓝手套，让他显得与众不同。"/>
