	<string key="T1051194" kor="도스코 시즌2 남성 부문 1위 IWannaBeTheBoshy의 No.2 삽오 슈즈 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}신발은 내 취향으로 바꿔봤지만, 맘에 들지?" ger="Die Blue Revolution Shoes von IWannaBeTheBoshy, dem Gewinner für Männeroutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Welche Schuhe ziehe ich nur an? Sieht das so gut aus?" eng="Blue Revolution Shoes by IWannaBeTheBoshy, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}These shoes perfectly sum up my personality. You like them, right?" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin erkek kazananı olan IWannaBeTheBoshy'den Blue Revolution Shoes {N}{N}Ayakkabıları zevkime hitap edecek şekilde değiştirdim. Hoşuna gitti, değil mi?" fre="Blue Revolution Shoes, par IWannaBeTheBoshy, gagnant de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}Ces chaussures sont plus à mon goût. Qu'en pensez-vous ?" rus="Ботинки Blue Revolution от IWannaBeTheBoshy, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Ботинки – отражение моей души. Как тебе, нравятся?" cns="想法离奇、行为古怪的科学怪人鞋子。{N}高贵的皇家蓝鞋子，让他显得与众不同。"/>
