	<string key="T1001195" kor="도스코 시즌2 여성 부문 1위 All.Green의 네온사인:그린 헤어 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}짧은 머리도 매력적이지만, 이런 스타일을 원했던거지?" ger="Dem Gewinner für Frauenoutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Kurzes Haar sieht auch gut aus, aber du wolltest eher sowas, oder? " eng="Green Neon Hair by All.Green, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}Short hair also suits you, but you wanted something like this, right?" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin kadın kazananı olan All.Green'den Green Neon Hair {N}{N}Kısa saçta sana yakışıyor fakat böyle bir şey istemiştin, değil mi?" fre="Green Neon Hair par la gagnante de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}Les cheveux courts, ça vous va bien aussi. C'est à ça que vous pensiez ?" rus="Волосы Green Neon от All.Green, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Короткие волосы тебе тоже идут, но ведь тебе хочется что-то эдакое, правда?" cns="某天突然出现在实验室的神秘女子发型。{N}荧光绿色的发型，让她显得十分神秘。"/>
	<string key="N1011195" kor="네온사인:그린 스타일" ger="Green Neon Styling" eng="Green Neon Styling" tur="Green Neon Styling" fre="Green Neon Styling" spa="" ita="" rus="Green Neon Styling" ame="" cns="幻影魅魔脸型" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T1011195" kor="도스코 시즌2 여성 부문 1위 All.Green의 네온사인:그린 스타일 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}전체적인 톤에 맞춰봤어. 괜찮네. 응, 좋아." ger="Dem Gewinner für Frauenoutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Jetzt passt es besser zum Rest. Cool. Sieht super aus." eng="Green Neon Styling by All.Green, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}I tried to match the overall tone... Nice! Looking good!" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin kadın kazananı olan All.Green'denGreen Neon Styling {N}{N}Genel tonuna uydurdum. Güzel oldu. Evet, gerçekten iyi görünüyor." fre="Green Neon Styling par la gagnante de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}J'ai voulu adopter des tons osés. Je trouve que ça vous va à ravir !" rus="Прическа Green Neon от All.Green, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Хотелось подобрать цвет к образу... Кажется, получилось!" cns="某天突然出现在实验室的神秘女子脸型。{N}脸上从未有过任何表情，但总让人觉得似曾相识。"/>
