	<string key="T1021195" kor="도스코 시즌2 여성 부문 1위 All.Green의 네온사인:그린 비키니탑 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}이걸 이렇게 매치할 줄이야… 솔직히 좀 놀랐어!" ger="Dem Gewinner für Frauenoutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Oh, das passt ja richtig gut zusammen ... wie unerwartet." eng="Green Neon Bikini Top by All.Green, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}I never thought these would go together... what a surprise!" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin kadın kazananı olan All.Green'den Green Neon Bikini Top {N}{N}Bunların uyacağı hiç aklıma gelmezdi... Çok şaşırdım!" fre="Green Neon Bikini Top par la gagnante de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}Je n'aurais jamais cru qu'on pouvait les associer. Je suis stupéfaite !" rus="Верх купальника Green Neon от All.Green, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Они так подходят друг к другу... Вот так сюрприз!" cns="某天突然出现在实验室的神秘女子上衣。{N}荧光绿色的上衣，让她显得十分神秘。"/>
