	<string key="T1031195" kor="도스코 시즌2 여성 부문 1위 All.Green의 네온사인:그린 팬츠 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}사이토닉이 굉장히 예쁘지. 나도 좋아해." ger="Dem Gewinner für Frauenoutfits von Koreas Next Top Model S2 {N}{N}Psytonic ist einfach der Wahnsinn. Mir gefällt es auch!" eng="Green Neon Pants by All.Green, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}Style and comfort, all in one!  " tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin kadın kazananı olan All.Green'den Green Neon Pants {N}{N}Psytonic muhteşem görünüyor. Benim de hoşuma gitti." fre="Green Neon Pants par la gagnante de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}J'adore les soirées DJ. Le dubstep c'est tendance !" rus="Штаны Green Neon от All.Green, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Стиль и удобство – все при них!  " cns="某天突然出现在实验室的神秘女子裤子。{N}荧光绿色的裤子，让她显得十分神秘。"/>
	<string key="N1041195" kor="네온사인:그린 글러브" ger="Green Neon Gloves" eng="Green Neon Gloves" tur="Neon Green Gloves" fre="Neon Green Gloves" spa="" ita="" rus="Green Neon Gloves" ame="" cns="幻影魅魔手套" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T1041195" kor="도스코 시즌2 여성 부문 1위 All.Green의 네온사인:그린 글러브 {N}{N}카리스마디자이너B0N1 @B0N1{N}옷에 어울리는 장갑을 고르는건 항상 어려운 일이지만, 가장 보람찬 일이기도 하지!" ger="Dem Gewinner für Frauenoutfits von Korea's Next Top Model S2, All.Green's Neon Sign:Green Gloves {N}{N}Charismatic DesignerB0N1 @B0N1{N}Passende Handschuhe zu finden, ist immer so schwer, aber toll wenn es klappt!" eng="Green Neon Gloves by All.Green, winner of Korea's Next Top Model!{N}{N}It's always a struggle to find the right gloves for an outfit, but it's worth it!" tur="Korea's Next Top Model S2'nin kadın kazananı olan All.Green'den Neon Green Gloves {N}{N}Kıyafet için doğru eldivenleri bulmak her zaman için zordur ama sonunda insan gerçekten tatmin oluyor!" fre="Neon Green Gloves par la gagnante de Top Model Corée S02{N}{N}C'est toujours très dur de trouver les gants assortis !" rus="Перчатки Green Neon от All.Green, победителя шоу Next Top Model в Корее!{N}{N}Подобрать правильные перчатки к костюму всегда непросто, но оно того стоит!" cns="某天突然出现在实验室的神秘女子手套。{N}荧光绿色的手套，让她显得十分神秘。"/>
