	<string key="T4052266" kor="돌핀 앵커링 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}돌핀 앵커링(내구제/SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%)){N}돌핀 앵커링(7일/SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%)){N}돌핀 앵커링(30일/SP사용량 감소(-5%),사용거리 증가(+5%))" ger="Dolphin Anchor Capsule. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Dolphin Anchor (Permanent/SP-Verbrauch reduziert (-5%), Reichweite erhöht (+5%)){N}Dolphin Anchor (7 Days/SP-Verbrauch reduziert (-5%), Reichweite erhöht (+5%)){N}Dolphin Anchor (30 Days/SP-Verbrauch reduziert (-5%), Reichweite erhöht (+5%))" eng="Dolphin Anchor Capsule. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Dolphin Anchor (Permanent/Reduces SP consumption (-5%), Increases range (+5%)){N}Dolphin Anchor (7 days/Reduces SP consumption (-5%), Increases range (+5%)){N}Dolphin Anchor (30 days/Reduces SP consumption (-5%), Increases range (+5%))" tur="Dolphin Anchor Capsule. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Dolphin Anchor (Kalıcı/SP kullanımını azaltır (-%5), Menzili artırır (+%5)){N}Dolphin Anchor (7 gün/SP kullanımını azaltır (-%5), Menzili artırır (+%5)){N}Dolphin Anchor (30 gün/SP kullanımını azaltır (-%5), Menzili artırır (+%5))" fre="Capsule Dolphin Anchor{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Dolphin Anchor (Illimité/PC requis -5 %, Portée +5 %){N}Dolphin Anchor (7 jours/PC requis -5 %, Portée +5 %){N}Dolphin Anchor (30 jours/PC requis -5 %, Portée +5 %)" rus="Dolphin Anchor Capsule. {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}Dolphin Anchor (Бессрочн./снижает потребление SP (-5%), повышает дальность (+5%)){N}Dolphin Anchor (7 дней/снижает потребление SP (-5%), повышает дальность (+5%)){N}Dolphin Anchor (30 дней/снижает потребление SP (-5%), повышает дальность (+5%))" cns="海豚飞索滑板扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}海豚飞索滑板（永久/能量消耗-5%,使用距离+5%）{N}海豚飞索滑板（7日/能量消耗-5%,使用距离+5%）{N}海豚飞索滑板（30日/能量消耗-5%）,使用距离+5%）"/>
