	<string key="N1061200" kor="마시멜로우 퍼피" ger="marshmallow puppy" eng="marshmallow puppy" tur="marshmallow puppy" fre="marshmallow puppy" rus="marshmallow puppy" cns="棉花糖小狗"/>
	<string key="T1061200" kor="화이트데이를 기념한 달콤하고 폭신한 마시멜로우 퍼피! 마시멜로우 퍼피로 마음을 전달하세요!" ger="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" eng="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" tur="Tatlı ve yumuşak Marshmallow Puppy!!" fre="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" rus="Милый и мягкий зефирный щенок!" cns="为纪念白色情人节的甜蜜松软的棉花糖小狗！用棉花糖小狗传达心意吧！"/>
	<string key="N1061201" kor="마시멜로우 퍼피" ger="marshmallow puppy" eng="marshmallow puppy" tur="marshmallow puppy" fre="marshmallow puppy" rus="marshmallow puppy" cns="棉花糖小狗"/>
	<string key="T1061201" kor="화이트데이를 기념한 달콤하고 폭신한 마시멜로우 퍼피! 마시멜로우 퍼피로 마음을 전달하세요!" ger="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" eng="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" tur="Tatlı ve yumuşak Marshmallow Puppy!!" fre="Sweet and Soft Marshmallow Puppy!!" rus="Милый и мягкий зефирный щенок!" cns="为纪念白色情人节的甜蜜松软的棉花糖小狗！用棉花糖小狗传达心意吧！"/>
	<string key="N2000071" kor="슈팅스타 배트" ger="Summernight Stormbat" eng="Summernight Stormbat" tur="Summernight Stormbat" fre="Summernight Stormbat" rus="Summernight Stormbat" cns="满天星"/>
	<string key="T2000071" kor="터져버릴 것 처럼 심지가 타고있는 로켓 폭죽 모양의 배트.{N}심지가 타오르면 하늘높이 날아갈 수 있을 것 같지만 심지는 아무런 기능이 없는 장식이라고 한다." ger="Ein Knüppel in der Form einer Feuerwerksrakete?! {N} Keine Waffe hat mehr Bumms! Lunte anzünden auf eigene Gefahr!" eng="A bat shaped like a firework, complete with burning wick.{N} Though it looks ready to blast off into the summer night, its wick is only for decoration." tur="Fitiline kadar eksiksiz ve havai fişek şeklinde bir yarasa.{N} Bir yaz gecesinde patlamaya hazır görünse de fitili sadece süs amaçlı." fre="Une batte en forme de feu d'artifice, comprenant une mèche enflammée.{N} Bien qu'elle ait l'air sur le point de décoller vers les cieux étoilés, sa mèche n'est que décorative." rus="Бита в виде фейерверка с горящим фитилем.{N} Выглядит так, как будто вот-вот полетит в небо, но на самом деле фитиль для украшения." cns="特典蝙蝠风暴。{N}顶部燃着的引线，总让人担心它下一秒就会爆炸。{N}其实只是一个装饰罢了。"/>
	<string key="N2050014" kor="수박 봄버" ger="Watermelon Bomber" eng="Basketball Bomb" tur="Watermelon Bomber" fre="Watermelon Bomber" rus="Watermelon Bomber" cns="西瓜手雷"/>
	<string key="T2050014" kor="시원한 수박 모양의 폭탄.{N}수박 모양에 속아 가까이 가다가는 뜨거운 맛을 보게 될것이다." ger="Eine Wassermelonenbombe, genial!{N} Die sieht zwar furchtbar lecker aus, reinbeißen könnte aber böse ausgehen, haha ... Nein, im Ernst: NICHT REINBEISSEN!" eng="A bomb shaped liked a watermelon.{N} Don't be fooled by its delicious disguise— this melon's not for eating!" tur="Karpuz şeklinde bir bomba.{N} Leziz görünümüne aldanmayın, bu karpuz yenmez!" fre="Une bombe en forme de pastèque.{N} Ne vous laissez pas avoir par son succulent déguisement : elle n'est pas comestible !" rus="Бомба в виде арбуза.{N} Не обманитесь тем, как она вкусно выглядит – такую лучше не кусать!" cns="特典核爆手雷{N}西瓜模样的核爆手雷{N}如果一口咬下去，那画面太美简直不敢看。"/>
	<string key="N1001196" kor="올라 리젠트 헤어" ger="Tulio's Fabulous Hair" eng="Tulio's Fabulous Hair" tur="Tulio's Fabulous Hair" fre="Tulio's Fabulous Hair" rus="Tulio's Fabulous Hair" cns="清凉一夏（男）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001196" kor="하늘로 멋지게 올린 리젠트 스타일의 헤어." ger="Wer ist der hipste Typ im S4L-Land? Tulio natürlich. Schau dir die Haare an! Die stehen selbst im stärksten Sturm noch wie eine Eins." eng="A fancy up-do for the most marvelous-looking people." tur="En tarz görünen kişiler için şık bir saç kesimi." fre="Une coiffure fabuleuse, pour les gens fabuleux." rus="Модный начес для самых красивых людей." cns="颜值高的人可以搞定任何发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021196" kor="올라 타투 바디" ger="Tulio's Flex Body" eng="Tulio's Flex Body" tur="Tulio's Flex Body" fre="Tulio's Flex Body" rus="Tulio's Flex Body" cns="清凉一夏（男）刺青身体"/>
	<string key="T1021196" kor="건강미 넘치는 구리빛 피부와 강렬한 타투로 자신감 업!" ger="Waschbrettbauch oder Tattoos ... Waschbrettbauch oder Tattoos ... Waschbrettbauch oder ... Ach, egal. BEIDES!" eng="It's hard to choose between a six-pack or tattoos. So why not both?" tur="Baklava şekilli kaslar ve dövme arasında seçim yapmak gerçekten zor. E niye ikisi birden olmasın?" fre="Pas facile de choisir entre des abdos et des tatoos. Pourquoi pas les deux ?" rus="Железные пресс или модные татуировки? А почему бы не то и другое сразу?" cns="六块腹肌和帅气刺青，你选哪个？不如都要吧！"/>
	<string key="N1031196" kor="올라 삼각 수영복" ger="Tulio's Swim Briefs" eng="Tulio's Swim briefs" tur="Tulio's Swim briefs" fre="Tulio's Swim briefs" rus="Tulio's Swim briefs" cns="清凉一夏（男）三角泳裤"/>
	<string key="T1031196" kor="남성미를 과시할 수 있는 심플한 스타일의 삼각 수영복." ger="Diese Badehose ist so männlich, da wächst dir direkt ein Schnurrbart! *Resultate können abweichen." eng="These briefs are so manly, you grow a moustache when you wear them. *Results may vary." tur="Bu mayo o kadar erkeksi ki giydiğinizde bıyıklarınız çıkıyor. *Sonuçlar farklılık gösterebilir." fre="Un pantalon tellement « mec » qu'une moustache vous en poussera. *Résultats non garantis." rus="Плавки такие мужественные, что когда их надеваешь, начинают расти усы. *Но не у всех." cns="显示男性美的朴素三角泳裤。"/>
	<string key="N1041196" kor="올라 타투 핸드" ger="Tulio's Hand Tattoo" eng="Tulio's Hand Tattoo" tur="Tulio's Hand Tattoo" fre="Tulio's Hand Tattoo" rus="Tulio's Hand Tattoo" cns="清凉一夏（男）刺青手臂"/>
	<string key="T1041196" kor="건강미 넘치는 구리빛 피부와 강렬한 타투로 자신감 업!" ger="Keine Angst, das kann man abwaschen. Wirst also noch einen ordentlichen Job finden können." eng="Don't worry, it's not permanent. You can still find a job." tur="Merak etme, kalıcı değil. İşe girerken sorun çıkarmaz." fre="Relax, il n'est pas permanent. Vous pourrez toujours trouver un boulot." rus="Не бойся, она временная. Работу потом можно будет найти." cns="别担心，这不是永久性的刺青。说不定水里洗洗就没了呢！"/>
	<string key="N1051196" kor="올라 스트랩 슬리퍼" ger="Tulio's Flip-Flops" eng="Tulio's Flip-Flops" tur="Tulio's Flip-Flops" fre="Tulio's Flip-Flops" rus="Tulio's Flip-Flops" cns="清凉一夏（男）背带拖鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051196" kor="발목의 스트랩이 포인트인 심플한 디자인의 슬리퍼" ger="Flip-Flops alleine wären viel zu 2007, deshalb legen wir noch ein paar Fußbändchen obendrauf!" eng="These simple slippers are held on with ankle straps." tur="Bu sade görünümlü terlikler bilek bağı ile tutturulmuş." fre="De simples sandales maintenues par une lanière autour de la cheville." rus="Простые сланцы с застежками вокруг лодыжки." cns="沙滩配拖鞋，完美！"/>
	<string key="N1061196" kor="올라 미러 선글라스" ger="Tulio's Cool Shades" eng="Tulio's Cool Shades" tur="Tulio's Cool Shades" fre="Tulio's Cool Shades" rus="Tulio's Cool Shades" cns="清凉一夏（男）太阳镜"/>
	<string key="T1061196" kor="올 여름 눈부신 태양 앞에서도 당당하게!" ger="Die Sonne scheint nicht und du sitzt sowieso lieber drinnen? Egal, setz diese coole Sonnenbrille trotzdem auf, du kannst es dir leisten!" eng="These shades guarantee you the spotlight! A fortunate side effect is that they reflect harmful solar rays." tur="Bu gözlükler ile gözler üzerinde olacak! Güzel bir yan etkisi ise zararlı güneş ışınlarını yansıtıyor olması." fre="Lunettes parfaites pour les sunlights des tropiques. Effet secondaire : reflètent les rayons ultraviolets." rus="С этими очками ты в центре внимания! А заодно они еще и вредные солнечные лучи отражают." cns="想跟太阳比大眼瞪小眼吗？戴上它你准能赢！"/>
	<string key="N1031197" kor="올라 시스루 수영복" ger="Tullio's Shorts" eng="Tullio's Shorts" tur="Tullio's Shorts" fre="Tullio's Shorts" rus="Tullio's Shorts" cns="清凉一夏（男）透视泳裤"/>
	<string key="T1031197" kor="은근히 드러나는 시스루 재질의 트렁크 수영복." ger="Manche Leute lästern, dass diese Shorts einfach zu viel des Guten sind. Aber diese Leute haben auch keine Ahnung von Mode. Also reingeschlüpft und ab dafür!" eng="Some people say these shorts are too much. Don't judge them, they are small-minded." tur="Bazıları bu şortun sınırları aştığınını düşünüyor. Onları yargılamayın, herkes açık fikirli olamaz." fre="Certains disent que ce short est trop court. Sûrement parce qu'ils sont jaloux." rus="Некоторые говорят, что эти шорты – это уж слишком. Но мы всякие ограниченные мнения не слушаем." cns="若隐若现的透视泳裤，一般人还真不敢尝试！"/>
	<string key="N1021198" kor="플라야 타투 비키니 탑" ger="Tully's Tattoo Bikini Top" eng="Tully's Tattoo Bikini Top" tur="Tully's Tattoo Bikini Top" fre="Tully's Tattoo Bikini Top" rus="Tully's Tattoo Bikini Top" cns="清凉一夏（女）比基尼上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021198" kor="과감한 비키니와 시스루 사이로 은근히 드러나는 타투로 섹시함 업!" ger="Um dieses Bikini-Oberteil zu tragen, braucht es schon etwas Selbstbewusstsein. Das hast du natürlich, also trau dich und zeig, was du hast!" eng="This halter bikini top requires a lot of courage to wear." tur="Bu bikini üstünü giymek gerçekten cesaret gerektiriyor." fre="Un haut de bikini pour les filles qui n'ont pas froid aux yeux (et aux bras)." rus="Чтобы носить такой топ от бикини, нужна смелость." cns="没有好身材，你敢穿比基尼吗？！"/>
	<string key="N1031199" kor="플라야 시스루 랩스커트" ger="Tully's Wrap Skirt" eng="Tully's Wrap Skirt" tur="Tully's Wrap Skirt" fre="Tully's Wrap Skirt" rus="Tully's Wrap Skirt" cns="清凉一夏（女）比基尼泳裤"/>
	<string key="T1031199" kor="화려한 허리 장식의 시스루 랩스커트." ger="Manche beschreiben diesen Rock als 'durchsichtig', Tully nennt ihn lieber 'Fashion-Statement'!" eng="Some call it see-through, Tully calls it a fashion statement!" tur="Bazıları içini göstermesine takıyor, Tully içinse tam anlamıyla bir moda harikası!" fre="Certains la trouvent transparente, mais c'est le dernier cri !" rus="Некоторые говорят, мол, слишком прозрачно. А мы говорим – это и есть настоящая мода!" cns="性感的比基尼泳裤，准备好拜倒在她裙下吧！"/>
	<string key="N1041198" kor="플라야 글러브" ger="Tully's Gloves" eng="Tully's Gloves" tur="Tully's Gloves" fre="Tully's Gloves" rus="Tully's Gloves" cns="清凉一夏（女）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041198" kor="반지와 연결된 손목장식.{N}간단하면서도 고급스러운 디자인으로 여성 리거들 사이에서 인기 만점!" ger="Simple Stulpen, versehen mit einem hübschen Ring.{N} Das Design ist simpel aber elegant, so dass viele Mädels vor Neid erblassen, wenn sie dich damit sehen." eng="A simple bracelet chained to a ring.{N} Luxuriant in spite of its simplicity, it has attracted a lot of rage from the female espers." tur="Bir halkaya bağlanmış olan sade bir bilezik.{N} Sadeliğine rağmen zengin bir görüntüsü var, diğer kadın esperler gördükçe deliriyorlar!" fre="Un bracelet attaché à un anneau.{N} Débordant de simplicité, la gente féminine se l'arrache." rus="Простой браслет с кольцом на цепочке.{N} Простой, но роскошный. Так и притягивает к себе завистливые взгляды." cns="手套还是要戴的，多少能遮一点紫外线。"/>
	<string key="N1051198" kor="플라야 하이스트랩 샌들" ger="Tully's Sandals" eng="Tully's Sandals" tur="Tully's Sandals" fre="Tully's Sandals" rus="Tully's Sandals" cns="清凉一夏（女）高跟凉鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051198" kor="발목의 스트랩이 포인트인 심플한 디자인의 샌들" ger="Elegante Sommersandalen mit ein klein wenig Absatz. Wer hat gesagt, dass man am Strand nicht auch großartig aussehen darf?" eng="An elegant pair of sandals for summer. Who said you can't bring fashion to the beach!" tur="Yaz için bir çift şık sandalet. Plajda moda olmaz diye kim söylemiş?" fre="Une élégante paire de sandales estivales. Parce qu'être fashion à la plage, c'est crucial !" rus="Элегантная пара летних сандалий. Кто сказал, что моде не место на пляже?" cns="不懂为什么去海边还要穿高跟鞋……"/>
	<string key="N1061198" kor="플라야 미러 선글라스" ger="Tully's Cool Shades" eng="Tully's Cool Shades" tur="Tully's Cool Shades" fre="Tully's Cool Shades" rus="Tully's Cool Shades" cns="清凉一夏（女）太阳镜"/>
	<string key="T1061198" kor="올 여름 눈부신 태양 앞에서도 당당하게!" ger="Die Sonne scheint nicht und du sitzt sowieso lieber drinnen? Egal, setz diese coole Sonnenbrille trotzdem auf, du kannst es dir leisten!" eng="These shades guarantee you the spotlight! A fortunate side effect is that they reflect harmful solar rays." tur="Bu gözlükler ile gözler üzerinde olacak! Güzel bir yan etkisi ise zararlı güneş ışınlarını yansıtıyor olması." fre="Lunettes parfaites pour les sunlights des tropiques. Effet secondaire : reflètent les rayons ultraviolets." rus="С этими очками ты в центре внимания! А заодно они еще и вредные солнечные лучи отражают." cns="想跟太阳比大眼瞪小眼吗？戴上它你准能赢！"/>
	<string key="N1031198" kor="플라야 비키니 팬츠" ger="Tully's Bikini Bottom" eng="Tully's Bikini Bottom" tur="Tully's Bikini Bottom" fre="Tully's Bikini Bottom" rus="Tully's Bikini Bottom" cns="清凉一夏（女）纱裙"/>
	<string key="T1031198" kor="심플한 비키니 팬츠와 발목의 타투가 포인트" ger="Zu diesem Bikini-Höschen gibt's noch ein Tattoo obendrauf. Auch als Fashion-Victim muss man schließlich sehen, wo man bleibt." eng="This bikini bottom is paired with an ankle tattoo. Talk about being original." tur="Bu bikini altı ile birlikte bir de bilek dövmesi geliyor. Orijinallikte sınır yok." fre="Ce bas de bikini est livré avec son tatouage de cheville. Plus original, tu meurs." rus="Трусики бикини и татуировка на щиколотке. Очень оригинально." cns="若隐若现的泳裤隐藏在纱裙后面。{N}就问你心不心动！"/>
	<string key="N1061199" kor="플라야 플로피 햇" ger="Tully's Floppy Hat" eng="Tully's Floppy Hat" tur="Tully's Floppy Hat" fre="Tully's Floppy Hat" rus="Tully's Floppy Hat" cns="清凉一夏（女）松软宽檐帽"/>
	<string key="T1061199" kor="넓은 챙의 플로피 햇으로 햇볕 차단과 패션 모두를 만족 시킬 수 있는 올여름 머스트 해브 아이템!" ger="Ein praktischer Hut, der dich vor Sonne schützt und gleichzeitig modisch genug ist, um alle Blicke auf dich zu ziehen." eng="A floppy-brimmed hat wide enough to block the sun, yet chic enough to garner approval from those in the know." tur="Güneşten koruyacak kadar geniş bir şapka, yine de zevkli insanlardan tam not alacak kadar şık." fre="Un chapeau à bord souple assez large pour protéger du soleil, mais assez chic pour obtenir l'approbation des plus exigeants." rus="Шляпа с полями защищает от солнца и выглядит достаточно хорошо, чтобы получить высокую оценку от тех, кто понимает." cns="用松软的宽檐帽挡住太阳光，又能满足时尚的今夏必备道具！"/>
	<string key="N4035458" kor="올라 화이트 캡슐" ger="Tulio's White Capsule" eng="Tulio's White Capsule" tur="Tulio's White Capsule" fre="Tulio's White Capsule" rus="Tulio's White Capsule" cns="清凉一夏（男）特典扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035458" kor="올라 화이트 캡슐 입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Tulio's White Capsule. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="Tulio's White Capsule. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random." tur="Tulio's White Capsule. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule Tulio White.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Tulio's White Capsule. {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="清凉一夏（男）特典扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
