	<string key="T1061203" kor="바다의 향기가 물씬 풍기는 바다소녀 모자" cns="散发着浓浓海水气息的大海少女帽子"/>
	<string key="N2010055" kor="버블 호밍 라이플 (2016)" cns="泡泡枪（2016）"/>
	<string key="T2010055" kor="퐁퐁퐁! 신선한 물방울 소리가 기분까지 상쾌해지는 호밍라이플의 유니크 물총!{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}이벤트 종료 시 삭제됩니다." cns="砰砰砰！可以发射泡沫的特典追踪步枪！{N}在炎热的夏日使用这把枪，能让心情都变得爽朗起来！{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}活动结束时，该道具将会被移除。"/>
	<string key="N1001204" kor="시노비 헤어" ger="Shinobi Hair" eng="Shinobi Hair" tur="Shinobi Hair" fre="Shinobi Hair" rus="Shinobi Hair" cns="绝地武士（男）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001204" kor="정체를 감추기위해 최대한 얼굴을 가린 헤어 스타일." ger="Diese Frisur verbirgt dein Gesicht und schützt so deine Identität." eng="This hairstyle obscures your face, concealing your true identity." tur="Bu saç biçimi gerçek kimliğinizi gölgeleyerek yüzünü örtüyor." fre="Cette coupe durcit vos traits, masquant votre vraie nature." rus="Прическа скрывает лицо, затрудняя идентификацию личности." cns="为了隐瞒身份，最大程度遮掩面部的发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021204" kor="시노비 상의" ger="Shinobi Top" eng="Shinobi Top" tur="Shinobi Top" fre="Shinobi Top" rus="Shinobi Top" cns="绝地武士（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021204" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}타이트한 디자인으로 움직임에 제약을 최소화 했다." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Die enge Passform des Oberteils reduziert unnötige Bewegungen." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Its tight fit enables you to minimize unnecessary movements." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Dar yapısı sayesinde gereksiz hareketleri en aza indirmeni sağlar." fre="Porté lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Coupe ajustée pour réduire au maximum vos mouvements." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Сводит нежелательные движения к минимуму." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士男性成员的服装。{N}紧身的设计,最大程度地减少行动限制。"/>
	<string key="N1031204" kor="시노비 하의" ger="Shinobi Bottom" eng="Shinobi Bottom" tur="Shinobi Bottom" fre="Shinobi Bottom" rus="Shinobi Bottom" cns="绝地武士（男）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031204" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}펑퍼짐한 상부와 각반으로 보호한 하부로 활동성과 보호를 동시에 실현한 실용성 있는 의상" ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Die weiten Hosen garantieren dir im Kampf maximale Begungsfreiheit." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}The bagginess of these pants allows unprecedented freedom of movement during battle." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Bu pantolonların bolluğu sayesinde dövüş sırasında rahatça hareket edebilirsin." fre="Porté lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Pantalon ample qui offre une grande liberté de mouvements en combat." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Широкие штаны дают непревзойденную свободу перемещений в бою." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士男性成员的服装。{N}蓬松的上衣和用绑腿保护的下肢，在方便行动的同时减少伤害。"/>
	<string key="N1041204" kor="시노비 장갑" ger="Shinobi Gloves" eng="Shinobi Gloves" tur="Shinobi Gloves" fre="Shinobi Gloves" rus="Shinobi Gloves" cns="绝地武士（男）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041204" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}손등과 손목을 두터운 가죽으로 보호한 손목 보호구." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Die robusten Handschuhe schützen deine Hände, ohne die Beweglichkeit deiner Finger einzuschränken. Ein Must-Have für jeden Assassinen." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}These thick, flexible gloves protect your hands and wrists without reducing your dexterity. They're an essential part of any assassin's ensemble." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Bu kalın ve esnek eldivenler, çevikliğini azaltmadan ellerini korumana yardımcı olur. Her türdeki suikastçı kostümünün ayrılmaz bir parçasıdır." fre="Portés lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Gants épais et souples qui protègent vos mains ainsi que vos poignets tout en conservant votre dextérité. Accessoire essentiel de la tenue d'assassin." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Толстые и гибкие перчатки защищают руки и кисти, не уменьшая ловкости. Неотъемлемая часть гардероба любого убийцы." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士男性成员的服装。{N}用厚厚的皮革保护手背和手碗。"/>
	<string key="N1051204" kor="시노비 신발" ger="Shinobi Shoes" eng="Shinobi Shoes" tur="Shinobi Shoes" fre="Shinobi Shoes" rus="Shinobi Shoes" cns="绝地武士（男）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051204" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}벽이나 나무등을 편하게 탈 수 있도록 디자인한 신발." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Mit diesen Spezialschuhen kannst du ganz leicht Bäume und Wände emporklettern." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}These specialized shoes allow you to climb walls and trees." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir bir parçası.{N}Bu özel ayakkabılar sayesinde duvarlara ve ağaçlara tırmanabilirsin." fre="Portées lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Chaussures polyvalentes qui permettent d'escalader les murs et les arbres." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Особые ботинки позволяют лазать по стенам и деревьям." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士男性成员的服装。{N}可以轻松攀爬墙壁或树木的鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N1001205" kor="쿠노이치 헤어" ger="Kunoichi Hair" eng="Kunoichi Hair" tur="Kunoichi Hair" fre="Kunoichi Hair" rus="Kunoichi Hair" cns="绝地武士（女）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001205" kor="움직임에 방해되지 않게 머리위로 묶어올린 포니테일 스타일" ger="Eine schlichte aber dennoch stylishe Frisur. Sitzt auch im Kampf noch perfekt!" eng="A simple, yet stylish hairstyle. It allows you to move around swiftly in battle." tur="Basit fakat şık bir saç biçimi. Savaş sırasında etrafta hızlı bir şekilde hareket etmene olanak sağlar." fre="Coupe simple mais élégante qui permet de se déplacer rapidement en combat." rus="Простая, но стильная прическа. Позволяет быстро двигаться в бою." cns="为不妨碍行动而将马尾绑在头顶。"/>
	<string key="N1021205" kor="쿠노이치 상의" ger="Kunoichi Top" eng="Kunoichi Top" tur="Kunoichi Top" fre="Kunoichi Top" rus="Kunoichi Top" cns="绝地武士（女）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021205" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}타이트한 디자인으로 움직임에 제약을 최소화 했다." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Die enge Passform des Oberteils reduziert unnötige Bewegungen." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Its tight fit enables you to minimize unnecessary movements." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Dar yapısı sayesinde gereksiz hareketleri en aza indirmeni sağlar." fre="Porté lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Coupe ajustée pour réduire au maximum vos mouvements." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Сводит нежелательные движения к минимуму." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士女性成员的服装。{N}紧身的设计,最大程度地减少行动限制。"/>
	<string key="N1031205" kor="쿠노이치 하의" ger="Kunoichi Bottom" eng="Kunoichi Bottom" tur="Kunoichi Bottom" fre="Kunoichi Bottom" rus="Kunoichi Bottom" cns="绝地武士（女）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031205" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}활동성을 중시하기위해 불필요한 장식을 최대한 배제한 여성 닌자 복장." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Dieses schlichte Unterteil kommt ohne viel Chichi, damit du dich im Kampf freier bewegen kannst." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}This garden-variety ninja clothing comes without an extra accessories in order to keep you mobile in combat." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Savaş sırasında hareketini kısıtlamaması için hiçbir fazladan aksesuar bulundurmaz." fre="Porté lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Ce pantalon de ninja classique vous offre une grande liberté de mouvements." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Никаких украшений, которые мешали бы перемещениям в бою." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士女性成员的服装。{N}为了拥有良好的活动性而牺牲装饰的女性传说中来去无踪的忍者服装。"/>
	<string key="N1041205" kor="쿠노이치 장갑" ger="Kunoichi Gloves" eng="Kunoichi Gloves" tur="Kunoichi Gloves" fre="Kunoichi Gloves" rus="Kunoichi Gloves" cns="绝地武士（女）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041205" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}손등과 손목을 두터운 가죽으로 보호한 손목 보호구." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Die robusten Handschuhe schützen deine Hände, ohne die Beweglichkeit deiner Finger einzuschränken. Ein Must-Have für jeden Assassinen." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}These thick, flexible gloves protect your hands and wrists without reducing your dexterity. They're an essential part of any assassin's ensemble." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Bu kalın ve esnek eldivenler, çevikliğini azaltmadan ellerini korumana yardımcı olur. Her türdeki suikastçı kostümünün ayrılmaz bir parçasıdır." fre="Portés lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Gants épais et souples qui protègent vos mains ainsi que vos poignets tout en conservant votre dextérité. Accessoire essentiel de la tenue d'assassin." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Толстые и гибкие перчатки защищают руки и кисти, не уменьшая ловкости. Неотъемлемая часть гардероба любого убийцы." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士女性成员的服装。{N}用厚厚的皮革保护手背和手。"/>
	<string key="N1051205" kor="쿠노이치 신발" ger="Kunoichi Shoes" eng="Kunoichi Shoes" tur="Kunoichi Shoes" fre="Kunoichi Shoes" rus="Kunoichi Shoes" cns="绝地武士（女）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051205" kor="코드네임 어쌔신에서 지급되는 닌자복.{N}가볍고 부드러운 재질을 사용하여 소음을 최대한 줄인 신발." ger="Teil eines Ninja-Outfits für die Operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}Die Schuhe bestehen aus leichtem, weichen Material. So schleichst du wie auf Katzenpfoten durch die Nacht." eng="Part of a ninja outfit given to you for the operation &quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot;.{N}These shoes are made of light, soft materials. They allow you to sneak silently through the night." tur="&quot;Code Name: Assassin&quot; için sana veilen ninja kostümünün bir parçası.{N}Bu ayakkabılar hafif ve yumuşak malzemeden yapılmıştır. Gece vakti sessizce hareket etmene olanak sağlar." fre="Portées lors de l'opération Assassin.{N}Chaussures légères et confortables. La nuit, vous pouvez vous déplacer sans vous faire remarquer." rus="Часть костюма ниндзя, выданного на операцию «Позывной „Убийца“».{N}Ботинки из легкого мягкого материала. Позволяют бесшумно красться в ночи." cns="红蜂帝国秘密部队——绝地武士女性成员的服装。{N}可以尽量降低噪音的鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N2000072" kor="나마하게 Type-A" ger="Namahage Type-A" eng="Namahage Type-A" tur="Namahage Type-A" fre="Namahage Type-A" rus="Namahage Type-A" cns="观世正宗"/>
	<string key="T2000072" kor="해커G에의해 탈취당한 카타나의 개량형.{N}본래 시그마 블레이드와 함께 가변형의 카타나로 개발중이였으나 해커G의 해킹 공격으로 개발이 중지되어 카타나 본연의 베는 기능에만 충실하도록 제작되었다." ger="Diese neue Version des Katana wurde von Hacker G gestohlen.{N}Ursprünglich wurden mehrere Versionen des Katanas zusammen mit der Sigma Blade entwickelt. Die Forschungen wurden jedoch durch den unerwarteten Angriff von Hacker G behindert. Daher war nur ein einziges, grobes Katana verfügbar. Bis jetzt!" eng="This upgraded version of the katana was stolen by Hacker G.{N}Originally, various versions of the katana were being developed in tandem with the Sigma Blade. However, research was halted due to the unexpected Hacker G attack. As a result, only a bare-bones, slashing katana was available... until now." tur="Katananın bu gelişmiş sürümü Hacker G tarafından çalınmıştır.{N}Sigma Blade dikkate alınarak bu katananın birçok sürümü üretilmekteydi. Ancak, beklenmeyen Hacker G saldırısından dolayı araştırma askıya alınmıştır. Sonuç olarak, katananın sadece kesici tarafı elde kalmıştır, şimdiye kadar..." fre="Version améliorée du katana subtilisé par Hacker G.{N}À l'origine, les créateurs avaient imaginé de nombreux modèles de Katanas et de Sigma Blades. Ils ont malheureusement dû abandonner leurs recherches après l'attaque de Hacker G. Ils n'avaient alors conçu qu'un prototype de Katana..." rus="Улучшенная версия катаны была украдена группой Hacker G.{N}Изначально разные версии катаны разрабатывались в паре с Sigma Blade. Но затем разработка приостановилась из-за атаки Hacker G. В итоге была доступна только самая простая версия катаны... До этого дня." cns="根据名刀改造而成的特典斩魄太刀。{N}神秘黑客窃取了斩魄太刀的数据后，根据名刀的特性加以改造，使之更加接近传说的能力。"/>
	<string key="N2000073" kor="나마하게 Type-B" ger="Namahage Type-B" eng="Namahage Type-B" tur="Namahage Type-B" fre="Namahage Type-B" rus="Namahage Type-B" cns="妖刀村正"/>
	<string key="T2000073" kor="해커G에의해 탈취당한 카타나의 개량형.{N}본래 시그마 블레이드와 함께 가변형의 카타나로 개발중이였으나 해커G의 해킹 공격으로 개발이 중지되어 카타나 본연의 베는 기능에만 충실하도록 제작되었다." ger="Diese neue Version des Katana wurde von Hacker G gestohlen.{N}Ursprünglich wurden mehrere Versionen des Katanas zusammen mit der Sigma Blade entwickelt. Die Forschungen wurden jedoch durch den unerwarteten Angriff von Hacker G behindert. Daher war nur ein einziges, grobes Katana verfügbar. Bis jetzt!" eng="This upgraded version of the katana was stolen by Hacker G.{N}Originally, various versions of the katana were being developed in tandem with the Sigma Blade. However, research was halted due to the unexpected Hacker G attack. As a result, only a bare-bones, slashing katana was available... until now." tur="Katananın bu gelişmiş sürümü Hacker G tarafından çalınmıştır.{N}Sigma Blade dikkate alınarak bu katananın birçok sürümü üretilmekteydi. Ancak, beklenmeyen Hacker G saldırısından dolayı araştırma askıya alınmıştır. Sonuç olarak, katananın sadece kesici tarafı elde kalmıştır, şimdiye kadar..." fre="Version améliorée du katana subtilisé par Hacker G.{N}À l'origine, les créateurs avaient imaginé de nombreux modèles de Katanas et de Sigma Blades. Ils ont malheureusement dû abandonner leurs recherches après l'attaque de Hacker G. Ils n'avaient alors conçu qu'un prototype de Katana..." rus="Улучшенная версия катаны была украдена группой Hacker G.{N}Изначально разные версии катаны разрабатывались в паре с Sigma Blade. Но затем разработка приостановилась из-за атаки Hacker G. В итоге была доступна только самая простая версия катаны... До этого дня." cns="根据名刀改造而成的特典斩魄太刀。{N}神秘黑客窃取了斩魄太刀的数据后，根据名刀的特性加以改造，使之更加接近传说的能力。"/>
	<string key="N4035464" kor="시노비 캡슐" ger="Shinobi Capsule" eng="Shinobi Capsule" tur="Shinobi Capsule" fre="Shinobi Capsule" rus="Shinobi Capsule" cns="绝地武士（男）扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035464" kor="시노비 캡슐 입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Shinobi Capsule.{N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="This is a Shinobi Capsule. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Bu bir Shinobi Capsule'ü. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule Shinobi.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Shinobi Capsule. {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="绝地武士（男）扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
