	<string key="N1001208" kor="라이더 블리츠 헤어" ger="Blitz's Windswept Do" eng="Blitz's Windswept Do" tur="Blitz's Windswept Do" fre="Blitz's Windswept Do" rus="Blitz's Windswept Do" cns="闪电骑士（男）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001208" kor="부드러운 웨이브를 가진 헤어 스타일로이다." ger="Ein Ritt durch den Sturm birgt Risiken. Allerdings kann dabei auch eine unerwartet coole Frisur entstehen." eng="Open-air riding has its dangers. Thankfully, a great looking hairdo is one of the unexpected benefits!" tur="Açık havada sürüşün kendine has tehlikeleri var. Neyse ki beklenmedik bir sonuç da harika biçimlenmiş saçlar!" fre="Qui a dit qu'il est impossible de garder une coiffure irréprochable après 100 km en bécane ?" rus="Езда под открытым небом небезопасна. Зато ветер делает крутую прическу!" cns="追求闪电般速度的男性机车骑士发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021208" kor="라이더 블리츠 후드티" ger="Blitz's Haste Hoodie" eng="Blitz's Haste Hoodie" tur="Blitz's Haste Hoodie" fre="Blitz's Haste Hoodie" rus="Blitz's Haste Hoodie" cns="闪电骑士（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021208" kor="넷 스피어를 활보하는 라이더 복장으로 가상 세계에서의 어떠한 상황에서도 착용자를 보호해 주는 후드티이다." ger="Wer viel draußen ist, verlässt das Haus nie ohne Super-Hoodie! Einmal angezogen, schützt er Haut und Haar praktisch in jeder Situation. " eng="An experienced rider never leaves home without a killer hoodie. Once equipped, this headgear will save your skin in just about any situation." tur="Deneyimli bir sürücü, şekil bir kapüşon almadan evden çıkmaz. Bu kafalık seni her durumdan kurtaracaktır." fre="Ne sortez jamais sans votre hoodie de la mort sur le dos. Il vous protégera des situations les plus improbables." rus="Опытный ездок не выйдет из дома без балахона. Капюшон спасет голову почти в любой ситуации." cns="追求闪电般速度的男性机车骑士上衣。"/>
	<string key="N1031208" kor="라이더 블리츠 바지" ger="Blitz's Lethal Leathers" eng="Blitz's Lethal Leathers" tur="Blitz's Lethal Leathers" fre="Blitz's Lethal Leathers" rus="Blitz's Lethal Leathers" cns="闪电骑士（男）裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031208" kor="넷 스피어를 활보하는 라이더 복장으로 가상 세계에서의 어떠한 상황에서도 움직일 수 있게 설계된 바지이다." ger="Alles andere sind billige Fummel! Diese Lederkluft bietet Schutz und Bewegungsfreiheit auf der Piste." eng="Road rash is a drag! These leathers offer superb protection and excellent mobility." tur="Yolda &quot;tahriş&quot; olmak çok can sıkar! Bu deriler harika hareket kabiliyeti ve koruma sağlıyor." fre="Marre d'attraper des coups de soleil dès que vous mettez le nez dehors ? Heureusement, cette superbe tenue en cuir vous protégera des rayons UV sans sacrifier votre liberté de mouvement." rus="Дорога зовет! Кожаные штаны дают отличную защиту и не сковывают движений." cns="追求闪电般速度的男性机车骑士裤子。"/>
	<string key="N1041208" kor="라이더 블리츠 장갑" ger="Blitz's Gashing Gloves" eng="Blitz's Gashing Gloves" tur="Blitz's Gashing Gloves" fre="Blitz's Gashing Gloves" rus="Blitz's Gashing Gloves" cns="闪电骑士（男）手套"/>
	<string key="T1041208" kor="칼날 처럼 날카롭게 제작된 손톱이 부착되어있는 장갑으로 다양한 면에서 유용하다." ger="Du findest, die Teile sehen scharf aus? Dann warte mal, bis du sie spürst! Diese Stulpen mit Klingen sind echt ... spitze!" eng="If you think these gloves look sharp, just wait until you feel them! These bladed gauntlets are the cutting edge." tur="Bu eldivenlerle jilet gibi giyineceğini düşünüyorsan takana kadar bekle! Bu eldivenler hareketlerini keskinleştirecek." fre="Vous avez flashé sur le look de ces gants ornés de lames acérées ? Attendez un peu de les essayer... Vos mains ne voudront plus les quitter !" rus="Выглядят круто, но на ощупь еще круче! Перчатки с заостренными краями на переднем крае моды." cns="追求闪电般速度的男性机车骑士手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051208" kor="라이더 블리츠 신발" ger="Blitz's Speed Sneakers" eng="Blitz's Speed Sneakers" tur="Blitz's Speed Sneakers" fre="Blitz's Speed Sneakers" rus="Blitz's Speed Sneakers" cns="闪电骑士（男）鞋子"/>
	<string key="T1051208" kor="라이더들의 실험과 도전이 그대로 담겨있는 라이더들의 신발이다." ger="Wer einen Bleifuß hat und auf die Tube drücken will, kann mit diesen schnittigen Schuhen so richtig Gummi geben. " eng="Got a lead foot and want to make a dash? These sleek sneaks are the perfect way to burn rubber!" tur="Hız bağımlısısın ve öne fırlamak mı istiyorsun? Bu şık ayakkabılar lastik yakmak için birebir!" fre="Vous avez une course urgente à faire mais vous avez les jambes ankylosées ? Ces chaussures de running ultra résistantes sont faites pour vous !" rus="Хотите втопить по полной? В этих модных ботинках так круто отжигать!" cns="追求闪电般速度的男性机车骑士鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N1001209" kor="라이더 제스 헤어" ger="Jess' Power Pony" eng="Jess' Power Pony" tur="Jess' Power Pony" fre="Jess' Power Pony" rus="Jess' Power Pony" cns="闪电骑士（女）发型"/>
	<string key="T1001209" kor="오른 쪽으로 치우치게 묶어 올린 개성있는 포니테일 스타일의 헤어" ger="Wenn du so schnell bist wie Jess, sind Haare im Gesicht das Letzte, was du brauchst. Binde deine Locken zusammen und gib Vollgas!" eng="When you're as fast as Jess is, the last thing you want is hair in your eyes. Tie those locks back and go full throttle!" tur="Jess kadar hızlıysan son ihtiyacın olan şey saçlarının gözüne girmesidir. O yüzden hepsini arkadan topla ve gazı körükle!" fre="Même dans les situations extrêmes, Jess n'a jamais de mèches dans les yeux. Faites comme elle : attachez vos bouclettes rebelles et roulez à plein gaz !" rus="На скорости, на которой гоняет Jess, волосам в глаза лучше не лезьте. Заправьте их назад – и полный газ!" cns="追求闪电般速度的女性机车骑士发型。"/>
	<string key="N1021209" kor="라이더 제스 후드티" ger="Jess' Haste Hoodie" eng="Jess' Haste Hoodie" tur="Jess' Haste Hoodie" fre="Jess' Haste Hoodie" spa="" ita="" rus="Jess' Haste Hoodie" ame="" cns="闪电骑士（女）上衣" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T1021209" kor="라이더들 중 가장 빠른 그녀만의 복장으로 라이더 복장을 자신의 개성에 맞게 튜닝했다." ger="Wer viel draußen ist, verlässt das Haus nie ohne Super-Hoodie! Einmal angezogen, schützt er Haut und Haar praktisch in jeder Situation. " eng="An experienced rider never leaves home without a killer hoodie. Once equipped, this headgear will save your skin in just about any situation." tur="Deneyimli bir sürücü, şekil bir kapüşon almadan evden çıkmaz. Bu kafalık seni her durumdan kurtaracaktır." fre="Ne sortez jamais sans votre hoodie de la mort sur le dos. Il vous protégera des situations les plus improbables." rus="Опытный ездок не выйдет из дома без балахона. Капюшон спасет голову почти в любой ситуации." cns="追求闪电般速度的女性机车骑士上衣"/>
	<string key="N1031209" kor="라이더 제스 바지" ger="Jess' Lethal Leathers" eng="Jess' Lethal Leathers" tur="Jess' Lethal Leathers" fre="Jess' Lethal Leathers" spa="" ita="" rus="Jess' Lethal Leathers" ame="" cns="闪电骑士（女）裤子" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T1031209" kor="라이더들 중 가장 빠른 그녀만의 복장으로 라이더 복장을 좀 더 활동성이 높게 튜닝했다." ger="Alles andere sind billige Fummel! Diese Lederkluft bietet Schutz und Bewegungsfreiheit auf der Piste." eng="Road rash is a drag! These leathers offer superb protection and excellent mobility." tur="Yolda &quot;tahriş&quot; olmak çok can sıkar! Bu deriler harika hareket kabiliyeti ve koruma sağlıyor." fre="Marre d'attraper des coups de soleil dès que vous mettez le nez dehors ? Heureusement, cette superbe tenue en cuir vous protégera des rayons UV sans sacrifier votre liberté de mouvement." rus="Дорога зовет! Кожаные штаны дают отличную защиту и не сковывают движений." cns="追求闪电般速度的女性机车骑士裤子"/>
	<string key="N1041209" kor="라이더 제스 장갑" ger="Jess' Gashing Gloves" eng="Jess' Gashing Gloves" tur="Jess' Gashing Gloves" fre="Jess' Gashing Gloves" spa="" ita="" rus="Jess' Gashing Gloves" ame="" cns="闪电骑士（女）手套" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T1041209" kor="칼날 처럼 날카롭게 제작된 손톱이 부착되어있는 장갑으로 다양한 면에서 유용하다." ger="Du findest, die Teile sehen scharf aus? Dann warte mal, bis du sie spürst! Diese Stulpen mit Klingen sind echt ... spitze!" eng="If you think these gloves look sharp, just wait until you feel them! These bladed gauntlets are the cutting edge." tur="Bu eldivenlerle jilet gibi giyineceğini düşünüyorsan takana kadar bekle! Bu eldivenler hareketlerini keskinleştirecek." fre="Vous avez flashé sur le look de ces gants ornés de lames acérées ? Attendez un peu de les essayer... Vos mains ne voudront plus les quitter !" rus="Выглядят круто, но на ощупь еще круче! Перчатки с заостренными краями на переднем крае моды." cns="追求闪电般速度的女性机车骑士手套。"/>
	<string key="N1051209" kor="라이더 제스 신발" ger="Jess' Blazing Boots" eng="Jess' Blazing Boots" tur="Jess' Blazing Boots" fre="Jess' Blazing Boots" spa="" ita="" rus="Jess' Blazing Boots" ame="" cns="闪电骑士（女）鞋子" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T1051209" kor="라이더들 중 가장 빠른 그녀를 위해 주문 제작된 신발로 안정성과 스타일 두 가지를 갖추었다." ger="Diese Hammer-Schuhe wurden speziell für das schnellste Girl in der Netsphere entworfen. Sie sind so hartnäckig und heiß wie du!" eng="These specially designed shoes are a must for the fastest girl in the Netsphere. Stable and stylish!" tur="Bu özel tasarım botlar Netsphere'deki en hızlı kadının vazgeçilmezidir. Dayanıklı ve şık!" fre="Ces chaussures ultra confortables sont un must pour la fille la plus rapide de la Netsphere. Elles sont stables et stylées, que demander de plus ?" rus="Разработаны специально для быстрейшей девчонки в Netsphere. Крепкие и стильные!" cns="追求闪电般速度的女性机车骑士鞋子。"/>
	<string key="N2000074" kor="룩스 플라즈마 스워드" ger="Rux Plasma Sword" eng="Rux Plasma Sword" tur="Rux Plasma Sword" fre="Rux Plasma Sword" spa="" ita="" rus="Crystal Plasma Sword" ame="" cns="闪电" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
	<string key="T2000074" kor="라이더들이 자신들의 스타일에 맞게 개량한 플라스마 스워드이다. {N}플라즈마 분해기와 외형을 재설계하여 안정성과 휴대성을 높였다." ger="Ein Plasma Sword für Geschwindigkeits-Junkies:{N}Der neu entwickelte Plasmazerleger in der Waffe sorgt für mehr Stabilität und Handlichkeit." eng="This plasma sword was customized to meet riders' demanding expectations. {N}A redesigned plasma dismantler was utilized to enhance stability and portability." tur="Bu plazma kılıcı, sürücülerin yüksek beklentilerini karşılamak için özelleştirildi. {N}Dayanıklılığı ve taşınabilirliği artırmak için içerisine bir plazma parçalayıcı da eklendi." fre="Cette épée plasma a été spécialement conçue pour répondre aux attentes des motards les plus exigeants.{N}Elle est encore plus stable et pratique à transporter grâce à son démonteur à plasma." rus="Плазменный меч переделан специально для ездоков. {N}Для лучшей стабильности и компактности использован плазменный раздатчик новой конструкции." cns="为闪电骑士专门改装的特典离子重剑。{N}加装了可以提高速度的装置，更便于闪电骑士携带。"/>
	<string key="N4035470" kor="라이더 블리츠 캡슐" ger="Blitz's Rider Capsule" eng="Blitz's Rider Capsule" tur="Blitz's Rider Capsule" fre="Blitz's Rider Capsule" spa="" ita="" rus="Blitz's Rider Capsule" ame="" cns="闪电骑士（男）扭蛋" tha="" twn="" jap="" idn=""/>
