	<string key="T1061210" kor="점점 악에 물들어가는 고귀한 자의 머리 장식" ger="Edle Kopfbedeckung, die ein finsteres Aussehen verleiht." eng="The head accessory of a mysterious nobleman. It's imbued with the power of darkness." tur="Bir asilzadenin karanlığı barındıran kafa takısı" fre="Une coiffe ouvragée ténébreuse." rus="Украшение для головы таинственного благородного гостя. В нем сокрыта сила тьмы." cns="便当夜幕降临，便会苏醒的古老吸血鬼头饰"/>
	<string key="N1011211" kor="바토리의 얼굴" ger="Carmilla's Face" eng="Carmilla's Face" tur="Carmilla's Face" fre="Carmilla's Face" rus="Carmilla's Face" cns="幽灵公主脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011211" kor="아름답지만 위험한 그녀의 얼굴" ger="Wunderschönes Gesicht einer gruseligen Blutgräfin." eng="Carmilla's face is marked by an alluring, yet sinister smile." tur="Ürkünç gülümsemesi olan güzel bir Carmilla yüzü" fre="Un visage gothique au sourire qui fait froid dans le dos." rus="Улыбка Кармиллы пленяет, но в ней есть что-то зловещее." cns="便当夜幕降临，便会在废弃圣堂现身的幽灵公主脸型"/>
	<string key="N1021211" kor="바토리의 블라우스" ger="Carmilla's Dress" eng="Carmilla's Dress" tur="Carmilla's Dress" fre="Carmilla's Dress" rus="Carmilla's Dress" cns="幽灵公主礼服"/>
	<string key="T1021211" kor="할로윈 축제를 즐기러온 위험한 악녀의 블라우스" ger="Edles Kleid für den eleganten Auftritt auf jeder Halloweenparty." eng="The dress of an evil lady who came to enjoy the Halloween party." tur="Cadılar Bayramı partisine gelmiş olan şeytani bir kadının elbisesi" fre="La robe idéale pour assister à la fête d'Halloween." rus="Платье зловещей дамы, пришедшей на Хэллоуин." cns="便当夜幕降临，便会在废弃圣堂现身的幽灵公主上衣"/>
