	<string key="T4052355" kor="C의 폴링 스타 세트 입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Ein komplettes C's Stella Set.{N} Enthält folgende Items:" eng="A complete C's Stella Set.{N} Set contains the following items:" tur="C's Stella Set.{N} Set şu eşyaları içerir:" fre="C's Stella Set complet.{N}Le set contient les objets suivants :" rus="Полный C's Stella Set.{N}В набор входят предметы:" cns="C的自由之星套装{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4160149" kor="C의 플레어 세트 캡슐" ger="C's Iggy Set Capsule" eng="C's Iggy Set Capsule" tur="C's Iggy Set Capsule" fre="Capsule C's Iggy Set" rus="C's Iggy Set Capsule" cns="C的闪光之心套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4160149" kor="C의 플레어 세트 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="C's Iggy Set Capsule. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="C's Iggy Set Capsule. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="C's Iggy Set Capsule. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule C's Iggy Set.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="C's Iggy Set Capsule. {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得C的闪光之心套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4160150" kor="C의 폴링 스타 세트 캡슐" ger="C's Stella Set Capsule" eng="C's Stella Set Capsule" tur="C's Stella Set Capsule" fre="Capsule C's Stella Set" rus="C's Stella Set Capsule" cns="C的自由之星套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4160150" kor="C의 폴링 스타 세트 캡슐입니다. {N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="C's Stella Set Capsule. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="C's Stella Set Capsule. {N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="C's Stella Set Capsule. {N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule C's Stella Set.{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="C's Stella Set Capsule. {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得C的自由之星套装的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2000075" kor="딥 기어스" ger="Sonic Shredder" eng="Sonic Shredder" tur="Sonic Shredder" fre="Sonic Shredder" rus="Sonic Shredder" cns="深渊齿轮"/>
	<string key="T2000075" kor="단숨에 적을 찟어버릴 듯한 강렬한 느낌을 가진 기타로 퍼포먼스를 좋아하는 기타리스트들에게 인기가 많다. {N}물론 소리도 좋다." ger="Unter Rockmusikern gilt die Hardcore-Gitarre als das Nonplusultra. Im Kampf peinigt sie Gegner mit grausig verzerrten Tönen.{N}Außerhalb des Kampfes aber kann man ihr grandiose Sounds entlocken." eng="Popular among up-and-coming rock stars, this hardcore guitar easily shreds enemies using acute sonic distortions.{N}Outside of battle, it transports its avid listeners to new and exciting soundscapes." tur="Ünlenen rock yıldızları arasında popüler olan bu gitar şiddetli distortion sesleriyle rakiplerini paramparça eder. {N} Savaş dışındaysa dinleyicilerini yeni ve heyecan dolu bir ses alemine gönderir." fre="Très populaire auprès des stars montantes du rock, cette guitare électrique réduit les ennemis en charpie grâce à ses à ses larsens lancinants.{N}Hors combat, ses accords percutants transportent les auditeurs vers un monde aux mélodies audacieuses." rus="Популярная среди восходящих рок-звезд гитара рвет врагов на части звуковыми волнами.{N}А когда бой кончается, ее мягкий звук переносит слушателей в новые чарующие миры звука." cns="外表十分可怕，仿佛可以将敌人撕碎{N}实际上只是一把造型奇特的吉他，音色非常不错哟~"/>
	<string key="N4035480" kor="G의 딥 기어스 캡슐" ger="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule" eng="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule" tur="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule" fre="Capsule G's Sonic Shredder" rus="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule" cns="G的深渊齿轮扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035480" kor="G의  딥 기어스 캡슐{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule. {N}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule{N}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule{N}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Capsule G's Sonic Shredder{N}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="G's Sonic Shredder Capsule. {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得G的深渊齿轮的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N6000050" kor="HAPPY 카드" ger="Happy Card" eng="Happy Card" tur="Happy Card" fre="Happy Card" spa="Happy Card" ita="Happy Card" rus="Happy Card" cns="[新]卡片"/>
	<string key="T6000050" kor="크리스마스 이벤트 'HAPPY' 카드" ger="Happy" eng="Happy" tur="Happy" fre="Happy" spa="Happy" ita="Happy" rus="Счастливого" cns="圣诞节活动卡片，上面写着[新]字"/>
	<string key="N6000051" kor="NEW 카드" ger="New Card" eng="New Card" tur="New Card" fre="New Card" spa="New Card" ita="New Card" rus="New Card" cns="[年]卡片"/>
	<string key="T6000051" kor="크리스마스 이벤트 'NEW' 카드" ger="New" eng="New" tur="New" fre="New" spa="New" ita="New" rus="Нового" cns="圣诞节活动卡片，上面写着[年]字"/>
	<string key="N6000052" kor="YEAR 카드" ger="Year Card" eng="Year Card" tur="Year Card" fre="Year Card" spa="Year Card" ita="Year Card" rus="Year Card" cns="[快乐]卡片"/>
	<string key="T6000052" kor="크리스마스 이벤트 'YEAR' 카드" ger="Year" eng="Year" tur="Year" fre="Year" spa="Year" ita="Year" rus="Года" cns="圣诞节活动卡片，上面写着[快乐]两字"/>
	<string key="N1021223" kor="크리스의 롱코트" ger="Klaus's Coat" eng="Klaus's Coat" tur="Klaus's Coat" fre="Klaus's Coat" rus="Klaus's Coat" cns="圣诞克里斯外套"/>
	<string key="T1021223" kor="크리스마스의 따뜻함이 느껴지는 롱코트" ger="Der lange Mantel ist so warm und kuschelig wie ein Weihnachtsabend vor dem Kamin." eng="This long coat is as plush and warm as Christmas morning." tur="Bu uzun pardösü Yılbaşı sabahı kadar yumuşak ve sıcak." fre="Ce long manteau est aussi douillet et chaleureux qu'un matin de Noël au coin de la cheminée." rus="Плащ такой же уютный, как утро на Рождество." cns="圣诞老人的男学徒——克里斯穿的外套"/>
	<string key="N1031223" kor="크리스의 바지" ger="Klaus's Pants" eng="Klaus's Pants" tur="Klaus's Pants" fre="Klaus's Pants" rus="Klaus's Pants" cns="圣诞克里斯裤子"/>
	<string key="T1031223" kor="추운 겨울에도 따뜻함을 느낄수 있는 바지" ger="Diese warmen Hosen bringen dich durch jede Winterkälte." eng="This pair of pants brings warmth to the heart of winter." tur="Bu pantolon kışın kalbine bile sıcaklık getirebilir." fre="Ce pantalon thermique emmagasine la chaleur lorsque la température descend en-dessous de zéro." rus="Штаны сохраняют тепло даже в самую сильную стужу." cns="圣诞老人的男学徒——克里斯穿的裤子"/>
	<string key="N1041223" kor="크리스의 벙어리 장갑" ger="Klaus's Mittens" eng="Klaus's Mittens" tur="Klaus's Mittens" fre="Klaus's Mittens" rus="Klaus's Mittens" cns="圣诞克里斯无指手套"/>
	<string key="T1041223" kor="시려운 손을 따뜻하게 감싸주는 벙어리 장갑" ger="Nie wieder kalte Finger? Mit den flauschigen Handschuhen ist das möglich!" eng="This pair of mittens can instantly warm your frozen hands." tur="Bu eldivenler donmuş ellerini hemen ısıtır." fre="Ces gants réchauffent instantanément vos mains glacées." rus="Теплые перчатки быстро согреют озябшие руки." cns="圣诞老人的男学徒——克里斯戴的无指手套"/>
	<string key="N1051223" kor="크리스의 웜 부츠" ger="Klaus's Boots" eng="Klaus's Boots" tur="Klaus's Boots" fre="Klaus's Boots" rus="Klaus's Boots" cns="圣诞克里斯暖靴"/>
	<string key="T1051223" kor="추운 겨울을 버틸수 있게 해주는 웜 부츠" ger="Schnee, Eis und Matsch auf den Wegen können dir nichts anhaben, wenn du diese gefütterten Stiefel trägst." eng="These insulated boots can get you through the worst that winter has to offer." tur="Bu yalıtımlı çizmeler seni en kışın en kötü günlerinde koruyabilir." fre="Ces bottes isolantes vous permettent de garder les pieds au sec tout l'hiver." rus="Утепленные сапоги спасут от самых лютых холодов." cns="圣诞老人的男学徒——克里斯穿的暖靴"/>
	<string key="N1061223" kor="크리스의 장식" ger="Klaus's Accessory" eng="Klaus's Accessory" tur="Klaus's Accessory" fre="Klaus's Accessory" rus="Klaus's Accessory" cns="圣诞克里斯饰品"/>
	<string key="T1061223" kor="루돌프 코기 포인트인 머리를 따뜻하게 해주는 장식" ger="Was kann weihnachtlicher sein, als warm eingepackt zu sein UND wie Rudolph auszusehen?" eng="There's no better way to look like Rudolph and keep your head warm at the same time!" tur="Rudolph gibi görünüp başını sıcak tutmanın daha iyi bir yolu yoktur!" fre="Qui vous a dit que vous ne pouvez pas ressembler à Rudolphe tout en gardant les oreilles au chaud ?" rus="Мало того, что тепло, так еще и на оленя Рудольфа похоже!" cns="圣诞老人的男学徒——克里斯戴的装饰"/>
	<string key="N1011223" kor="깔끔 머리 페이스" ger="Chiseled Face" eng="Chiseled Face" tur="Chiseled Face" fre="Chiseled Face" rus="Chiseled Face" cns="圣诞克里斯脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011223" kor="깔끔깔끔한 머리 스타일을 가지게 되는 얼굴" ger="Wow, ein Gesicht wie gemeißelt! Dieses Kinn!" eng="So statuesque! Check out that jawline!" tur="Heykel gibi! Şu çeneye bakın!" fre="Un visage anguleux et de grands yeux bleus : Noël sourit aux bienheureux." rus="Какая красота! Ты посмотри на эту челюсть!" cns="圣诞老人的男学徒——克里斯的脸型"/>
	<string key="N1021224" kor="메리의 코트" ger="Klaudia's Coat" eng="Klaudia's Coat" tur="Klaudia's Coat" fre="Klaudia's Coat" rus="Klaudia's Coat" cns="圣诞玛丽外套"/>
	<string key="T1021224" kor="크리스마스의 따뜻함이 느껴지는 코트" ger="Der Wintermantel ist so warm und kuschelig wie ein Weihnachtsabend vor dem Kamin." eng="This winter coat is as snuggly and warm as Christmas morning." tur="Bu uzun pardösü Yılbaşı sabahı kadar kabarık ve sıcak." fre="Ce long manteau est aussi doux et chaleureux qu'un matin de Noël au coin de la cheminée." rus="Зимняя накидка такая же уютная, как утро на Рождество." cns="圣诞老人的女学徒——玛丽穿的外套"/>
	<string key="N1031224" kor="메리의 하의" ger="Klaudia's Pants" eng="Klaudia's Pants" tur="Klaudia's Pants" fre="Klaudia's Pants" rus="Klaudia's Pants" cns="圣诞玛丽裙子"/>
	<string key="T1031224" kor="따뜻한 스타킹과 섹시한 핫팬츠로 개성을 살려낸 하의 패션" ger="Die Kombination aus Shorts und Strümpfen ist vielleicht etwas eigenwillig, aber definitiv weihnachtlich!" eng="This pair of pants with matching stockings captures the wearer's unique personality." tur="Çoraplarla uyumlu bu pantolon giyen kişinin eşsiz kişiliğini yansıtıyor." fre="Cet ensemble short et chaussettes révèle la véritable personnalité de celle qui le porte." rus="Комплект из штанов и чулок так хорошо передает характер владельца." cns="圣诞老人的女学徒——玛丽穿的裙子"/>
	<string key="N1041224" kor="메리의 벙어리 장갑" ger="Klaudia's Mittens" eng="Klaudia's Mittens" tur="Klaudia's Mittens" fre="Klaudia's Mittens" rus="Klaudia's Mittens" cns="圣诞玛丽无指手套"/>
	<string key="T1041224" kor="시려운 손을 따뜻하게 감싸주는 벙어리 장갑" ger="Nie wieder kalte Finger? Mit den flauschigen Handschuhen ist das möglich!" eng="This pair of mittens can instantly warm your frozen hands." tur="Bu eldivenler donmuş ellerini hemen ısıtır." fre="Ces gants réchauffent instantanément vos mains glacées." rus="Теплые перчатки быстро согреют озябшие руки." cns="圣诞老人的女学徒——玛丽戴的无指手套"/>
	<string key="N1051224" kor="메리의 구두" ger="Klaudia's Shoes" eng="Klaudia's Shoes" tur="Klaudia's Shoes" fre="Klaudia's Shoes" rus="Klaudia's Shoes" cns="圣诞玛丽皮靴"/>
	<string key="T1051224" kor="추운 겨울을 버틸수 있게 해주는 따뜻한 구두" ger="Mit diesen gefütterten Stiefeletten bist du modisch auf der Höhe der Zeit und hast trotzdem warme Füße." eng="These insulated shoes can get anyone through the coldest of winters." tur="Bu yalıtımlı ayakkabılar seni kışın en soğuk günlerinde koruyabilir." fre="Ces bottines imperméables protégeront vos petons du froid. Garanties anti-flocons." rus="Утепленные ботинки спасут от самых лютых холодов." cns="圣诞老人的女学徒——玛丽穿的皮靴"/>
	<string key="N1061224" kor="메리의 리본" ger="Klaudia's Ribbon" eng="Klaudia's Ribbon" tur="Klaudia's Ribbon" fre="Klaudia's Ribbon" rus="Klaudia's Ribbon" cns="圣诞玛丽蝴蝶结"/>
	<string key="T1061224" kor="마치 선물 처럼 머리를 장식하고 있는 리본" ger="Nein, das ist keine Geschenkschleife, in deinem Haar sieht sie viel besser aus!" eng="This ribbon looks so good in your hair, it would be a waste to use it on a gift box!" tur="Bu kurdele saçında harika görünüyor, hediye paketinde israf etmek haksızlık olur!" fre="Ce ruban vous va si bien... Tant pis pour Klaus, vous emballerez son cadeau avec de la ficelle." rus="Ленточка так хорошо смотрится в волосах, что ее даже жалко пускать на подарочную упаковку!" cns="圣诞老人的女学徒——玛丽戴的蝴蝶结"/>
	<string key="N1001224" kor="풍성 포니테일" ger="Gorgeous Ponytail" eng="Gorgeous Ponytail" tur="Gorgeous Ponytail" fre="Gorgeous Ponytail" rus="Gorgeous Ponytail" cns="圣诞玛丽发型"/>
	<string key="T1001224" kor="몹시 풍성풍성한 포니테일 헤어 스타일" ger="Wer braucht schon Kampfskills, wenn die Gegner schon beim Anblick dieser grandiosen Frisur völlig gebannt sind?" eng="Who needs combat abilities when a simple hairstyle can leave your enemies stunned?" tur="Düşmanlarını basit bir saç şekliyle etkisiz hale getirebilecekken kimin savaş becerilerine ihtiyacı var ki?" fre="Détournez l'attention de vos adversaires grâce à votre chevelure de rêve. Vous êtes éblouissante." rus="Кому нужно тренироваться, когда одна только твоя прическа поразит врагов?" cns="圣诞老人的女学徒——玛丽的发型"/>
	<string key="N4035481" kor="크리스 캡슐" ger="Klaus Capsule" eng="Klaus Capsule" tur="Klaus Capsule" fre="Klaus Capsule" rus="Klaus Capsule" cns="圣诞克里斯套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035481" kor="크리스 복장 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[유니크 세트 착용 시 슈퍼 레어 이펙트 발생!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Kapsel enthält ein Klaus Costume Set.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Die Ausrüstung eines Unique Sets verleiht dir einen unglaublich seltenen Effekt!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule containing a Klaus Costume Set.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Equipping a Unique Set will grant an incredibly rare effect!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Klaus Costume Set içeren kapsül. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Unique Set giydiğinizde inanılmaz derecede nadir bir etki verir!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Une capsule contenant l'ensemble complet de Klaus.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Le set Unique vous accordera un effet rare !]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула с набором Klaus Costume Set.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Выбрав Уникальный набор, ты получишь невероятный редкий эффект!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得圣诞克里斯套装的扭蛋{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}【穿上特典套装可触发稀有效果！】{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N4035482" kor="메리 캡슐" ger="Klaudia Capsule" eng="Klaudia Capsule" tur="Klaudia Capsule" fre="Klaudia Capsule" rus="Klaudia Capsule" cns="圣诞玛丽套装扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035482" kor="메리 복장 세트를 획득할 수 있는 캡슐입니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[유니크 세트 착용 시 슈퍼 레어 이펙트 발생!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}캡슐 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="Diese Kapsel enthält ein Klaudia Costume Set.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Die Ausrüstung eines Unique Sets verleiht dir einen unglaublich seltenen Effekt!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Diese Kapsel kann folgende Items enthalten:" eng="A capsule containing a Klaudia Costume Set.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Equipping a Unique Set will grant an incredibly rare effect!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="Klaudia Costume Set içeren kapsül. {N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Unique Set giydiğinizde inanılmaz derecede nadir bir etki verir!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Kapsül şu eşyaları rastgele içerir:" fre="Une capsule contenant l'ensemble complet de Kladia.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Le set Unique vous accordera un effet rare !]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Cette capsule donne aléatoirement certains des objets suivants :" rus="Капсула с набором Klaudia Costume Set.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}[Выбрав Уникальный набор, ты получишь невероятный редкий эффект!]{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得圣诞玛丽套装的扭蛋{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}【穿上特典套装可触发稀有效果！】{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
