	<string key="N2010057" kor="AR-03" ger="Tactical AR" eng="Tactical AR" tur="Tactical AR" fre="Tactical AR" rus="Tactical AR" cns="AR-03"/>
	<string key="T2010057" kor="우수한 안정성으로 유명한 어썰트 라이플의 개량형으로 어떠한 환경에서도 제기능을 발휘 할 수 있도록 설계되었다.{N}[넷 스피어 고등학교의 사격술 수업에서 사용되고 있다.]" ger="Modifizierte Version einer Assault Rifle, bekannt für ihre herausragende Sicherheit. Sie wurde entworfen, um aus jeder Art von Umgebung das Beste rauszuholen.{N}[Wird beim Schießtraining an der Netsphere Highschool benutzt]" eng="Modified version of an assault rifle well-known for its excellent safety. It's been designed to work in its full potential in any type of environment.{N}[Used in Marksmanship Training at Netsphere Highschool]" tur="Assault Rifle’ın modifiye edilmiş versiyonu. Her türlü ortam şartında tam verimli çalışacak şekilde tasarlandı.{N}[Netsphere Lisesi Nişancılık Eğitiminde kullanılıyor]" fre="Version modifiée d'un fusil d'assaut connu pour son excellente sécurité. Il a été conçu pour pouvoir donner le maximum de son potentiel dans tout type d'environnement.{N}[Utilisé dans l'entraînement de Tireur d'Élite au collège Netsphere]" rus="Измененная версия штурмовой винтовки, известной своей безопасностью. Создана для безупречной работы в любых погодных условиях.{N}[Используется на стрелковых тренировках в средней школе Netsphere]" cns="红蜂帝国根据现实中的枪械，移植到极限战网的特典突击步枪{N}被誉为枪王的经典枪械，在任何环境下都能发挥不错的战力"/>
	<string key="N4035492" kor="G의 AR-03 캡슐" ger="G's Tactical AR Capsule" eng="G's Tactical AR Capsule" tur="G's Tactical AR Capsule" fre="G's Tactical AR Capsule" rus="G's Tactical AR Capsule" cns="G的AR-03扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035492" kor="G의  AR-03 캡슐{N}캡슐 아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤하게 지급됩니다." ger="G's Tactical AR Capsule {N} Enthält eines der folgenden zufälligen Items:" eng="G's Tactical AR Capsule {N} The capsule contains the following items at random:" tur="G's Tactical AR Capsule {N} Kapsül aşağıdaki eşyalardan birini rastgele içerir:" fre="G's Tactical AR Capsule {N} La capsule contient au hasard l'un des objets suivants:" rus="G's Tactical AR Capsule {N}Капсула содержит случайные предметы:" cns="可以获得G的AR-03的扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
