	<string key="N1021237" kor="델피노의 레쉬가드 상의" ger="Delfino Rashguard Top" eng="Delfino Rashguard Top" tur="Delfino Rashguard Top" fre="Rashguards Delfino Top" rus="Delfino Rashguard Top" cns="深海猎手（男）上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021237" kor="위험한 자외선뿐만 아니라 몸을 상하게 하는 것이라면 모두 막아내어 몸을 지켜주는 델피노 레쉬가드 상의" ger="Das Delfino Rashguard Top beschützt dich vor den schädigenden UV-Strahlen, so wie alles andere, was eurem Körper schaden könnte." eng="Delfino Rashguard Top protects you from the harmful ultraviolet rays as well as anything else that might harm your body." tur="Delfino Rashguard Top, seni hem zararlı ultraviyole ışınlarından hem de vücuduna zarar verebilecek başka herşeyden korur." fre="Rashguards Delfino Top vous protège des dangereux rayons ultraviolets ainsi que de toute autre menace à votre corps." rus="Delfino Rashguard Top защищает твое тело от вредных ультрафиолетовых лучей и прочих вредоносных воздействий." cns="专门潜入深海探索宝藏的男性猎手上衣"/>
