	<string key="N3000007" kor="유니크 듀얼 마스터리" ger="Unique Dual-Mastery" eng="Unique Dual Mastery" tur="Unique Dual-Mastery" fre="Unique Dual-Mastery" rus="Unique Dual-Mastery" cns="特典生存加持"/>
	<string key="T3000007" kor="체력과 SP가 같이 증가하는 듀얼 마스터리의 체력 향상 시스템과 SP 지원 시스템을 업그레이드하여 기존의 듀얼 마스터리 보다 5 정도 더 효과적인 능력을 가진 듀얼 마스터리이다." ger="Sowohl die HP, als auch die SP sind erhöht beim upgraden des HP-Verbesserungssystems und dem SP-Supportsystems der Dual Mastery und im Vergleich zum Vorgänger, ist es weit aus effektiver und ca. 5 mal besser." eng="Both HP and SP increase +5 compared to the previous Dual-Mastery due to the upgrade of the Enhancement and SP Support Systems." tur="Dual Mastery'nin güç yükseltme sistemi ve SP destek sistemi geliştirilerek hem Güç hem de SP birlikte arttırılır, daha önceki Dual-Mastery'ye göre daha verimlidir ve 5 kadar daha fazla arttırır." fre="Force et PC sont augmentés simultanément en mettant à jour le système d'amélioration de force et le système de support de PC de la Dual Mastery. En comparaison de la précédente version du système, l'efficacité est augmentée de 5." rus="Благодаря улучшению системы повышения силы и системы поддержки SP увеличиваются и сила и SP. По сравнению с Dual-Mastery увеличение больше примерно на 5 пунктов." cns="在原本的生存加持基础上进行了强化，提高了生命和能量上限，让玩家可以生存更长的时间。"/>
	<string key="N4052658" kor="한여름의 보물상자" ger="Mittsommer-Schatztruhe" eng="Midsummer's Treasure Chest" tur="Midsummer's Treasure Chest" fre="Coffre au trésor Midsummer" rus="Midsummer's Treasure Chest" cns="夏日宝物箱"/>
	<string key="T4052658" kor="최신 상품 {CB-255,255,0,255}유니크 듀얼 마스터리{CB-255,255,255,255}와 다양한 상품들이 들어있는 보물 상자." ger="Eine Schatztruhe, die verschiedene einzigartige Skills, Capsules und das neuste Item, Unique Dual-Mastery, enthält." eng="This Treasure Chest includes several unique skills, capsules and the newest Unique Dual Mastery." tur="Çeşitli benzersiz yetenekler, capsules ve en son eşya, Unique Dual-Mastery içeren bir hazine sandığı." fre="Un Coffre au trésor {CB-255,255,0,255}contenant divers compétences uniques, capsules{CB-255,255,255,255} et le tout dernier objet, Unique Dual-Mastery." rus="Сундук с сокровищами, {CB-255,255,0,255}в котором сокрыты уникальные умения{CB-255,255,255,255} и новейший предмет Unique Dual-Mastery." cns="装有{CB-255,255,0,255}特典生存加持{CB-255,255,255,255}和不同特典技能的宝物箱"/>
	<string key="N6000053" kor="여름 쿠폰" ger="Sommer-Coupons" eng="Summer Coupons" tur="Summer Coupons (Yaz Kuponları)" fre="Summer Coupons" rus="Летние купоны" cns="夏日兑换券"/>
	<string key="T6000053" kor="6장을 모으면 이벤트 페이지에서 다양한 선물이 들어있는 {CB-255,255,0,255}한여름의 보물상자{CB-255,255,255,255}를 얻을수 있습니다!!" ger="Wenn du 6 Coupons gesammelt hast, kannst du die {CB-255,255,0,255}Mittsommer-Schatztruhe{CB-255,255,255,255} erlangen, welche verschiedene Geschenke der Geschenkseite enthält!" eng="Collect 6 coupons to obtain the {CB-255,255,0,255}Midsummer's Treasure Chest{CB-255,255,255,255} containing many gifts from the Events Page!" tur="6 kupon topladığınızda, Etkinlikler sayfasından çeşitli hediyeler taşıyan {CB-255,255,0,255}Midsummer's Treasure Chest{CB-255,255,255,255} elde edebilirsiniz!" fre="Lorsque vous rassemblerez 6 coupons, vous pourrez obtenir le {CB-255,255,0,255}Coffre au trésor Midsummer{CB-255,255,255,255}. Celui-ci contient diverses récompenses provenant de la page des Events !" rus="Собрав 6 купона, на странице «События» ты можешь получить {CB-255,255,0,255}Midsummer's Treasure Chest{CB-255,255,255,255} с ценным содержимым!" cns="集齐6张，可以获得活动页面中各种礼物的{CB-255,255,0,255}夏日宝物箱{CB-255,255,255,255}！！"/>
	<string key="N1021239" kor="투파 상의" ger="Tupa Top" eng="Tupa Top" tur="Tupa Top" fre="Tupa Top" rus="Tupa Top" cns="图帕族勇士上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021239" kor="야성미가 느껴지는 큰 뿔의 투파 상의" ger="Ein Tupa Top mit einem langen Horn, welches Männlichkeit ausstrahlt." eng="A tank top to show how buff you are!" tur="Erkeksiliği vurgulayan büyük bir boynuz içeren Tupa üstlüğü." fre="Un Top Tupa à la coupe proclamant la masculinité." rus="Верх Tupa с очень мужественным рогом." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族勇士上衣"/>
	<string key="N1031239" kor="투파 하의" ger="Tupa Bottom" eng="Tupa Bottom" tur="Tupa Bottom" fre="Tupa Bottom" rus="Tupa Bottom" cns="图帕族勇士下装"/>
	<string key="T1031239" kor="통풍이 잘되기 때문에 하루종일 시원함을 느낄 수 있는 투파 하의" ger="Ein luftiges Tupa Bottom, welches dich den ganzen Tag kühl hält." eng="Fresh and cool short that help you beat the heat." tur="Gün boyu serinlik sağlayan iyi havalandırılmış Tupa altlığı." fre="Un bas Tupa qui vous gardera au frais toute la journée." rus="Дышащий низ Tupa – прохлада целый день." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族勇士下装"/>
	<string key="N1041239" kor="투파 장갑" ger="Tupa Gloves" eng="Tupa's Gloves" tur="Tupa Gloves" fre="Tupa Gloves" rus="Tupa Gloves" cns="图帕族勇士手套"/>
	<string key="T1041239" kor="착용한지도 모르는 편안함의 투파 장갑" ger="Diese Handschuhe sind so bequem, dass du noch nicht einmal merkst, dass du sie trägst. " eng="These gloves are so comfy that you won't notice that you're wearing them. " tur="Onları giydiğinizin farkına varamayacağınız kadar rahat Tupa eldivenleri. " fre="Des gants Tupa si confortables que vous oublierez que vous les portez. " rus="Перчатки Tupa такие удобные, что их вообще не чувствуешь, когда носишь." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族勇士手套"/>
	<string key="N1051239" kor="투파 샌들" ger="Tupa Sandals" eng="Tupa Sandals" tur="Tupa sandals" fre="Tupa Sandals" rus="Tupa sandals" cns="图帕族勇士凉鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051239" kor="빠른 이동에도 닳지않는 튼튼한 투파 샌들" ger="Robuste Tupa Sandals die nicht verschleißen, auch wenn du schnell und häufig mit ihnen läufst." eng="These long-lasting sandals are the perfect companion to any mission." tur="Hızlı hareketlerinize rağmen aşınmayacak sert Tupa sandalları(terlikleri)" fre="Des sandales solides qui ne s'useront pas de sitôt." rus="Крепкие сандалии Tupa, способные выдержать самые сложные условия." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族勇士凉鞋"/>
	<string key="N1001239" kor="투파 타투헤어" ger="Tupa Tattoo" eng="Tupa's Hair Tattoo" tur="Tupa tattoo hair" fre="Tupa tattoo hair" rus="Tupa tattoo hair" cns="图帕族勇士头发"/>
	<string key="T1001239" kor="자신감을 키워주는 투파 타투헤어" ger="Diese lässt dein Selbstvertrauen wachen. " eng="Boost your confidence with this tattoo. " tur="Özgüveninizi arttıracak Tupa tattoo saçı " fre="Ce tatouage est une excellente façon d'améliorer votre confiance en vous-même. " rus="Волосы и татуировка Tupa придадут тебе уверенности." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族勇士头发"/>
	<string key="N1011239" kor="투파 타투얼굴" ger="Tupa Face Tattoo" eng="Tupa's Face Tattoo" tur="Tupa tattoo face" fre="Tupa tattoo face" rus="Tupa tattoo face" cns="图帕族勇士脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011239" kor="태양에 그을린 구리빛 피부로 여심을 흔들 수 있는 투파 타투얼굴" ger="Eine Tätowierung, welches die Herzen von Frauen zum schmelzen bringen wird, wenn die Sonne auf deine strahlende Haut fällt. " eng="The reflection of the sun gleaming all over your tattooed face will captivate everyone around. " tur="Parıldayan teninizden güneş ışınları yansıdığında kadınların kalbini çalacak Tupa tattoo yüzü " fre="Ce tatouage touchera les femmes au cœur lorsque le soleil le mettra en valeur. " rus="Татуировка для лица Tupa – когда солнце касается твоего лица, тают женские сердца." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族勇士脸型"/>
	<string key="N1021240" kor="라마나 상의" ger="Ramana Top" eng="Ramana Top" tur="Ramana top" fre="Ramana Top" rus="Ramana top" cns="图帕族女王上衣"/>
	<string key="T1021240" kor="자연의 시원함과 섹시함을 느낄 수 있는 라마나 상의" ger="Dieses Top lässt dich eine natürliche Briese spüren und zeigt deine sexy Seite." eng="Enjoy the cool and refreshing breeze with this top." tur="Doğanın esintisini ve seksiliğini hissetmenizi sağlayan Ramana üstlüğü." fre="Un top qui vous permettra de ressentir une plus grande connexion avec la nature." rus="Верх Ramana – прохлада и сексуальность самой природы." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族女王上衣"/>
	<string key="N1031240" kor="라마나 하의" ger="Ramana Bottom" eng="Ramana Bottom" tur="Ramana bottom" fre="Ramana Bottom" rus="Ramana bottom" cns="图帕族女王下装"/>
	<string key="T1031240" kor="오크나뭇잎을 엮어 자연스럽게 다리를 감싸주는 라마나 하의. 나뭇잎에 베일 수도 있는 치명적인 아찔함이 포인트다." ger="Das Ramana Bottom besteht aus Eichenblättern, welche ziemlich natürlich um deine Beine liegen. Das fatale Risiko, von den Blättern geschnitten zu werden, ist ein einzigartiges Merkmal, das zum Tragen kommt. " eng="The oak leaves in this piece of clothing are an absolute delight to your legs.  Its dazzling greeneryis a truly unique feature. " tur="Doğal olarak bacaklarınızı saran meşe yapraklarından örülmüş Ramana altlığı. Yaprakların bacaklarınızı kesme ölümcül riski de eşsiz özelliğidir. " fre="Ce bottom est tissée avec l'ajout de grandes feuilles qui s'enroulent avec grâce autour ds jambes. Le danger de se faire couper par celles-ci ne fait que rajouter à l'impression unique donnée par ce vêtement. " rus="Низ Ramana, сплетенный из дубовых листьев, вьющихся вокруг твоих ног. Отдельная фишка – возможность порезаться кромками листьев." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族女王下装"/>
	<string key="N1041240" kor="라마나 오크팔찌" ger="Ramana Eichen-Armband" eng="Ramana Oak Bracelet" tur="Ramana oak bracelet" fre="Ramana oak bracelet" rus="Ramana oak bracelet" cns="图帕族女王手链"/>
	<string key="T1041240" kor="오크 나무의 새순으로 만들어진 귀여운 나뭇잎 팔찌" ger="Ein süßes Armband, welches aus Eichensprossen und Blättern gemacht ist." eng="A cute bracelet made of true oak tree branches and leaves." tur="Meşe ağacı filiz ve yapraklarından yapılmış şirin bir bileklik." fre="Un joli bracelet fait à partir de petites branches et de feuilles." rus="Милый браслет из побегов и листьев дуба." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族女王手链"/>
	<string key="N1051240" kor="라마나 샌들" ger="Ramana Sandals" eng="Ramana Sandals" tur="Ramana Sandals" fre="Ramana Sandals" rus="Ramana sandals" cns="图帕族女王凉鞋"/>
	<string key="T1051240" kor="력성이 좋아 발이 편하고 쉽게 찢어지지 않는 라마나 샌들" ger="Sehr elastische Sandalen, welche es sehr bequem machen und nicht so schnell verschleißen." eng="Its elasticity prevents these sandals from tearing down and makes them extremely comfy." tur="Kolayca yırtılmayan ve esnekliği nedeniyle oldukça rahat olan Ramana sandalları(terlikleri)." fre="Ces sandales sont solides mais gardent malgré tout une bonne souplesse." rus="Сандалии Ramana – прочные, эластичные и удобные." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族女王凉鞋"/>
	<string key="N1061240" kor="라마나 머리장식" ger="Ramana Frisur-Accessoire" eng="Ramana Hair Accessory" tur="Ramana hair accessory" fre="Ramana Hair Accessory" rus="Ramana hair accessory" cns="图帕族女王饰品"/>
	<string key="T1061240" kor="열대숲의 있을 법한 토템의 문양이 새겨진 라마나 머리장식" ger="Ein Accessoire mit Eingravierungen von Totem-Symbolen, welche meistens in den Tropen zu finden sind. " eng="Bring some tropical spirit to you hair with this engraved totem symbols from the forest. " tur="Tropik ormanlarda görülmesi muhtemel totem sembolleriyle işlenmiş Ramana saç aksesuarı " fre="Cet accessoire est gravé de symboles totémiques qu'ont peut voir dans les forêts tropicales. " rus="Аксессуар для волос Ramana с гравировкой в виде тотемных символов из тропических лесов." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族女王装饰"/>
	<string key="N1011240" kor="라마나 얼굴" ger="Ramana Face" eng="Ramana's Face" tur="Ramana face" fre="Ramana Face" rus="Ramana face" cns="图帕族女王脸型"/>
	<string key="T1011240" kor="열대바다 색을 담은 눈빛이 매력인 라마나 얼굴. 한번 빠지면 헤어나올 수 없다." ger="Ramana Face mit faszinierenden Augen in der Farbe des Meeres. Du kannst sie nicht vergessen, nach dem du sie einmal gesehen hast." eng="Ramana's eyes mirror the calm and peaceful waves of the blue ocean. There's no escape once you have fallen for them." tur="Büyüleyici deniz rengi gözleriyle Ramana yüzü. O gözlere bir kere bakınca başka yere kaçamayacaksınız." fre="Ce visage possède des yeux de la couleur de la mer. Difficile d'en détourner les yeux, une fois que fois que vous avez posé les yeux dessus." rus="Лицо Ramana с глазами цвета морской волны. От них просто невозможно отвернуться." cns="以树之灵为信仰，生活在丛林深处的图帕族女王脸型"/>
	<string key="N2000080" kor="하푼 플라즈마 스워드" ger="Harpoon Plasma Sword" eng="Harpoon Plasma Sword" tur="Harpoon Plasma Sword" fre="Harpoon Plasma Sword" rus="Harpoon Plasma Sword" cns="橡木鱼叉"/>
	<string key="T2000080" kor="오크 나무로 만들어져 쉽게 부러지지 않으며,{N}갓 잡은 물고기가 아직도 싱싱한 것이 포인트입니다." ger="Aus Eichenblättern gefertigt ist es ziemlich robust, {N}und der Hauptaspekt dahinter ist, dass der frisch gefangene Fisch noch frisch bleibt." eng="The oak tree wood makes it hard to break, {N} and the best part is that the fish was recently caught and is still fresh." tur="Meşe ağaçlarından yapılmıştır, kolayca kırılmaz, {N}ve önemli nokta yeni yakalanan balıkların hala taze olması." fre="Fait à partir d'un bois très dur, {N}il sort du lot avec ce poisson fraîchement pêché qui y est toujours planté." rus="Такой прочный, ведь он сделан из дуба. {N}А пойманная рыба дольше остается свежей." cns="由橡木制成的特典离子重剑{N}一插击中，都不需要瞄准！不愧为鱼叉界的神器！"/>
	<string key="N4035515" kor="투파의 패키지 캡슐" ger="Tupa Package Capsule" eng="Tupa Package Capsule" tur="Tupa package capsule" fre="Tupa Package Capsule" rus="Tupa package capsule" cns="图帕族勇士礼包扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035515" kor="투파의 패키지 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}발리언트 울프는 7일, 15일, 30일에서 랜덤으로 적용됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 투파 유니크 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Tupa Package Capsule genutzt wird,{N} wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Days, 15 Day, 30 Days oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Valiant Wolf wird zufällig mit 7 Days, 15 Days oder 30 Days ausgegeben.{N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Tupa Unique Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Tupa Package Capsule{N}, the item receives a random duration of 7, 15, and 30 days or it can be permanent.{N}{N}Valiant Wolf only receives a duration ranging from 7, 15 until 30 Days.{N}{N}The Unique Booster is only applied to the Tupa Unique Set (Permanent)." tur="Tupa package capsule kullandığınızda{N}, şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir.{N}{N}Valiant Wolf rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, ya da 30 gün süreyle uygulanır.{N}{N}Benzersiz İhtimali Yükseltme sadece Tupa Unique Set (kalıcı) için kullanılabilir." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Tupa Package Capsule{N}, un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent. {N}{N}Valiant Wolf recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours.{N}{N}La Unique Probability-Up sera seulement appliquée au Tupa Unique Set (Permanent)." rus="Использовав капсулу Tupa package capsule,{N} ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия – 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Срок действия Valiant Wolf – 7, 15 или 30 дней.{N}{N}Unique Probability-Up можно применить только для Tupa Unique Set (Бессрочн.)." cns="图帕族勇士礼包扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可以随机获得下列道具（7天，15天，30天，永久）{N}{N}勇者狼（7天，15天，30天）{N}{N}特典概率提升只能用于获得图帕族勇士特典套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="N4035516" kor="라마나의 패키지 캡슐" ger="Ramana Package Capsule" eng="Ramana Package Capsule" tur="Ramana package capsule" fre="Ramana package capsule" rus="Ramana package capsule" cns="图帕族女王礼包扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035516" kor="라마나의 패키지 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}발리언트 울프는 7일, 15일, 30일에서 랜덤으로 적용됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 라마나 유니크 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Ramana Package Capsule genutzt wird,{N} wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Days, 15 Day, 30 Days oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Valiant Wolf wird zufällig mit 7 Days, 15 Days oder 30 Days ausgegeben. {N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Ramana Unique Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Ramana Package Capsule, {N}the item receives a random duration of 7, 15, and 30 days or it can be permanent.{N}{N}Valiant Wolf only receives a duration ranging from 7, 15 until 30 Days. {N}{N}Increased Unique Probability is only applied to Ramana Unique Set (Permanent)." tur="Ramana package capsule kullandığınızda{N}, şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir.{N}{N}Valiant Wolf rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, ya da 30 gün süreyle uygulanır. {N}{N}Benzersiz İhtimali Yükseltme sadece Ramana Unique Set (kalıcı) için kullanılabilir." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Ramana Package Capsule{N}, un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent. {N}{N}Valiant Wolf recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours. {N}{N}La Unique Probability-Up sera seulement appliquée au Ramana Unique Set (Permanent)." rus="Использовав капсулу Ramana Package Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия – 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Срок действия Valiant Wolf – 7, 15 или 30 дней.{N}{N}Unique Probability-Up можно применить только для Ramana Unique Set (Бессрочн.)." cns="图帕族女王礼包扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可以随机获得下列道具（7天，15天，30天，永久）{N}{N}勇者狼（7天，15天，30天）{N}{N}特典概率提升只能用于获得图帕族女王特典套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="N4052656" kor="투파의 파츠 캡슐 (M)" ger="Tupa Teile Capsule (M)" eng="Tupa Part Capsule (M)" tur="Tupa Parts Capsule (M)" fre="Tupa Parts Capsule (M)" rus="Tupa Parts Capsule (M)" cns="图帕族勇士部件扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4052656" kor="투파의 파츠 캡슐 (M){N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다. {N}{N}해당 아이템은 유니크  활률업이 적용되지 않습니다." ger="Wenn Tupa Package Capsule (M) genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Days, 15 Day, 30 Days oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt. {N}{N}Das ausgewählte Item profitiert nicht von der Erhöhten Unique Probability." eng="When you use the Tupa Part Capsule, {N}the item receives a random duration of 7, 15, and 30 days or it can be permanent. {N}{N}The selected item does not benefit from the Increased Unique Probability." tur="Tupa Parts Capsule (M) kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir. {N}{N}Seçilen eşya Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalinden faydalanamaz." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Tupa Package Capsule{N}, un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent. {N}{N}L'objet sélectionné ne bénéficiera pas de la Increased Unique Probability." rus="Использовав капсулу Tupa Parts Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия – 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно. {N}{N}Выбранный предмет не получает бонуса от увеличенной вероятности уникальности." cns="图帕族勇士的部件扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可以随机获得下列道具（7天，15天，30天，永久）{N}{N}特典概率提升对该道具无效"/>
	<string key="N4052657" kor="라마나의 파츠 캡슐 (F)" ger="Ramana Parts Capsule (W)" eng="Ramana Parts Capsule (F)" tur="Ramana Parts Capsule (F)" fre="Ramana Parts Capsule (F)" rus="Ramana Parts Capsule (F)" cns="图帕族女王部件扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4052657" kor="라마나의 파츠 캡슐 (F){N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다. {N}{N}해당 아이템은 유니크  활률업이 적용되지 않습니다." ger="Wenn Ramana Package Capsule (W) genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Days, 15 Day, 30 Days oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt. {N}{N}Das ausgewählte Item profitiert nicht von der Erhöhten Unique Probability." eng="When you use the Ramana Part Capsule, {N}the item receives a random duration of 7, 15, and 30 days or it can be permanent. {N}{N}The selected item does not benefit from the Increased Unique Probability." tur="Ramana Parts Capsule (F) kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir. {N}{N}Seçilen eşya Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalinden faydalanamaz." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Ramana Package Capsule{N}, un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent. {N}{N}L'objet sélectionné ne bénéficiera pas de la Increased Unique Probability." rus="Использовав капсулу Ramana Parts Capsule (F),{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия – 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно. {N}{N}Выбранный предмет не получает бонуса от увеличенной вероятности уникальности." cns="图帕族女王的部件扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可以随机获得下列道具（7天，15天，30天，永久）{N}{N}特典概率提升对该道具无效"/>
	<string key="N4035517" kor="원주민 도구 캡슐" ger="Native Tool Capsule" eng="Native Tool Capsule" tur="Native Tool Capsule" fre="Native Tool Capsule" rus="Native Tool Capsule" cns="图帕族工具扭蛋"/>
	<string key="T4035517" kor="원주민 도구 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다. {N}{N}유니크 확률업은 하푼 플라즈마 스워드(내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Native Tool Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Days, 15 Day, 30 Days oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt. {N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Harpoon Plasma Sword (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Native Tool Capsule, {N}the item receives a random duration of 7, 15, and 30 days or it can be permanent. {N}{N}Unique Booster is only applied to Harpoon Plasma Sword (Permanent)." tur="Native Tool Capsule kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir. {N}{N}Benzersiz İhtimali Yükseltme sadece Harpoon Plasma Sword (kalıcı) için kullanılabilir." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Ramana Package Capsule{N}, un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent. {N}{N}La Unique Probability-Up sera seulement appliquée à la Harpoon Plasma Sword (Permanent)." rus="Использовав капсулу Native Tool Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия – 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно. {N}{N}Unique Probability-Up можно применить только для Harpoon Plasma Sword (Бессрочн.)." cns="土著人工具扭蛋{N}使用扭蛋时，可以随机获得下列道具（7天，15天，30天，永久）{N}{N}特典概率提升只能用于获得鱼叉离子重剑（永久）"/>
	<string key="N4052659" kor="투파 유니크 세트 (내구제)" ger="Tupa Unique Set (Permanent)" eng="Tupa Unique Set (Permanent)" tur="Tupa Unique Set (Kalıcı)" fre="Tupa Unique Set (Permanent)" rus="Tupa Unique Set (Бессрочн.)" cns="图帕族勇士特典套装（永久）"/>
	<string key="T4052659" kor="투파 유니크 세트 (내구제)입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Dies ist das Tupa Unique Set (Permanent).{N}Es enthält folgende Items:" eng="The Tupa Unique Set (Permanent) {N}contains the following items:" tur="Tupa Unique Set (Kalıcı).{N}Set şu eşyaları içerir:" fre="Voici le Tupa Unique Set (Permanent).{N}Le Set contient les objets suivants :" rus="Tupa Unique Set (Бессрочн.).{N}В набор входят предметы:" cns="图帕族勇士特典套装（永久）{N}使用套装时，可随机获得下列道具"/>
