	<string key="N4052774" kor="출석부 6일 보상 (복귀)" ger="6-Day Attendance Reward (Return)" eng="6-Day Attendance Reward (Return)" tur="6-Gün Attendance Reward (Geri Gelen)" fre="Récompense 6 jours de connexion (Retour)" rus="Награда за вход в течение 6 дней (возвр.)" cns="小天狼星鞋子"/>
	<string key="T4052774" kor="출석부 6일 보상 (복귀)입니다.{N}사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Das ist der 6-Day Attendance Reward (Return).{N}Bei Nutzung wird eines der folgenden Items ausgegeben." eng="Obtain all of the following items{N}using the 6-Day Attendance Reward (Return)." tur="6-Gün Attendance Reward (Geri Gelen).{N}Kullanıldığında aşağıdakiler gibi bir eşya verir." fre="Voici la Récompense 6 jours de connexion (Retour).{N} Lorsque vous l'utilisez, un objet de la liste suivante vous sera donné." rus="Награда за вход в течение 6 дней (возвр.).{N}При использовании ты получишь такой предмет." cns="在月圆之夜原形毕露的小天狼星鞋子"/>
	<string key="N4052775" kor="출석부 3일 보상 (신규)" ger="3-Day Attendance Reward (New)" eng="3-Day Attendance Reward (New)" tur="3-Gün Attendance Reward (Yeni)" fre="Récompense 3 jours de connexion (Nouveau)" rus="Награда за вход в течение 3 дней (нов.)" cns="小天狼星脸型"/>
	<string key="T4052775" kor="출석부 3일 보상 (신규)입니다.{N}사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Das ist der 3-Day Attendance Reward (New).{N}Bei Nutzung wird eines der folgenden Items ausgegeben." eng="Obtain all of the following items{N}using the 3-Day Attendance Reward (New)." tur="3-Gün Attendance Reward (Yeni).{N}Kullanıldığında aşağıdakiler gibi bir eşya verir." fre="Voici la Récompense 3 jours de connexion (Nouveau).{N} Lorsque vous l'utilisez, un objet de la liste suivante vous sera donné." rus="Награда за вход в течение 3 дней (нов.).{N}При использовании ты получишь такой предмет." cns="在月圆之夜原形毕露的小天狼星脸型"/>
	<string key="N4052776" kor="출석부 6일 보상 (신규)" ger="6-Day Attendance Reward (New)" eng="6-Day Attendance Reward (New)" tur="6-Gün Attendance Reward (Yeni)" fre="Récompense 6 jours de connexion (Nouveau)" rus="Награда за вход в течение 6 дней (нов.)" cns="小天狼星尾巴"/>
	<string key="T4052776" kor="출석부 6일 보상 (신규)입니다.{N}사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Das ist der 6-Day Attendance Reward (New).{N}Bei Nutzung wird eines der folgenden Items ausgegeben." eng="Obtain all of the following items{N}using the 6-Day Attendance Reward (New)." tur="6-Gün Attendance Reward (Yeni).{N}Kullanıldığında aşağıdakiler gibi bir eşya verir." fre="Voici la Récompense 6 jours de connexion (Nouveau).{N} Lorsque vous l'utilisez, un objet de la liste suivante vous sera donné." rus="Награда за вход в течение 6 дней (нов.).{N}При использовании ты получишь такой предмет." cns="在月圆之夜原形毕露的小天狼星尾巴"/>
	<string key="N1070015" kor="에그 펌비" ger="Egg Fumbi" eng="Egg Fumbi" tur="Egg Fumbi" fre="Egg Fumbi" rus="Egg Fumbi" cns="梦魇魔女上衣"/>
	<string key="T1070015" kor="알 모양으로 제작된 귀여운 펌비" ger="Niedlicher, eiförmiger Fumbi." eng="Cute egg-shaped fumbi." tur="Yumurta şeklinde şirin bir fumbi." fre="Un mignon petit fumbi en forme d'œuf." rus="Прелестный Fumbi в форме яйца." cns="出现在你最深梦魇里的苍白少女——梦魇魔女上衣"/>
	<string key="N1021241" kor="라이코스의 상의" ger="Lycos' Top" eng="Lycos' Top" tur="Lycos' Top" fre="Lycos' Top" rus="Lycos' Top" cns="梦魇魔女吊带裙"/>
	<string key="T1021241" kor="근육세포가 급격하게 분열되어 몸체가 커져버린 라이코스의 상의." ger="Ein Top für Lycos, dem aufgrund seines schnellen Muskelwachstums die alten Kleider nicht mehr passen." eng="A Top for Lycos' huge body due to the accelerated growth of his muscle cells." tur="Lycos'un kas hücrelerinin hızlı artışı nedeniyle gelişen muazzam bedenine uygun bir Top." fre="Un top adapté au corps de Lycos, incroyablement musclé par la croissance accélérée de ses cellules." rus="Верхняя часть костюма Ликоса, чье туловище стало огромным из-за ускоренного роста мышечных клеток." cns="出现在你最深梦魇里的苍白少女——梦魇魔女吊带裙"/>
	<string key="N1031241" kor="라이코스의 하의" ger="Lycos' Bottom" eng="Lycos' Bottom" tur="Lycos' Bottom" fre="Lycos' Bottom" rus="Lycos' Bottom" cns="梦魇魔女手套"/>
	<string key="T1031241" kor="늑대의 끈질긴 지구력을 가진 라이코스의 하의. 목표로 잡은 사냥감을 따라잡는데 지치지 않는다." ger="Lycos' Bottom verleiht ihm die unermüdliche Ausdauer des Wolfes. So ermüdet er nicht, während er seine Beute jagt." eng="Lycos' Bottom grants the tireless endurance of the wolf. He would never get tired while chasing his prey." tur="Lycos' Bottom kurtun bitmez tükenmez dayanıklılığını sağlar. Avını kovalarken asla yorgun düşmez." fre="Lycos' Bottom lui garantit une endurance sans limite, semblable à celle du loup. Il peut ainsi chasser une proie sans jamais se fatiguer." rus="Нижняя часть костюма Ликоса придает неутомимость и выносливость волка. С ней он никогда не уставал преследовать жертву." cns="出现在你最深梦魇里的苍白少女——梦魇魔女手套"/>
	<string key="N1041241" kor="라이코스의 손갈퀴" ger="Lycos' Clawhand" eng="Lycos' Clawhand" tur="Lycos' Clawhand" fre="Lycos' Clawhand" rus="Lycos' Clawhand" cns="梦魇魔女雨靴"/>
	<string key="T1041241" kor="두꺼운 가죽도 단숨에 찢을 수 있는 날카로운 라이코스의 손갈퀴" ger="Lycos' Clawhand kann auch dicke Lederschichten durchreißen." eng="Lycos' sharp Clawhand can rip through a thick layer of leather" tur="Lycos' keskin Clawhand'i kalın bir deri katmanını delip geçebilir" fre="Les griffes de Lycos peuvent transpercer le cuir." rus="Лапа Ликоса с острыми когтями может прорвать толстый слой кожи." cns="出现在你最深梦魇里的苍白少女——梦魇魔女雨靴"/>
	<string key="N1051241" kor="라이코스의 신발" ger="Lycos' Shoes" eng="Lycos' Shoes" tur="Lycos' Shoes" fre="Lycos' Shoes" rus="Lycos' Shoes" cns="梦魇魔女头巾"/>
	<string key="T1051241" kor="긴 발톱과 두꺼운 발바닥을 가진 라이코스의 신발" ger="Lycos' Shoes besitzen dicke Sohlen und genug Platz für seine langen Klauen." eng="Lycos' Shoes have thick soles and can accomodate his long claws." tur="Lycos' Shoes kalın tabanlara sahiptir ve onun uzun pençelerine uyum sağlayabilir." fre="Lycos' Shoes disposent d'épaisses semelles adaptées à ses puissantes griffes." rus="Обувь Ликоса обладает толстой подошвой и достаточно велика, чтобы в нее поместились его длинные когти." cns="出现在你最深梦魇里的苍白少女——梦魇魔女头巾"/>
	<string key="N1001241" kor="라이코스의 늑대머리" ger="Lycos' Wolf Head" eng="Lycos' Wolf Head" tur="Lycos' Wolf Head" fre="Lycos' Wolf Head" rus="Lycos' Wolf Head" cns="梦魇魔女脸型"/>
	<string key="T1001241" kor="사냥감에 굶주린듯한 표정을 가진 라이코스의 늑대머리" ger="Lycos' Wolf Head spiegelt seinen Beutehunger wieder." eng="Lycos' Wolf Head conveys his hunger for prey." tur="Lycos' Wolf Head onun ava olan açlığını aksettirir." fre="Lycos' Wolf Head n'a qu'une seule expression : celle d'un vrai chasseur." rus="Голова волка Ликоса выражает его жажду убивать." cns="出现在你最深梦魇里的苍白少女——梦魇魔女脸型"/>
	<string key="N1061241" kor="라이코스의 꼬리" ger="Lycos' Tail" eng="Lycos' Tail" tur="Lycos' Tail" fre="Lycos' Tail" rus="Lycos' Tail" cns="UMG-11"/>
	<string key="T1061241" kor="몸의 균형감을 잡아주고, 빠르게 방향을 전환할 수 있도록 도와주는 라이코스의 꼬리" ger="Lycos' Tail hilft, das Gleichgewicht zu halten, besonders beim Richtungswechsel." eng="Lycos' Tail helps with balance and are useful when quickly changing direction." tur="Lycos' Tail denge sağlamaya yardımcı olur ve ani yön değiştirmelerde faydalıdır." fre="Lycos' Tail l'aide à garder son équilibre et à changer rapidement de direction lorsqu'il court." rus="Хвост Ликоса помогает балансировать и быстро менять направление движения." cns="UMG-11是突击用的冲锋枪，是军迷喜欢的枪支，因为具有快速的连射速度，对于体力较低的敌人是特殊武器"/>
	<string key="N1021242" kor="발레리의 코르셋" ger="Valery's Corset" eng="Valery's Corset" tur="Valery's Corset" fre="Valery's Corset" rus="Valery's Corset" cns="军用匕首"/>
	<string key="T1021242" kor="악령이 스며든 스카프와 허리를 잘록하게 잡아주는 발레리의 코르셋. 입을 때 숨을 참아야 하는 고통이 있다." ger="Valery's Corset mit Schal formt ihre Taille. Sie muss die Luft anhalten, wenn sie es anlegen will." eng="Valery's Corset shapes her waist and comes with a scarf. She'd have to hold her breath to put it on." tur="Valery's Corset onun beline şekil verir ve bir eşarp ile birlikte gelir. Bunu giymek için nefesini tutmuş olmalı." fre="Valery's Corset maintient sa posture et dispose d'une écharpe assortie. Pour l'enfiler, il faut qu'elle arrête de respirer..." rus="Корсет Валери идет в комплекте с шарфом и плотно облегает талию: чтобы его надеть, ей приходилось задерживать дыхание." cns="军用匕首是专门提供给军队的特典战术匕首，拥有锋利的刀刃，能给予敌人致命一击。"/>
	<string key="N1031242" kor="발레리의 멜빵 스커트" ger="Valery's Suspender Skirt" eng="Valery's Suspender Skirt" tur="Valery's Suspender Skirt" fre="Valery's Suspender Skirt" rus="Valery's Suspender Skirt" cns="连续签到3天奖励"/>
	<string key="T1031242" kor="두개의 멜빵이 달려있는 발레리의 멜빵 스커트. 두개의 멜빵은 사실 적을 속박할 때 사용한다." ger="Valery's Suspender Skirt kommt mit feschen Trägern! Damit kann sie den Feind fesseln." eng="Valery's Suspender Skirt comes with a pair of suspenders. These can be used to restrain the enemy." tur="Valery's Suspender Skirt bir çift askı ile birlikte gelir. Bunlar düşmanı zaptetmek için kullanılabilir." fre="Valery's Suspender Skirt est maintenue par une paire de bretelles. Elles peuvent aussi servir à attacher ses adversaires." rus="Юбка Валери с двумя бретелями, которыми можно связать врага." cns="连续签到3天奖励{N}使用时，可以获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N1041242" kor="발레리의 장갑" ger="Valery's Gloves" eng="Valery's Gloves" tur="Valery's Gloves" fre="Valery's Gloves" rus="Valery's Gloves" cns="连续签到6天奖励"/>
	<string key="T1041242" kor="암살용 나이프가 장착된 발레리의 장갑. 함부로 발레리의 손목을 잡다가는 나이프에 베일 수 있으니 조심해야 한다." ger="Valery's Gloves sind mit einem Assassinen-Messer ausgestattet. Wer meint, sie einfach am Handgelenk ergreifen zu können, der hat sich wahrlich geschnitten!" eng="Valery's Gloves come with an assassin's knife. A careless attempt to hold her wrist might cause a terrible injury." tur="Valery's Gloves bir suikastçi bıçağı ile birlikte gelir. Onun bileğini tutmak gibi dikkatsiz bir hareket korkunç yaralanmalara neden olabilir." fre="Valery's Gloves vont de pair avec un poignard. Lui attraper le poignet, c'est une blessure garantie." rus="Перчатки Валери идут в комплекте с ножом убийцы. Неосторожная попытка схватить ее за запястье может стать причиной ужасной травмы." cns="连续签到6天奖励{N}使用时，可以获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N1051242" kor="발레리의 장화" ger="Valery's Boots" eng="Valery's Boots" tur="Valery's Boots" fre="Valery's Boots" rus="Valery's Boots" cns="连续签到3天奖励（重置）"/>
	<string key="T1051242" kor="방수기능으로 폭우에도 발을 뽀송뽀송하게 지켜주는 발레리의 장화" ger="Valery's Boots schützen ihre Füße auch bei starkem Regen vor Nässe." eng="Valery's Boots will keep her feet dry even in pouring rain." tur="Valery's Boots bardaktan boşalırcasına yağan yağmurda bile onun ayaklarını kuru tutar." fre="Valery's Boots protègent ses pieds des plus terribles tempêtes." rus="С ботинками Валери ноги не промокнут даже в сильный ливень." cns="连续签到3天奖励（重置）{N}使用时，可以获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N1061242" kor="발레리의 빨간두건" ger="Valery's Red Hood" eng="Valery's Red Hood" tur="Valery's Red Hood" fre="Valery's Red Hood" rus="Valery's Red Hood" cns="连续签到6天奖励（重置）"/>
	<string key="T1061242" kor="발레리가 어릴때부터 착용해왔던 빨간두건. 아무도 두건을 벗은 그녀를 본 적이 없다고 한다." ger="Ihre Red Hood trägt Valerie schon seit Kindestagen. Niemand hat sie je ohne diese gesehen." eng="Valery has been wearing her Red Hood since she was a little girl. She has never been seen without it." tur="Valery küçük kızlığından beri Red Hood'unu giymektedir. Hiçbir zaman onsuz görülmemiştir." fre="Valery porte sa cape rouge depuis qu'elle est petite fille. Nul ne l'a jamais vue sans." rus="Валери носит свою красную шапочку с самого детства. Без этой шапочки ее никогда не видели." cns="连续签到6天奖励（重置）{N}使用时，可以获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N1011242" kor="발레리의 얼굴" ger="Valery's Face" eng="Valery's Face" tur="Valery's Face" fre="Valery's Face" rus="Valery's Face" cns="连续签到3天奖励（新增）"/>
	<string key="T1011242" kor="광기의 눈을 가진 발레리의 얼굴. 빨간두건의 악령에게 정신을 빼앗겨버렸다." ger="Valery's Face verleiht einem irre Augen. Ihre Seele wurde von der bösen Red Hood gestohlen." eng="Valery's Face gives you mad eyes. Her soul's been taken by the evil Red Hood." tur="Valery's Face size delice gözler verir. Onun ruhu kötü Red Hood tarafından çalınmıştır." fre="Valery vous dévisage d'un regard fou. Son âme a été emportée par le chaperon rouge maléfique." rus="Глаза Валери горят безумством. Ее душой завладела злая красная шапочка." cns="连续签到3天奖励（新增）{N}使用时，可以获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2010058" kor="UMG-11" ger="UMG-11" eng="UMG-11" tur="UMG-11" fre="UMG-11" rus="UMG-11" cns="连续签到6天奖励（新增）"/>
	<string key="T2010058" kor="UMG-11는 돌격용 기간단총으로 밀리터리 매니아들이 즐겨쓰는 총입니다. 빠른 연사속도의 장점이 있어서 체력이 낮은 적에게는 특화된 무기입니다." ger="Das UMG-11 ist eine Maschinenpistole, die bei Soldaten sehr beliebt ist. Ihre schnelle Feuergeschwindigkeit ist ein Vorteil gegen Gegner mit wenig HP." eng="UMG-11 is a submachine gun for raining that's popular amongst military types. Fast firing speed is its advantage against enemies with low HP." tur="UMG-11 askeri tipler arasında popüler olan bir yarı-otomatik silahtır. Süratli ateş hızı düşük HP'li düşmanlara karşı avantaj sağlar." fre="L'UMG-11 est une mitraillette très populaire auprès des différentes forces armées. Son principal avantage contre les adversaires ayant peu de PV réside dans sa cadence de tir élevée." rus="UMG-11 — это популярный среди военных пистолет-пулемет для массированного огня. Высокая скорость стрельбы дает ему преимущество над врагами с низким уровнем HP." cns="连续签到6天奖励（新增）{N}使用时，可以获得下列道具"/>
	<string key="N2000081" kor="택티컬 나이프" ger="Tactical Knife" eng="Tactical Knife" tur="Tactical Knife" fre="Tactical Knife" rus="Tactical Knife" cns="鸡蛋波比"/>
	<string key="T2000081" kor="택티컬 나이프는 전술 다목적 나이프로 예리한 칼날을 가지고 있어 사정거리 안에 들어온 적에게 강력한 치명상를 입힐 수 있습니다." ger="Das Tactical Knife ist ein Multifunktionsmesser mit scharfer Klinge, das Gegnern in Reichweite tödlichen Schaden zufügt." eng="Tactical Knife is a multi-functional knife with a sharp blade that will inflict deadly damage on any enemy within range." tur="Tactical Knife keskin ağızı menzili içindeki herhangi bir düşmana ölümcül hasar verebilen çok işlevli bir bıçaktır." fre="Tactical Knife est un couteau multifonctions à la lame affûtée qui infligera des dégâts mortels à tout ennemi à portée." rus="Tactical Knife — это многоцелевой нож с острым лезвием, способный нанести смертельный урон любому врагу в пределах досягаемости." cns="鸡蛋形状的可爱波比"/>
	<string key="N2010059" kor="골든 UMG-11" ger="Golden UMG-11" eng="Golden UMG-11" tur="Golden UMG-11" fre="Golden UMG-11" rus="Golden UMG-11"/>
	<string key="T2010059" kor="UMG-11의 골드 에디션으로 금색 도금 되어 몹시 블링블링한 것이 특징이다." ger="Goldene Ausgabe des UMG-11. Sein mit Edelsteinen und Gold umhülltes Äußeres ist wahrlich blendend." eng="Gold edition of the UMG-11. Its most stunning feature is the bling-bling gold covered exterior." tur="UMG-11'in altın versiyonu. En çekici özelliği aşırı lüks altın kaplaması." fre="Version dorée de l'UMG-11. Il est plaqué or, et c'est trop la classe." rus="Золотая версия UMG-11. Самое потрясающее в нем — это сверкающая золотом отделка."/>
	<string key="N2000083" kor="골든 택티컬 나이프" ger="Golden Tactical Knife" eng="Golden Tactical Knife" tur="Golden Tactical Knife" fre="Golden Tactical Knife" rus="Golden Tactical Knife"/>
	<string key="T2000083" kor="택티컬 나이프의 골드 에디션으로 금색 도금 되어 몹시 블링블링한 것이 특징이다." ger="Goldene Ausgabe des Tactical Knife. Sein mit Edelsteinen und Gold umhülltes Äußeres ist wahrlich blendend." eng="Gold edition of the Tactical Knife. Its most stunning feature is the bling-bling gold covered exterior." tur="Tactical Knife'nin altın versiyonu. En çekici özelliği aşırı lüks altın kaplaması." fre="Version dorée du Tactical Knife. Il est plaqué or, et c'est trop la classe." rus="Золотая версия Tactical Knife. Самое потрясающее в нем — это сверкающая золотом отделка."/>
	<string key="N1061243" kor="빅 펌프킨 헤드" ger="Big Pumpkin Head" eng="Big Pumpkin Head" tur="Big Pumpkin Head" fre="Big Pumpkin Head" rus="Big Pumpkin Head"/>
	<string key="T1061243" kor="즐거운 할로윈을 광란의 할로윈으로 바꾸는 거대한 호박 머리 장식" ger="Eine riesige Kürbiskopfdekoration, die aus Frohsinn Grusel macht!" eng="A huge pumpkin head decoration that turns &quot;Happy Halloween&quot; into &quot;Mad Halloween&quot;." tur="&quot;Mutlu Halloween'i&quot; &quot;Çılgın Halloween'e&quot; döndüren bir kocaman balkabağı kafası süsü." fre="Un énorme masque de citrouille qui tempère le « joyeux » de « joyeux Halloween »." rus="Огромная голова из тыквы, с которой «Веселый Хэллоуин» превращается в «Безумный Хэллоуин»."/>
	<string key="N4035523" kor="라이코스 패키지 캡슐" ger="Lycos Package Capsule" eng="Lycos Package Capsule" tur="Lycos Package Capsule" fre="Lycos Package Capsule" rus="Lycos Package Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4035523" kor="라이코스 패키지 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 라이코스 유니크 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Lycos Package Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Tage, 15 Tage, 30 Tage oder Permanent ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Erhöhte Unique Wahrscheinlichkeit nur bezogen auf das Lycos Unique Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Lycos Package Capsule,{N}you'll receive the following item with a random duration of 7 days, 15 days, 30 days or permanent.{N}{N}Increased Unique Probability is only applied to Lycos Unique Set (Permanent)." tur="Lycos Package Capsule kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir.{N}{N}Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalinden sadece Lycos Unique Set (Kalıcı) için kullanılabilir." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Lycos Package Capsule,{N}un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent.{N}{N}La Probabilité Unique Augmentée sera seulement appliquée au Lycos Unique Set (Permanent)." rus="Использовав капсулу Lycos Package Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Увеличенная вероятность уникальности действует только для бессрочного Lycos Unique Set."/>
	<string key="N4035524" kor="발레리 패키지 캡슐" ger="Valery Package Capsule" eng="Valery Package Capsule" tur="Valery Package Capsule" fre="Valery Package Capsule" rus="Valery Package Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4035524" kor="발레리 패키지 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 발레리 유니크 세트 (내구제) 에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Valery Package Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Tage, 15 Tage, 30 Tage oder Permanent ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Erhöhte Unique Wahrscheinlichkeit nur bezogen auf das Valery Unique Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Valery Package Capsule,{N}you'll receive the following item with a random duration of 7 days, 15 days, 30 days or permanent.{N}{N}Increased Unique Probability is only applied to Valery Unique Set (Permanent)." tur="Valery Package Capsule kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir.{N}{N}Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalinden sadece Valery Unique Set (Kalıcı) için kullanılabilir." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Valery Package Capsule,{N}un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent.{N}{N}La Probabilité Unique Augmentée sera seulement appliquée au Valery Unique Set (Permanent)." rus="Использовав капсулу Valery Package Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Увеличенная вероятность уникальности действует только для бессрочного Valery Unique Set."/>
	<string key="N4052783" kor="라이코스의 파츠 캡슐" ger="Lycos Parts Capsule" eng="Lycos Parts Capsule" tur="Lycos Parts Capsule" fre="Lycos Parts Capsule" rus="Lycos Parts Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4052783" kor="라이코스의 파츠 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다. {N}{N}해당 아이템은 유니크  활률업이 적용되지 않습니다." ger="Wenn Lycos Parts Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Tage, 15 Tage, 30 Tage oder Permanent ausgehändigt. {N}{N}Das ausgewählte Item profitiert nicht von der Erhöhten Unique Wahrscheinlichkeit." eng="When you use the Lycos Parts Capsule,{N}you'll receive the following item with a random availability of 7 days, 15 days, 30 days, or permanent. {N}{N}The selected item does not benefit from the Increased Unique Probability." tur="Lycos Parts Capsule kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir. {N}{N}Seçilen eşya Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalinden faydalanamaz." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Lycos Parts Capsule,{N}un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent. {N}{N}L'objet ne bénéficie pas de la Probabilité Unique Augmentée." rus="Использовав капсулу Lycos Parts Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно. {N}{N}Выбранный предмет не получает бонуса от увеличенной вероятности уникальности."/>
	<string key="N4052784" kor="발레리의 파츠 캡슐" ger="Valery Parts Capsule" eng="Valery Parts Capsule" tur="Valery Parts Capsule" fre="Valery Parts Capsule" rus="Valery Parts Capsule"/>
