	<string key="T4035525" kor="할로윈 스페샬 캡슐 (M){N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 라이코스 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Halloween Special Capsule (M) genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 Tage, 15 Tage, 30 Tage oder Permanent ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Erhöhte Unique Wahrscheinlichkeit nur bezogen auf das Halloween Special Set (M) (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Halloween Special Capsule (M),{N}you'll receive the following item with a random duration of 7 days, 15 days, 30 days or permanent.{N}{N}Increased Unique Probability is only applied to Halloween Special Set (M) (Permanent)." tur="Halloween Special Capsule (M) kullandığınızda,{N}şu eşyalardan biri rastgele 7 gün, 15 gün, 30 gün süreyle, ya da &quot;Kalıcı&quot; olarak verilir.{N}{N}Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalinden sadece Halloween Special Set (M) (Kalıcı) için kullanılabilir." fre="Une fois que vous aurez utilisé la Halloween Special Capsule (M),{N}un objet parmi les suivants recevra une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou Permanent.{N}{N}La Probabilité Unique Augmentée sera seulement appliquée au Halloween Special Set (M) (Permanent)." rus="Использовав капсулу Halloween Special Capsule (M),{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Увеличенная вероятность уникальности действует только для бессрочного Halloween Special Set (M)."/>
