	<string key="N4052825" kor="Treat 캡슐" ger="Treat Capsule" eng="Treat Capsule" tur="Treat Capsule" fre="Treat Capsule" rus="Treat Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4052825" kor="승리의 보상! Treat 캡슐 입니다.{N}황금 무기를 얻을수 있는 기회가 담긴 캡슐입니다. 행운의 주인공이 되어보세요" ger="Glückwunsch zum Sieg! Hier hast du eine Treat Capsule.{N}Mit dieser Capsule hast du die Chance auf eine goldene Waffe. Viel Glück!" eng="Congratulations on your victory! This is a Treat Capsule.{N}This Capsule gives you the chance to acquire a golden weapon. Be the lucky winner!" tur="Galibiyetinizi tebrik ederiz! Bu bir Treat Capsule.{N}Bu Capsule size bir altın silah kazanma şansı veriyor. Şansınız bol olsun!" fre="Félicitations quant à votre victoire ! Voilà une Treat Capsule.{N}Cette capsule vous donne une chance d'obtenir une arme dorée. Un peu de réussite, et c'est dans la poche !" rus="Поздравляем с победой! Это «сладкая» капсула.{N}Она дает тебе шанс получить золотое оружие. Пусть тебе повезет!"/>
	<string key="N4052826" kor="Trick 캡슐" ger="Trick Capsule" eng="Trick Capsule" tur="Trick Capsule" fre="Trick Capsule" rus="Trick Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4052826" kor="아쉬운 패벼였습니다. Trick 캡슐을 통해 위로의 보상을 받으세요." ger="Leider verloren … Dein Trostpreis ist diese Trick Capsule." eng="Sorry, but you have lost... Your consolation prize is this Trick Capsule." tur="Üzgünüz, ama kaybettiniz... Teselli ödülünüz bu Trick Capsule." fre="Désolé, c'est perdu... Comme lot de consolation, voilà une Trick Capsule." rus="Прости, но тебе не удалось победить... Эта «гадкая» капсула — твой утешительный приз."/>
	<string key="N4052827" kor="할로윈 코스튬 세트 (잭 오 랜턴)" ger="Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern)" eng="Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern)" tur="Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern)" fre="Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern)" rus="Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern)"/>
	<string key="T4052827" kor="할로윈 코스튬 세트 (잭 오 랜턴)입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다.{N}{CB-255,102,0,255}Happy Halloween~{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}" ger="Dies ist ein Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern).{N}Enthält folgende Items:{N}{CB-255,102,0,255}Happy Halloween!{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}" eng="This is a Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern).{N}Set contains the following items:{N}{CB-255,102,0,255}Happy Halloween!{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}" tur="Bu Halloween Costume Set'dir (Jack-o'-Lantern){N}Set şu eşyaları içerir:{N}{CB-255,102,0,255}Mutlu Cadılar Bayramı!{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}" fre="Il s'agit d'un Halloween Costume Set (Jack-o'-Lantern).{N}Contient les objets suivants :{N}{CB-255,102,0,255}Joyeux Halloween !{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}" rus="Это костюм на Хэллоуин (фонарь из тыквы).{N}Набор содержит следующие предметы:{N}{CB-255,102,0,255}Веселого Хэллоуина!{N}{CB-255,255,255,255}"/>
