	<string key="N4052935" kor="Winner 캡슐" ger="Winner Capsule" eng="Winner Capsule" tur="Winner Capsule" fre="Winner Capsule" rus="Winner Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4052935" kor="승자에게는 승자에게 맞는 보상이 있기를…{N}승자만이 가질수 있는 Winner 캡슐입니다.{N}아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다." ger="Das ist eine Belohnung nur für die Gewinner ...{N}Nur sie können den Winner Capsule erhalten.{N}Enthält folgende Items:" eng="This is a reward just for the winners...{N}Only they can have the Winner Capsule.{N}Capsule contains the following items:" tur="Bu kazananlar için bir ödül...{N}Sadece onlar Winner Capsule kazanabilir.{N}Kapsülün içinde aşağıdaki eşyalar mevcut:" fre="La Winner Capsule{N}n'est que pour les gagnants...{N}Contient les objets suivants :" rus="Эта награда предназначена для победителей!{N}Только они достойны Winner Capsule.{N}Капсула содержит следующие предметы:"/>
	<string key="N4052936" kor="펌비볼 스트라이커 세트" ger="Fumbi Striker Set" eng="Fumbi Striker Set" tur="Fumbi Striker Set" fre="Fumbi Striker Set" rus="Fumbi Striker Set"/>
	<string key="N4052937" kor="섹시 스트라이커 세트" ger="Sexy Striker Set" eng="Sexy Striker Set" tur="Sexy Striker Set" fre="Sexy Striker Set" rus="Sexy Striker Set"/>
	<string key="N1021243" kor="익스트리머 슈트" ger="Arctic Defender Suit" eng="Arctic Defender Suit" tur="Arctic Defender Suit" fre="Arctic Defender Suit" rus="Arctic Defender Suit"/>
	<string key="T1021243" kor="슈트 내부의 냉기를 밖으로 끌어내는 웜 펌프가 부착되어 체온을 유지할 수 있는 익스트리머 슈트." ger="Der Arctic Defender Suit hält die Körpertemperatur aufrecht, indem er eine Pumpe anbringt, um die kalte Luft aus dem Anzug herauszieht." eng="The Arctic Defender Suit can maintain the body temperature by attaching a pump that extracts cold air from inside the suit." tur="Arctic Defender Suit, içindeki soğuk havayı dışarı pompalayan cihaz sayesinde vücut sıcaklığını korur." fre="L'Arctic Defender Suit maintient la température du corps grâce à une pompe qui extrait l'air froid de l'intérieur du costume." rus="Костюм Арктического защитника поддерживает идеальную температуру тела за счет специально установленного насоса извлекающий холодный воздух из костюма."/>
	<string key="N1031243" kor="익스트리머 팬츠" ger="Arctic Defender Pants" eng="Arctic Defender Pants" tur="Arctic Defender Pants" fre="Arctic Defender Pants" rus="Arctic Defender Pants"/>
	<string key="T1031243" kor="보호패드가 내장되어 웬만한 충격에도 하체를 보호할 수 있는 익스트리머 팬츠" ger="Diese Hosen schützen den Unterkörper. Sie haben sogar ein eingebaute Schutzpad." eng="Arctic Defender Pants that can protect the lower body. It even has a built-in protection pad." tur="Bu pantolonlar vücudun alt kısmını korur. Hatta yerleşik birer koruyucuları bile vardır." fre="Ces pantalons protègent le bas du corps. Ils ont même des protections renforcées intégrées." rus="Эти штаны защитят нижнюю часть твоего тела. В них встроен специальная защитный слой."/>
	<string key="N1041243" kor="익스트리머 글러브" ger="Arctic Defender Gloves" eng="Arctic Defender Gloves" tur="Arctic Defender Gloves" fre="Arctic Defender Gloves" rus="Arctic Defender Gloves"/>
	<string key="T1041243" kor="만약의 사태를 대비하여 팔목을 고정한 익스트리머 글러브. 세심한 움직임은 안되지만 손의 보호만큼은 단연 최고입니다." ger="Handschuhe mit engen Bündchen für jeden Notfall. Obwohl präzise Bewegungen schwierig werden, der Schutz der Hände hat eine höhere Priorität." eng="Arctic Defender Gloves with tight cuffs for any emergency. Although precise movements are going to be difficult, protecting your hands is by far the most important thing." tur="Her türlü acil duruma uygun, dar ağızlı eldivenler. Hassas hareketler zorlaşsa da, öncelik elleri korumak." fre="Gants avec poignets serrés pour toute urgence. Bien que les mouvements précis deviennent difficiles, la protection des mains est une priorité." rus="Перчатки с плотными манжетами подойдут для любой чрезвычайной ситуации. Они затрудняют движения, но безопасность рук превыше всего."/>
	<string key="N1051243" kor="익스트리머 슈즈" ger="Arctic Defender Shoes" eng="Arctic Defender Shoes" tur="Arctic Defender Shoes" fre="Arctic Defender Shoes" rus="Arctic Defender Shoes"/>
	<string key="T1051243" kor="글러브와 동일한 소재로 발과 발목을 보호하기위해 제작된 익스트리머 슈즈. 큰 트럭이 밟고 지나가도 변형되지 않는다고 합니다." ger="Diese Schuhe schützen deine Füße und Knöchel mit dem gleichen Material wie die Handschuhe. Angeblich kann nicht einmal ein LKW, der über sie fährt, Schaden anrichten." eng="Arctic Defender Shoes designed to protect your feet and ankles with the same material as the Gloves. It is said that you can't even dent a truck by stepping on it." tur="Bu ayakkabılar eldivenler ile aynı materyali kullanarak ayak ve bileklerinizi korumak için tasarlanmıştır. Öyle ki, üzerlerinden bir tır bile geçse hiçbir şey yapamaz." fre="Ces chaussures sont conçues pour protéger vos pieds et vos chevilles en utilisant le même matériau que les gants. Apparemment, même un camion roulant dessus ne ferait rien." rus="Эта обувь разработана для защиты ног и лодыжек, она изготовлена из того же материала, что и перчатки. По некоторым тестированиям даже грузовик не сможет их повредить."/>
	<string key="N1001243" kor="익스트리머 고글 헤어" ger="Arctic Defender Goggles 'n' Hair" eng="Arctic Defender Goggles Hair" tur="Arctic Defender Goggles 'n' Hair" fre="Arctic Defender Goggles 'n' Hair" rus="Arctic Defender Goggles 'n' Hair"/>
	<string key="T1001243" kor="익스트리머를 위해서 제작된 익스트리머 고글과 자유로운 느낌의 레게헤어. 익스트리머의 최고 애장품인 고글을 건드리면 익스트리머가 화를 낼수도 있습니다" ger="Schutzbrillen für extreme Bedingungen, während die Filzlocken frei bleiben. Der Arctic Defender wirch sich aufregen, wenn jemand seine Brille berührt." eng="Arctic Defender Goggles designed for extreme conditions and for your reggae hair to feel free. Arctic Defenders can get angry if someone touches their Arctic Defender Goggles." tur="Rastalarınızı serbest bırakırken sizi şiddetli koşullara karşı korumak için tasarlanmış gözlükler. Eğer birisi gözlüklerine dokunursa Arctic Defender'lar öfkelenebilirler." fre="Des lunettes conçues pour des conditions extrêmes tout en gardant vos dreadlocks libres. Les Arctic Defender peuvent se fâcher si quelqu'un touche leurs lunettes." rus="Защитные очки для экстремальных условий, кстати они идеально совмещаются с дредами. Никогда не трогай очки другого Арктического защитника, это может его разозлить!"/>
	<string key="N1011243" kor="익스트리머 페이스" ger="Arctic Defender's Face" eng="Arctic Defender's Face" tur="Arctic Defender's Face" fre="Arctic Defender's Face" rus="Arctic Defender's Face"/>
	<string key="T1011243" kor="죽음의 고비를 겪으며 더욱 강렬해진 익스트리머 페이스. 그의 표정은 새로운 도전을 향한 의지가 담겨있습니다." ger="Das Gesicht des Arctic Defenders ist extrem bitter, besonders nachdem er die Leere des Todes erlebt hat. Sein Ausdruck zeigt, wie begierend er nach einer neuen Herausforderung sucht." eng="Arctic Defender's Face has become more intense after experiencing the fierceness of death. His expression shows commitment to a new challenge." tur="Arctic Defender'ın yüzü özellikle de ölümün karanlık boşluğunu tecrübe ettikten sonra fazla gergindir. Yüz ifadesi yeni zorluklar için hevesini gösterir." fre="Le visage de l'Arctic Defender est super-intense, après avoir vécu la mort. Son expression montre l'envie d'affronter un nouveau défi." rus="Лицо Арктических защитников всегда под сильным впечатлением, особенно после пребывания на ниточке от смерти. Его выражение никогда не теряет стремления к новым испытаниям."/>
	<string key="N1021244" kor="아틀레티카 슈트" ger="Arctic Striker Suit" eng="Arctic Striker Suit" tur="Arctic Striker Suit" fre="Arctic Striker Suit" rus="Arctic Striker Suit"/>
	<string key="T1021244" kor="공기의 저항을 줄여주고 움직임의 불편함이 없는 고탄력 아틀레티카 슈트." ger="Hochbelastbarer Anzug, der den Luftwiderstand reduziert und Unannehmlichkeiten beseitigt." eng="High-resilience Arctic Striker Suit that reduces air resistance and eliminates discomfort." tur="Yüksek orandaki esnekliği ile hava direncini azaltır ve rahatsızlığı ortadan kaldırır." fre="Costume haute résilience qui réduit la résistance de l'air et élimine l'inconfort." rus="Высокоэффективный костюм с уменьшенным сопротивлением воздуха и без дискомфорта в движениях."/>
	<string key="N1031244" kor="아틀레티카 팬츠" ger="Arctic Striker Pants" eng="Arctic Striker Pants" tur="Arctic Striker Pants" fre="Arctic Striker Pants" rus="Arctic Striker Pants"/>
	<string key="T1031244" kor="마찰력을 최소화하여 근육의 움직임을 부드럽게 해주는 아틀레티카 팬츠." ger="Hosen, die die Reibungen minimieren." eng="Arctic Striker Pants that minimize muscle friction by minimizing friction." tur="Kas sürtünmesini en aza indirgeyen kaplamalar." fre="Pantalon qui minimise la friction musculaire." rus="Штаны с минимальной силой трения."/>
	<string key="N1041244" kor="아틀레티카 글러브" ger="Arctic Striker Gloves" eng="Arctic Striker Gloves" tur="Arctic Striker Gloves" fre="Arctic Striker Gloves" rus="Arctic Striker Gloves"/>
	<string key="T1041244" kor="주변온도를 감지하여 손의 체온을 유지시켜주는 일렉트릭 팔찌가 포함된 아틀레티카 글러브." ger="Diese Handschuhe haben ein elektrisches Armband, das die Umgebungstemperatur misst und die Hände auf einer optimalen Temperatur hält." eng="Arctic Striker Gloves with an electric bracelet that senses the ambient temperature and keeps your hands at an optimal temperature." tur="Bu eldivenlerde çevredeki sıcaklığı ölçüp ellerinizi uygun bir sıcaklıkta tutmaya yarayan bir elektrikli bileklik bulunmaktadır." fre="Ces gants ont un bracelet électrique qui maintient vos mains à une température optimale." rus="В эти перчатки встроен электронный браслет, регулирующий оптимальную температуру рук в зависимости от температуры окружающей среды."/>
	<string key="N1051244" kor="아틀레티카 슈즈" ger="Arctic Striker Shoes" eng="Arctic Striker Shoes" tur="Arctic Striker Shoes" fre="Arctic Striker Shoes" rus="Arctic Striker Shoes"/>
	<string key="T1051244" kor="발의 활동량을 감지하여 공기의 흐름을 조절하는 일렉트릭 발찌가 포함된 아틀레이카 슈즈." ger="Schuhe mit einer elektrischen Fußschlaufe, die den Luftstrom durch Wahrnehmung der Fußaktivität reguliert." eng="Arctic Striker Shoes with an electric foot strap that adjusts the flow of air by sensing the amount of foot activity." tur="Ayak aktivitesini hissederek hava akışını ayarlayan elektrikli kayışlara sahip ayakkabılar." fre="Chaussures avec une sangle de pied électrique qui ajuste le flux d'air en détectant la quantité d'activité du pied." rus="Обувь с электронными датчиками, которые управляют потоком воздуха в зависимости от активности человека."/>
	<string key="N1001244" kor="아틀레티카 헤어" ger="Arctic Striker Hair" eng="Arctic Striker Hair" tur="Arctic Striker Hair" fre="Arctic Striker Hair" rus="Arctic Striker Hair"/>
	<string key="T1001244" kor="눈처럼 하얀 머리카락과 귀를 따뜻하게 해주는 귀마개가 매력적인 아틀레티카 헤어." ger="Eine attraktive Mähne aus weißem Haar mit Ohrenschützern, die deine Ohren warm halten." eng="Arctic Striker Hair is an attractive white hair with earmuffs keeping your ears warm." tur="Çekici bembeyaz saçlar ve kulaklarınızı sıcak tutacak kulaklıklar." fre="De beaux cheveux blancs avec des cache-oreilles qui gardent vos oreilles au chaud." rus="Привлекательная мужская прическа с наушниками для поддержки ушей в тепле."/>
	<string key="N1011244" kor="아틀레티카 페이스" ger="Arctic Striker's Face" eng="Arctic Striker's Face" tur="Arctic Striker's Face" fre="Arctic Striker's Face" rus="Arctic Striker's Face"/>
	<string key="T1011244" kor="승부에 자신감이 넘치는 아틀레티카 페이스. 사람들은 눈 아래의 점 때문에 생기는 자신감이라고 믿고있다." ger="Das Gesicht des Arctic Strikers drückt volle Zuversicht in ihre Fähigkeiten aus. Es ist ein Vertrauen, das aus dem Wissen kommt, dass du der Beste bist." eng="Arctic Striker's Face is full of confidence in the game. People believe it is the confidence that comes from knowing you're the best." tur="Arctic Striker'ın yüzü yeteneklerine olan sonsuz güvenini gösteriyor. En iyi olduğunuzu bildiğinizden gelen bir özgüven bu." fre="Le visage de l'Arctic Striker est plein de confiance. Confiance provenant du fait d'être le meilleur." rus="Выражение лица Арктического нападающего никогда не сомневается в своих способностях. Оно полно уверенности и стремления к реализации!"/>
	<string key="N2000082" kor="선물 꾸러미 배트" ger="Arctic Surprise" eng="Arctic Surprise" tur="Arctic Surprise" fre="Arctic Surprise" rus="Arctic Surprise"/>
	<string key="T2000082" kor="크리스마스를 기념한 선물 꾸러미 배트.{N}그 속에 무엇이 들었는지는 알 수 없지만 분명 좋은 선물은 아닌 것 같습니다.{N}선물 모양에 속아 다가갔다간 큰 코 다칠 수 있으니 주의하시기 바랍니다." ger="Ein Arctic Surprise zur Feier des Weihnachtens.{N}Ich weiß nicht, was drin ist, aber es ist sicherlich nicht angenehm.{N}Bitte beachten: Du könntest dich beim Öffnen dieses Geschenks verletzen." eng="An Arctic Surprise that commemorates Christmas.{N}I do not know what is in it, but it is certainly not a good gift.{N}Please note that you may get hurt when opening this gift." tur="Yılbaşını kutlayan bir Arctic Sürpriz.{N}İçinde ne var bilmiyorum, ama kesinlikle sevimli bir şey değil.{N}Aklında bulunsun: bu hediyeyi açarken canın acıyabilir." fre="L'Arctic Surprise fête Noël.{N}Je n'ai aucune idée ce qu'il y a dedans, mais cela ne doit pas être des sucreries.{N}Note : vous risquez de vous blesser en ouvrant ce cadeau." rus="Арктический подарок к Рождеству.{N}Я не знаю, что внутри, но и милым он не выглядит.{N}Примечание: При открытии возможны травмы!"/>
	<string key="N3080003" kor="펌비 메탈릭" ger="Metallic Fumbi" eng="Metallic Fumbi" tur="Metallic Fumbi" fre="Metallic Fumbi" rus="Metallic Fumbi"/>
	<string key="T3080003" kor="이 펌비 메탈릭은 당신을 아름다운 육체미를 자랑하는 펌비로 변신시킬 것입니다.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}지속 SP사용량 감소(-5%),방어력 증가(+5%)" ger="Der Metallic Fumbi verwandelt dich in einen wunderschön gepflegten Fumbi." eng="This Metallic Fumbi will transform you into a beautifully groomed Fumbi.{N}{CB-255,255,0,255}(SP usage -5%, Defense +5%)" tur="Bu Metalik Fumbi sizi iyi bakılmış bir Fumbi'ye çevirecek." fre="Ce Metallic Fumbi vous transformera en un Fumbi magnifiquement soigné." rus="Этот Metallic Fumbi превратит тебя в хорошо сложенного Fumbi."/>
	<string key="N2050015" kor="스노우 어스 봄버 (이벤트 전용)" ger="Snow Earth Bomber (Event)" eng="Snow Earth Bomber (Event)" tur="Snow Earth Bomber (Event)" fre="Snow Earth Bomber (Event)" rus="Snow Earth Bomber (Event)"/>
	<string key="T2050015" kor="거친 눈폭풍으로 적을 휩쓸어버리는 어스 봄버" ger="Dieser Bomber löscht Feinde mit einem rauen Schneesturm aus." eng="The Earth Bomber wipes out enemies with a rough snow storm." tur="Bu bombalayıcı sert bir kar fırtınası ile düşmanları ortadan kaldırır." fre="Ce bombardier éradique les ennemis avec une sauvage tempête de neige." rus="Эта бомба поглощает врагов снежной бурей."/>
	<string key="N2050016" kor="스노우 어스 봄버" ger="Snow Earth Bomber" eng="Snow Earth Bomber" tur="Snow Earth Bomber" fre="Snow Earth Bomber" rus="Snow Earth Bomber"/>
	<string key="T2050016" kor="거친 눈폭풍으로 적을 휩쓸어버리는 어스 봄버" ger="Dieser Bomber löscht Feinde mit einem rauen Schneesturm aus." eng="The Earth Bomber wipes out enemies with a rough snow storm." tur="Bu bombalayıcı sert bir kar fırtınası ile düşmanları ortadan kaldırır." fre="Ce bombardier éradique les ennemis avec une sauvage tempête de neige." rus="Эта бомба поглощает врагов снежной бурей."/>
	<string key="N4052938" kor="눈싸움 승리 보상" ger="Snowball Victory Reward" eng="Snowball Victory Reward" tur="Kartopu Zafer Ödülü" fre="Récompense de Victoire Snowball" rus="Snowball Victory награда"/>
	<string key="T4052938" kor="눈싸움 모드에서 승리 하셨군요!{N}승자만을 위해 준비된 렌덤 보상입니다.!{N}아이템 사용 시 하나의 아이템이 지급되며, 장비 아이템은 1일, 3일 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다." ger="Du hast den Snowball Fight gewonnen!{N}Dies ist die Belohnung des Siegers!{N}Wenn Du es nutzt, bekommst Du ein einzelnes Item mit einer zufälligen Dauer von 1, 3 Tage oder Permanennt." eng="You won the Snowball Fight!{N}This is the victor's reward!{N}When using this, a single item will be given with a random duration of 1, 3 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot;." tur="Kartopu Savaşı'nı kazandın!{N}Bu kazananın ödülü!{N}Bunu kullanırken rastgele 1 veya 3 günlük, ya da kalıcı bir eşya verilecektir." fre="Vous avez gagné le combat de Snowball !{N}C'est la récompense du vainqueur !{N}En utilisant cet objet, vous recevrez un objet avec une durée aléatoire de 1, 3 jours ou « Illimité »." rus="Ты победил в Snowball Fight!{N}Вот твоя награда!{N}Открыв, ты получишь один предмет со случайным сроком действия на 1, 3 дня или бессрочный."/>
	<string key="N4052939" kor="눈싸움 플레이 보상" ger="Snowball Participation Reward" eng="Snowball Participation Reward" tur="Kartopu Katılım Ödülü" fre="Récompense de participation au mode Snowball" rus="Snowball Participation награда"/>
	<string key="T4052939" kor="눈싸움 모드 플레이에 감사드립니다.{N}아이템 사용 시 하나의 아이템이 지급되며, 장비 아이템은 1일, 7일 기간제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다." ger="Danke für das Spiel!{N}Wenn Du es nutzt, bekommst Du ein einzelnes Item mit einer zufälligen Dauer von 1 oder 7 Tage." eng="Thank you for playing the Snowball Fight Mode.{N}When using this, a single item will be given with a random duration of 1 or 7 Days." tur="Kartopu Savaşı Modu'nu oynadığınız için teşekkürler.{N}Bunu kullanırken rastgele 1 veya 7 günlük bir eşya verilecektir." fre="Merci d'avoir joué au mode Snowball Fight.{N}En utilisant cet objet, vous recevrez un objet avec une durée aléatoire de 1 ou 7 jours." rus="Спасибо за участие в режиме Snowball Fight!{N}Открыв, ты получишь один предмет со случайным сроком действия на 1 или 7 дней."/>
	<string key="N4035535" kor="익스트리머 패키지 캡슐" ger="Arctic Defender Package Capsule" eng="Arctic Defender Package Capsule" tur="Arctic Defender Package Capsule" fre="Arctic Defender Package Capsule" rus="Arctic Defender Package Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4035535" kor="익스트리머 패키지 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 익스트리머 유니크 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Arctic Defender Package Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 , 15, 30 Tage oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Arctic Defender Package Capsule{N}an item like the following is given with a random duration of 7, 15, 30 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot; applied.{N}{N}Unique Probability-Up applies only to the Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent)." tur="Arctic Defender Package Capsule eşyasını kullandığınızda{N}eşya rastgele 7,15,30 gün veya &quot;sınırsız&quot; kullanım süresi kazanır.{N}{N}Unique Booster yalnızca Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent) için kullanılabilir." fre="Lorsque vous utilisez la Capsule Arctic Defender Package,{N}l'objet reçoit une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou « Permanent ».{N}{N}Unique Booster n'est utilisé que sur le set Unique Arctic Defender (Permanent)." rus="Использовав Arctic Defender Package Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Unique Booster действует только для бессрочного Arctic Defender Unique Set."/>
	<string key="N4035536" kor="아틀레티카 패키지 캡슐" ger="Arctic Striker Package Capsule" eng="Arctic Striker Package Capsule" tur="Arctic Striker Package Capsule" fre="Arctic Striker Package Capsule" rus="Arctic Striker Package Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4035536" kor="아틀레티카 패키지 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 아틀레티카 유니크 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Arctic Striker Package Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7, 15, 30 Tage oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Arctic Striker Unique Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Arctic Striker Package Capsule{N}an item like the following is given with a random duration of 7, 15, 30 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot; applied.{N}{N}Unique Probability-Up applies only to the Arctic Striker Unique Set (Permanent)." tur="Arctic Striker Package Capsule eşyasını kullandığınızda{N}eşya rastgele 7,15,30 gün veya &quot;sınırsız&quot; kullanım süresi kazanır.{N}{N}Unique Booster yalnızca Arctic Striker Unique Set (Permanent) için kullanılabilir." fre="Lorsque vous utilisez la Capsule Arctic Striker Package,{N}l'objet reçoit une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou « Permanent ».{N}{N}Unique Booster n'est utilisé que sur le set Unique Arctic Striker (Permanent)." rus="Использовав Arctic Striker Package Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Unique Booster действует только для бессрочного Arctic Striker Unique Set."/>
	<string key="N4052940" kor="익스트리머의 파츠 캡슐" ger="Arctic Defender Parts Capsule" eng="Arctic Defender Parts Capsule" tur="Arctic Defender Parts Capsule" fre="Arctic Defender Parts Capsule" rus="Arctic Defender Parts Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4052940" kor="익스트리머의 파츠 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다. {N}{N}해당 아이템은 유니크  활률업이 적용되지 않습니다." ger="Wenn Arctic Defender Parts Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7, 15, 30 Tage oder (Permanent) ausgehändigt. {N}{N}Das ausgewählte Item profitiert nicht von erhöhter Unique Wahrscheinlichkeit." eng="When you use the Arctic Defender Parts Capsule{N}an item like the following is given with a random duration of 7, 15, 30 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot; applied. {N}{N}The selected item does not benefit from the Increased Unique Probability." tur="Arctic Defender Parts Capsule eşyasını kullandığınızda{N}eşya rastgele 7,15,30 gün veya &quot;sınırsız&quot; kullanım süresi kazanır. {N}{N}Seçilen eşya Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalden faydalanamaz." fre="Lorsque vous utilisez la Capsule Arctic Defender Parts,{N}l'objet reçoit une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou « Permanent ». {N}{N}L'objet ne bénéficie pas de la Probabilité Unique Augmentée." rus="Использовав Arctic Defender Parts Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно. {N}{N}Выбранный предмет не получает бонуса от увеличенной вероятности уникальности."/>
	<string key="N4052941" kor="아틀레티카의 파츠 캡슐" ger="Arctic Striker Parts Capsule" eng="Arctic Striker Parts Capsule" tur="Arctic Striker Parts Capsule" fre="Arctic Striker Parts Capsule" rus="Arctic Striker Parts Capsule"/>
	<string key="T4052941" kor="아틀레티카의 파츠 캡슐{N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다. {N}{N}해당 아이템은 유니크  활률업이 적용되지 않습니다." ger="Wenn Arctic Striker Parts Capsule genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7, 15, 30 Tage oder (Permanent) ausgehändigt. {N}{N}Das ausgewählte Item profitiert nicht von erhöhter Unique Wahrscheinlichkeit." eng="When you use the Arctic Striker Parts Capsule{N}an item like the following is given with a random duration of 7, 15, 30 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot; applied. {N}{N}The selected item does not benefit from the Increased Unique Probability." tur="Arctic Striker Parts Capsule eşyasını kullandığınızda{N}eşya rastgele 7,15,30 gün veya &quot;sınırsız&quot; kullanım süresi kazanır. {N}{N}Seçilen eşya Yükseltilmiş Benzersiz İhtimalden faydalanamaz." fre="Lorsque vous utilisez la Capsule Arctic Striker Parts,{N}l'objet reçoit une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou « Permanent ». {N}{N}L'objet ne bénéficie pas de la Probabilité Unique Augmentée." rus="Использовав Arctic Striker Parts Capsule,{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно. {N}{N}Выбранный предмет не получает бонуса от увеличенной вероятности уникальности."/>
	<string key="N4035537" kor="크리스마스 스페샬 캡슐 (M)" ger="Christmas Special Capsule (M)" eng="Christmas Special Capsule (M)" tur="Christmas Special Capsule (M)" fre="Christmas Special Capsule (M)" rus="Christmas Special Capsule (M)"/>
	<string key="T4035537" kor="크리스마스 스페샬 캡슐 (M){N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 익스트리머 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Christmas Special Capsule (M) genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 , 15, 30 Tage oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Arctic Defender Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Christmas Special Capsule (M){N}an item like the following is given with a random duration of 7, 15, 30 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot; applied.{N}{N}Unique Probability-Up can only be used on Arctic Defender Set (Permanent)." tur="Christmas Special Capsule (M) eşyasını kullandığınızda{N}eşya rastgele 7,15,30 gün veya &quot;sınırsız&quot; kullanım süresi kazanır.{N}{N}Unique Booster yalnızca Arctic Defender Set (Permanent) için kullanılabilir." fre="Lorsque vous utilisez la Capsule Christmas Special (M),{N}l'objet reçoit une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou « Permanent ».{N}{N}Unique Booster n'est utilisé que sur le set Unique Arctic Defender (Permanent)." rus="Использовав Christmas Special Capsule (M),{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Unique Booster действует только для бессрочного Arctic Defender Set."/>
	<string key="N4035538" kor="크리스마스 스페샬 캡슐 (F)" ger="Christmas Special Capsule (F)" eng="Christmas Special Capsule (F)" tur="Christmas Special Capsule (F)" fre="Christmas Special Capsule (F)" rus="Christmas Special Capsule (F)"/>
	<string key="T4035538" kor="크리스마스 스페샬 캡슐 (F){N}아이템 사용 시 다음과 같은 아이템에 7일, 15일, 30일, 내구제가 랜덤으로 적용되어 지급됩니다.{N}{N}유니크 확률업은 아틀레티카 세트 (내구제)에만 적용됩니다." ger="Wenn Christmas Special Capsule (F) genutzt wird,{N}wird eines der folgenden Items mit zufälliger Dauer von 7 , 15, 30 Tage oder &quot;Permanent&quot; ausgehändigt.{N}{N}Die Unique Probability-Up ist nur möglich auf dem Arctic Striker Set (Permanent)." eng="When you use the Christmas Special Capsule (F){N}an item like the following is given with a random duration of 7, 15, 30 Days or &quot;Permanent&quot; applied.{N}{N}Unique Probability-Up can only be used on Arctic Striker Set (Permanent)." tur="Christmas Special Capsule (F) eşyasını kullandığınızda{N}eşya rastgele 7,15,30 gün veya &quot;sınırsız&quot; kullanım süresi kazanır.{N}{N}Unique Booster yalnızca Arctic Striker Set (Permanent) için kullanılabilir." fre="Lorsque vous utilisez la Capsule Christmas Special (F),{N}l'objet reçoit une durée aléatoire de 7, 15, 30 jours ou « Permanent ».{N}{N}Unique Booster n'est utilisé que sur le set Unique Arctic Striker (Permanent)." rus="Использовав Christmas Special Capsule (F),{N}ты получишь предмет со случайным сроком действия: 7, 15, 30 дней или бессрочно.{N}{N}Unique Booster действует только для бессрочного Arctic Striker Set."/>
	<string key="N4052942" kor="익스트리머 유니크 세트 (내구제)" ger="Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent)" eng="Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent)" tur="Arctic Defender Unique Set (Kalıcı)" fre="Set Arctic Defender Unique (Permanent)" rus="Arctic Defender Unique Set (Бессрочн.)"/>
	<string key="T4052942" kor="익스트리머 유니크 세트 (내구제)입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent){N}enthält folgende Items:" eng="This is the Arctic Defender Unique Set (Permanent).{N}Set contains the following items:" tur="The Arctic Defender Unique Set (Kalıcı){N}set şu eşyaları içerir:" fre="Le Set Arctic Defender Unique (Permanent){N}contient les objets suivants :" rus="Уникальный костюм Арктического защитника (бессрочный),{N}набор содержит следующие предметы:"/>
	<string key="N4052943" kor="익스트리머 유니크 세트 (30일)" ger="Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 Days)" eng="Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 Days)" tur="Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 Gün)" fre="Set Arctic Defender Unique (30 Days)" rus="Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 дней)"/>
	<string key="T4052943" kor="익스트리머 유니크 세트 (30일)입니다.{N}세트 아이템 사용시 다음과 같은 아이템이 지급됩니다." ger="Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 Days){N}enthält folgende Items:" eng="This is the Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 Days).{N}Set contains the following items:" tur="The Arctic Defender Unique Set (30 Gün){N}set şu eşyaları içerir:" fre="Le Set Arctic Defender Unique (30 Days){N}contient les objets suivants :" rus="Уникальный костюм Арктического защитника (30 дней),{N}набор содержит следующие предметы:"/>
	<string key="N4052944" kor="익스트리머 유니크 세트 (15일)" ger="Arctic Defender Unique Set (15 Days)" eng="Arctic Defender Unique Set (15 Days)" tur="Arctic Defender Unique Set (15 Gün)" fre="Set Arctic Defender Unique (15 Days)" rus="Arctic Defender Unique Set (15 дней)"/>
